<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="EZK" style="id">- Selee Old Testament</book>
  <para style="h">HESEKIEL</para>
  <para style="toc1">Hesekiel Kukũ</para>
  <para style="toc2">Hesekiel</para>
  <para style="toc3">Hes</para>
  <para style="mt1">HESEKIEL</para>
  <para style="mt2">KUKŨ</para>
  <para style="imt">ODIKIOTUO</para>
  <para style="ip">Ɔlaabuɛtɛtɛ Hesekiel lasiɛ di sɛlanle kamɛ di Babel di obe wɔ di Yerusalem diibiɛ ni ku obiɛ nɔɔ sɛmaa di alɛɛ alafa anɔɔ-afosi-anɛ-akuɔ kamɛ <char style="sc">Fiɛ baalofo NI kristo</char>. Ɔlaa nɔɔ lawa kuata balanle nwu di Babel ku Yerusalem batii, akyuu nwu anyɔ. <char style="bk">Hesekiel Kukũ nwu</char> lɛsɛ di akyuu kplɛ akuɔ kamɛ: (1) Yaa lɛlɛɛ le aalɛɛ ni Hesekiel alɛ ale ni ɔlaabuɛtɛtɛ; (2) Ɔlaa osĩ ɔta batii di Yaa lɛkanko le nimawa ni di batii suoto, obiɛ ku kawɔɔ ka nikɔɔwa ni di Yerusalem suoto; (3) Sɛlaa se niakye ni SAATE nwu nfũ di mmle di lɛkanko nɔɔ kamawa ni di nnle ateate be nianyinka ni batii nɔɔ, baakyɔnkyɔ ma ni kafɔɔ; (4) Kɔnɛɛ okpee kaafutu ɔta Israel di Yerusalem obiɛ sɛmaa ku ɔlaa obuɛ ɔtɛ ɔta di dibiene le nimawa ni di dii kaamaa suoto; (5) Ɔlaa obuɛ ɔtɛ oyila di Gog suoto; (6) Mmle di Hesekiel lanya ni Olekatakɔ nwu ose letofo ku kale nwu ose lelolaa.</para>
  <para style="ip">Hesekiel lale otii wɔ niawɛ ni ofũ onu osie kanya ku disibu kplɛ aata ni dii kaamaa. Lɛsɔnu nɔɔ kpinwu lawa di odiki otuo kamɛ, aadiki sɛlaa nɔɔ kpinwu kafɔɔ aafenko di atembi sɛsaabla kamɛ. Hesekiel labuɛ aatika difuɔ di mmle diefĩ diɛta ni otu kaamɛ kamɛ ku ninwuna fɔle ose lɛbla, ku mmle di otii biala kamadiki ni kanya di nnwɔɔ omu nɔɔ sikpile suoto. Aayie lɛkya kafɔɔ di osuku onyu nɔɔ ɔta kale nwu nkpa fɔle ose lɛbla. Fɛ oletatɛ ku ɔlaabuɛtɛtɛ yi, aayɔ nwu ole nwaa di Olekatakɔ nwu suoto ku mmle diefĩ diɛta ni leklekle.</para>
  <para style="iot">Kukũ nwu kamɛ sɛlaa</para>
  <para style="io1">Hesekiel lɛlɛɛ</para>
  <para style="io1">1 1.1-3.27</para>
  <para style="io1">Sɛlaa di Yerusalem obiɛ suoto 4.1-24.27</para>
  <para style="io1">Yaa lɛkanko di nnle nwu suoto 25.1-32.32</para>
  <para style="io1">Ɔlaa wɔ di Yaa labuɛ aatɛ aata ni batii nɔɔ 33.1-37.28</para>
  <para style="io1">Ɔlaa obuɛ ɔtɛ oyila di Gog suoto 38.1-39.29</para>
  <para style="io1">Olekatakɔ nwu ku kasɔ nwu dii kaamaa odiki otuo 40.1-48.35</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="EZK 1" />
  <para style="s1">Yaa Lɛkakpomii</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 1:1" />Di dii nɔnle suoto di Yuda batii kɔwɛntɛ naafa kamɛ, di alɛɛ afosi-atiɛ nii kamɛ, di obe wɔ lasiɛ ni di balanle kamɛ di Kebar Okle kotoko yi, osi lasɛkɛtɛ, ni lanya Yaa odiki otuo nɛ.<verse eid="EZK 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 1:2" />Di kɔwɛntɛ nwu dii nɔnle suoto- niale ni lɛlɛɛ nɔnle di Ɔka Yehoiakin lasifi ni sɛlanle kamɛ yi- <verse eid="EZK 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 1:3" />SAATE nwu ɔlaa lawa kuata Busi obisuɔtɔbi, oletatɛ Hesekiel di Kebar Okle kotoko di Kaldea<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1.3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Nnwu nwu manlɛɛ Babel nɛ</char></note> batii kasɔ suoto. Nfa di Yaa kɔnɛɛ latika nwɔ di suoto nɛ.<verse eid="EZK 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 1:4" />Lanyu nii, ni lanya afɛɛfɔ lakye katoo-kasɔ aatɔɔwa- lelokonkyɛ kplɛ latoomunaa ku ɔtɔ, lɛkpa kafɔɔ lamana ni diakyi. Ɔtɔ nwu ntɛɛntɛɛ late fɛle lɛbɔɔsaa le niebe ni ɔtɔ bɔmbɔ okle. <verse eid="EZK 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 1:5" />Asaa ya kafɔɔ niate ni fɛle asaa ya ninkpe ni nkpa ana lasiɛ di ɔtɔ nwu kamɛ. Di letembi nini late ni fɛle otii, <verse eid="EZK 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 1:6" />kafɔɔ dibiala lɛma lawɛ anu ana ku afoko ana. <verse eid="EZK 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 1:7" />Nkpaa lɛma layila tinini; nkpaatũ lɛma late fɛle lɛnankyuebi akpɔbi okle, diatoosesee kafɔɔ fɛle lɛbɔɔsaa sɛɛle le beekpee ni di ɔtɔ kamɛ okle. <verse eid="EZK 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 1:8" />Baawɛ otii nnɛɛ di afoko lɛma kalɔ di ɛfankyi lɛma ɛna nwu suoto. Bana lɛma nwu bamuu lawɛ anu ku afoko, <verse eid="EZK 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 1:9" />afoko lɛma kafɔɔ lakpanko bawo. Dibiala lɛma lanyu sitũ aakyɛ tinini; batamunikĩi di obe wɔ baakyɛ nii.<verse eid="EZK 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 1:10" />Nnya mmle okle di anu lɛma late ni: Bana nwu biala lawɛ otii anu, dibiala lawɛ kyata anu di oletanɛɛkyɛ, di ɔmɛntukyɛ kafɔɔ yi, dibiala lawɛ nankyue-suɔtɔ anu; dibiala kafɔɔ lawɛ klikpo anu. <verse eid="EZK 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 1:11" />Nkpo di anu lɛma late nɛ. Afoko lɛma lafukuti aakyɔɔ osi lɛkyɛ; dibiala lawɛ afoko anyɔ, kunwii kɔkpanko ɔbamba kofoko di kakyɛ biala, afoko anyɔ kafɔɔ latĩi ma suoto. <verse eid="EZK 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 1:12" />Dibiala lanyu sitũ aakyɛ tinini. Kakɔlele di ninwuna nwu nkyɛ, mankyɛ nfa, mammunikĩi kafɔɔ di obe wɔ bakyɛ nii. <verse eid="EZK 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 1:13" />Asaa nwu ninkpe ni nkpa late fɛle atɔkɔnii nikɔfiɛ nii ee fɛle kaka sɛtɔ. Ɔtɔ latɔɔkyɛ sitũ kuatookple sɛmaa di asaa nwu ninkpe ni nkpa kamɛ; kuakpa, ɔtɔ kafɔɔ latoomunaa kuatoodie nwu kaamɛ. <verse eid="EZK 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 1:14" />Asaa ya ninkpe ni nkpa nwu ntoso ankyɛ sitũ ankple sɛmaa fɛle ɔtɔ amunaa okle.<verse eid="EZK 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 1:15" />Lanyu ni asaa nwu ninkpe ni nkpa yi, lanya keke kɔkpaa di kasɔ suoto di asaa ya ninkpe ni nkpa biala ɔlɔɔkɔ ku anu ana ninya nwu. <verse eid="EZK 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 1:16" />Nnya mmle di keke nwu nkpaa letembi late ni ku mmle baabla nya ni: Aatoosesee fɛle afuɔ ya manlɛɛ ni krisolite, ana nwu amuu kafɔɔ ladie bawo. Ɔbla baabla dibiala late fɛle keke kɔkpaa nwu lewo nsi di keke kɔkpaa lewo kamɛ okle. <verse eid="EZK 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 1:17" />Nse bakyɛ yi, manfuo ɔkyɛ di ɛfankyi nwu ɛna onwii lele suoto di asaa nwu ninkpe ni nkpa lɛkyɔɔ ni anu; bakeke nwu ninmumunikĩi nse asaa nwu ninkpe ni nkpa nkyɛ. <verse eid="EZK 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 1:18" />Nkpaa abɔɔsaa lɛma lataka katoo di difu lasiɛ ni kafɔɔ, nkpaa abɔɔsaa ana nwu amuu kafɔɔ lawɛ anu, aamana amuu aakyi.<verse eid="EZK 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 1:19" />Nse asaa nwu ninkpe ni nkpa nkyɛ, bakeke nkpaa nwu nkyɛ di ɔlɔɔkɔ lɛma; nse asaa nwu ninkpe ni nkpa lɛtaka kaasɔ yi, bakeke nkpaa nwu kafɔɔ ntaka. <verse eid="EZK 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 1:20" />Kakɔlele di ninwuna nwu nkyɛ, mankyɛ nfa, bakeke nkpaa nwu kafɔɔ ntaka ku mma, diekye asaa ya ninkpe ni nkpa ninwuna lasiɛ di bakeke nkpaa nwu kamɛ. <verse eid="EZK 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 1:21" />Nse babɔkɛɛ nwu nkyɛ, mma kafɔɔ mankyɛ; nse babɔkɛɛ nwu leyila, mma kafɔɔ man-yila; nse babɔkɛɛ nwu lɛtaka kaasɔ, bakeke nwu kafɔɔ ntaka ku mma, diekye asaa ya ninkpe ni nkpa ninwuna lasiɛ di bakeke nwu kamɛ.<verse eid="EZK 1:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZK 1:22" />Lɛsaa ninwii latika di asaa ya ninkpe ni nkpa nsintɛɛ, diate ni fɛle kablɛfɛɛkɔ okle, diatoosesee fɛle ditubakani, di difu lasiɛ ni. <verse eid="EZK 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZK 1:23" />Beefukuti afoko lɛma bɛɛkyɔɔ bawo di kablɛfɛɛkɔ nwu kalɔ, dibiala lawɛ afoko anyɔ ya niatĩi ni suoto nini. <verse eid="EZK 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZK 1:24" />Nse asaa nwu ninkpe ni nkpa nkyɛ yi, nnu afoko lɛma lɛkpanko, fɛle ntu be nikobiɛ ninfe ni diwi, fɛle Nnwɔ Ninlenke ni sɛlɔ, fɛle bakpɛtɛ kudu. Nse beeyila, manwakosa afoko lɛma kasɔ.<verse eid="EZK 1:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EZK 1:25" />Ninfɛ di sɛlɔ sinwii ladie siakye kablɛfɛɛkɔ nwu osi di asintɛɛ lɛma di obe wɔ nfɛ bayɛ bɛɛwakosa ni afoko kasɔ. <verse eid="EZK 1:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EZK 1:26" />Di kablɛfɛɛkɔ nwu osi yi, lɛsaa ninwii latika di nsintɛɛ lɛma diate ni fɛle difuɔ le manlɛɛ ni safir lɛkakpomii. Lɛsaa ninwii kafɔɔ niate ni fɛle otii lasiɛ di lɛkakpomii nwu suoto. <verse eid="EZK 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EZK 1:27" />Lanya ni nkpo fɛle lɛsaa le niate ni fɛle kataduu nɔɔ. Diasifi ni osi, aate fɛle lɛbɔɔsaa le nikosesee nii, fɛle ɔtɔ nieyii ni kamɛ. Diayɔ ni ninfa kafɔɔ diawa ni di kalɔ lɛkyɛ yi, aate fɛle ɔtɔ; ɔtɔ wɔ niatɔɔkpa kuamana nwɔ kuakyi nii. <verse eid="EZK 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EZK 1:28" />Fɛle mmle di kolosansa ntaa ni di kolo osi di kanto ɔnɔɔbee kamɛ yi, nkpo niale lɛkpa le niamana nwɔ diakyi ni nɛ.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EZK 1:28">Nle mmle niale SAATE nwu dibu letembi le ate ni nɛ. Obe wɔ lanya ni nii yi, lafuusa anu kaasɔ, ni lanu otii onwii niatɔkakatɛ ni sɛlɔ nɛ.<verse eid="EZK 1:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="EZK 2" />
  <para style="s1">Yaa Lalɛɛ Hesekiel</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 2:1" />Ni aatɔkɔ mi alɛ, “Otii obi, takafayila di nkpaa lɛfɔ suoto ninkakatɛko fɔ.” <verse eid="EZK 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 2:2" />Aatɔɔkakatɛko mi ni yi, Ninwuna nwu labuo mi kaamɛ aabatakatɛ mi aase di nkpaa nii suoto, ni lanu nwɔ aatɔɔkakatɛko mi nɛ.<verse eid="EZK 2:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 2:3" />Aatɔkɔ mi alɛ: “Otii obi, kokpee fɔ Israel batii ɔkyɛ, di batokopĩtɛ kale ka nintɔɔtaka bayɛ mi ni di suoto nfũ; mma ku bate lɛma lɛtaka bayɛ mi di suoto diɛbadu miɛ dii le mmle. <verse eid="EZK 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 2:4" />Batii ba ɔkyɛ kokpee fɔ ni nle batii ba ninambu ni lɛsaa, bakpe ni kafɔɔ onunsie. Laatɔkɔ ma falɛ, ‘Nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE Kplɛ nwu kobuɛ ni alɛ.’ <verse eid="EZK 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 2:5" />Bɛɛkyɔɔ atoko woo, beesĩ woo- diekye batokopĩtɛ bale- babatofo alɛ ɔlaabuɛtɛtɛ owo ntodiwɛ ma kaamɛ. <verse eid="EZK 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 2:6" />Kafɔɔ, otii obi, tanyɛkɛ ma ee faayɛkɛ sɛlaa lɛma. Tanyɛkɛ, kuntɛ akuna ku siwuu simuu lɛmana fɔ siekyi, fasi kafɔɔ di nkpakana kamɛ. Tanyɛkɛ sɛlaa se boobuɛ nii ee baakpee fɔ difu, nu di batokopĩtɛ batii bale. <verse eid="EZK 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 2:7" />Dikpeni feebuɛ sɛlaa nii fɛɛta ma, bɛɛkyɔɔ atoko woo, beesĩ woo, diekye batokopĩtɛ bale. <verse eid="EZK 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 2:8" />Kafɔɔ afɔ yi, otii obi, kyɔɔ atoko di ɔlaa wɔ kɔtɔkɔ fɔ ni. Tambla otokopĩ fɛle batokopĩtɛ nwu; bɛ kanya lɛfɔ faale lɛsaa le kɔta fɔ ni.”<verse eid="EZK 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 2:9" />Ninfɛ lanyu nɛ, ni lanya kɔnɛɛ lananfi kuakyɔɔ mi nɛ. Kukũ kunwii lasiɛ di kɔnɛɛ nwu kamɛ, <verse eid="EZK 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 2:10" />ni aafukuti kũ di anu nii nɛ. Baakpana sikunu ku kaku owi ku dibuo sɛlaa baatika di nkyɛ nwu nnyɔ suoto.<verse eid="EZK 2:10" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="EZK 3" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 3:1" />Ni di Yaa latɔkɔ mi alɛ, “Otii obi, le lɛsaa le ninte fɔ ni di anu, wee kukũ ko mmle; faakyɛ falaakakatɛ fata Israel batii.” <verse eid="EZK 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 3:2" />Nioso labɛ kanya nii, ni aatɛɛ kukũ nwu lawee nɛ.<verse eid="EZK 3:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 3:3" />Ninfɛ aatɔkɔ mi alɛ, “Otii obi, wee kukũ ko mmle kɔta fɔ ni, faayiisa kafutu lɛfɔ ku nkũ.” Nioso lawee kũ, ni kuate mɛnɛmɛnɛ fɛ bablɔ di kanya nii kamɛ nɛ.<verse eid="EZK 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 3:4" />Ninfɛ aatɔkɔ mi alɛ: “Otii obi, tɔɔkyɛ Israel batii nfũ kanunua faalaabuɛ sɛlaa nii fata ma. <verse eid="EZK 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 3:5" />Diele batii ba lɛkakatɛ niɛkpɔkpɔtɔ ni di sele lɛma nkpe ni osie ɔkyɛ beekpee fɔ, kafɔɔ Israel batii nfũ- <verse eid="EZK 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 3:6" />diele batii kpinwu ba lɛkakatɛ niɛkpɔkpɔtɔ ni di sele lɛma kafɔɔ nkpe ni osie, mba sele fanamafuo ni kasɔ onu. Nwaako nse nkpee fɔ ɔkyɛ lɛma yi, batabakyɔɔ fɔ atoko. <verse eid="EZK 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 3:7" />Kafɔɔ Israel batii dilootuna alɛ bɔɔkyɔɔ fɔ atoko, diekye blootuna alɛ bɔɔkyɔɔ mi ni atoko, ta Israel batii bamuu nkpe ni atoole osie ku onunsie oso. <verse eid="EZK 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 3:8" />Kafɔɔ kamata fɔ fanwɛ kamakata ku letoole osie fɛ mmle bate nii. <verse eid="EZK 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 3:9" />Kamabla katũ lɛfɔ fɛ difuɔ le ninkpe osie dilenke nii, ninwɛ osie ninlenkee lɛklɛklɛfuɔ. Tanyɛkɛ ma ee baakpee fɔ difu, nu bale batokopĩtɛ.”<verse eid="EZK 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 3:10" />Ni aatɔkɔ mi alɛ, “Otii obi, kyɔɔ atoko nwaa, faamufũ kafɔɔ sɛlaa nii simuu kamabuɛ ntɔkɔ fɔ ni fakpee di otu. <verse eid="EZK 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 3:11" />Tɔɔkyɛ okpoo lɛfɔ batii ba ninsi ni di sɛlanle kamɛ ɔkyɛ kanunua faalaakakatɛ fata ma. Tɔkɔ ma falɛ, ‘Nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE Kplɛ nwu kobuɛ ni alɛ,’ Bɛɛkyɔɔ atoko woo, beesĩ woo.”<verse eid="EZK 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 3:12" />Ninfɛ di Ninwuna nwu latakatɛ mi katoo nɛ, ni lanu sɛlɔ dikpududuu osie kanya di sɛmaa nii- Baatansa SAATE nwu leklekle di kasiɛkɔ nɔɔ!- <verse eid="EZK 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 3:13" />asaa ya ninkpe ni nkpa afoko nwu niatɔɔlɔɔfɔ ni baawo sɛlɔ ku bakeke nkpaa be di ɔlɔɔkɔ lɛma sɛlɔ lakpududuu osie kanya. <verse eid="EZK 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 3:14" />Ninfɛ di Ninwuna nwu latakatɛsa mi katoo, ni aakpaa mi aasifiko nɛ. Ni lasifi di ninyinyii ku ninwuna nii ɔblɔ kamɛ, ku SAATE nwu kɔnɛɛ siene ko niatika mi ni di suoto nɛ. <verse eid="EZK 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 3:15" />Ni lawa balanle ba niasiɛ ni di Tel-Abib di Kebar Okle kotoko nfũ nɛ. Ni lawɛ ma kaamɛ ninfa, di lɛba le baasiɛ ni, ayi akuɛnsĩ- di nnɛɛ lefee kamɛ nɛ.<verse eid="EZK 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">SAATE Nwu Ladiki Hesekiel Fɛ Nyuntɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 3:16" />Di ayi akuɛnsĩ nwu kayɛntɛkɔ yi, SAATE nwu ɔlaa lawa kuatɛɛ alɛ: <verse eid="EZK 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 3:17" />“Otii obi, ntɔɔyɔ fɔ lɛbla nyuntɛ lɛta Israel batii; nioso nu ɔlaa wɔ kamabuɛ ni, faasĩ kafɔɔ ɔlaa fata ma ku ɔlaa wɔ niekye ni ɔkyɛ nii. <verse eid="EZK 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 3:18" />Nse lɛtɔkɔ kpiletɛ nlɛ, ‘Nwaako fabakpi,’ fanansĩ ɔlaa fatɔɔ ee fakakatɛ fatɔɔ fadiki nwɔ di sisuku kpile nɔɔ suoto alɛ aawɛ nkpa nɔɔ yi, kpiletɛ nwu kamakpi di okpile nɔɔ kamɛ, ni ami kamakaalɛ ntɔ nɔɔ nkyeko nnɛɛ lɛfɔ. <verse eid="EZK 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 3:19" />Kafɔɔ nse feesĩ ɔlaa fɛɛta kpiletɛ nwu, anankyi di akpilesaa nɔɔ suoto ee akyi di sisuku kpile nɔɔ suoto yi, abakpi di sikpile nɔɔ kamɛ; kafɔɔ fatoodiki nkpa lɛfɔ.<verse eid="EZK 3:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 3:20" />“Nkpo kafɔɔ, nse tininitɛ lekyi di ɔsaabla tinini nɔɔ suoto ɛɛbla okpile, lɛyɔ lewosoku lɛtɛ di anu nɔɔ eetuula yi, abakpi. Ta fanansĩ ɔlaa fatɔɔ ni oso yi, abakpi di sikpile nɔɔ ɔbla kamɛ. Blɔbanyuma sɛsaabla tinini se aabla nii, ni kamakaalɛ ntɔ nɔɔ nkyeko nnɛɛ lɛfɔ. <verse eid="EZK 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 3:21" />Kafɔɔ nse feesĩ ɔlaa fɛɛta tininitɛ nwu falɛ atambla okpile, anambla okpile kafɔɔ yi, ni nwaako abasiɛ nkpa, diekye aanu ɔlaa osĩ ɔta nwu, ni fabadiki nkpa lɛfɔ.”<verse eid="EZK 3:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZK 3:22" />SAATE nwu kɔnɛɛ latika mi di suoto ninfa, ni aatɔkɔ mi alɛ, “Taka faadie fakyɛ kasɔ lakataa nwu, nfa kamakakatɛ nta fɔ nɛ.” <verse eid="EZK 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZK 3:23" />Nioso lataka ladie lakyɛ kasɔ lakataa nwu. Ni di SAATE nwu leklekle layila ninfa fɛle leklekle le lanya ni di Kebar Okle kotoko, ni lafuusa anu kaasɔ nɛ.<verse eid="EZK 3:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZK 3:24" />Ninfɛ di Ninwuna nwu lababuo mi kaamɛ, ni aatakatɛ mi aase di nkpaa nii suoto nɛ. Aakakatɛ aatɛɛ, aatɔkɔ mi alɛ: “Tɔɔkyɛ, falaasɛɛ suoto lɛfɔ fakpee di leyo lɛfɔ kamɛ. <verse eid="EZK 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EZK 3:25" />Ni afɔ, otii obi, babanii fɔ ku sikũ; babaninii fɔ alɛ flɔbafuo odie ɔkyɛ batii nwu kamɛ. <verse eid="EZK 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EZK 3:26" />Kamata ɔkplalomii lɛfɔ nnu kunkaa di katoo lɛnyasi lɛfɔ alɛ faalo kanana fanamafuo ni ɔlaa osĩ ɔta ma, nu bale batokopĩtɛ. <verse eid="EZK 3:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EZK 3:27" />Kafɔɔ nse lɛkakatɛ lɛta fɔ yi, kamatikiti fɔ kanya fantɔkɔ ma falɛ, ‘Nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE Kplɛ nwu kobuɛ ni alɛ.’ Otii lele nimakyɔɔ atoko yi, tɔɔ akyɔɔ atoko, otii lele kafɔɔ nimasĩ atoko ɔkyɔɔ yi, tɔɔ asĩ atoko ɔkyɔɔ; diekye batokopĩtɛ bale.<verse eid="EZK 3:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="EZK 4" />
  <para style="s1">Hesekiel Ladiki Dituosaa Aatuo Di Yerusalem Ɔwɔɔsa Suoto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 4:1" />“Otii obi, nunua yi, yɔ kɔtɛ lɛkpanafuɔ fatɛ di anu lɛfɔ faatá Yerusalem okpoo kplɛ nwu fatika niini suoto. <verse eid="EZK 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 4:2" />Faamana nwu fakyi: faatofo ayo banyuntɛ ntakalekɔ ninwu suoto, faapɛ ditii falaadunko nwu, bla bakpɛtɛ nsiɛkɔ ninwu suoto, faatɛ kafɔɔ oyoyiɛ abiɛsaa fakyisa nwu. <verse eid="EZK 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 4:3" />Di afɔ kafɔɔ yi, faayɔ abɔɔsaa bɛɛsi fase fɛ abɔɔsaa oyoyiɛ di afɔ ku okpoo kplɛ nwu ntɛɛ, faamunikĩisa anu lɛfɔ fakyɔɔ okpoo nwu. Kubasiɛ di ɔmana okyi nwu kalɔ, ni afɔ fabamana nwu fankyi. Nle mmle nimale nsũlɛtɛsaa ninta Israel kale nɛ.<verse eid="EZK 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 4:4" />“Ni faate di ɔmɛntukyɛ lɛfɔ, faayɔ Israel kale letokonanfi fatika di suoto lɛfɔ. Ayi ya lɛpɔ kanya fabate ni di ɔfankyi lɛfɔ nwu suoto fabatuka letoko nanfi lɛma nwu nɛ. <verse eid="EZK 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 4:5" />Lɛyɔ ayi lɛpɔ nwu okle fɛ sikpile lɛma alɛɛ lɛta fɔ. Nioso di ayi alafa atiɛ-afosi-anaasĩ fabatuka Israel kale sikpile.<verse eid="EZK 4:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 4:6" />“Nse fatooloo nle mmle yi, faakple faklɛfate, kafɔɔ di obe wɔ mmle yi, te di koletanɛɛkyɛ lɛfɔ, faatuka Yuda kale letoko nanfi. Lɛta fɔ ayi afosi-ana, dii ninwii diɛta lɛlɛɛ biala. <verse eid="EZK 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 4:7" />Munikĩisa anu lɛfɔ fakyɔɔ Yerusalem wɔ bɛɛmana beekyi ni, faabuɛ ɔlaa ninwu suoto fatɛ ku kɔnɛɛ lɛfɔ fukuti. <verse eid="EZK 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 4:8" />Kamanii fɔ ku sikũ alɛ flɔbafuo omunikĩi di ɔfankyi onwii fafe ɔfankyi bamba ninaase di obe wɔ feeloo ni ɔmana okyi lɛfɔ ayi nwu.<verse eid="EZK 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 4:9" />“Ni afɔ yi, yɔ akpaa ku kamɔɔ, ayii ku aketeku, atitabi ku akaafɔbi; fakuɔ fakpete di dibukii ninwii kamɛ fase, faayɔ fafiɛ bloblo fata suoto lɛfɔ. Ayi alafa atiɛ-afosi-anaasĩ kamɛ fabale bloblo nwu, di obe wɔ fate ni di ɔfankyi lɛfɔ suoto. <verse eid="EZK 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 4:10" />Klapoosa alesaa ya fabale ni dii biala dibla kilo onwii ɔfã-dikuu nɔɔ. Le alesaa nwu kafɔɔ di obe wɔ bɛɛtɛ ni kanya. <verse eid="EZK 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 4:11" />Klapoosa kafɔɔ ntu abo anyɔ, faanyi mi dii biala di obe wɔ bɛɛtɛ ni kanya. <verse eid="EZK 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 4:12" />Le alesaa nwu fɛ mmle fabale ni eyo; wa mi di batii nwu anu, faayɔ batii mbi fabla ntɔɔni.” <verse eid="EZK 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 4:13" />Ninfɛ di SAATE nwu labuɛ alɛ, “Nkpo di Israel batii kamale alesaa ya ninanklekle ni di nnle be kamɛ kamatɔɔ ma nkpee ni nɛ.”<verse eid="EZK 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 4:14" />Ninfɛ labuɛ nlɛ, “SAATE Kplɛ, Kuote nkpo! Ninkpɔnɔfɔsa suoto nii diidii. Diayɔ ni di sekosopo nii obe diɛbadu ni nua, diidii ninle lɛsalɛsaa kuninwii niekpi dite ni, ee nnwɔ di lepoo kamɛ babɔkɛɛ lɛbɛbɛɛ nii. Diidii sina se ninanklekle ni kusinwii diikyɛ mi kanya.”<verse eid="EZK 4:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 4:15" />Ni aabuɛ alɛ, “Diɛtɛ dilɛ, kamata fɔ fan-wa alesaa lɛfɔ di banankyue mbi suoto, dilɔbasinle ni di batii mbi suoto.”<verse eid="EZK 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 4:16" />Ninfɛ aatɔkɔ mi alɛ: “Otii obi, kamata alesaa ndiɛ Yerusalem ɔkyɛ. Batii nwu kamale alesaa ya bɛɛklapoosa ni di lɛyɛkɛ kamɛ, man-nyi kafɔɔ ntu be bɛɛklapoosa ni di nnɛɛ lefee kamɛ, <verse eid="EZK 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 4:17" />diekye alesaa ku ntu ɔlaa kamawɛ osie. Dibabla ma ɔkpɛ di bawo lɛma anu man-wɔɔ kafɔɔ ta sikpile lɛma oso.<verse eid="EZK 4:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="EZK 5" />
  <para style="s1">Hesekiel Lanwiɛ Sinwini Nɔɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 5:1" />“Afɔ, otii obi, yɔ kapamii ka ninkpe ni kobe faayɔ ka fabla fɛ disinwiɛtɛ kakpaasupamii fakpaasu disi ku okusu lɛfɔ. Ni faayɔ lɛklapoosaa fasɛ sinwini nwu kamɛ. <verse eid="EZK 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 5:2" />Nse ɔmana okyi lɛfɔ nwu ntooloo yi, faafiɛ sinwini nwu dikyuu tiɛfa ninwii ku ɔtɔ di okpoo kplɛ nwu ntɛɛ. Yɔ dikyuu tiɛfa nwu ninwii nimuu fasasafɔ ku kapamii fawiwii fakyiko okpoo kplɛ nwu. Faayɔ dikyuu tiɛfa nwu ninwii kafɔɔ fasa fakpete kɔɔfɛɛfɔ. Diekye kamabɔkɔtɛ kapamii ntikanko ma. <verse eid="EZK 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 5:3" />Kafɔɔ diki enwini ɛsɛɛ fanii di akpeele lɛfɔ atokosi fasifiko. <verse eid="EZK 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 5:4" />Kple fadiki ɛsɛɛ di n-se feediki ni kamɛ fakpee di ɔtɔ fiɛ. Ɔtɔ kamakye ninfa kunkpɛ kunsifi Israel kale kamuu.<verse eid="EZK 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 5:5" />“Nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE Kplɛ nwu kobuɛ ni alɛ: Nnya Yerusalem wɔ lɛyɔ lɛtɛ ni di nnle nwu ntɛɛntɛɛ, di nnle mmuu lɛmana nwu beekyi ni. <verse eid="EZK 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 5:6" />Kafɔɔ Yerusalem lataka aayila di afiofa nii ku sɛsaabla nii suoto amumu kanya aalenkee nnle be niɛmana nwɔ diekyi nii. Atoosĩ afiofa nii, aakyɛ kafɔɔ di sɛsaabla nii sisuku suoto.<verse eid="EZK 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 5:7" />“Nkpo oso nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE Kplɛ nwu kobuɛ ni alɛ: Biabla amumusaa bialenkee nnle be niɛmana ye beekyi nii, bitatikanko kafɔɔ sɛsaabla nii ee biklee afiofa nii. Bia bitabla di nnle be niɛmana ye beekyi ni ablasaa suoto.<verse eid="EZK 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 5:8" />“Nkpo oso nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE Kplɛ nwu kobuɛ ni alɛ: Yerusalem, ami omu nii n-yɛ ye di suoto, kamawako letoko nanfi di suoto lee di nnle nwu anu. <verse eid="EZK 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 5:9" />Ta ayududusaa afiɔtii lee nwu oso yi, kamabla ye lɛsaa le ninadibla ni diidii, namasinkple mbla ni kafɔɔ diidii. <verse eid="EZK 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 5:10" />Nkpo oso babibate kamawee babi lɛma, babi kafɔɔ kamawee bate lɛma. Kamayɔ letoko nanfi n-wako di suoto lee, ninsamiisa batii lee ba niebu basi ni nkpa kafɔɔ nkpete kɔɔfɛɛfɔ. <verse eid="EZK 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 5:11" />Nkpo oso, nwaako lɛnya nkpe ni nkpa, SAATE Kplɛ nwu niebuɛ alɛ, ta fatɔɔyɔ ni atembi nyakatãa ku ayududusaa lɛfɔ sɛsaabla amuu fɛɛkpɔnɔfɔsa ni kakleklekɔ nii oso yi, ami omu kamatekete sibualɛ nii di suoto lɛfɔ; namanya fɔ nyaami ee n-yɔ nkyɛ fɔ. <verse eid="EZK 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 5:12" />Ofiɛ kpile kamalo batii lɛfɔ dikyuu tiɛfa ninwii ee kɔka kamawɔɔsa ma di kamɛ lɛfɔ; dikyuu tiɛfa bamba kamanɔɔ di kapamii kanya di seyoyiɛ lee sɛmaa; kamasamiisa dikyuu tiɛfa yɛntɛle kafɔɔ nkpete di kɔfɛɛfɔ kamɛ, nimbɔkɔtɛ kapamii kafɔɔ ntikanko ma.<verse eid="EZK 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 5:13" />“Ni ɔblɔ nii kamaloo, ɔblɔ yakayaka nii kafɔɔ di suoto lɛma kamayɔɔ, ni otu ntoote mi nɛ. Ni nse ntɔɔblako ɔblɔ yakayaka nii ɔkpɛ di suoto lɛma leloo yi, ni babatofo alɛ ami SAATE nwu niɛkakatɛ di sɛsɔfɔwo ɔkpɛ nii kamɛ nɛ.<verse eid="EZK 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 5:14" />“Kamawɔɔsa fɔ nimbla fɔ kafɔɔ ditufasaa di nnle be niɛmana fɔ diekyi ni kamɛ, di mba bamuu ninwaalɛ manfe ni di anu lɛfɔ. <verse eid="EZK 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 5:15" />Fabale ditufasaa ku lɛmansaa, ɔlaa disinsaa ku lɛyɛkɛsaa fanta nnle be niɛmana fɔ diekyi ni, nse lɛta letoko nanfi lɛwa di suoto lɛfɔ di ɔblɔ ku lɛblɔfiɛ yakayaka kamɛ ku ɔlaa osĩ ɔta di kakuo kanya. Ami SAATE nwu niebuɛ. <verse eid="EZK 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 5:16" />Nse lɛtaa ye ku kawɔɔ kɔka kɔtaa kpile nii lekpee ye yi, kamataa nwɔɔsa ye. Kamayɔ kɔka ɔkpɛ kanya ka ninkpe ni osie n-wako di suoto lee nta alesaa lee kakyekɔ kafɔɔ mbudi. <verse eid="EZK 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 5:17" />Kamadiki kɔka ku babɔkɛɛ yakayaka nkpee ye, manta ye mimbla batii ba ninaa ni babi. Ofiɛ kpile ku ntɔ owii kamafiɛ anfe ye kaamɛ. Kamayɔ kapamii kafɔɔ di suoto lee. Ami SAATE nwu niebuɛ.”<verse eid="EZK 5:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="EZK 6" />
  <para style="s1">SAATE Nwu Lekyidi Afiɔ Kasumu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 6:1" />Ni di SAATE nwu ɔlaa lawa kuatɛɛ alɛ: <verse eid="EZK 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 6:2" />“Otii obi, yɔ anu lɛfɔ fakyɔɔ Israel abokote suoto; faabuɛ ɔlaa kuoyila nya di suoto, <verse eid="EZK 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 6:3" />faabuɛ falɛ: ‘Oo Israel abokote, nu SAATE Kplɛ nwu ɔlaa. Nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE Kplɛ nwu kobuɛ antɔkɔ ni abokote ku akpenkpe, awɛ ku sɛtaata alɛ: nfɛ kamayɔ kapamii di suoto lee, kamawɔɔsa kafɔɔ ntakalekɔ lee nwu. <verse eid="EZK 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 6:4" />Kamakpakpaa seleɔta akyikye lee, mbibiɛ kafɔɔ olufui seleɔta akyikye lee; kamalo batii lee di afiɔtii lee anu. <verse eid="EZK 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 6:5" />Kamayɔ Israel batii bakpi ntɛ di afiɔtii lɛma anu, masamiisa akufi lee kafɔɔ nkyakasa seleɔta akyikye lee. <verse eid="EZK 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 6:6" />Kakɔ lele bisi yi, sekpoo nwu kamate sifukuti, mambibiɛ kafɔɔ ntakalekɔ nwu, alɛ seleɔta akyikye lee kamate di kawɔɔ ku kalalaa kamɛ. Olufui seleɔta akyikye lee kamabiɛ ante kaasɔ, asaa ya biabla ni kafɔɔ kamawɔɔ. <verse eid="EZK 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 6:7" />Batii lee kamakpi mante kaamɛ lee, ni bibatofo bilɛ ami ninle SAATE nwu nɛ.<verse eid="EZK 6:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 6:8" />“ ‘Kafɔɔ kamata batii bawo nsiɛ nkpa, diekye batii lee bawo kamatoso kapamii nwu, nse bɛɛsamiisa ye beekpee di nsɔ ku nnle nwu kamɛ. <verse eid="EZK 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 6:9" />Ni nnle be bɛɛkpaa ma beesifiko ni sɛlanle kamɛ, mba niatoso ni kamanyuma mi- mmle di afiɔtii osumu di situ lɛma lakpee mi ni sɛnyaami, situ se niakyisa kamaa siatɛɛ ni, ku anu lɛma ya niatika ni di afiɔtii lɛma suoto. Suoto lɛma kamakpɛ ma oyududu di akpilesaa ya baabla ni ku ayududusaa lɛma sɛsaabla simuu. <verse eid="EZK 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 6:10" />Ni babatofo alɛ ami ninle SAATE nwu nɛ; diele kasakasa lafunaa nlɛ kamawako ɔlaa kpile wɔ mmle di suoto lɛma.<verse eid="EZK 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 6:11" />“ ‘Nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE Kplɛ nwu kobuɛ ni alɛ: Pɛ anɛɛkya, faatufu kɔkpaa lɛfɔ kaasɔ, faawi fabuɛ falɛ “Ao!” ta Israel batii asaa kpile ku ayududusaa sɛsaabla simuu oso yi, babanɔɔ di kapamii kanya, kɔka ku ofiɛ kpile kamɛ. <verse eid="EZK 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 6:12" />Ofiɛ kpile kamalo nnwɔ ninkpe ni di kakyonkɔ, nnwɔ kafɔɔ niɛtɛɛtɛɛ ni kamanɔɔ di kapamii kanya, nnwɔ kafɔɔ nietoso ɛɛwɛ ni nkpa kamakpi ta kɔka oso. Nkpo kamasoosa ɔblɔ yakayaka nii di suoto lɛma nɛ. <verse eid="EZK 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 6:13" />Ni babatofo alɛ ami ninle SAATE nwu nɛ, nse batii lɛma lekpi bate di afiɔtii lɛma kamɛ, bɛɛmana seleɔta akyikye lɛma beekyi, di lekpenkpe takale biala suoto ku abokote amuu osi, di kowoso biala niefukuti ni ku kusiɛntu biala ninkpe ni afata kalɔ- di aba ya manta ni olufui kɔnɔnkɔnɔ manta ni afiɔtii lɛma amuu. <verse eid="EZK 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 6:14" />Ni kamananfi kɔnɛɛ nii di suoto lɛma, mbla kafɔɔ kasɔ lɛma kante kafukuti diɛyɔ ni di ɔfaafuu diɛlaadu ni Ribla-<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6.14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">aba awo kafɔɔ alɛ Dibla</char></note> kakɔ lele beesiɛ. Ni babatofo alɛ ami ninle SAATE nwu nɛ.’ ”<verse eid="EZK 6:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="EZK 7" />
  <para style="s1">Israel Kalookɔ Ntɔɔtɛɛtɛɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 7:1" />Ni di SAATE nwu ɔlaa lawa kuatɛɛ alɛ: <verse eid="EZK 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 7:2" />“Otii obi, nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE Kplɛ nwu kobuɛ antɔkɔ ni Israel kasɔ alɛ: Kalookɔ! Kalookɔ ntɔɔwa di kasɔ akɔ ana nwu suoto. <verse eid="EZK 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 7:3" />Kalookɔ nwu nfɛ ntika ye di suoto, kamanyɛɛnɛ ni ɔblɔ nii kafɔɔ nkpete ni di suoto lee. Kamakanko ye di ɔsaabla lee kanya, ninta ye letota kafɔɔ di ayududusaa lee sɛsaabla suoto. <verse eid="EZK 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 7:4" />Namanya ye nyaami ee n-yɔ nkyɛ ye; nwaako kamata ye koto di ɔsaabla ku ayududusaa ablasaa lee ya ninsi ye ni kaamɛ. Ni bibatofo bilɛ ami ninle SAATE nwu nɛ.<verse eid="EZK 7:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 7:5" />“Nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE nwu kobuɛ ni alɛ: Ɔlaa otũ kɔwa! Ɔlaa otũ wɔ minadinu ni kɔwa. <verse eid="EZK 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 7:6" />Kalookɔ ntɔɔwa! Kalookɔ ntɔɔwa! Katɔɔtakatɛsa suoto nika katoo di suoto lee. Kalookɔ ntɔɔwa! <verse eid="EZK 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 7:7" />Kawɔɔ ntɔɔwa di suoto lee- aye ba ninsi ni di kasɔ nwu suoto. Obe nwu ntoowo, dii nwu ntɔɔtɛɛtɛɛ; difu nfɛ nkpe, diele suoto lɛyɔɔ di abokote nwu suoto. <verse eid="EZK 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 7:8" />Nfɛ kamanyɛɛnɛ ɔblɔ yakayaka nii nkpete ye di suoto, ninsoosa kafɔɔ lɛblɔfiɛ nii di suoto lee; kamakanko ye di ɔsaabla lee kanya, nta ye koto kafɔɔ di ayududusaa ablasaa lee amuu suoto. <verse eid="EZK 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 7:9" />Namanya ye nyaami ee n-yɔ nkyɛ ye; kamata ye koto di mmle di ɔsaabla lee nte ni kanya ku ayududusaa ablasaa ya ninsi ye ni kaamɛ. Ninfɛ bibatofo bilɛ ami SAATE nwu ninta letoko nanfi nɛ.<verse eid="EZK 7:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 7:10" />“Nyu lo, dii nwu ntoowo! Ditɔɔwa! Kawɔɔ lee ntɔɔtɛɛtɛɛ, kawesee nwu ntoodie afata, lɛkanta ntookpee atoto! <verse eid="EZK 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 7:11" />Amumu ɔbla ntoomuɔ eekple kawesee kɛɛta alɛ baananfi asiensiesaa kootoko; batii kubanwii dilɔbabu, dikudi kuninwii dilɔbabu- lɛsaawɛ kuninwii dilɔbawɛ, lɛsaa le niefũ ni kɔya kuninwii dilɔbawɛ. <verse eid="EZK 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 7:12" />Obe nwu ntoowo, dii nwu ntɔɔbabuo. Tanta asaayatɛ lapɔ ee asaasunsũtɛ labuo sɛnyaami, diekye lɛblɔfiɛ yakayaka nfɛ ntika di batii dikudi nwu nimuu suoto. <verse eid="EZK 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 7:13" />Asaasunsũtɛ dilɔbakple afũ kasɔ ka aasunsũ ni di obe wɔ di akyuu lɛma nwu anyɔ basi ni nkpa. Diekye blɔbasinkplesa odiki otuo wɔ bɛɛnya ni di batii dikudi nwu nimuu suoto. Ta sikpile lɛma oso yi, kuonwii lɛma dilɔbafuo nkpa nɔɔ ofũ. <verse eid="EZK 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 7:14" />Kuntɛ bɛɛfɛ dikyikyoo beelolaa kafɔɔ lɛsaa biala bɛɛtɛ yi, kuonwii dilɔbakyɛ kakpɛ, diekye lɛblɔfiɛ yakayaka nii nfɛ ntika di batii dikudi nwu nimuu suoto.<verse eid="EZK 7:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Letoko Nanfi Diɛta Ni Israel Sikpile</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 7:15" />“Kapamii nkpe di kɔba sɛɛmaa, ofiɛ kpile ku kɔka nsi di kamɛ; mba ninsi ni di lepoo kamɛ kamakpi di kapamii kanya, ofiɛ kpile ku kɔka kafɔɔ kamabɛbɛɛ mba ninsi ni di okpoo kplɛ kamɛ. <verse eid="EZK 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 7:16" />Mba bamuu niɛwɛ ni nkpa beetoso ni kamawɛ di abokote. Obiala mantootũuni fɛle sɛtaata kamɛ alaapɔɔ, ta obiala sikpile nɔɔ oso. <verse eid="EZK 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 7:17" />Kɔnɛɛ biala kamakpɔnɔɔ, dikunkyi biala kafɔɔ kamate kpiɛkpiɛ fɛ ntu. <verse eid="EZK 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 7:18" />Babanyukũ aboko mansiɛ kafɔɔ di lɛyɛkɛ kamɛ. Babatĩi anu lɛma ku sinunsɔ, mankpaasu asi lɛma kafɔɔ. <verse eid="EZK 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 7:19" />Babafuki koto fututu lɛma mantɛ di akpaka, koto sɛɛle lɛma kafɔɔ kamale lɛsaa le ninanklekle nii. Koto sɛɛle ku koto fututu lɛma dilɔbafuo ma odiki di SAATE nwu lɛblɔfiɛ yakayaka dii nwu suoto. Blɔbayɔ bakya kɔka lɛma ee bayiisa nfutu lɛma ku nni, diekye nni niata ma baatuula baabuo di okpile kamɛ nɛ. <verse eid="EZK 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 7:20" />Baakanta di anyɛnɛ lɛma ya niatɔɔlɛ ni onyu suoto, ni baayɔ nya baabla diyududusaa afiɔtii ku atɛmbi nyakatãa ninya nɛ. Nkpo oso kamamunikĩisa nya mbla lɛsaa le ninanklekle ni nta ma. <verse eid="EZK 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 7:21" />Kamayɔ ni nimuu nkpee di bafɔɔ nnɛɛ fɛ kakpɛ kamɛ lɛsaa, fɛ diyusaa kafɔɔ nta bakpiletɛ di kasɔ suoto, nkpɔnɔfɔsa ni. <verse eid="EZK 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZK 7:22" />Kamakyisa anu nii di suoto lɛma, mankpɔnɔfɔsa lɛba nii le niefũ ni kɔya kafɔɔ; bayu kamabuo ni kamɛ mankpɔnɔfɔsa ni.<verse eid="EZK 7:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZK 7:23" />“Bla sɛkpɛnkyɛ, diekye kasɔ nwu ntooyii ku ntɔ owii, okpoo kplɛ nwu kafɔɔ ntooyii ku amumu ɔbla. <verse eid="EZK 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZK 7:24" />Kamakpaa nnle be niɛtɛ bakpe ni amumu balenke ni n-wako mammafũ ayo lɛma; kamayɔ sientɛ nwu suoto katoo ɔtakatɛ n-wako kalookɔ, mankpɔnɔfɔsa kafɔɔ nkleklekɔ lɛma nwu. <verse eid="EZK 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EZK 7:25" />Nse difu lɛwa, babamiɛ atoko ɔkyɛ ole, kafɔɔ kuninwii dilɔbawɛ. <verse eid="EZK 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EZK 7:26" />Anyanyasaa di anyanyasaa suoto kamawa, ku alɛ, alɛ di alɛ, alɛ suoto. Babamiɛ alɛ baawɛ odiki otuo mankyeko ɔlaabuɛtɛtɛ nfũ; olebatatɛ kufiofa asaa otuo kamayu, nkpo kafɔɔ di banɔɔfo kɔkà kamayu nɛ. <verse eid="EZK 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EZK 7:27" />Ɔka nwu kamawi, ninta nnɛɛ nfee ɔnɔɔfotii nwu, batii nnɛɛ di kasɔ nwu kafɔɔ kamatũtũkũ. Kamablako suoto lɛma ɔkpɛ di ɔsaabla lɛma kanya, kamakanko ma kafɔɔ di n-yilakɔ lɛma mmu kanya. Ninfɛ babatofo alɛ ami ninle SAATE nwu nɛ.”<verse eid="EZK 7:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="EZK 8" />
  <para style="ms">Hesekiel Odiki Otuo Nyɔɔfa Di Yaa Suoto</para>
  <para style="s1">Afiɔ Kasumu Di Yerusalem</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 8:1" />Di lɛlɛɛ kuɔnle kamɛ, di kɔwɛntɛ kuɔnle dii nɔnle suoto, lasiɛ ni di leyo nii kamɛ, di Yuda banɔɔfo kafɔɔ lasiɛ ni di anu nii yi, SAATE Kplɛ nwu kɔnɛɛ labatika mi di suoto ninfa. <verse eid="EZK 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 8:2" />Ni lanyu nii, ni lanya lɛsaa ninwii fɛle otii letembi nɛ. Latɔɔnya lɛsaa le niate ni fɛ ɔtɔ̀ nɔɔ diasooko diɔwa ni kasɔ labla fɛle ɔtɔ, diayɔ ni ninfa kafɔɔ diasifi ni osi nɔɔ letembi lakpa fɛ lɛbɔɔsaa le niebe ni ɔtɔ bɔmbɔ. <verse eid="EZK 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 8:3" />Aananfi lɛsaa le niate ni fɛle kɔnɛɛ aakyɔɔ, ni aamufũ mi di disi nii sinwini nɛ. Ni di Ninwuna nwu lakɛnkɛ mi aasakasa di kasɔ ku osi obo nɛ. Ni aakpaa mi di Yaa odiki otuo kamɛ aasifiko Yerusalem nɛ, aasifiko mi kaflɔnkɔ ka kaamɛ di katookasɔ kayoko di lɛba le di afiɔ ya ninta ni sɛsɔfɔwo ɔkpɛ layila nii. <verse eid="EZK 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 8:4" />Nyu lo, Israel Yaa nwu leklekle lawɛ di anu nii ninfa fɛ odiki otuo wɔ lanya ni di kasɔ lakataa nwu kamɛ.<verse eid="EZK 8:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 8:5" />Ninfɛ aatɔkɔ mi alɛ, “Otii obi, nyu fafenko katookasɔ.” Nioso lanyu, ni lanya afiɔ ya mmle ninkpɛ ni sɛsɔfɔwo di oleɔta akyikye katookasɔ kayoko nɛ.<verse eid="EZK 8:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 8:6" />Ni aatɔkɔ mi alɛ, “Otii obi, fɔɔnya lɛsaa le bɔɔbla ni- ayududusaa kplɛ ya di Israel batii kɔbla ni ninfũ, asaa ya nimatososa mi ni fanfa andiki ni di kakleklekɔ nii? Kafɔɔ fabanya bia asaa ya nikɔkpɛ ni oyududu alenke nii.”<verse eid="EZK 8:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 8:7" />Ninfɛ aakpaa mi aawako kaflɔnkɔ nwu kayoko nɛ. Lanyunyu, ni lanya kutuɛ kunwii di oyoyiɛ nwu kamɛ nɛ. <verse eid="EZK 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 8:8" />Ni aatɔkɔ mi alɛ, “Otii obi, kutu oyoyiɛ nwu kamɛ.” Nioso lakutu oyoyiɛ nwu kamɛ, ni lanya kayoko osuku ninfa nɛ.<verse eid="EZK 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 8:9" />Ni aatɔkɔ mi alɛ, “Buo kamɛ faalaanyu asaa kpile ku ayududusaa ya bɔɔbla ni ninfũ.” <verse eid="EZK 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 8:10" />Nioso labuo kamɛ lalaanyu, ni lanya asaa ya baatá baatika ni di seyoyiɛ nwu simuu suoto, asaa ateate amuu ya ninkpɔkɔ nii ku babɔkɛɛ ba ninkpɛ ni oyududu ku Israel batii afiɔ amuu. <verse eid="EZK 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 8:11" />Israel batii banɔɔfo afosi akuɛnsĩ layila nya di anu, Safan obisuɔtɔbi Yaasania kafɔɔ layila kaamɛ lɛma. Obiala laklee olufui lɛfiɛsaa di kɔnɛɛ nɔɔ, ni di olufui kɔyɔ kɔnɔnkɔnɔ latoodie nɛ.<verse eid="EZK 8:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 8:12" />Ni aatɔkɔ mi alɛ, “Otii obi, fatɔɔnya lɛsaa le di Israel batii banɔɔfo nwu kɔbla ni di ditunu kamɛ, obiala di nnwɔɔ omu nɔɔ difiɔyo kamɛ. Boobuɛ alɛ, ‘SAATE nwu dilɔɔnya wo; SAATE nwu ntosĩ kasɔ nwu.’ ” <verse eid="EZK 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 8:13" />Ni aakple aabuɛ alɛ, “Fabanya ma bɔɔbla ni asaa ya bia niɛbla ni ayududusaa alenke nii.”<verse eid="EZK 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 8:14" />Ninfɛ aakpaa mi aawako SAATE nwu leyo katookasɔ kayoko, ni lanya basanko lasiɛ ninfa, baatoowi kaku baatɔɔta Tamus nɛ. <verse eid="EZK 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 8:15" />Ni aatɔkɔ mi alɛ, “Otii obi, fɔɔnya nle mmle? Fabanya ayududusaa ya bia ninlenke ni nle mmle.”<verse eid="EZK 8:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 8:16" />Ninfɛ aakpaa mi aawako SAATE nwu leyo kaflɔnkɔ ka kaamɛ nɛ. Di olekatakɔ kayokontũ, di lɛkpata ku oleɔta akyikye obo. Basuɔtɔ fɛ afosi anyɔ-banɔɔ lawɛ ninfa. Baayɔ mmaa lɛma baakyɔɔ SAATE nwu olekatakɔ, anu lɛma kafɔɔ lakyɔɔ kufĩ katunkɔ, baatɔɔwa kasɔ baatɔɔta kufĩ di kufĩ katunkɔ.<verse eid="EZK 8:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 8:17" />Ni aatɔkɔ mi alɛ, “Otii obi, fatɔɔnya nle mmle? Lɛsaa biibii dile alɛ Yuda batii kabla ayududusaa ya mmle bɔɔbla ni ninfũ? Dikaatɛ alɛ baayɔ amumu ɔbla kafɔɔ man-yisa kasɔ nwu, mantookpee mi ɔblɔ obe lele? Nyu mmle bootufa mi mankpee mi ni sinunsɔ! <verse eid="EZK 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 8:18" />Nkpo oso kamadieko ma ku ɔblɔ; namanya ma nyaami ee n-yɔ nkyɛ ma. Nu booyiisa kudu mankpee mi di atoko yi, namakyɔɔ ma atoko.”<verse eid="EZK 8:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="EZK 9" />
  <para style="s1">Baananfi Yerusalem Kootoko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 9:1" />Ninfɛ lanu SAATE nwu lalɛɛ ku sɛlɔ osie kanya alɛ, “Kpaa okpoo kplɛ nwu banyuntɛ fawako ninfũ, di obiala aklee lɛkpɛsaa di kɔnɛɛ nɔɔ.” <verse eid="EZK 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 9:2" />Ni lanya basuɔtɔ bakuɔ lakye kayoko ka katoo niakyɔɔ ni katookasɔ lɛkyɛ anu baatɔɔwa nɛ, obiala laklee lɛkpɛsaa siene di kɔnɛɛ nɔɔ. Osuɔtɔ onwii niakpee ni akpeele fɛnɛnɛɛ lawɛ ku mma, di lɛsaa le mankpana ni asaa lasaka ni di ɔfankyi nɔɔ. Ni baawa baabayila di lɛbɔɔsaa sɛɛle oleɔta akyikye ɔlɔɔkɔ nɛ.<verse eid="EZK 9:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 9:3" />Ninfɛ di Israel Yaa nwu leklekle ladie di bakerubi nwu suoto di nfũ aayila ni aasifi osi, ni aakyɛ aasifi olekatakɔ nwu kayoko kanya nɛ. Ninfɛ di SAATE nwu lalɛɛ osuɔtɔ nwu niakpee ni akpeele fɛnɛnɛɛ, di lɛsaa le mankpana ni asaa lasaka ni di ɔfankyi nɔɔ nɛ. <verse eid="EZK 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 9:4" />Ni aatɔkɔ nwɔ alɛ, “Kyɛ faalaakyi Yerusalem okpoo kplɛ nwu faatɛ mba nikowi ni sɛnyaami ku sikududu nsũ di ntũ lɛma, di ayududusaa ya amuu bɔɔbla ni di okpoo kplɛ nwu kamɛ.”<verse eid="EZK 9:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 9:5" />Lakyɔɔ atoko, ni aatɔkɔ babule alɛ, “Bitikanko nwɔ biekyi okpoo kplɛ nwu, bieloloo batii, bitan-nya nyaami ee baakpɛ ye nyaami. <verse eid="EZK 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 9:6" />Bilo basuɔtɔ nɔɔfo, bakosopo ku bakpeele, basanko ku babisɔ, kafɔɔ bitankpanko nnwɔ di nsũ ntika ni kuonwii. Bikyekasɔ di kakleklekɔ nii.” Nioso baakye kasɔ ku banɔɔfo ba niawɛ ni di olekatakɔ nwu anu.<verse eid="EZK 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 9:7" />Ninfɛ aatɔkɔ ma alɛ, “Bikpɔnɔfɔsa olekatakɔ nwu biɛyɔ bakpi nwu bitɛtɛɛ di nflɔnkɔ nwu. Bitɔɔkyɛ!” Nioso baadie baasifi baalaakyekasɔ baatoolo batii di okpoo kplɛ nwu kamɛ. <verse eid="EZK 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 9:8" />Obe wɔ baatoolo ni batii, diabu ni lete nii yi, lafuusa anu kaasɔ, latoowi osie kanya nlɛ, “Ao, SAATE Kplɛ! Fɔɔwa Israel batii ba bamuu niebu basi ni nkpa ɔwɔɔsa di lɛblɔfiɛ yakayaka lɛfɔ le mmle foosoosa ni di Yerusalem suoto?”<verse eid="EZK 9:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 9:9" />Ni aatɔkɔ mi alɛ, “Israel ku Yuda batii sikpile ntoosii ɔpɔ; kasɔ nwu ntooyii ku ntɔ owii, okpoo kplɛ nwu kafɔɔ ntooyii ku onukwale ɔtanle. Boobuɛ alɛ, ‘SAATE nwu ntoosĩ kasɔ nwu; SAATE nwu dilɔɔnya.’ <verse eid="EZK 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 9:10" />Nioso namanya ma nyaami ee n-yɔ nkyɛ ma, kafɔɔ kamasoosa lɛsaa le bɛɛbla ni ntika di mma bamu nsintɛɛ.”<verse eid="EZK 9:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 9:11" />Ninfɛ di osuɔtɔ nwu niakpee ni akpeele fɛnɛnɛɛ, di lɛsaa le mankpana ni asaa lasaka ni di ɔfankyi nɔɔ lakplesa kanya aawako, aabuɛ alɛ, “Ntɔɔbla fɛ mmle faabuɛ nii.”<verse eid="EZK 9:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="EZK 10" />
  <para style="s1">SAATE Nwu Leklekle Ladie Di Olekatakɔ Nwu Diasifi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 10:1" />Lanyu nii, ni lanya lɛkakpomii ninwii di lɛsaa le manlɛɛ ni safir difuɔ letembi kamɛ di obo wɔ niate ni di bakerubi nwu nsintɛɛ nɛ. <verse eid="EZK 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 10:2" />Ni di SAATE nwu latɔkɔ osuɔtɔ nwu niekpee ni akpeele fɛnɛnɛɛ alɛ, “Buo di nkpaa be ninsi ni di bakerubi nwu kalɔ kamɛ. Kusii atɔkɔnii fakyeko bakerubi nwu kamɛ fayiisa nnɛɛ lɛfɔ, faasamiisa nya fakpete di okpoo kplɛ nwu kamɛ.” Ni lanyɔɔ aabuo kaamɛ nɛ.<verse eid="EZK 10:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 10:3" />Ni di bakerubi nwu layila di olekatakɔ nwu kalakasɔ lɛkyɛ di obe wɔ di osuɔtɔ nwu labuo ni kaamɛ, ni di lelokonkyɛ layii kaflɔnkɔ nwu kaamɛ nɛ. <verse eid="EZK 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 10:4" />Ninfɛ di SAATE nwu leklekle lataka di bakerubi nwu osi baasifi olekatakɔ nwu kayokontũ nɛ. Ni di lelokonkyɛ nwu layii olekatakɔ nwu, ni di SAATE nwu leklekle lɛkpa layii kaflɔnkɔ nwu pɔ nɛ. <verse eid="EZK 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 10:5" />Baatoonu bakerubi nwu afoko sɛlɔ fanfã dialaadu kaflɔnkɔ nwu kayi lɛkyɛ, fɛle Yaa wɔ Ninlenke ni sɛlɔ, nse ɔɔkakatɛ.<verse eid="EZK 10:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 10:6" />Obe wɔ di SAATE nwu ladiki ni osuɔtɔ nwu niakpee ni akpeele fɛnɛnɛɛ kanya alɛ, “Diki ɔtɔ fakyeko keke nkpaa kamɛ di bakerubi nwu kamɛ,” ni di osuɔtɔ nwu labuo kaamɛ aalaayila di kɔkpaa kunwii ɔlɔɔkɔ nɛ. <verse eid="EZK 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 10:7" />Ninfɛ di bakerubi nwu onwii lananfi kɔnɛɛ nɔɔ aakyɔɔ ɔtɔ wɔ niasiɛ ni di kamɛ lɛma nɛ. Ni aadiki atɔkɔnii nwu awo aakpee di osuɔtɔ nwu niakpee ni akpeele fɛnɛnɛɛ nnɛɛ, ni aafũ ɔtɔ nwu aadie aasifi nɛ. <verse eid="EZK 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 10:8" />(Baatɔɔnya lɛsaa le niate ni fɛle otii nnɛɛ di bakerubi nwu afoko kalɔ.)<verse eid="EZK 10:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 10:9" />Lanyu nii, ni lanya nkpaa nna di bakerubi nwu ɔlɔɔkɔ, kunwii lawɛ di kerubi biala ɔlɔɔkɔ; nkpaa nwu latɔɔkpa fɛle afuɔ ya manlɛɛ ni krisolite. <verse eid="EZK 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 10:10" />Nkpaa nwu nna letembi ladie bawo; kubiala late fɛle kɔkpaa nsi di kowo nɔɔ kamɛ. <verse eid="EZK 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 10:11" />Nse nkpaa nwu nkyɛ yi, nin-fuo ɔkyɛ di ɛfankyi ɛna nwu lele di bakerubi nwu lɛkyɔɔ ni anu suoto; bakeke nwu ninkyi nse bakerubi nwu nkyɛ. Bakerubi nwu nfe di kakɔ lele di disi nwu lɛkyɔɔ anu, alɛ dilaakyi nse dikyɛ nii. <verse eid="EZK 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 10:12" />Suoto lɛma simuu, di mmaa lɛma nkyakaa nii, nnɛɛ ku afoko lɛma layii ku anumbi, fɛ mmle di nkpaa nna lɛma nwu late nii. <verse eid="EZK 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 10:13" />Ni lanu baalɛɛ nkpaa nwu alɛ, “Kakitikɔ nkpaa.” <verse eid="EZK 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 10:14" />Kerubi nwu biala lawɛ anu ana: ɔkasale lale kerubi anu, ɔnyɔɔfa lale otii anu, otiɛfa lale kyata anu, ɔnaafa kafɔɔ lale klikpo anu.<verse eid="EZK 10:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 10:15" />Ninfɛ di bakerubi nwu lataka baafe katoo lɛkyɛ nɛ. N-ya mmle niale asaa ya ninkpe ni nkpa lanya ni di Kebar Okle kotoko nɛ. <verse eid="EZK 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 10:16" />Nse bakerubi nwu nkyɛ yi, nkpaa be di ɔlɔɔkɔ lɛma nkyɛ; nse bakerubi nwu lefukuti afoko lɛma kafɔɔ alɛ bɔɔflɛlɛtɛ mantaka kaasɔ yi, nkpaa nwu ninkpukuti di ɔlɔɔkɔ lɛma. <verse eid="EZK 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 10:17" />Nse bakerubi nwu leyila kloklo, nkpaa nwu kafɔɔ n-yila kloklo; nse bakerubi nwu kafɔɔ lɛflɛlɛtɛ kafɔɔ yi, nkpaa nwu ntaka ku mma, diekye asaa ya ninkpe ni nkpa ninwuna lasiɛ ma kaamɛ.<verse eid="EZK 10:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 10:18" />Ninfɛ di SAATE nwu leklekle lataka di olekatakɔ nwu kayokontũ ni dialayila di bakerubi nwu osi nɛ. <verse eid="EZK 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 10:19" />Obe wɔ lanyu ni yi, bakerubi nwu lafukuti afoko lɛma baaflɛlɛtɛ baataka kaasɔ. Nse bakyɛ, nkpaa nwu kafɔɔ nkyɛ ku mma. Ni baayila di kayokontũ ka nikofe ni SAATE nwu leyo kufĩ katunkɔ kayoko nɛ. Ni di Israel Yaa leklekle nwu lawɛ ma di osi nɛ.<verse eid="EZK 10:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 10:20" />N-ya mmle niale asaa ya ninkpe ni nkpa lanya ni di Israel Yaa nwu kalɔ di Kebar Okle kotoko, ninfɛ latofo nlɛ bakerubi baale nɛ. <verse eid="EZK 10:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 10:21" />Dibiala lawɛ anu ana ku afoko ana, lɛsaa ninwii kafɔɔ late fɛle otii nnɛɛ di afoko lɛma kalɔ. <verse eid="EZK 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZK 10:22" />Anu lɛma lawɛ letembi ninwii fɛ n-ya lanya ni di Kebar Okle kotoko. Dibiala lakyɛ tinini.<verse eid="EZK 10:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="EZK 11" />
  <para style="s1">Baalo Yerusalem Lɛpɔɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 11:1" />Ninfɛ di Ninwuna latakatɛ mi katoo, ni aakpaa mi aawako SAATE nwu leyo kayoko ka niakyɔɔ ni kufĩ katunkɔ anu nɛ. Basuɔtɔ afosi-anyɔ-banɔɔ lawɛ ninfa di kayoko nwu kayokontũ, ni lanya Asur obisuɔtɔbi Yaasania ku Benaia obisuɔtɔbi Pelatia, batii nwu batunletɛ di kamɛ lɛma nɛ. <verse eid="EZK 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 11:2" />Ni di SAATE nwu latɔkɔ mi alɛ, “Otii obi, nnya mba mmle ninle ni batii ba nikokũ ni kanwumbe, bɔɔta ni kafɔɔ disibu kpile di okpoo kplɛ wɔ mmle kamɛ nɛ. <verse eid="EZK 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 11:3" />Mambuɛ ni alɛ, ‘Obe diiwo alɛ baatofo ni ayo. Okpoo kplɛ wɔ mmle nle ɔkakutu, ni di awoo bule sina nɛ.’ <verse eid="EZK 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 11:4" />Nkpo oso buɛ ɔlaa fatɛ di suoto lɛma; otii obi, buɛ ɔlaa fatɛ.”<verse eid="EZK 11:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 11:5" />Ninfɛ di SAATE nwu Ninwuna labuo mi di suoto nɛ, ni aatɔkɔ mi alɛ mbuɛ nlɛ: “Nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE nwu kobuɛ ni alɛ: Oo Israel leyo, nkpo biobuɛ nɛ, kafɔɔ n-ye lɛsaa le nikofe ni di disibu lee kamɛ. <verse eid="EZK 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 11:6" />Bitoolo batii nii kpinwu di okpoo kplɛ wɔ mmle kamɛ, biɛta kafɔɔ sisuku ninwu leyii ku bakpi pɔ.<verse eid="EZK 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 11:7" />“Nkpo oso nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE Kplɛ nwu kobuɛ ni alɛ: Bakpi nwu biefuki biɛtɛ ni ninfa nle sina, okpoo kplɛ wɔ mmle kafɔɔ ninle ɔkakutu, kafɔɔ kamatososa ye ndiki ninwu kamɛ. <verse eid="EZK 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 11:8" />Min-yɛkɛ kapamii, kapamii nwu kafɔɔ ninle lɛsaa le kamayɔ n-wako ye ni di suoto nɛ, SAATE Kplɛ nwu niebuɛ. <verse eid="EZK 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 11:9" />Kamatososa ye ndiki di okpoo kplɛ nwu, nin-yɔ ye nkpee di bafɔɔ nnɛɛ, nin-yɔ letokonanfi kafɔɔ n-wako ye di suoto. <verse eid="EZK 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 11:10" />Bibanɔɔ di kapamii kanya, kamakanko ye kafɔɔ di Israel amɛ suoto. Ninfɛ bibatofo bilɛ ami ninle SAATE nwu nɛ. <verse eid="EZK 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 11:11" />Okpoo kplɛ wɔ mmle dilɔbale ɔkakutu kuta ye, ee bile sina ninwu kamɛ; kamakanko ye di Israel amɛ suoto. <verse eid="EZK 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 11:12" />Ni bibatofo bilɛ ami ninle SAATE nwu nɛ. Diekye bitatikanko sɛsaabla nii ee bile afiofa nii, kafɔɔ biabla di nnle be niɛmana ye diekyi ni afiofa kanya.”<verse eid="EZK 11:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 11:13" />Di obe wɔ latoobuɛ ɔlaa latɔɔtɛ nii yi, Benaia obisuɔtɔbi Pelatia lakpi. Ninfɛ lafuusa anu kaasɔ, lawi kaku layiisa kudu osie kanya nlɛ, “Ao, SAATE Kplɛ! Fabawɔɔsa Israel batii ba niebu basi ni nkpa klekle?”<verse eid="EZK 11:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɔlaa Wɔ Di Yaa Labuɛ Aatɛ Aata Ni Balanle</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 11:14" />Ni di SAATE nwu ɔlaa lawa kuatɛɛ alɛ: <verse eid="EZK 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 11:15" />“Otii obi, babilee-suɔtɔbi- babilee-suɔtɔbi ba ninle ni ntɔ nnwii ku afɔ ku Israel leyo nimuu- nle mba suoto di Yerusalem batii labuɛ ni alɛ, ‘Batookyo di SAATE nwu suoto; kasɔ ka mmle baata wo fɛ kalewo nɛ.’<verse eid="EZK 11:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 11:16" />“Nkpo oso buɛ falɛ: ‘Nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE Kplɛ nwu kobuɛ ni alɛ: Nu latɔɔ ma lakpee fanfa di nnle nwu kamɛ, lasamiisa ma kafɔɔ lakpete di nnle nwu kamɛ yi, kafɔɔ di obe kakui kamɛ lale kakleklekɔ lata ma di nnle be kamɛ baasifi nii.’<verse eid="EZK 11:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 11:17" />“Nkpo oso buɛ falɛ: ‘Nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE Kplɛ nwu kobuɛ ni alɛ: Kamasiisa ye nkyeko nnle nwu kamɛ, nkplesa ye nkyeko nnle be kamɛ bɛɛsamiisa ye kafɔɔ beekpete ni nwako, ninkplesa kafɔɔ Israel kasɔ nwu nta ye.’<verse eid="EZK 11:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 11:18" />“Babapɛmankple manwa kasɔ nwu suoto mamakpakpaa kafɔɔ atembi nyakatãa ku afiɔ ayududusaa nwu amuu. <verse eid="EZK 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 11:19" />Kamata ma manwɛ otu onwii, n-yɔ kafɔɔ ninwuna fɔle nkpee ma kaamɛ; kamadiki difuɔ otu lɛma nwu, ninta ma sina lɛbɔtɔ otu. <verse eid="EZK 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 11:20" />Ni nfɛ babatikanko sɛsaabla nii, manlolaa afiofa nii manle kafɔɔ nɛ. Babale batii nii, ami kafɔɔ kamale ma Yaa. <verse eid="EZK 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 11:21" />Kafɔɔ mba niɛyɔ ni situ lɛma bɛɛta ni atembi nyakatãa ku afiɔ ayududusaa lɛma nwu yi, kamasoosa lɛsaa le baabla ni ntika di mma bamu asintɛɛ, SAATE Kplɛ nwu niebuɛ.”<verse eid="EZK 11:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZK 11:22" />Ninfɛ di bakerubi nwu ku nkpaa nwu di ɔlɔɔkɔ lɛma lafukuti afoko lɛma, ni di Israel Yaa nwu leklekle latika di osi lɛma nɛ. <verse eid="EZK 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZK 11:23" />Ni di SAATE nwu leklekle ladie di okpoo kplɛ nwu kamɛ diasifi dialatika di kobokote osi di kufĩ katunkɔ lɛkyɛ nɛ. <verse eid="EZK 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZK 11:24" />Ni di Ninwuna nwu lakɛnkɛ mi aasifiko osi, ni aakpaa mi aawako balanle nwu ɔkyɛ di Babel, di odiki otuo wɔ di Yaa Ninwuna lata ni kamɛ nɛ.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EZK 11:24">Ninfɛ di odiki otuo nwu lanya ni layɛ di anu nii nɛ. <verse eid="EZK 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EZK 11:25" />Ni latɔkɔ balanle nwu lɛsaa biala le di Yaa ladiki aatuo mi ni nɛ.<verse eid="EZK 11:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="EZK 12" />
  <para style="s1">Yaa Ɔlaabuɛtɛtɛ Fɛ Otii Wɔ Niɛlaataniko Nii</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 12:1" />Ninfɛ di SAATE nwu ɔlaa lawa kuatɛɛ alɛ: <verse eid="EZK 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 12:2" />“Otii obi, batii ba ninkpe ni otokopĩ kamɛ fasi. Bakpe anumbi alɛ baanya kafɔɔ blɔɔnya, bakpe atoko alɛ baanu kafɔɔ bloonu, diekye batokopĩtɛ bale.<verse eid="EZK 12:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 12:3" />“Nkpo oso, otii obi, kpee atoo lɛfɔ fata sɛlanle kamɛ osifi di anu-nwaa kamɛ, di obe wɔ boonyu nii yi, die di lɛba le fakpe ni, faayefe osuku fasifi lɛba bamba. Nu bale batokopĩtɛ yi, loobia babanu kasɔ. <verse eid="EZK 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 12:4" />Di anu-nwaa kamɛ, di obe wɔ boonyu nii yi, dieko atoo lɛfɔ ya feekpee fɛɛta ni sɛlanle kamɛ osifi fawako kayi. Di kɔtɔɔfɔ obe kamɛ, di obe wɔ boonyu fɔ ni yi, faadie fasifi fɛle mba ninsifi ni sɛlanle kamɛ. <verse eid="EZK 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 12:5" />Dufu oyoyiɛ di obe wɔ boonyu fɔ ni, faadieko atoo lɛfɔ fafenko di oyoyiɛ nwu kamɛ. <verse eid="EZK 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 12:6" />Yɔ nya fatika di nimuusi lɛfɔ di obe wɔ boonyu fɔ ni, faatuka nya fadieko di obe di kayi nfɛ kɔwɔfɔ ni. Tĩi anu lɛfɔ di mmle flɔbanya ni kasɔ nwu. Diekye ntɔɔyɔ fɔ lɛbla dituosaa lɛta Israel batii.”<verse eid="EZK 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 12:7" />Nioso labla fɛ mmle baatɔkɔ mi nii. Ladieko atoo nii ya lakpee lata ni sɛlanle kamɛ osifi di anu-nwaa lawako kayi. Ni di kɔtɔɔfɔ obe kamɛ ladufu oyoyiɛ nwu ku nnɛɛ nii nɛ. Ninfɛ ladieko atoo nii kayi di obe wɔ di kayi nfɛ kɔwɔfɔ nii, latika nya di amuusi nii di obe wɔ baatoonyu mi ni nɛ.<verse eid="EZK 12:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 12:8" />Ni di SAATE nwu ɔlaa lawa kuatɛɛ di olesɛ nwu alɛ: <verse eid="EZK 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 12:9" />“Otii obi, Israel batii batokopĩtɛ nwu diɛkaalɛ fɔ alɛ, ‘Obe lɛsaa fɔɔbla?’<verse eid="EZK 12:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 12:10" />“Tɔkɔ ma falɛ, ‘Nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE Kplɛ nwu kobuɛ ni alɛ: Lɛkakatɛ le mmle lɛyɔ nwu ole di ɔka wɔ ninkpe ni di Yerusalem suoto ku Israel batii ba bamuu ninkpe ni ninfa.’ <verse eid="EZK 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 12:11" />Tɔkɔ ma falɛ, ‘Ami, Hesekiel nle dituosaa lɛta ye.’</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EZK 12:11">“Fɛ mmle lɛbla ni yi, nkpo okle bababla ma nɛ. Babasifi sɛlanle kamɛ fɛ balanle.<verse eid="EZK 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 12:12" />“Ɔka wɔ ninsi ni di kamɛ lɛma kamayɔ atoo nɔɔ antika di nimuusi di obe wɔ di kayi kɔwɔfɔ ni aandie ansifi, babadufu kafɔɔ kutuɛ manfenko di oyoyiɛ mantɔɔ aanfe. Abatĩi anu nɔɔ alɛ ɔlɔbafuo kasɔ nwu ɔnya. <verse eid="EZK 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 12:13" />Kamafukuti asawu nii ntɛ nwɔ, ninta dikyĩ nii mmufũ nwɔ; kamakpaa nwɔ n-wako Babel, Kaldea batii kasɔ suoto, kafɔɔ ɔlɔbanya ka, ni nfa kafɔɔ abakpi nɛ. <verse eid="EZK 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 12:14" />Kamasamiisa batii ba bamuu niɛmana nwɔ beekyi ni nkpete di kɔfɛɛfɔ kamɛ- bakpɛntɛ nɔɔ ku bakpɛtɛ akudi nɔɔ amuu- kamananfi kafɔɔ kapamii ntikanko ma.<verse eid="EZK 12:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 12:15" />“Nse lɛsɛ ma lekpee di nnle nwu kamɛ, lɛsamiisa ma kafɔɔ lekpete di nsɔ nwu suoto yi, ni babatofo alɛ ami ninle SAATE nwu nɛ. <verse eid="EZK 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 12:16" />Kafɔɔ kamata batii lɛma basɛɛ ntoso di kapamii, kɔka ku ofiɛ kpile kanya, di mmle di nnle be kamɛ boofe ni katofo ni ayududusaa sɛsaabla lɛma nwu simuu. Ninfɛ babatofo alɛ ami ninle SAATE nwu nɛ.”<verse eid="EZK 12:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yaa Ɔlaabuɛtɛtɛ Wɔ Nintũtũkũ Ni Dituosaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 12:17" />Ni di SAATE nwu ɔlaa lawa kuatɛɛ alɛ: <verse eid="EZK 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 12:18" />“Otii obi, le alesaa lɛfɔ di ditũtũkũ kamɛ, nyi ntu lɛfɔ kafɔɔ ku nkyenkye di lɛyɛkɛ kanya. <verse eid="EZK 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 12:19" />Buɛ fatɔkɔ kasɔ nwu kamɛ batii falɛ: ‘Nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE wɔ Ninlenke ni lebuɛ eekyeko ni batii ba ninsi ni di Yerusalem ku Israel batii kasɔ suoto alɛ: Babale alesaa lɛma di lɛyɛkɛ kamɛ man-nyi ntu lɛma kafɔɔ ku nkyenkye, diekye lɛsaa biala di kasɔ lɛma suoto kamawɔɔ ninwu kamɛ ta batii ba bamuu ninsi ni ninfa amumu oso. <verse eid="EZK 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 12:20" />Sekpoo se di batii nsi ni kamalalaa sinte, kasɔ nwu kafɔɔ kamate kafukuti. Ninfɛ bibatofo bilɛ ami ninle SAATE nwu nɛ.’ ”<verse eid="EZK 12:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lɛkpa Le Niefũ Ni Leyooto Ku Ɔlaa Wɔ Nintafũ Ni Leyooto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 12:21" />SAATE nwu ɔlaa lawa kuatɛɛ alɛ: <verse eid="EZK 12:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZK 12:22" />Otii obi, obe ninle lɛkpa le mmle mimbuɛ ni di Israel kasɔ suoto bilɛ: ‘Ayi nfe, odiki otuo biala kafɔɔ ninwa kaanya’? <verse eid="EZK 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZK 12:23" />Nioso tɔkɔ ma falɛ, ‘Nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE Kplɛ nwu kobuɛ ni alɛ: Kamata lɛkpa le mmle obuɛ n-wa kaasekɔ, blɔbasimpɛ lɛkpa nwu kafɔɔ di Israel.’ Tɔkɔ ma falɛ, ‘Ayi ntɔɔtɛɛtɛɛ di odiki otuo biala kamawa ni kaanya. <verse eid="EZK 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZK 12:24" />Diekye sɛlaa ku afunu odiki otuo dilɔbasinwɛ, ee ɔnyamɛnɛfɛ asaa ɔnya diwɛ di Israel batii suoto. <verse eid="EZK 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EZK 12:25" />Kafɔɔ ami SAATE nwu kamabuɛ ɔlaa wɔ kamabuɛ nii, dibawa kaanya kafɔɔ kunɔmakpi ni kamaa. Diekye aye batokopĩtɛ, di ayi lee kamɛ yi, kamabla di ɔlaa lele lebuɛ ni kanya, SAATE Kplɛ nwu niebuɛ.’ ”<verse eid="EZK 12:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="EZK 12:26" />Ni di SAATE nwu ɔlaa lawa kuatɛɛ alɛ: <verse eid="EZK 12:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EZK 12:27" />“Otii obi, Israel batii kobuɛ alɛ, ‘Odikiotuo wɔ annya ni kamawa di alɛɛ kpinwu ya nikɔwa ni sɛmaa, ambuɛ sɛlaa antɛ kafɔɔ di kayi kamaa ka niekyo ni suoto.’<verse eid="EZK 12:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="EZK 12:28" />“Nkpo oso tɔkɔ ma falɛ, ‘Nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE Kplɛ nwu kobuɛ ni alɛ: Sɛlaa nii kusinwii dilɔbasinkpi kamaa diidii; ɔlaa lele lebuɛ kamawa kaanya, SAATE Kplɛ nwu niebuɛ.’ ”<verse eid="EZK 12:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="EZK 13" />
  <para style="s1">Ɔlaa Obuɛ Ɔtɛ Oyila Di Balaatɛ Ɔlaababuɛtɛtɛ-Suɔtɔ Suoto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 13:1" />SAATE nwu ɔlaa lawa kuatɛɛ alɛ: <verse eid="EZK 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 13:2" />“Otii obi, buɛ ɔlaa fatɛ kuoyila di Israel ɔlaababuɛtɛtɛ ba nfɛ nikobuɛ sɛlaa mantɛ ni suoto. Tɔkɔ mba nikobuɛ sɛlaa mantɛ mankyeko ni mma bamu asibu kamɛ falɛ: ‘Binu SAATE nwu ɔlaa! <verse eid="EZK 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 13:3" />Nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE Kplɛ nwu kobuɛ ni alɛ: Babuutɛ ɔlaababuɛtɛtɛ bayɔɔsa, mba nintikanko ni mma bamu ninwuna kafɔɔ manan-nya ni lɛsalɛsaa! <verse eid="EZK 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 13:4" />Oo Israel, ɔlaababuɛtɛtɛ lee nte fɛle lepoo kamɛ baweewee di n-yiɛkuu suoto. <verse eid="EZK 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 13:5" />Biɛɛkata bikyɛ osi bilalolaa aba ya niebiɛ ni di seyoyiɛ nwu bita Israel batii alɛ kuayila kpinkpĩ di kakpɛ kamɛ di SAATE nwu dii suoto. <verse eid="EZK 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 13:6" />Odiki otuo lɛma nwu nle sɛlaa ku afunu, asaa lɛma ɔnya nwu kafɔɔ nle sɛlaa ku afunu. Mambuɛ alɛ, “SAATE nwu alɛ,” di obe wɔ di SAATE nwu diekpee ma nii; kafɔɔ man-nyu osuku alɛ sɛlaa lɛma nwu kawa kaanya. <verse eid="EZK 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 13:7" />Diele anyapɛ min-nya, minka kafɔɔ sɛlaa ku afunu sɛlaa di obe wɔ mimbuɛ ni bilɛ, “SAATE nwu alɛ,” nu di ami ninkakatɛ ni?<verse eid="EZK 13:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 13:8" />“ ‘Nkpo oso yi, nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE Kplɛ nwu kobuɛ ni alɛ: Ta sɛlaa ku afunu ku kakyɔnkyɔ sɛlaa ku anyapɛ lee nwu oso yi, lɛtaka n-yɛ ye di suoto, SAATE Kplɛ nwu niebuɛ. <verse eid="EZK 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 13:9" />Kɔnɛɛ nii kamataka di ɔlaababuɛtɛtɛ ba nin-nya ni sɛlaa ku afunu odiki otuo, mambuɛ ni kafɔɔ sɛlaa ku afunu sɛlaa. Blɔbasiɛ di batii nii bawo kalɛɛkɔ ee bakpana ayooto lɛma bakpee di Israel leyo akũ kamɛ, ee babuo Israel batii kasɔ suoto. Ninfɛ bibatofo bilɛ ami ninle SAATE Kplɛ nwu nɛ.<verse eid="EZK 13:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 13:10" />“ ‘Ta bɛɛkpaa batii nii, beeyu ni osuku oso, mambuɛ ni alɛ, “Atoko ɔkyɛ ole nkpe,” obe wɔ di atoko ɔkyɛ ole nnaa nii, diekye nse batii letofo oyoyiɛ wɔ ninaa ni osie yi, ɔlaababuɛtɛtɛ nkpiitaa nwu ku akaaloo. <verse eid="EZK 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 13:11" />Nkpo oso tɔkɔ batii ba ninkpiitaa ni oyoyiɛ nwu ku akaaloo falɛ oyoyiɛ nwu kɔwa ɔbabiɛ. Kanto kplɛ kamanɔɔ, kamata kafɔɔ atubakani nkpakpaa, afɛɛfɔ siene kafɔɔ kamakpɛ. <verse eid="EZK 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 13:12" />Nse seyoyiɛ nwu lebiɛ, batii dilɔbakaalɛ ye alɛ, “Ɔfɛ di akaaloo nwu biekpiitaa ni oyoyiɛ nwu nkpe?”<verse eid="EZK 13:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 13:13" />“ ‘Nkpo oso nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE Kplɛ nwu kobuɛ ni alɛ: Kamata afɛɛfɔ siene nkpɛ di lɛblɔfiɛ yakayaka nii kamɛ, ninta kafɔɔ atubakani ku kanto kplɛ nnɔɔ anlalasa asaa di ɔblɔ nii kamɛ. <verse eid="EZK 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 13:14" />Kamabiɛ oyoyiɛ wɔ biekpiitaa ni ku akaaloo ntɛ kaasɔ, kamabiɛ nwu kafɔɔ nkyɛkyɛsa nkaasa kaasɔ alɛ lɛsɔse ninwu kamate temple. Nse kuobiɛ yi, bibawɔɔ ninwu kamɛ; ni bibatofo bilɛ ami ninle SAATE nwu nɛ. <verse eid="EZK 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 13:15" />Nkpo kamadiki lɛblɔfiɛ yakayaka nii ntuo di oyoyiɛ nwu ku batii ba niakpiitaa nwu ni ku akaaloo suoto nɛ. Kamatɔkɔ ye nlɛ, “Oyoyiɛ nwu nsinnaa, nkpo kafɔɔ di batii ba niakpiitaa nwu ni ku akaaloo nsinnaa nɛ. <verse eid="EZK 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 13:16" />Israel batii ɔlaababuɛtɛtɛ ba niabuɛ sɛlaa baatɛ baata ni Yerusalem, baanya ni atoko ɔkyɛ ole odiki otuo baata nwu ni, di obe wɔ di atoko ɔkyɛ ole nnaa nii, SAATE Kplɛ nwu niebuɛ.” ’<verse eid="EZK 13:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Sɛlaa Obuɛɔtɛ Oyila Di Basanko Ɔlaababuɛtɛtɛ Suoto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 13:17" />“Nunua yi, otii obi, yɔ anu lɛfɔ fatika di batii lɛfɔ babisankobi suoto, mba nimbuɛ sɛlaa mantɛ mankyeko ni mma bamu asibu kamɛ. Buɛ ɔlaa fatɛ kuoyila suoto lɛma, <verse eid="EZK 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 13:18" />faabuɛ falɛ, ‘Nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE Kplɛ nwu kobuɛ ni alɛ: Biyɔɔsa, aye basanko ba ninnii ni sɛfakũ di nnɛɛtũ lɛma mmuu, bɛɛbla ni kafɔɔ bataku kaanale ateate bɛɛta ni asi lɛma alɛ baayɔ mankyɔɔ ni batii dikyĩ. Bibakyɔɔ batii nii nkpa dikyĩ, kafɔɔ minlolaa aye bamu nkpa minklee? <verse eid="EZK 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 13:19" />Bitɔɔkpɔnɔfɔsa mi leyooto di batii nii kamɛ, ta atitabi asɛɛ nnɛɛ dikusii kamɛ ku bloblo kɔkyɛɛ oso. Biɛlaa biɛta batii nii ba ninkyɔɔ ni sɛlaa ku afunu atoko, ni bitoolo batii ba ninankaatɛ alɛ baakpi nii, biediɛ mba kafɔɔ ninankaatɛ alɛ baasiɛ ni nkpa biɛtɛ nɛ.<verse eid="EZK 13:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 13:20" />“ ‘Nkpo oso nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE Kplɛ nwu kobuɛ ni alɛ: Lɛtaka n-yɛ di sɛfakũ lee nwu suoto, n-se min-yɔ minkyɔɔ ni batii akyĩ fɛle bakansiɛ, kamabudi sĩ kafɔɔ di nnɛɛtũ lee; kamafukuti batii ba biɛkyɔɔ ni akyĩ fɛle bakansiɛ. <verse eid="EZK 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 13:21" />Kamabɛbɛɛ bataku lee nwu, nindiki kafɔɔ batii nii nkyeko nnɛɛ lee, blɔbasinsiɛ di osie lee nwu kalɔ. Ninfɛ bibatofo bilɛ ami ninle SAATE nwu nɛ. <verse eid="EZK 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZK 13:22" />Diekye biayɔ sɛlaa ku afunu biafeesa batininitɛ nnɛɛ, di obe wɔ ditale ni sɛnyaami owi lawako ma nii, ta biakpee ni kafɔɔ akpisaa bablatɛ osie bilɛ batankyi ni di sisuku kpile lɛma suoto alɛ baafũ ma ni nkpa oso yi, <verse eid="EZK 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZK 13:23" />nioso bilɔbasinnya sɛlaa ku afunu odiki otuo ee bibla asaa ɔnya sɛsaabla nwu. Kamadiki batii nii nkyeko nnɛɛ lee. Ni bibatofo bilɛ ami ninle SAATE nwu nɛ.’ ”<verse eid="EZK 13:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="EZK 14" />
  <para style="s1">Yaa Lalo Afiɔ Ɔtɔ Lɛpɔɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 14:1" />Di obe onwii kamɛ Israel banɔɔfo bawo lawa ɔkyɛ nii baabasiɛ di anu nii. <verse eid="EZK 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 14:2" />Ninfɛ di SAATE nwu ɔlaa lawa kuatɛɛ alɛ: <verse eid="EZK 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 14:3" />“Otii obi, basuɔtɔ ba mmle nkle afiɔ di situ lɛma kamɛ, bɛɛyɔ kafɔɔ atuulasaa kpile bɛɛtɛ di anu lɛma. Kata ma osuku mamawolaa asaa kamɛ di ɔkyɛ nii? <verse eid="EZK 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 14:4" />Nkpo oso kakatɛko ma faatɔkɔ ma falɛ, ‘Nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE Kplɛ nwu kobuɛ ni alɛ: Nse Israel otii lele niekpee afiɔ di otu nɔɔ kamɛ, ɛɛyɔ kafɔɔ dituulasaa kpile ɛɛtɛ di anu nɔɔ, ɛɛkyɛ ɔlaabuɛtɛtɛ nfũ yi, ni ami SAATE nwu omu kamadiki kanya ntɔɔ di afiɔ nɔɔ ya akle ni di lɛpɔ kamɛ. <verse eid="EZK 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 14:5" />Kamabla nle mmle alɛ kase Israel batii bamuu nintoodiɛ mi bɛɛtɛ ni situ difũ, ta afiɔ lɛma oso.’<verse eid="EZK 14:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 14:6" />“Nkpo oso tɔkɔ Israel batii falɛ, ‘Nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE nwu kobuɛ ni alɛ: Bikyi! Bikple di afiɔ lee sɛmaa, biesĩ kafɔɔ ayududusaa lee sɛsaabla simuu!<verse eid="EZK 14:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 14:7" />“ ‘Nse Israel otii lele ee ɔfɔɔ lele ninsi ni di Israel lɛblasa suoto nɔɔ di suoto nii, eefũ afiɔ eekpee di otu nɔɔ kamɛ, ɛɛyɔ kafɔɔ dituulasaa kpile ɛɛtɛ di anu nɔɔ, ɛɛkyɛ ɔlaabuɛtɛtɛ nfũ alɛ ɔɔlaawolaa asaa kamɛ di ɔkyɛ nii yi, ni ami SAATE nwu kamadiki kanya ntɔɔ ami omu. <verse eid="EZK 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 14:8" />Kamadiki anu nii ntika di otii nwu nkpo suoto, n-yɔ nwɔ mbla ɔtɛ onyu ku okyonsanu. Kamablasa nwɔ ndiki di batii nii suoto. Ni bibatofo bilɛ ami ninle SAATE nwu nɛ.<verse eid="EZK 14:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 14:9" />“ ‘Kafɔɔ nse bɛɛkyɔnkyɔ ɔlaabuɛtɛtɛ owo eebuɛ ɔlaa ɛɛtɛ, alɛ ami SAATE nwu niɛkyɔnkyɔ ɔlaabuɛtɛtɛ nwu yi, kamananfi kɔnɛɛ nii di suoto nɔɔ, nwɔɔsa nwɔ kafɔɔ di batii nii Israel kamɛ. <verse eid="EZK 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 14:10" />Lɛpɔɔ okpi lɛma kamatika ma di suoto- ɔlaabuɛtɛtɛ nwu kafɔɔ kamakpi lɛpɔɔ fɛ nnwɔ niɛwa ni asaa owolaa di ɔkyɛ nɔɔ. <verse eid="EZK 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 14:11" />Ni Israel batii dilɔbasin-yu osuku di suoto nii, ee bakpɔnɔfɔsa suoto lɛma ku sikpile lɛma simuu diidii. Alɛ babale batii nii, ami kafɔɔ kamale Yaa lɛma, SAATE Kplɛ nwu niebuɛ.’ ”<verse eid="EZK 14:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Noa, Daniel Ku Yob</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 14:12" />Ni di SAATE nwu ɔlaa lawa kuatɛɛ alɛ: <verse eid="EZK 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 14:13" />“Otii obi, nse kale kawo lɛbla okpile di suoto nii, ta kata le ni onukwale oso, lediki kɔnɛɛ nii di kale nwu suoto, letĩi osuku wɔ kanfe kanwɛ ni alesaa, lɛta kafɔɔ kɔka lɛkpɛ kale nwu, lelo kafɔɔ batii ku babɔkɛɛ lɛma, <verse eid="EZK 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 14:14" />nse bia basuɔtɔ ba mmle batiɛ- Noa, Daniel ku Yob- lasiɛ di kale nwu kamɛ yi, suoto lɛma nkpa lete baafuo ofũ, ta ɔsaabla tinini lɛma oso, SAATE Kplɛ nwu niebuɛ.<verse eid="EZK 14:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 14:15" />“Ee nse lediki lepoo kamɛ babɔkɛɛ ba nikpe ni kobe lekpee di kasɔ nwu suoto, bɛɛwɔɔsa batii ninka suoto, di kasɔ nwu lɛbate kafukuti alɛ kuonwii diloofuo ofe ninka suoto ta babɔkɛɛ yakayaka nwu oso yi, <verse eid="EZK 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 14:16" />nwaako lɛnya nkpe ni nkpa, SAATE Kplɛ nwu niebuɛ alɛ, nse bia basuɔtɔ ba mmle batiɛ lasiɛ di kasɔ nwu suoto yi, bataafuo mma bamu babisuɔtɔbi ee babisankobi lɛma nkpa ofũ. Nkpa lɛma lete batabafũ, kafɔɔ kasɔ nwu ntabate kafukuti.<verse eid="EZK 14:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 14:17" />“Ee nse lɛwako kapamii di kasɔ nwu nkpo suoto lebuɛ nlɛ, ‘Kapamii kafe di kasɔ nwu kamuu suoto,’ lelo kasɔ nwu batii ku babɔkɛɛ lɛma yi, <verse eid="EZK 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 14:18" />nwaako lɛnya nkpe ni nkpa, SAATE Kplɛ nwu niebuɛ alɛ, nse bia basuɔtɔ ba mmle batiɛ lasiɛ di kasɔ nwu, bataafuo mma bamu lɛma babisuɔtɔbi ee babisankobi nkpa ofũ. Nkpa lɛma lete batabafũ.<verse eid="EZK 14:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 14:19" />“Ee nse lediki ofiɛ kpile lekpee di kasɔ nwu nkpo suoto, lɛnyɛɛnɛ ɔblɔ yakayaka nii lekpete ka diefe ni di ntɔ owii suoto, lelo kasɔ nwu batii ku babɔkɛɛ lɛma yi, <verse eid="EZK 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 14:20" />nwaako lɛnya nkpe ni nkpa, SAATE Kplɛ nwu niebuɛ alɛ, nse bia Noa, Daniel ku Yob lasiɛ di kasɔ nwu suoto yi, bataafuo obisuɔtɔbi ee obisankobi nkpa ofũ. Mma bamu nkpa lete batabafuo ofũ, ta ɔsaabla tinini lɛma oso.<verse eid="EZK 14:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 14:21" />“Diekye nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE Kplɛ nwu kobuɛ ni alɛ: Lɛ nfɛ kubalalaa kunte nse lediki akanko nii yɛkɛle ana nwu lekpee Yerusalem- kapamii ku kɔka ɔkpɛ, lepoo kamɛ babɔkɛɛ ku ofiɛ kpile- alɛ balo kasɔ nwu batii ku babɔkɛɛ lɛma! <verse eid="EZK 14:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZK 14:22" />Kafɔɔ batii bawo kamabu mansiɛ nkpa- babisuɔtɔbi ku babisankobi ba babadieko ni ninwu kamɛ. Babawa ɔkyɛ lee, nse biɛnya nkpa lɛma disiɛbi ku ɔsaabla lɛma kafɔɔ yi, otu kamate ye di ɔlaa otũ wɔ lata kuawa ni di Yerusalem suoto- ɔlaa otũ biala lata kuawa ni ninwu suoto. <verse eid="EZK 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZK 14:23" />Otu kamate ye nse biɛnya nkpa lɛma disiɛbi ku ɔsaabla lɛma, diekye bibatofo bilɛ ntabla lɛsalɛsaa ninwu kamɛ kasakasa, SAATE Kplɛ nwu niebuɛ.”<verse eid="EZK 14:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="EZK 15" />
  <para style="s1">Lɛkpa Ɔpɛ Di Nta Kowoso Suoto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 15:1" />Ni di SAATE nwu ɔlaa lawa kuatɛɛ alɛ: <verse eid="EZK 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 15:2" />“Otii obi, lɛ di nta kowoso katɔɔni nlɛ kalenke owosola lele di awoso ya di lepoo kamɛ? <verse eid="EZK 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 15:3" />Man-yɔ owoso ninwu mambla lɛsaa biene lewo? Man-yɔ owoso ninwu mambla ayee alɛ baasaka asaa ninwu suoto? <verse eid="EZK 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 15:4" />Nse bɛɛyɔ owoso nwu beekpee di ɔtɔ kamɛ fɛ katɔɔni, di ɔtɔ nwu kafɔɔ lefiɛ asi nwu anyɔ di ntɛɛntɛɛ kafɔɔ lɛpɛpɛɛ ɔtɔ sɛmaa, keekple kalɛ kɛɛta lɛsaa lewo ɔblako? <verse eid="EZK 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 15:5" />Nse katabla lɛsaa biene kata lɛsalɛsaa di obe wɔ kaale ni kamu, ni lɛ nfɛ kabalɛ ɔyɔ ɔblako lɛsaa le ninle ni dibiene di obe wɔ di ɔtɔ ntɔɔfiɛ ka kɛɛpɛpɛɛ ni kafɔɔ ɔtɔ?<verse eid="EZK 15:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 15:6" />“Nkpo oso nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE Kplɛ nwu kobuɛ ni alɛ: Fɛ mmle ntɔɔyɔ nta kowoso di lepoo awoso kamɛ lɛta ni fɛ ntɔɔni diɛta ni ɔtɔ yi, nkpo kamabla batii ba ninsi ni di Yerusalem nɛ. <verse eid="EZK 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 15:7" />Kamadiki anu nii ntika ma di suoto. Kuntɛ batoodie di ɔtɔ kamɛ yi, ɔtɔ nwu kamafiɛ ma. Ni nse lediki anu nii kafɔɔ letika ma di suoto yi, ni bibatofo bilɛ ami ninle SAATE nwu nɛ. <verse eid="EZK 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 15:8" />Ta batale onukwale baatɛɛ ni oso yi, kamabla kasɔ nwu kante kafukuti, SAATE Kplɛ nwu niebuɛ.”<verse eid="EZK 15:8" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="EZK 16" />
  <para style="s1">Yerusalem, Onukwale Ɔtanle</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 16:1" />Ni di SAATE nwu ɔlaa lawa kuatɛɛ alɛ: <verse eid="EZK 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 16:2" />“Otii obi, ta Yerusalem atofo ku ayududusaa nɔɔ sɛsaabla nwu, <verse eid="EZK 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 16:3" />faatɔkɔ nwɔ falɛ, ‘Nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE Kplɛ nwu kobuɛ antɔkɔ ni Yerusalem alɛ: Kafa lɛfɔ ku lɛba le baalofo fɔ ni lawɛ di Kanaan batii kasɔ suoto; teefɔ lale Amori otii, yaafɔ kafɔɔ lale Heti otii. <verse eid="EZK 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 16:4" />Di dii le baalofo fɔ nii, batabudi sɛkɔɔ lɛfɔ ee bakpeesa fɔ ntu alɛ faabla klekle, ee bafifia fɔ mmba ee bamiminisa fɔ di abula kamɛ. <verse eid="EZK 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 16:5" />Kuonwii ditanyu fɔ di sɛnyaami ɔnya kamɛ ee kafutu kanyinyii nwɔ alɛ aabla asaa ya mmle kuninwii anta fɔ. Kafɔɔ, lepoo kamɛ baafuki fɔ baakpee, diekye baanyu fɔ nyakatãa di dii le baalofo fɔ nii.<verse eid="EZK 16:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 16:6" />“ ‘Ninfɛ lawaalɛ fɔ lafe, ni lanya fɔ faatɔɔpɛ faatoomunu di ntɔ lɛfɔ kamɛ nɛ. Ni latɔkɔ fɔ di obe wɔ faate ni di ntɔ lɛfɔ kamɛ nlɛ, “Wɛ nkpa!” <verse eid="EZK 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 16:7" />Lata fɔ faamuɔ fɛle lepoo kamɛ kowoso. Faataka disi, faamuɔ, ni faabakple anyɛnɛ ya nikɔtɛ anlɛ onyu anlenkee ni nɛ. Faatika anyɛɛ, sinwini layie fɔ, afɔ wɔ niasiɛ ni lɛkyɔtɔ, faate ni ototoole.<verse eid="EZK 16:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 16:8" />“ ‘Sɛmaa lawaalɛ fɔ lafe, di obe wɔ latɛ anu lanyu fɔ nii, lanya nlɛ fatoowo fɛɛta ni kɔsa ɔyɔ, ni lablɛfɛsa akpeele nii latika di suoto lɛfɔ latĩi fɔ lɛkyɔtɔ nɛ. Laka ntam nii lata fɔ osie kanya, ni labla kafɔɔ kanya ninii ku afɔ, ni faabakple ole mi nɛ, SAATE Kplɛ nwu niebuɛ.<verse eid="EZK 16:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 16:9" />“ ‘Lakpeesa fɔ ntu, lafoto ntɔ di suoto lɛfɔ, ni lafifia fɔ nnɔnyi nɛ. <verse eid="EZK 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 16:10" />Lanyukũsa fɔ dibula le beeloso ni ku sikũ ateate, layɔ bɔkɛɛ kukũ ntokota lakpee fɔ. Lakpee fɔ akpeele biene fɛnɛnɛɛ fututu, ni layɔ kafɔɔ akpeele ya niafũ ni kɔya latĩi fɔ nɛ. <verse eid="EZK 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 16:11" />Layɔ anyɛnɛ laklɛɛ fɔ: Lakpee fɔ nkɔnĩi di nnɛɛtũ, lakpee fɔ kafɔɔ anyɛnɛ di siimu lɛfɔ. <verse eid="EZK 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 16:12" />Ni layɔ lɛkɔnii lakpee fɔ di onwu, lasaka fɔ atokosakasaa di atoko lɛfɔ, layɔ kafɔɔ lɛkakoto le nikɔlɛ ni onyu latukũsa fɔ di disi nɛ. <verse eid="EZK 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 16:13" />Nkpo baaklɛɛ fɔ ku koto sɛɛle ku koto fututu nɛ; abula lɛfɔ lale abiene fɛnɛnɛɛ fututu ku n-ya niafũ ni kɔya ku dibula le baayɔ sikũ baaloso nii. Alesaa lɛfɔ niale nnaafũ muɛmuɛ, bablɔ ku awosobi nnɔnyi nɛ. Faabalɛ sekpeele osie kanya, ni faataka faabale ɔka-sanko nɛ. <verse eid="EZK 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 16:14" />Ni di leyooto lɛfɔ lataka katoo di nnle kamɛ ta sekpeele lɛfɔ oso, diekye mmle laklɛɛ fɔ ni lata sekpeele lɛfɔ lawo niimu, SAATE Kplɛ nwu niebuɛ.<verse eid="EZK 16:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 16:15" />“ ‘Kafɔɔ faatika disi di sekpeele lɛfɔ suoto, ni faayɔ leyooto le faafũ ni faabakple sɔnɔkpeetɛ nɛ. Faadiɛ suoto lɛfɔ faata otii lele ninwaalɛ fɔ anfe di lɛsɔnɔkpee kamɛ. <verse eid="EZK 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 16:16" />Faayɔ akpeele lɛfɔ awo faabla abula ateate faasasaka di ntakalekɔ, faatookpee asɔnɔ ninfa. Asaa ya ninankaatɛ alɛ ɛɛwa nii, ee bɛɛbla ni diidii. <verse eid="EZK 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 16:17" />Faayɔ kafɔɔ anyɛnɛ biene ya lata fɔ nii, anyɛnɛ ya baabla ni ku koto sɛɛle ku koto fututu nii, ni faayɔ nya faabla afiɔ-suɔtɔ faata suoto lɛfɔ, ni faakpee asɔnɔ ku mma nɛ. <verse eid="EZK 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 16:18" />Ni faayɔ abula lɛfɔ ya baayɔ sikũ ateate baaloso ni faakpa ma, faayɔ kafɔɔ nnɔnyi ku olufui nii faase di anu lɛma. <verse eid="EZK 16:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 16:19" />Alesaa ya kafɔɔ lata fɔ nii- nnaafũ muɛmuɛ, awosobi nnɔnyi ku bablɔ ba lata fɔ nlɛ faale nii- faayɔ faata fɛ olufui wɔ nikɔpɛ ni ɔkɔnɔ di anu lɛma. Nni niale lɛsaa le niawa ni nɛ, SAATE Kplɛ nwu niebuɛ.<verse eid="EZK 16:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 16:20" />“ ‘Ninfɛ faayɔ babisuɔtɔbi ku babisankobi lɛfɔ ba faalofo faatɛɛ ni faata ole fɛ alesaa faata afiɔ nɛ. Lɛsɔnɔkpee lɛfɔ nwu ditapɔ? <verse eid="EZK 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 16:21" />Faalo babi nii, faayɔ ma faata ole faata afiɔ. <verse eid="EZK 16:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZK 16:22" />Di ayududusaa lɛfɔ sɛsaabla simuu ku lɛsɔnɔkpee lɛfɔ nwu kamɛ yi, fatanyuma sekpeele lɛfɔ obe, di obe wɔ faasiɛ ni lɛkyɔtɔ, faate ni ototoole, faatɔɔpɛ faatoomunu ni di ntɔ lɛfɔ kamɛ.<verse eid="EZK 16:22" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yerusalem Lasiɛ Nkpa Fɛ Sɔnɔkpeetɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZK 16:23" />“ ‘Yɔɔsa! Yɔɔsa, SAATE Kplɛ nwu niebuɛ. Diɛkyakaa ni di asiensiesaa lɛfɔ bamba ɔbla kamɛ, <verse eid="EZK 16:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZK 16:24" />faatofo difiɔyo faata suoto lɛfɔ, ni faabla afiɔtii takale di bawo kalɛɛkɔ biala nɛ. <verse eid="EZK 16:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EZK 16:25" />Faatofo afiɔyo takale lɛfɔ di lɛkpaka biala, ni faayɔ sekpeele lɛfɔ faakpee asɔnɔ, faatoodiɛ suoto lɛfɔ faatɔɔta otii lele ninwaalɛ anfe ni, faata lɛsɔnɔkpee lɛfɔ nwu latɔɔpɔ diatɔɔkyakaa. <verse eid="EZK 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EZK 16:26" />Faakpee asɔnɔ ku Egipte batii, ɔkɔnsɔ akleesaa bawo lɛfɔ nwu, faata lɛsɔnɔkpee lɛfɔ nwu lapɔ diatɔɔkyakaa, ni faayɔ ni faakpee mi ɔblɔ nɛ. <verse eid="EZK 16:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EZK 16:27" />Nioso lananfi kɔnɛɛ nii di suoto lɛfɔ, ni lakɔlɛkɔlɛ kasɔ lɛfɔ nɛ; ni layɔ fɔ lakpee di balo lɛfɔ ba nimbɛbɛɛ ni anu nnɛɛ nɛ, Filisti batii babisankobi nwu, diabla ni yaaa di asɔnɔkpeesaa lɛfɔ ɔbla nwu suoto. <verse eid="EZK 16:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EZK 16:28" />Faakpee asɔnɔ ku Asiria batii kafɔɔ, diekye fatamiɛ; bia di nninkpo sɛmaa kafɔɔ yi, ditakple diamiɛ fɔ. <verse eid="EZK 16:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EZK 16:29" />Ninfɛ di lɛsɔnɔkpee lɛfɔ nwu lataka katoo, faayɔ Kaldea asaa-basunsũtɛ kasɔ faakyakaa, kafɔɔ bia nle mmle tintĩ ditamiɛ fɔ.<verse eid="EZK 16:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="EZK 16:30" />“ ‘Lɛ okle di otu lɛfɔ lɛbɔmbɔ lɛwakasɔ nkpo, SAATE Kplɛ nwu niebuɛ alɛ, nse fɛɛbla asaa ya mmle amuu, fɔɔbla fɛle sɔnɔkpeetɛ wɔ ninaa ni sinunsɔ! <verse eid="EZK 16:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EZK 16:31" />Faatofo nfiofa di osuku biala suoto, faatofo kafɔɔ afiɔyo takale di lɛkpaka biala, fatadie sɔnɔkpeetɛ, diekye fatatoofũ koto.<verse eid="EZK 16:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="EZK 16:32" />“ ‘Afɔ santɛ sɔnɔkpeetɛ! Bafɔɔ lalɛ fɔ baalenkee afɔ omu lɛfɔ ɔsa! <verse eid="EZK 16:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="EZK 16:33" />Sɔnɔkpeetɛ biala nfũ koto, kafɔɔ afɔ ninta basɔnɔ lɛfɔ bamuu akyɛsaa, fantɔɔta ma koto di lewofa kamɛ alɛ baakye kakɔ biala manwa fɔ ɔkyɛ alɛ faakpee asɔnɔ ku mma. <verse eid="EZK 16:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="EZK 16:34" />Nioso di lɛsɔnɔkpee lɛfɔ kamɛ yi, feekyi lete di basɔnɔkpeetɛ bamba suoto; otii kuonwii nintɛ aamiɛ fɔ aata asɔnɔ lɛfɔ okpee. Fɛɛtɛ feekyi lete, diekye fanta koto kafɔɔ manta fɔ kukunwii.<verse eid="EZK 16:34" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yaa Lɛkanko Di Yerusalem Suoto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="EZK 16:35" />“ ‘Nkpo oso, afɔ sɔnɔkpeetɛ, nu SAATE nwu ɔlaa! <verse eid="EZK 16:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="EZK 16:36" />Nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE Kplɛ nwu kobuɛ ni alɛ: Ta fɛnyɛɛnɛ ni lɛsaawɛ lɛfɔ feewii nii, feediki ni kafɔɔ lɛkyɔtɔ lɛfɔ fɛɛtɛ ni di asɔnɔ lɛfɔ okpee kamɛ ku basɔnɔ lɛfɔ oso, ta di afiɔ lɛfɔ ya amuu nikɔkpɛ ni oyududu, fɛɛyɔ ni kafɔɔ babi lɛfɔ ntɔ fɛɛta ma ni oso yi, <verse eid="EZK 16:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="EZK 16:37" />nkpo oso kamasiisa basɔnɔ lɛfɔ nwu bamuu, ku mba suoto faanya ni ɔmɛnɛfɛ, mba faabɔmbɔ ni ku mba faakyidi nii. Kamasiisa ma nkyeko kakɔ biala di suoto lɛfɔ, anu lɛma kafɔɔ kamadiki fɔ asaa di suoto, man-nya lɛkyɔtɔ lɛfɔ nimuu. <verse eid="EZK 16:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="EZK 16:38" />Kamakanko fɔ fɛ mmle mankanko ni basanko ba ninkpee ni asɔnɔ, man-wii ni kafɔɔ ntɔ; kamata ntɔ ɔbla okyisa letokonanfi di ɔblɔ yakayaka nii kamɛ ku lɛblɔfiɛ sɛsɔfɔwo ɔkpɛ n-wa di suoto lɛfɔ. <verse eid="EZK 16:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="EZK 16:39" />Ni kamayɔ fɔ nkpee di basɔnɔ lɛfɔ nnɛɛ, mambibiɛ nfiofa lɛfɔ nwu mantɛ kaasɔ manlalaasa kafɔɔ afiɔyo takale lɛfɔ nwu. Babadiki abula di suoto lɛfɔ, man-yɔ kafɔɔ anyɛnɛ biene lɛfɔ, mandiɛ fɔ fansiɛ lɛkyɔtɔ ku ototoole. <verse eid="EZK 16:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="EZK 16:40" />Babasiisa batii dikudi di suoto lɛfɔ, mma nimasafɔ fɔ afuɔ, mansasafɔ fɔ kafɔɔ wɛkyɛwɛkyɛ ku mpamii lɛma. <verse eid="EZK 16:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="EZK 16:41" />Babakpee ayo lɛfɔ ɔtɔ manfiɛ, man-yɔ letokonanfi mantika fɔ di suoto di basanko kpinwu anu. Kamata fandiɛ lɛsɔnɔkpee lɛfɔ nwu, flɔbasinta kafɔɔ basɔnɔ lɛfɔ nwu asaa. <verse eid="EZK 16:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="EZK 16:42" />N-se ɔblɔ yakayaka nii di suoto lɛfɔ ntɔɔyɔɔ, sɛsɔfɔwo ɔkpɛ lɛblɔfiɛ nii ntoodie di suoto lɛfɔ; otu ntoote mi, ɔblɔ kafɔɔ dilɔbasinfiɛ mi.<verse eid="EZK 16:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="EZK 16:43" />“ ‘Ta fatanyuma ni sekpeele lɛfɔ obe, kafɔɔ feekpee mi ni ɔblɔ ku asaa ya mmle amuu oso yi, nwaako kamasoosa asaa ya fɛɛbla ni ntika di nsintɛɛ lɛfɔ, SAATE Kplɛ nwu niebuɛ. Fatayɔ anunsɔsaa faakyakaa di ayududusaa sɛsaabla lɛfɔ nwu bamba suoto?<verse eid="EZK 16:43" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Fɛ Mmle Di Obi Ɔya Nte Nii, Nkpo Di Obisankobi Nɔɔ Nte Nɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="EZK 16:44" />“ ‘Otii biala nimpɛ akpa kamapɛ lɛkpa le mmle di suoto lɛfɔ alɛ: “Mmle di obi ɔya nte nii, nkpo di obisankobi nɔɔ nte nɛ.” <verse eid="EZK 16:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="EZK 16:45" />Nwaako yaafɔ obisankobi fale, nnwɔ niasĩ ni ɔsa nɔɔ ku babi nɔɔ; nwaako obilɛma-sankobi fale fɛɛta babilee-sankobi, mba niasĩ ni basa lɛma ku babi lɛma. Hiti otii di yaafɔ lale, teefɔ kafɔɔ lale Amori otii. <verse eid="EZK 16:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="EZK 16:46" />Obilee-sankobi nɔɔfole niale Samaria, nnwɔ niasiɛ ni di katookasɔ lɛfɔ lɛkyɛ ku babisankobi nɔɔ; ku obilee-sankobi bisɔnle wɔ niasiɛ ni di kalakasɔ lɛfɔ lɛkyɛ ku babisankobi nɔɔ ba niale ni Sodom nɛ. <verse eid="EZK 16:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="EZK 16:47" />Diele sisuku lɛma lete faakyɛ, faanyunko kafɔɔ ayududusaa sɛsaabla lɛma nwu, kafɔɔ di sisuku lɛfɔ simuu kamɛ yi, faabalalaa wla faalenkee ma. <verse eid="EZK 16:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="EZK 16:48" />Nwaako lɛnya nkpe ni nkpa, SAATE Kplɛ nwu niebuɛ alɛ, obilee-sankobi Sodom ku babisankobi nɔɔ ditabla lɛsaa le di afɔ ku babisankobi lɛfɔ lɛbla ni diidii.<verse eid="EZK 16:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="EZK 16:49" />“ ‘Nyu lo, n-se mmle niale obilee-sankobi Sodom sikpile nɛ: Nnwɔɔ ku babisankobi nɔɔ latakatɛ suoto katoo, baale olepokyoa, batayɔ nwu ole kafɔɔ; batakyakaako bapiitɛ ku mba diafĩ nii. <verse eid="EZK 16:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="EZK 16:50" />Baatuo suoto, ni baabla ayududusaa di anu nii nɛ. Nkpo oso ladiɛ ma nnɛɛ fɛ mmle fatɔɔnya ni nɛ. <verse eid="EZK 16:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="EZK 16:51" />Samaria ditabla sikpile se faabla ni ɔfã nɔɔ. Fatɔɔbla ayududusaa kpinwu falenke ma, ni fɛɛbla babilee-sankobi fɛ bate tinini di asaa ya mmle amuu fɛɛbla ni suoto nɛ. <verse eid="EZK 16:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="EZK 16:52" />Sinunsɔ lɛfɔ sitika fɔ di suoto, diekye fatɔɔbla fɛɛta babilee-sankobi lɛwɛ lɛbɛ lewo. Ta sikpile lɛfɔ lakpɛ oyududu sialenkee ni sele ma oso yi, baate fɛ baabla tinini balenke fɔ. Nioso, sinunsɔ sikpɛ fɔ, sietika fɔ kafɔɔ di suoto, diekye fatɔɔta babilee-sankobi nte fɛ bɛɛbla tinini.<verse eid="EZK 16:52" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Babakple Manse Sodom Ku Samaria Lelolaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="EZK 16:53" />“ ‘Kafɔɔ yi, kamakplesa Sodom ku babisankobi nɔɔ, Samaria ku babisankobi nɔɔ lɛlɛ ku lɛlɛ lɛfɔ nta ma, <verse eid="EZK 16:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="EZK 16:54" />di mmle di sinunsɔ lɛfɔ katika fɔ ni di suoto, sinunsɔ nkpɛ fɔ ni kafɔɔ di asaa ya amuu fɛɛbla fɛɛta diekple ma ni kɔnɛɛ okpee kaafutu. <verse eid="EZK 16:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="EZK 16:55" />Ni babilee-sankobi, Sodom ku babisankobi nɔɔ ku Samaria ku babisankobi nɔɔ, kamakple manaasiɛ di letembi le baasiɛ ni kamɛ saa; ni afɔ ku babisankobi lɛfɔ kafɔɔ kamakple minaasiɛ di letembi le biasiɛ ni kamɛ saa. <verse eid="EZK 16:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="EZK 16:56" />Flɔbalɛɛ bia obilee-sankobi Sodom leyooto di ɔkantabee lɛfɔ kamɛ fɛ mmle faabla ni saa, <verse eid="EZK 16:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="EZK 16:57" />fiɛ nfɛ di akpilesaa lɛfɔ ladie ni kayi. Bia nunua yi, bitookple lɛmansaa biɛta Edom babisankobi ku batii ba bamuu ninsi bakaako nwɔ ni ku Filisti batii babisankobi- batii ba bamuu niɛmana ye beekyi ni boonyu ye ni nyakatãa. <verse eid="EZK 16:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="EZK 16:58" />Fabafũ letokonanfi di anunsɔsaa lɛfɔ ku ayududusaa lɛfɔ sɛsaabla suoto, SAATE Kplɛ nwu niebuɛ.<verse eid="EZK 16:58" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kanya Ninii Ka Ninte Dinaa Ni Kaloo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="EZK 16:59" />“ ‘Nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE Kplɛ nwu kobuɛ ni alɛ: Kamananfi fɔ kootoko fɛ mmle feesiɛko nii, diekye feenyu ntam nii nyakatãa, diefe ni di kanya ninii nwu ɔlalaasa suoto. <verse eid="EZK 16:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="EZK 16:60" />Kafɔɔ kamanyuma kanya ninii le lanii ni ku afɔ di sekpeele lɛfɔ obe kamɛ, kamabla kafɔɔ kanya ninii ku afɔ dinaa ni kaloo. <verse eid="EZK 16:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="EZK 16:61" />Ninfɛ fabanyuma ablasaa lɛfɔ, sinunsɔ kafɔɔ nkpɛ fɔ, nse feefũ babilee-sankobi, mba ninle fɔ ni banɔɔfo ku bamaatɛ lɛfɔ, akyuu nwu anyɔ nɛ. Kamayɔ ma nta fɔ fɛ babisankobi, kafɔɔ diele di kanya ninii nii le lanii ni ku afɔ oso. <verse eid="EZK 16:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="EZK 16:62" />Nioso kamabla kanya ninii nii ku afɔ, ni fabatofo falɛ ami ninle SAATE nwu nɛ. <verse eid="EZK 16:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="EZK 16:63" />Ni nse lɛbla lekoto otikiti lɛta fɔ di asaa ya amuu fɛɛbla ni suoto yi, fabanyuma, sinunsɔ kafɔɔ nkpɛ fɔ, ni diidii kafɔɔ flɔbasinkple fabɛ kanya lɛfɔ ta sinunsɔ lɛfɔ oso, SAATE Kplɛ nwu niebuɛ.’ ”<verse eid="EZK 16:63" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="EZK 17" />
  <para style="s1">Lɛkpa Ɔpɛ Di Baklikpo Ku Nta Kowoso Suoto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 17:1" />Ni di SAATE nwu ɔlaa lawa kuatɛɛ alɛ: <verse eid="EZK 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 17:2" />“Otii obi, tũ oku, faapɛ kafɔɔ Israel leyo lɛkpa. <verse eid="EZK 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 17:3" />Tɔkɔ ma falɛ, ‘Nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE Kplɛ nwu kobuɛ ni alɛ: Klikpo kplɛ onwii ku afoko kplɛ ku selonkoo kaanale siapɛpɛɛ ni kafɔɔ ku afa ateate di suoto lawa Lebanon. Ni aabamufũ sedar kowoso kunwii nsintɛɛ, <verse eid="EZK 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 17:4" />aafee ɔnyaɔnya nikũ, aayɔ nwu aasifiko asaa basunsũtɛ kasɔ kanwii suoto, ni aayɔ nwu aalaasɔ di asaabayatɛ okpoo kplɛ kamɛ nɛ.<verse eid="EZK 17:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 17:5" />“ ‘Ni aayɔ kasɔ lɛfɔ lewosobi lewo aalaapɛ di kasɔ ka ninsi ni lɛla suoto nɛ. Aapɛ ni fɛle pamplo di nfũ di ntu nte ni kpinwu, <verse eid="EZK 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 17:6" />ni diakɔntɔ diabakple nta kowoso kuafukiti kuatĩi kasɔ nɛ. Sɛla nikũ lamunikĩi siakyɔɔ nwɔ anu, kafɔɔ sidu nikũ laka di kalɔ nikũ. Nioso kuabakple nta kowoso, ni di sɛla latataa siadie kafɔɔ afata nɛ.<verse eid="EZK 17:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 17:7" />“ ‘Kafɔɔ klikpo kplɛ bamba wɔ niawɛ ni afoko kplɛ ku selonkoo kpinwu di suoto lawɛ. Kanunua yi, nta kowoso nwu lakɛnsa sidu nikũ di lɛba le baasɔ kũ ni siakyɔɔ nwɔ anu, ni siananfi sɛla nikũ siakyɔɔ alɛ okpete kũ ntu nɛ. <verse eid="EZK 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 17:8" />Kasɔ biene suoto baasɔ kũ di ntu kpinwu kotoko di mmle kuatataa ni sɛla, kuntika abi kunkple ni kafɔɔ nta kowoso nwaa.’<verse eid="EZK 17:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 17:9" />“Tɔkɔ ma falɛ, ‘Nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE Kplɛ nwu kobuɛ ni alɛ: Kubawɛ nkpa? Blɔbapɔ kũ bakpakpaa kafɔɔ awosobi ninya alɛ kuyɔɔ? Sɛla nikũ fɔle simuu kamayɔɔ. Diele kɔnɛɛ siene ee batii kpinwu babayɔ mampɔ kũ ku sidu nikũ. <verse eid="EZK 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 17:10" />Nse bia beesifi kũ bɛɛlase lɛsɔ, kubawɛ nkpa? Kulɔbayɔɔ fɛɛ, nse kufĩkatunkɔ afɛɛfɔ lɛfɛ kũ- kulɔbakpi di kasɔ ka suoto bɛɛsɔ kũ ni?’ ”<verse eid="EZK 17:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Baadiki Lɛkpa Nwu Kasɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 17:11" />Ninfɛ di SAATE nwu ɔlaa lawa kuatɛɛ alɛ: <verse eid="EZK 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 17:12" />“Kaalɛ batokopĩtɛ leyo le mmle falɛ, ‘Bienu asaa ya mmle kasɔ?’ Tɔkɔ ma falɛ: ‘Babel ɔka lakyɛ Yerusalem aalamufũ ɔka nɔɔ ku banɔɔfotii nɔɔ finle, aakpaa ma aawako Babel. <verse eid="EZK 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 17:13" />Ninfɛ aadiki otii onwii di ɔka leyo kamɛ aabla kanya ninii ku nnwɔɔ, ni aayɔ nwɔ aakpee di ntam kalɔ nɛ. Aakpaa kafɔɔ kasɔ nwu batunletɛ aasifiko, <verse eid="EZK 17:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 17:14" />di mmle di sɛka kalekɔ nwu kawa ni kasɔ, alɛ kalaasinfuo ni okple ɔtaka, alɛ sɛka kalekɔ nwu kaayila di kanya ninii nɔɔ nwu omufũ okle lete suoto. <verse eid="EZK 17:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 17:15" />Kafɔɔ ɔka nwu lataka aayila nwɔ di suoto, ni aakpee batii nɔɔ baakyɛ Egipte baalaakpaa bapɔnkɔ ku bakpɛtɛ kpinwu baawako nɛ. Dibalɛ ɔkyɛ nintɔɔ? Otii wɔ nimbla ni asaa ya mmle kamafuo otoso osifi? Abafukuti kanya ninii nwu, antoso kafɔɔ ansifi?<verse eid="EZK 17:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 17:16" />“ ‘Nwaako lɛnya nkpe ni nkpa yi, SAATE Kplɛ nwu niebuɛ alɛ, ɔɔwa ɔbakpi di Babel, di ɔka wɔ niesiɛsa nwɔ ni di lɛkakpomii suoto kasɔ, nnwɔ ntam aanyu ni nyakatãa ku nnwɔ kanya ninii aafukuti nii. <verse eid="EZK 17:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 17:17" />Nse bɛɛpɛ atii beetofo kafɔɔ seyoyiɛ beekyisa alɛ bɔɔwɔɔsa batii kpinwu yi, Farao ku bakpɛtɛ siene nɔɔ ku batii ɔlambu dilɔbafuo nwɔ ɔkyakaako di kakpɛ kamɛ. <verse eid="EZK 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 17:18" />Aanyu ntam nwu nyakatãa di kanya ninii le aafukuti ni suoto. Ta aakpee ni kɔnɛɛ nɔɔ di ɔlaa wɔ aabuɛ aatɛ ni kamɛ, aabla ni asaa ya mmle amuu kafɔɔ oso yi, ɔlɔbafuo otoso osifi.<verse eid="EZK 17:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 17:19" />“ ‘Nkpo oso, nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE Kplɛ nwu kobuɛ ni alɛ: Nwaako lɛnya nkpe ni nkpa, kamasoosa ntam nii be eenyu ni nyakatãa ku kanya ninii nii le eefukuti ni ntika nwɔ di nsintɛɛ. <verse eid="EZK 17:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 17:20" />Kamafukuti asawu nii ntɛ nwɔ, dikyĩ nii kafɔɔ kamamufũ nwɔ. Kamakpaa nwɔ n-wako Babel nimakanko nwu ninfa, diekye atale onukwale aatɛɛ. <verse eid="EZK 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 17:21" />Bakpɛtɛ nɔɔ akudi ya amuu nikotoso ni kamanɔɔ di kapamii kanya, babasamiisa mba kafɔɔ nimawɛ ni nkpa mankpee di afɛɛfɔ kamɛ. Ninfɛ bibatofo bilɛ ami SAATE nwu niakakatɛ nɛ.’”<verse eid="EZK 17:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yaa Labuɛ Aatɛ Alɛ Osuku Onyu Nkpe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZK 17:22" />“ ‘Nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE Kplɛ nwu kobuɛ ni alɛ: Ami omu nii kamafee sedar kowoso nsintɛɛ ɔnya ninaasɔ nwu; kamafee kayereyerekɔ nkyeko nsintɛɛ ninwu ɔla yɛntɛle suoto ninaasɔ nwu di kobokote takale ko ninte ni kyookyoo suoto. <verse eid="EZK 17:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZK 17:23" />Kamasɔ kũ di Israel kobokote ko niɛtaka kulenke ni suoto; kubatataa sɛla kuntika abi kumakple kafɔɔ sedar kowoso ko nikɔlɛ ni onyu nwaa. Bakansiɛ ateate biala kamabla ayo ninkũ kamɛ; babawɛ kasiɛkɔ di sɛla ninkũ oyududu kamɛ. <verse eid="EZK 17:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZK 17:24" />Awoso nwu amuu di lepoo kamɛ kamatofo alɛ ami SAATE nwu ninwakosa kowoso takale kasɔ, nta kafɔɔ kowoso ko niɛwa ni kasɔ ntaka nɛ. Ami ninta kowoso kɔnle nkoso, nta kafɔɔ kowoso kosole nfukuti.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EZK 17:24">“ ‘Ami SAATE nwu niɛkakatɛ, kamabla ni kafɔɔ.’ ”<verse eid="EZK 17:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="EZK 18" />
  <para style="s1">Otii Biala Kamata Nkuntaa Di Nle Ɛɛbla Ni Suoto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 18:1" />SAATE nwu ɔlaa lawa kuatɛɛ alɛ: <verse eid="EZK 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 18:2" />“Obe oso mintɔɔpɛ lɛkpa le mmle di Israel kasɔ suoto bilɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 18:2">“ ‘Babibate n-le awosobi ya niɛkplakpla nii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 18:2">kafɔɔ babi anyɛɛ ninkpakpaa’?<verse eid="EZK 18:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 18:3" />“Nwaako lɛnya nkpe ni nkpa, SAATE Kplɛ nwu niebuɛ alɛ, bilɔbasimpɛ lɛkpa le mmle di Israel. <verse eid="EZK 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 18:4" />Diekye ɔkla biala ninkpe ni nkpa nle mi ole, obi ote ku obi nɔɔ- akyuu lɛma nwu anyɔ bale mi bale. Ɔkla wɔ nimbla ni okpile ninle nwɔ nimakpi nii.<verse eid="EZK 18:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 18:5" />“Nse loo otii owo nkpe ate tinini,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 18:5">ambla ni lɛsaa le ninlɛ ni ku nle niesiɛko ni,<verse eid="EZK 18:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 18:6" />ananle alesaa di kobokote nfiofa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 18:6">ee asumu Israel batii afiɔ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 18:6">Anntenko owo nɔɔ ɔsɔfɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 18:6">ee atenko ɔsanko di obe wɔ kamɛ ɛɛpɛ ni kɔkpaa kaasɔ.<verse eid="EZK 18:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 18:7" />Annyinka otii kuonwii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 18:7">kafɔɔ ankplesa lɛsaa le eefũ ɛɛtɛ ni fiɛ ɛɛfɛnsa koto ɛɛta ni anta.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 18:7">Ammbla kayu asaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 18:7">kafɔɔ an-yɔ alesaa nɔɔ anta otii wɔ di kɔka nkle nii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 18:7">anta kafɔɔ mba ninkyɛ ni akyɔtɔ akpeele.<verse eid="EZK 18:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 18:8" />Annfɛnsa koto aata otii alɛ ɔɔwɛ lɛsaa ankyakaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 18:8">ee atikasa lɛsaa kpinwu di osi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 18:8">Ankpukutisa kɔnɛɛ nɔɔ di ɔtanlolaa ɔbla suoto,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 18:8">anlolaa kafɔɔ lɛka anka di otii ku otii ntɛɛ.<verse eid="EZK 18:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 18:9" />Antikanko sɛsaabla nii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 18:9">anklee kafɔɔ afiofa nii di onukwale kanya.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 18:9">Otii nwu nkpo nte tinini;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 18:9">nwaako abasiɛ nkpa,</para>
  <para style="q4" vid="EZK 18:9">SAATE Kplɛ nwu niebuɛ.<verse eid="EZK 18:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 18:10" />“Nse loo akpe obisuɔtɔbi wɔ ninkpee ni kudu, an-wii ni ntɔ kaasɔ ee ambla ni asaa ya mmle bamba lele, <verse eid="EZK 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 18:11" />(kuntɛ ote diɛbla kuninwii ninya):</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 18:11">“Anle alesaa di kobokote nfiofa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 18:11">Antenko owo nɔɔ ɔsɔfɔ.<verse eid="EZK 18:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 18:12" />An-nyinka bapiitɛ ku mba diefĩ nii.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 18:12">Ambla kayu asaa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 18:12">Annkplesa lɛsaa le eefũ ɛɛtɛ ni fiɛ ɛɛfɛnsa koto ɛɛta ni aata.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 18:12">Afiɔ ansumu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 18:12">Ayududusaa ambla.<verse eid="EZK 18:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 18:13" />Anfɛnsa koto anta otii anwɛ lɛsaa ankyakaa, antikasa kafɔɔ lɛsaa kpinwu di osi.</para>
  <para style="m" vid="EZK 18:13">Otii wɔ mmle okle kaasiɛ nkpa? Alaasiɛ! Ta ayududusaa ya mmle amuu atɔɔbla ni oso yi, nwaako babalo nwɔ, ntɔ nɔɔ kafɔɔ kamatika di nnwɔɔ omu nɔɔ disi.<verse eid="EZK 18:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 18:14" />“Kafɔɔ nse loo obisuɔtɔbi wɔ mmle nkpe obisuɔtɔbi wɔ nin-nya ni sikpile se simuu di ote kɔbla nii, kuntɛ ɔɔnya nya yi, nnwɔɔ ambla asaa nwu okle:<verse eid="EZK 18:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 18:15" />“Annle alesaa di kobokote nfiofa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 18:15">ee asumu Israel leyo afiɔ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 18:15">Anntenko owo nɔɔ ɔsɔfɔ.<verse eid="EZK 18:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 18:16" />Annyinka otii kuonwii</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 18:16">ee afũ lɛsaa atɛ fiɛ aafɛnsa koto aata otii.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 18:16">Ammbla kayu asaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 18:16">kafɔɔ an-yɔ alesaa nɔɔ anta otii wɔ di kɔka nkle nii</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 18:16">anta kafɔɔ batii ba ninkyɛ ni akyɔtɔ akpeele.<verse eid="EZK 18:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 18:17" />Ankpukutisa kɔnɛɛ nɔɔ di okpile suoto</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 18:17">Anntikasa koto aata otii alɛ ɔɔwɛ lɛsaa ankyakaa, ee atikasa lɛsaa kpinwu di osi atɔɔ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 18:17">Am-mufũ afiofa nii anklee, antikanko kafɔɔ sɛsaabla nii.</para>
  <para style="m" vid="EZK 18:17">Ɔlɔbakpi ata ote okpile; nwaako abasiɛ nkpa. <verse eid="EZK 18:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 18:18" />Kafɔɔ ote kamakpi anta nnwɔɔ omu nɔɔ okpile, diekye aabla katafaa asaa, aayu obilɛma, aabla kafɔɔ lɛsaa le ninanlɛ ni di batii nɔɔ kamɛ.<verse eid="EZK 18:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 18:19" />“Kafɔɔ biɔkaalɛ bilɛ, ‘Obe oso ninamabuo obi di ote lɛpɔɔ okpi suoto?’ Di obe wɔ di obi nwu lɛbla ni lɛsaa le ninlɛ ku lɛsaa le niesiɛko nii, eelolaa ni kafɔɔ sɛsaabla nii eeklee ni yi, nwaako abasiɛ nkpa. <verse eid="EZK 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 18:20" />Ɔkla wɔ niɛbla ni okpile ninle nnwɔ nimakpi ni nɛ. Dilɔbabuo obi di ote lɛpɔɔ okpi suoto, ee ote akpi di obi lɛpɔɔ okpi suoto. Babayɔ otii tinini ɔsaabla tinini mantɔɔ, siensientɛ kafɔɔ asiensiesaa kamatika nwɔ di suoto.<verse eid="EZK 18:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 18:21" />“Kafɔɔ nse kpiletɛ lekyi di sikpile se simuu atɔɔbla ni suoto, eemufũ sɛsaabla nii simuu eeklee, ɛɛbla kafɔɔ lɛsaa le ninlɛ ku lɛsaa le niesiɛko ni yi, nwaako abasiɛ nkpa; ɔlɔbakpi. <verse eid="EZK 18:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZK 18:22" />Blɔbanyuma ɔtanlolaa ɔbla wɔ aabla ni kuonwii di suoto nɔɔ. Ta asaa tinini ya aabla ni oso yi, abasiɛ nkpa. <verse eid="EZK 18:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZK 18:23" />Ninnya suoto lɛyɔɔ kuninwii di kpiletɛ kukpi kamɛ, SAATE Kplɛ nwu niebuɛ. Kafɔɔ suoto nin-yɔɔ mi nse beekyi di sisuku lɛma bɛɛwɛ nkpa.<verse eid="EZK 18:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZK 18:24" />“Kafɔɔ nse tininitɛ lekyi di ɔsaabla tinini nɔɔ suoto ɛɛbla okpile, ɛɛbla kafɔɔ ayududusaa ya okle di kpiletɛ mbla nii, ɔlɔbasiɛ nkpa. Blɔbanyuma asaa tinini ya aabla ni kuninwii. Abakpi ta onukwale ɔtanle wɔ suoto eekpi ni lɛpɔɔ ku sikpile se ɛɛbla ni oso.<verse eid="EZK 18:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EZK 18:25" />“Kafɔɔ biobuɛ bilɛ, ‘SAATE nwu osuku diete tinini.’ Oo Israel leyo, binu: Osuku nii diete tinini? Diele sisuku lee ninante tinini? <verse eid="EZK 18:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EZK 18:26" />Nse tininitɛ lekyi di ɔsaabla tinini nɔɔ suoto, ɛɛlaabla okpile yi, abakpi di okpile nwu suoto; abakpi ta okpile wɔ ɛɛbla ni oso. <verse eid="EZK 18:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EZK 18:27" />Kafɔɔ nse kpiletɛ lekyi di akpilesaa ya aabla ni suoto, ɛɛbla lɛsaa le ninlɛ ni ku lɛsaa le niesiɛko ni yi, abadiki nkpa nɔɔ. <verse eid="EZK 18:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EZK 18:28" />Ta eebu ni disi di ɔtanlolaa ɔbla wɔ omuu aabla ni, eediɛ nya ni ɔbla oso yi, nwaako abasiɛ nkpa; ɔlɔbakpi. <verse eid="EZK 18:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EZK 18:29" />Kafɔɔ Israel batii mbuɛ alɛ, ‘SAATE nwu osuku diete tinini.’ Oo Israel batii, sisuku nii diete tinini? Diele sisuku lee ninante tinini?<verse eid="EZK 18:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="EZK 18:30" />“Nkpo oso, Oo Israel batii, kamakanko ye, otii biala di sisuku nɔɔ kanya, SAATE Kplɛ nwu niebuɛ. Bikyi! Bikyi di ɔtanlolaa ɔbla lee omuu suoto; ni okpile dilɔbapɛ ye kaasɔ. <verse eid="EZK 18:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EZK 18:31" />Bidiki suoto lee di ɔtanlolaa ɔbla lee omuu biabla kamɛ, biɛwɛ otu fɔle ku ninwuna fɔle. Oo Israel batii, obe oso bibakpi? <verse eid="EZK 18:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EZK 18:32" />Diekye nin-nya suoto lɛyɔɔ di otii kuonwii kukpi kamɛ, SAATE Kplɛ nwu niebuɛ alɛ. Bikyi, biesiɛ nkpa!<verse eid="EZK 18:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="EZK 19" />
  <para style="s1">Israel Baka Okunu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 19:1" />“Afɔ yi, wola okunu di Israel baka suoto. <verse eid="EZK 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 19:2" />Sa onu nwu falɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 19:2">“ ‘Ɔmɛ kyata-sanko di yaafɔ lale nkpo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 19:2">di bakyata-suɔtɔ kamɛ!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 19:2">Ante di bakyata abi kamɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 19:2">an-nyu abi nɔɔ disi.<verse eid="EZK 19:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 19:3" />Aanyu dibi nɔɔ ninwii disi diamuɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 19:3">ni diabakple kyata siene nɛ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 19:3">Aatekete mmle mamufũ ni babɔkɛɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 19:3">ni aabɛbɛɛ batii nɛ.<verse eid="EZK 19:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 19:4" />Nnle nwu lanu nwɔ lɛkpanko,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 19:4">ni baakpa nwɔ baakpee di dibiɔ lɛma kamɛ nɛ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 19:4">Baakpee nwɔ nkɔnii baakpaa nwɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 19:4">baasifiko Egipte kasɔ.<verse eid="EZK 19:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 19:5" />“ ‘Obe wɔ di kyata-sanko nwu lanya alɛ osuku onyu nɔɔ ntɔɔkpɔtɔɔ nii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 19:5">di lɛsaa le oomiɛ ni ntooyu ni yi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 19:5">ni aadiki dibi nɔɔ bamba</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 19:5">aabla nwɔ kyata siene nɛ.<verse eid="EZK 19:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 19:6" />Ankumii di bakyata kamɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 19:6">diekye nfɛ ale kyata siene.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 19:6">Aatekete babɔkɛɛ omufũ owee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 19:6">ni aabɛbɛɛ kafɔɔ batii nɛ.<verse eid="EZK 19:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 19:7" />Aabibiɛ n-wofakɔ lɛma aatɛ kaasɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 19:7">aawɔɔsa kafɔɔ sekpoo lɛma.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 19:7">Nse eekumii yi, difu mpɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 19:7">kasɔ nwu ku mba bamuu niasiɛ ka ni di suoto.<verse eid="EZK 19:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 19:8" />Ninfɛ di nnle nwu lataka nwɔ di suoto,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 19:8">mba niakye ni nsɔ be niamana nwɔ diakyi nii.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 19:8">Baafukuti asawu lɛma baatɛ nwɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 19:8">ni aakpa aabuo di dibiɔ lɛma kamɛ nɛ.<verse eid="EZK 19:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 19:9" />Baananfi nwɔ ku nkɔnii baakpee di dikunyo kamɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 19:9">ni baakpaa nwɔ baawako Babel ɔka nfũ nɛ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 19:9">Baalaatɛ nwɔ di leyo katenkɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 19:9">nioso batasinnu dikumii nɔɔ nwu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 19:9">di Israel abokote suoto.<verse eid="EZK 19:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 19:10" />“ ‘Yaafɔ late fɛle nta kowoso di nta awoso lɛfɔ kofe kamɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 19:10">baapɛ ni di okle kotoko;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 19:10">kuatataa sɛla kpinwu kuatika abi kpinwu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 19:10">ta ntu kuawɛ ni ntu kpinwu oso.<verse eid="EZK 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 19:11" />Sɛla nikũ lawɛ osie,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 19:11">sialɛ siata ni ɔka lɛkɔ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 19:11">Siataka katoo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 19:11">sialenkee lɛnwaakɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 19:11">mannya ni katoo lɛtaka nikũ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 19:11">ku mmle di sɛla nikũ mpɔ nii.<verse eid="EZK 19:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 19:12" />Kafɔɔ baasifi nta kowoso nwu di ɔblɔ kanya</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 19:12">ni baafuki kũ baatɛ kaasɔ nɛ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 19:12">Kufĩkatunkɔ kɔfɛɛfɔ lata kũ kuakoso,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 19:12">awosobi nikũ lakpakpaa;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 19:12">sɛla siene nikũ lakoso,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 19:12">ni di ɔtɔ lafiɛ nya nɛ.<verse eid="EZK 19:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 19:13" />Kanunua yi, ɔfaafuu kamɛ batɔɔsɔ kũ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 19:13">di kasɔ kosole di ntu ɔlaa nkpe ni osie suoto.<verse eid="EZK 19:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 19:14" />Ɔtɔ lafiɛ kuakye ɔla nwu omu onwii suoto</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 19:14">kuabafiɛ awosobi nikũ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 19:14">Ɔla siene kuonwii ditabu ninkũ suoto</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 19:14">kualɛ kunta ni ɔka lɛkɔ.’</para>
  <para style="m" vid="EZK 19:14">Nnwu ninle nyaami ɔlaa wɔ baablako ni ɔkpɛ fɛ okunu nɛ.”<verse eid="EZK 19:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="EZK 20" />
  <para style="s1">Saate Nwu Dibiesaa Ku Batii Otokopĩ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 20:1" />Di lɛlɛɛ kuɛnsinle kamɛ, di Israel batii kɔwɛntɛ nɔnle dii fosile suoto yi, Israel banɔɔfo bawo lawa baabawolaa asaa kamɛ baakyeko SAATE nwu nfũ, ni baasiɛ kaasɔ di anu nii nɛ.<verse eid="EZK 20:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 20:2" />Ninfɛ di SAATE nwu ɔlaa lawa kuatɛɛ alɛ: <verse eid="EZK 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 20:3" />“Otii obi, kakatɛko Israel banɔɔfo, faatɔkɔ ma falɛ, ‘Nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE Kplɛ nwu kobuɛ ni alɛ: Ami biɛwa ɔlaa ɔkaalɛ? Nwaako lɛnya nkpe ni nkpa yi, nɔmata ye bikaalɛ mi ɔlaa, SAATE Kplɛ nwu niebuɛ.’<verse eid="EZK 20:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 20:4" />“Fabakanko ma? Otii obi, fabakanko ma? Ni ta ma batofo bate lɛma ayududusaa sɛsaabla nwu, <verse eid="EZK 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 20:5" />faatɔkɔ ma kafɔɔ falɛ: ‘Nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE Kplɛ nwu kobuɛ ni alɛ: Di dii le ladiki ni Israel, latakatɛ kɔnɛɛ nii katoo laka ntam lata Yakob leyo banantii, ladiki kafɔɔ suoto nii latuo ma di Egipte. Latakatɛ kɔnɛɛ nii katoo latɔkɔ ma nlɛ, “Ami ninle SAATE Yaa lee nɛ.” <verse eid="EZK 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 20:6" />Laka ntam lata ma di dii nwu suoto nlɛ kamakpaa ma ndieko di Egipte n-wako kasɔ ka lamiɛ lata ma ni suoto, kasɔ ka di nnyɛɛntu ku bablɔ kobiɛ ninfe ka ni di suoto, kasɔ ka ninlɛ kalenke ni nsɔ nwu mmuu. <verse eid="EZK 20:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 20:7" />Ni latɔkɔ ma nlɛ, “Obiala lee, afuki atembi nyakatãa nɔɔ nwu eediki anumbi nɔɔ eetika ni ayu, bitankpɔnɔfɔsa suoto lee kafɔɔ ku Egipte afiɔ. Ami ninle SAATE Yaa lee nɛ.”<verse eid="EZK 20:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 20:8" />“ ‘Kafɔɔ baataka baayila mi di suoto, ni batakyɔɔ mi atoko nɛ; batayɔ atembi nyakatãa lɛma nwu baadiki anu lɛma baatika ni bayu, ee basĩ Egipte afiɔ. Nioso labuɛ nlɛ kamasoosa ɔblɔ yakayaka nii nkpete ma di suoto, nimblako kafɔɔ ɔblɔ nii ɔkpɛ di suoto lɛma di Egipte. <verse eid="EZK 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 20:9" />Kafɔɔ ta leyooto nii oso, labla lɛsaa le ninamata ni dikpɔnɔfɔ ni di nnle be kamɛ basi ni anu, ku mba anu ladiki suoto nii latuo ni Israel batii, di obe wɔ lakpaa ma ladieko ni di Egipte. <verse eid="EZK 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 20:10" />Nkpo oso laleko ma katũ ladieko di Egipte, ni lakpaa ma lawako ɔfaafuu kamɛ nɛ. <verse eid="EZK 20:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 20:11" />Lata ma sɛsaabla nii, ni lata ma baatofo afiofa nii nɛ. Diekye otii wɔ niɛkyɔɔ nya ni atoko kamasiɛ nkpa ninnya suoto. <verse eid="EZK 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 20:12" />Lata ma kafɔɔ Anyɛɛtɛyi nii fɛ nsũ lɛtɛsaa le ninsi wo ni nintɛɛ, di mmle baatofo ni alɛ ami SAATE nwu niɛbla ma ni klekle.<verse eid="EZK 20:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 20:13" />“ ‘Kafɔɔ Israel batii lataka baayila mi di suoto di ɔfaafuu nwu kamɛ. Batatikanko sɛsaabla nii, kafɔɔ baasĩ afiofa nii- nu di otii wɔ niɛkyɔɔ nya ni atoko kamasiɛ nkpa ninnya suoto yi- baakpɔnɔfɔsa Anyɛɛtɛyi nii. Nioso labuɛ nlɛ kamanyɛɛnɛ ɔblɔ yakayaka nii nkpete ma di suoto, nin-wɔɔsa ma kafɔɔ di ɔfaafuu nwu suoto. <verse eid="EZK 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 20:14" />Kafɔɔ ta leyooto nii oso yi, labla lɛsaa le ninamata ni dikpɔnɔfɔ ni di nnle nwu anu, di batii ba anu lakpaa ma ladieko nii. <verse eid="EZK 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 20:15" />Latakatɛ kafɔɔ kɔnɛɛ katoo laka ntam lata ma di ɔfaafuu nwu kamɛ nlɛ, nɔmakpaa ma n-wako kasɔ ka lata ma nii- kasɔ ka di nnyɛɛntu ku bablɔ kobiɛ ninfe ka ni di suoto, kasɔ ka ninlɛ kalenke ni nsɔ nwu mmuu- <verse eid="EZK 20:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 20:16" />ta baasĩ ni afiofa nii, batatikanko ni sɛsaabla nii ku Anyɛɛtɛyi nii ya baakpɔnɔfɔsa ni oso. Diekye baayɔ situ lɛma baatika di afiɔ lɛma suoto. <verse eid="EZK 20:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 20:17" />Kafɔɔ lanya ma nyaami, ni nintawɔɔsa ma ee nta kalookɔ lɛma kawa di ɔfaafuu nwu kamɛ nɛ. <verse eid="EZK 20:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 20:18" />Ni latɔkɔ babi lɛma di ɔfaafuu nwu kamɛ nlɛ, “Bitantikanko bate lee nnafukpaa ee biale afiofa lɛma ee biakpɔnɔfɔsa suoto lee ku afiɔ lɛma nwu nɛ. <verse eid="EZK 20:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 20:19" />Ami ninle SAATE Yaa lee nɛ; bitikanko sɛsaabla nii, bielolaa kafɔɔ binyu bilɛ bieklee afiofa nii. <verse eid="EZK 20:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 20:20" />Bibla Anyɛɛtɛyi nii klekle, alɛ aale nsũ lɛtɛsaa le ninsi wo ni nintɛɛ. Ninfɛ bibatofo bilɛ ami ninle SAATE Yaa lee nɛ.”<verse eid="EZK 20:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 20:21" />“ ‘Kafɔɔ babi nwu lataka baayila mi di suoto: Batatikanko sɛsaabla nii, batalolaa afiofa nii baaklee. Nu di otii wɔ niɛkyɔɔ nya ni atoko kamasiɛ nkpa ninnya suoto yi- baakpɔnɔfɔsa Anyɛɛtɛyi nii. Nioso labuɛ nlɛ kamasoosa ɔblɔ yakayaka nii nkpete ma di suoto, nimablako kafɔɔ ɔblɔ nii ɔkpɛ di suoto lɛma di ɔfaafuu nwu. <verse eid="EZK 20:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZK 20:22" />Kafɔɔ lakplesa kɔnɛɛ nii, ta leyooto nii kafɔɔ oso yi, labla lɛsaa le ninɔmata ni dikpɔnɔfɔ ni di nnle nwu anu, di batii ba anu lakpaa ma ladieko nii. <verse eid="EZK 20:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZK 20:23" />Latakatɛ kafɔɔ kɔnɛɛ katoo laka ntam lata ma di ɔfaafuu kamɛ, nlɛ kamatososa ma nkpete di nnle nwu kamɛ, ninsamiisa ma kafɔɔ nfenko di nsɔ nwu suoto. <verse eid="EZK 20:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZK 20:24" />Diekye batale afiofa nii, kafɔɔ baasĩ sɛsaabla nii, baakpɔnɔfɔsa Anyɛɛtɛyi nii, ni di anu lɛma kafɔɔ latika di bate lɛma afiɔ suoto nɛ. <verse eid="EZK 20:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EZK 20:25" />Ni di ami kafɔɔ layɔ ma lata sɛsaabla kpile se ninanlɛ ni ku afiofa ya suoto manamafuo ni nkpa osiɛ ɔta nɛ; <verse eid="EZK 20:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EZK 20:26" />Lata ma baakpɔnɔfɔ, diafe ni di asaa ɔta lɛma suoto- lelofo kasale biala ɔyɔ ɔta ole- alɛ kata difu n-yii ma kamɛ di mmle baatofo ni alɛ, ami ninle ni SAATE nwu nɛ.’<verse eid="EZK 20:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="EZK 20:27" />“Nkpo oso, otii obi, kakatɛ fata Israel batii, faatɔkɔ ma falɛ, ‘Nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE Kplɛ nwu kobuɛ ni alɛ: Di nle mmle kamɛ kafɔɔ, bate lee lakpɔnɔfɔsa mi, di osĩ wɔ baasĩ mi ni kamɛ: <verse eid="EZK 20:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EZK 20:28" />Obe wɔ lakpaa ma lawako ni kasɔ ka laka ntam nlɛ kamayɔ nta ma ni suoto, baanya ni lekpenkpe takale lele ee kowoso kɔnle lele yi, baata seleɔta lɛma ninfa, baata asaaɔta ya niata ɔblɔ lafiɛ mi ni osie kanya. Baawako olufui kɔnɔnkɔnɔ lɛma, baanyɛɛnɛ kafɔɔ nta asaaɔta lɛma ninfa. <verse eid="EZK 20:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EZK 20:29" />Ninfɛ lakaalɛ ma nlɛ: Kamɛntakalekɔ ninle nka mmle biɔkyɛ ni?’ ” (Manlɛɛ ka Bama<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">20.29 </char><char style="fp" closed="false">Lɛsɔdiki ninle katakalekɔ lɛba nɛ </char></note> diɛbase di mmiɛ dii le mmle.)<verse eid="EZK 20:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="EZK 20:30" />“Nkpo oso tɔkɔ Israel batii falɛ: ‘Nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE Kplɛ nwu kobuɛ ni alɛ: Bibakpɔnɔfɔsa suoto lee fɛ mmle di bate lee labla ni, min-yɔ kafɔɔ anu lee mintika di atembi nyakatãa lɛma nwu suoto? <verse eid="EZK 20:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EZK 20:31" />Di obe wɔ biɔta ni akyɛsaa lee- babisuɔtɔbi lee nwu min-yɔ minta ni ole di ɔtɔ kamɛ- minkple mintɔɔkpɔnɔfɔsa ni suoto lee ku afiɔ lee amuu diɛbase di miɛ dii le mmle. Oo Israel batii, nta ye osuku biewolaa asaa kamɛ bekyeko ɔkyɛ nii? Nwaako, lɛnya nkpe ni nkpa yi, SAATE Kplɛ nwu niebuɛ alɛ, nɔmata ye osuku biwolaa asaa kamɛ bikyeko ɔkyɛ nii.<verse eid="EZK 20:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="EZK 20:32" />“ ‘Mimbuɛ bilɛ, “Buomiɛ bulɛ bute fɛle nnle nwu, fɛle kayi ka mmle batii, mba nintɔ ni awoso ku afuɔ.” Kafɔɔ disibu le bikle ni dilɔbawa kaanya diidii.<verse eid="EZK 20:32" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yaa Nnaanfi Kootoko An-yɔ Kafɔɔ An-kyɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="EZK 20:33" />Nwaako lɛnya nkpe ni nkpa yi, SAATE Kplɛ nwu niebuɛ alɛ, kamale sɛka di suoto lee ku kɔnɛɛ siene ku kɔnɛɛ lɛnanfi ku ɔblɔ yakayaka ɔnya. <verse eid="EZK 20:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="EZK 20:34" />Kamakpaa ye nkyeko nnle kamɛ, nsiisa ye kafɔɔ nkyeko nsɔ be kamɛ bɛɛsasamisa ye beekpete nii- ku kɔnɛɛ siene ku kɔnɛɛ lɛnanfi ku ɔblɔ yakayaka ɔnya. <verse eid="EZK 20:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="EZK 20:35" />Kamakpaa ye n-wako nnle nwu ɔfaafuu kamɛ, nfa kafɔɔ kamakanko ye anu ku anu nɛ. <verse eid="EZK 20:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="EZK 20:36" />Fɛ mmle lakanko ni bate lee di ɔfaafuu kamɛ di Egipte kasɔ suoto yi, nkpo kamakanko ye nɛ, SAATE Kplɛ nwu niebuɛ. <verse eid="EZK 20:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="EZK 20:37" />Kamanyu nlɛ biefe di owoso nii kalɔ, nkpaa ye kafɔɔ nkpee di kanya ninii ntam nwu kamɛ. <verse eid="EZK 20:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="EZK 20:38" />Kamadidiki aye ba ninkpe ni otokopĩ ku mba niɛtaka bayɛ mi ni di suoto di kamɛ lee. Kuntɛ kamakpaa ma ndieko di kasɔ ka suoto basi ni yi, kafɔɔ blɔbabuo Israel kasɔ nwu suoto. Ninfɛ bibatofo bilɛ ami ninle SAATE nwu nɛ.<verse eid="EZK 20:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="EZK 20:39" />“ ‘Kafɔɔ aye, Oo Israel batii, nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE Kplɛ nwu kobuɛ ni alɛ: Obiala lee atɔɔkyɛ biɛlaatɔ afiɔ lee! Kafɔɔ nle mmle kamaa yi, nwaako bibakyɔɔ mi atoko, minɔmasinkpɔnɔfɔsa ni kafɔɔ Leyooto nii klekle ku akyɛsaa ku afiɔ lee nwu. <verse eid="EZK 20:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="EZK 20:40" />Diekye di kobokote klekle nii suoto, Israel kobokote takale nwu, SAATE Kplɛ nwu niebuɛ alɛ, nfa di kasɔ nwu suoto di Israel batii bamuu kamasumu mi, nfa kafɔɔ kamafũ ma nɛ. Nfa kamakaalɛ asaaɔta lee ku akyɛsaa biene lee, diɛkyakaa ni di seleɔta klekle lee simuu nɛ. <verse eid="EZK 20:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="EZK 20:41" />Kamafũ ye fɛle olufui wɔ nikɔpɛ ni ɔkɔnɔ nse lɛkpaa ye ledieko di nnle nwu kamɛ, lesiisa ye kafɔɔ lekyeko nsɔ nwu di aba ya baasamiisa ye baakpete nii. Ni kamadiki suoto nii klekle ntuo di kamɛ lee di nnle nwu anu. <verse eid="EZK 20:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="EZK 20:42" />Nse lɛkpaa ye lɛwako Israel kasɔ nwu suoto, kasɔ ka latakatɛ kɔnɛɛ nii katoo laka ntam nlɛ kamayɔ nta ni bate lee yi, ninfɛ bibatofo bilɛ ami ninle SAATE nwu nɛ. <verse eid="EZK 20:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="EZK 20:43" />Nfa bibanyuma nkpa be biasiɛ ni ku sisuku se biafe biakpɔnɔfɔsa ni suoto lee nɛ, suoto lee kafɔɔ kamakpɛ ye oyududu di akpilesaa ya amuu biabla ni suoto. <verse eid="EZK 20:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="EZK 20:44" />Ni bibatofo bilɛ ami ninle SAATE nwu, nse lɛblako ye suoto ɔkpɛ ta leyooto nii oso, ninanle ni kafɔɔ di akpilesaa sisuku lee ku kalalaa sɛsaabla lee kanya. Oo Israel batii, SAATE Kplɛ nwu niebuɛ.’ ”<verse eid="EZK 20:44" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɔtɔ Nkpe Di Kalakasɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="EZK 20:45" />Ni di SAATE nwu ɔlaa lawa kuatɛɛ alɛ: <verse eid="EZK 20:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="EZK 20:46" />“Otii obi, yɔ anu lɛfɔ fakyɔɔ kalakasɔ; yie lɛkya di kalakasɔ suoto faabuɛ kafɔɔ ɔlaa fatɛ kuoyila di kalakasɔ lepoo suoto. <verse eid="EZK 20:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="EZK 20:47" />Buɛ fatɔkɔ kalakasɔ lepoo falɛ: ‘Nu SAATE nwu ɔlaa. Nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE Kplɛ nwu kobuɛ ni alɛ: Nfɛ kɔwa fɔ ɔtɔ ɔbakpee, kubafiɛ awoso lɛfɔ amuu, akɔnle ku akosole, akyuu nwu anyɔ. Ɔtɔ bembe nwu dilɔbanii, kubafiɛ kafɔɔ otii biala diɛyɔ ni di kalakasɔ diɛlaadu katookasɔ. <verse eid="EZK 20:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="EZK 20:48" />Otii biala kamanya alɛ ami SAATE nwu niakɛsɛɛsa nwu; blɔbaniisa nwu.’ ”<verse eid="EZK 20:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="EZK 20:49" />Ninfɛ labuɛ nlɛ, “Ao, SAATE Kplɛ! Boobuɛ di suoto nii alɛ, ‘Diele akpá lete ɔɔpɛ?’ ”<verse eid="EZK 20:49" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="EZK 21" />
  <para style="s1">SAATE Nwu Kapamii</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 21:1" />Ni di SAATE nwu ɔlaa lawa kuatɛɛ alɛ: <verse eid="EZK 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 21:2" />“Otii obi, yɔ anu lɛfɔ fakyɔɔ Yerusalem, faayie lɛkya fayila di kakleklekɔ nwu suoto. Buɛ ɔlaa fatɛ, kuoyila di Israel kasɔ suoto. <verse eid="EZK 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 21:3" />Tɔkɔ Israel kasɔ nwu falɛ: ‘Nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE nwu kobuɛ ni alɛ: N-yɛ fɔ di suoto. Kamananfi kapamii nii mbɔkɔtɛ di kopoo nika, nin-wɔɔsa batininitɛ ku bakpiletɛ, akyuu nwu anyɔ ndiki di suoto lɛfɔ. <verse eid="EZK 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 21:4" />Ta kɔwa ni batininitɛ ku bakpiletɛ ɔwɔɔsa oso yi, kapamii nii kamabɔkɔtɛ di kopoo kamɛ di otii biala suoto, diɛyɔ ni di kalakasɔ diɛlase ni di katookasɔ. <verse eid="EZK 21:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 21:5" />Ninfɛ di batii bamuu kamatofo alɛ ami SAATE nwu niɛnanfi kapamii nii lɛbɔkɔtɛ di kopoo nika nɛ; klɔbasimpɛ kakple kabuo di kopoo kamɛ.’<verse eid="EZK 21:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 21:6" />“Nkpo oso tũuni, otii obi! tũuni ku otu biɛle ku ɔkɔnsɔlo. <verse eid="EZK 21:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 21:7" />Nse bɛɛkaalɛ fɔ kafɔɔ alɛ, ‘Obe oso footũuni?’ tɔkɔ ma falɛ, ‘Ta ɔlaa wɔ nikɔwa ni oso. Otu biala kamanyanakĩi, kɔnɛɛ biala kafɔɔ kamakpiɛkpiɛ; ninwuna biala kamaloo ɔnyɛɛ, dikunkyi biala kafɔɔ kamabla kpɔkɔkpɔkɔ fɛ ntu.’ Nfɛ diɔwa! Nwaako diɔwa ɔbawa, SAATE Kplɛ nwu niebuɛ.”<verse eid="EZK 21:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 21:8" />Ni di SAATE nwu ɔlaa lawa kuatɛɛ alɛ: <verse eid="EZK 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 21:9" />“Otii obi, buɛ ɔlaa fatɛ faabuɛ falɛ, ‘Nnya ɔlaa wɔ di Saate nwu kobuɛ ni alɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 21:9">“ ‘Kapamii, kapamii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 21:9">bɛɛlɔɔfɔ ni, beefifia ka ni kafɔɔ nnɔnyi.<verse eid="EZK 21:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 21:10" />Bɛɛlɔɔfɔ ka bɛɛta batii olo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 21:10">beefifia ka nnɔnyi alɛ kaasesee fɛle ɔplalaa!</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EZK 21:10">“ ‘Sɛɛ buanya suoto lɛyɔɔ di obisuɔtɔbi nii Yuda kayofo suoto? Kapamii nwu lekyidi kawesee nwu okle biala.<verse eid="EZK 21:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 21:11" />“ ‘Beediki kapamii nwu alɛ baafifia ka nnɔnyi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 21:11">alɛ baamufũ ka ku kɔnɛɛ;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 21:11">bɛɛlɔɔfɔ ka beefifia ka nnɔnyi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 21:11">beelolaa ka bɛɛta batii lotɛ nwu kɔnɛɛ.<verse eid="EZK 21:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 21:12" />Otii obi, wi kaku ku mmuntũ ɔpɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 21:12">diekye kapamii nwu n-yɛ di batii nii suoto;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 21:12">kayɛ di Israel baka bamuu suoto.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 21:12">Bɛɛyɔ ma bɛɛta kapamii</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 21:12">diɛkyakaa ni ku batii nii.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 21:12">Nkpo oso pɛ kɔnɛɛ di lɛkankpɛɛ.<verse eid="EZK 21:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 21:13" />“ ‘Nwaako ɔsɔ onyu kamawa. Ni be nfɛ nimabla Yuda kayofo nwu, nka di kapamii nwu nnyu ni nyakatãa, nse kaasimbla ɔkpɛ? SAATE Kplɛ nwu niebuɛ.’<verse eid="EZK 21:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 21:14" />“Nioso otii obi, buɛ ɔlaa fatɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 21:14">faapɛ kafɔɔ anɛɛkya.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 21:14">Ta kapamii nwu kasafɔ asaa sɛnyɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 21:14">bia sitiɛ simu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 21:14">Kapamii ka manlo ni batii kale-</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 21:14">kapamii ka ninlo ni batii kpinwu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 21:14">kɛɛmana ma keekyi ni di ɔfankyi biala.<verse eid="EZK 21:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 21:15" />Alɛ situ kaanyanakĩi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 21:15">batii kpinwu kafɔɔ nnɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 21:15">ntɔɔyɔ kapamii nwu lɛtɛ lɛta batii olo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 21:15">di nyoko lɛma mmuu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 21:15">Ao! Bɛɛbla ka alɛ kaasesee fɛle ɔplalaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 21:15">bakle ka bɛɛta batii olo.<verse eid="EZK 21:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 21:16" />Ao kapamii, safɔ asaa fafe oletanɛɛkyɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 21:16">faafe di ɔmɛntukyɛ nfɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 21:16">di kakɔ lele di kapamii lɛfɔ lemunikĩi kɛɛkyɔɔ.<verse eid="EZK 21:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 21:17" />Ami kafɔɔ kamapɛ anɛɛkya nii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 21:17">n-se ɔblɔ yakayaka nii kanya ntɔɔyɔɔ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 21:17">Ami SAATE nwu niebuɛ.”<verse eid="EZK 21:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Babel Ɔka Kapamii</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 21:18" />Ni di SAATE nwu ɔlaa lawa kuatɛɛ alɛ: <verse eid="EZK 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 21:19" />“Otii obi, diki esuku ɛnyɔ di Babel ɔka kapamii kafe, akyuu nwu anyɔ sikye kasɔ di kasɔ nwu kanwii suoto. Bla nsũlɛtɛsaa di lɛba le di osuku nwu lɛkɛ kuosifi ni okpoo kplɛ nwu. <verse eid="EZK 21:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 21:20" />Diki osuku onwii fata kapamii nwu kawa di Amon batii suoto di Raba, di ɔbamba kafɔɔ kuwa di Yuda ku Yerusalem okpoo siene nwu suoto. <verse eid="EZK 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 21:21" />Diekye Babel ɔka kamayila di osuku nwu nkyakakɔ suoto, di esuku nwu ɛnyɔ nsukunya, alɛ ɔɔpɛ sɛbɔ: Abawii atrebi ku kɔtaa, an-wolaa asaa kamɛ di afiɔ nɔɔ ɔkyɛ, abatɛ anu an-nyunyu babɔkɛɛ akɔɔ kamɛ. <verse eid="EZK 21:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZK 21:22" />Letrebi le ninle ni Yerusalem lele kamawa di oletanɛɛkyɛ nɔɔ, lɛba le abatofo ni oyoyiɛ abiɛsaa, abadiki kanya anta ni batii olo, abapɛ ni kakpɛ kamuntũ, abatofo ni oyoyiɛ abiɛsaa di n-yoko nwu suoto, ampɛ ni kafɔɔ ditii anse ni ntakalekɔ. <verse eid="EZK 21:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZK 21:23" />Ote dibate fɛle sɛlaa ku afunu sɛbɔ ɔpɛ ninta mba niaka ntam baatɔɔ nii, kafɔɔ abanyumasa ma lɛpɔɔ okpi lɛma, ammufũ ma sɛlanle.<verse eid="EZK 21:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZK 21:24" />“Nkpo oso nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE Kplɛ nwu kobuɛ ni alɛ: ‘Ta bienyumasa ni lɛpɔɔ lee okpi di ɔtaka oyila lee di batii suoto kayi odie kamɛ, biediki sikpile lee kayi di asaa ya amuu biɛbla ni kamɛ- ta biabla ni nle mmle oso yi, babamufũ ye sɛlanle.<verse eid="EZK 21:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EZK 21:25" />“ ‘Oo Israel ɔka wɔ ninankpa ni kɔmɛ ku kpiletɛ, nnwɔ di dii nɔɔ ntoowo ni, di letoko nanfi nɔɔ obe ntoodu ni kayɛntɛlekɔ nini, <verse eid="EZK 21:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EZK 21:26" />nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE Kplɛ nwu kobuɛ ni alɛ: Tekete disi niniisaa lɛfɔ, faatekete lɛkakoto nwu. Dilɔbasinte fɛ mmle diate nii: Babatakatɛ mba niɛwa ni kasɔ katoo, manwakosa kafɔɔ mba niɛtaka ni katoo kasɔ. <verse eid="EZK 21:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EZK 21:27" />Kawɔɔ! Kawɔɔ! Kamabla ni kawɔɔ! Blɔbasinse ni lɛbla diɛlaase di obe wɔ di otii wɔ lele diɛtɛ dile ni kamawa nii; nnwɔɔ kamayɔ ni nta nɛ.’<verse eid="EZK 21:27" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kapamii Ku Amon Batii</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="EZK 21:28" />“Afɔ otii obi kafɔɔ yi, buɛ ɔlaa fatɛ, faabuɛ falɛ, ‘Nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE Kplɛ nwu kobuɛ ankyeko ni Amon batii ku atufa lɛma suoto alɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 21:28">“ ‘Kapamii, kapamii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 21:28">bɛɛnanfi bɛɛta batii olo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 21:28">beefifia ka nnɔnyi alɛ kawɔɔsa asaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 21:28">alɛ kasesee kafɔɔ fɛle ɔplalaa!<verse eid="EZK 21:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="EZK 21:29" />Nu bɔɔnya sɛlaa ku afunu odiki otuo mankyeko suoto lee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 21:29">ku kakyɔnkyɔ sɛbɔ ɔpɛ mankyeko suoto lee yi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 21:29">babayɔ nya mantika di</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 21:29">bakpiletɛ ba babalo ni simu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 21:29">mba dii nintɔɔwa nii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 21:29">mba di letokonanfi obe ntoodu ni kayɛntɛlekɔ nini.<verse eid="EZK 21:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="EZK 21:30" />Kplesa kapamii nwu fakpee di kopoo nika.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 21:30">Di lɛba le baabla fɔ ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 21:30">di bawa lɛfɔ kasɔ suoto,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 21:30">kamakanko fɔ.<verse eid="EZK 21:30" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="EZK 21:31" />Kamanyɛɛnɛ ɔblɔ yakayaka nii nkpete fɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 21:31">ninwuna kafɔɔ lɛblɔfiɛ nii ɔtɔ nkpete fɔ di suoto;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 21:31">kamayɔ fɔ nkpee di amumu bablatɛ nnɛɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 21:31">batii ba nin-ye ni asaa ɔlalaasa kamɛ nwaa.<verse eid="EZK 21:31" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="EZK 21:32" />Fabale ntɔɔni fanta ɔtɔ nwu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 21:32">babawii fɔ ntɔ di kasɔ lɛfɔ suoto,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 21:32">blɔbasinnyuma fɔ diidii;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 21:32">diekye ami SAATE nwu niebuɛ.’ ”<verse eid="EZK 21:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="EZK 22" />
  <para style="s1">Yerusalem Akpilesaa Ɔbla</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 22:1" />Ni di SAATE nwu ɔlaa lawa kuatɛɛ alɛ: <verse eid="EZK 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 22:2" />“Otii obi, fabakanko Yerusalem? Fabakanko okpoo kplɛ wɔ mmle nin-wii ni ntɔ? Ni diki ayududusaa sɛsaabla nɔɔ simuu fatuo nwɔ, <verse eid="EZK 22:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 22:3" />faabuɛ falɛ: ‘Nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE Kplɛ nwu kobuɛ ni alɛ: Oo okpoo kplɛ wɔ nin-yɔ kawɔɔ anwako ni di suoto nɔɔ di ntɔ owii di kamɛ nɔɔ, ankpɔnɔfɔsa ni suoto nɔɔ kafɔɔ di afiɔ ɔbla kamɛ. <verse eid="EZK 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 22:4" />Fatookpi lɛpɔɔ ta ntɔ be fatoowii ni kaasɔ, fɛɛkpɔnɔfɔ kafɔɔ di afiɔ ya fatɔɔbla ni oso. Fatɔɔyɔ ayi lɛfɔ fɛɛwako sitũ, alɛɛ lɛfɔ kafɔɔ ntɔɔwa kayɛntɛkɔ. Nkpo oso kamayɔ fɔ mbla ɔfɔ̀ɔ-disifisaa nta nnle ku lɛmansaa nta nsɔ nwu mmuu. <verse eid="EZK 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 22:5" />Mba niɛtɛɛtɛɛ ni ku mba ninkpe ni ninkyonkɔ kamama fɔ alɛ, Oo okpoo kplɛ wɔ leyooto nitɔɔlalaa ni, di kudu oyiisa leyii nwu ni kamɛ pɔ.<verse eid="EZK 22:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 22:6" />“ ‘Nyu mmle di Israel ɔka biala wɔ ninsi fɔ ni kaamɛ n-yɔ osie nɔɔ an-wii ni ntɔ kaasɔ. <verse eid="EZK 22:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 22:7" />Di kamɛ lɛfɔ batasimbu babi bate ku babi baya bakpee di lɛsalɛsaa kamɛ; di kamɛ lɛfɔ baanyinka bafɔɔ, baabla kafɔɔ bakuɛbi ku bakpisɔfɔ amumu. <verse eid="EZK 22:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 22:8" />Faanyu asaa nii klekle nyakatãa, ni faakpɔnɔfɔsa Anyɛɛtɛyi nii nɛ. <verse eid="EZK 22:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 22:9" />Kamɛ lɛfɔ di asaa balalaasatɛ nsi bɔɔtɛ man-wii ntɔ kaasɔ; kamɛ lɛfɔ di mba ninle ni alesaa di kobokote nfiofa nsi bɔɔbla kafɔɔ asaakuu. <verse eid="EZK 22:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 22:10" />Kamɛ lɛfɔ di mba ninkpɔnɔfɔsa ni bate lɛma atensaa nsi; kamɛ lɛfɔ di mba nintenko ni basanko di obe wɔ bɛɛpɛ ni kɔkpaa kaasɔ nsi, di obe wɔ manambla ni klekle di osuku kanya. <verse eid="EZK 22:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 22:11" />Di kamɛ lɛfɔ di osuɔtɔ owo mbla diyududusaa ku owo nɔɔ ɔsɔfɔ, ɔbamba mbla anunsɔsaa ku obi-sɔfɔ nɔɔ, ɔbamba kafɔɔ n-yɔ osie antenko obilɛma-sankobi, nnwɔɔ omu nɔɔ ote obisankobi. <verse eid="EZK 22:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 22:12" />Kamɛ lɛfɔ di batii nfũ ditunu kamɛ asaa alɛ boowii ntɔ kaasɔ; fanfɛnsa koto fanta otii fantikasa kafɔɔ lɛsaa kpinwu di osi fantɔɔ, fan-yɔ fanwɛ asaa ya ninankaatɛ ni fankyeko bawo lɛfɔ nfũ ninanle ni di osuku biene suoto. Fatooyee mi kafɔɔ, SAATE Kplɛ nwu niebuɛ.<verse eid="EZK 22:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 22:13" />“ ‘Nwaako kamapɛ anɛɛkya di katafaa asaa ya fatɔɔwɛ ni ku ntɔ be fatoowii ni kaasɔ di kamɛ lɛfɔ. <verse eid="EZK 22:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 22:14" />Fabafuo otu okpee ee nnɛɛ lɛfɔ n-wɛ osie di dii le kamadieko fɔ ni? Ami SAATE nwu niebuɛ, kamabla ni kafɔɔ. <verse eid="EZK 22:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 22:15" />Kamasamiisa fɔ nkpete di nnle nwu kamɛ, nsamiisa fɔ kafɔɔ nfenko di nsɔ suoto; kamayɔ kafɔɔ ɔtanklekle lɛfɔ nwu n-wako kase. <verse eid="EZK 22:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 22:16" />Nse bɛɛkpɔnɔfɔsa fɔ di nnle nwu anu yi, ni fabatofo falɛ ami ninle SAATE nwu nɛ.’ ”<verse eid="EZK 22:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yaa Okpetewu Wɔ Mannyanakĩisa Ni Abɔɔsaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 22:17" />Ninfɛ di SAATE nwu ɔlaa lawa kuatɛɛ alɛ: <verse eid="EZK 22:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 22:18" />“Otii obi, Israel batii ntookple abɔɔsaa-mbi bɛɛtɛɛ; bamuu lɛma nle abɔɔsaa sɛɛle, abɔɔsaa fututu, abɔɔsaa wɛɛfɛɛ ku abɔɔsaa nutũle ya bɛɛnyanakĩisa nii, di mbi ninya lebu asi ni di okpetewu kamɛ. Bate fɛle koto fututu-mbi. <verse eid="EZK 22:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 22:19" />Nkpo oso nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE Kplɛ nwu kobuɛ ni alɛ: ‘Ta bamuu lee bitookple ni abɔɔsaa-mbi oso yi, kamasiisa ye nkpee di Yerusalem. <verse eid="EZK 22:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 22:20" />Fɛ mmle di batii nsiisa ni koto fututu, abɔɔsaa sɛɛle, abɔɔsaa wɛɛfɛɛ, abɔɔsaa nutũle ku abɔɔsaa fututu mankpete ni di okpetewu mannyanakĩisa ni ku ɔtɔ bembe yi, nkpo kamasiisa ye di ɔblɔ nii ku ɔblɔ yakayaka nii kamɛ nkpee di okpoo kplɛ nwu kamɛ nnyanakĩisa ye nɛ. <verse eid="EZK 22:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 22:21" />Kamasiisa ye, nin-fɛ kafɔɔ ɔblɔ yakayaka nii ɔtɔ nkpete ye di suoto, minnyanakĩi di kamɛ nɔɔ. <verse eid="EZK 22:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZK 22:22" />Fɛ mmle mannyanakĩisa ni koto fututu di okpetewu kamɛ yi, nkpo babanyanakĩisa ye di kamɛ nɔɔ nɛ, ni bibatofo bilɛ ami SAATE nwu nianyɛɛnɛ ɔblɔ yakayaka nii lakpete ye di suoto nɛ.’ ”<verse eid="EZK 22:22" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Israel Batunletɛ Sikpile</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZK 22:23" />Ni di SAATE nwu ɔlaa lakple kuawa kuatɛɛ alɛ: <verse eid="EZK 22:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZK 22:24" />“Otii obi, tɔkɔ kasɔ nwu falɛ, ‘Kasɔ ka di kanto ditanɔɔ nii ee awiwii ni di ɔblɔ yakayaka dii suoto fale.’ <verse eid="EZK 22:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EZK 22:25" />Baka nɔɔ lekũ kanwumbe di kamɛ nɔɔ fɛle kyata wɔ ni kokumii ni, ɔɔbɛbɛɛ ni bɔkɛɛ nɔɔ wɔ eemufũ nii; mambɛbɛɛ batii, man-yɔ lɛsaawɛ ku asaa ya niefũ ni kɔya, manta batii kpinwu nkple bakpisɔfɔ di kamɛ nɔɔ. <verse eid="EZK 22:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EZK 22:26" />Olebatatɛ nɔɔ nwaalɛ kufiofa nii, mankpɔnɔfɔsa kafɔɔ asaa klekle nii; manntɛ nsũ di kasɛ ka ninsi ni di asaa ya nieklekle ni ku n-ya ninanklekle ni ntɛɛ; mantuo asaa alɛ kasɛ kukanwii diesi di asaa ya ninanklekle ni ku n-ya nieklekle ni ntɛɛ; mamaasa anu lɛma manta Anyɛɛtɛyi nii oklee, alɛ baakpɔnɔfɔsa mi di kamɛ lɛma. <verse eid="EZK 22:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EZK 22:27" />Banɔɔfotii nɔɔ di kamɛ nɔɔ nte fɛle bakplɛle ba nikɔbɛbɛɛ ni babɔkɛɛ lɛma ba beemufũ nii; man-wii ntɔ kaasɔ, manlo batii kafɔɔ, man-yɔ manwɛ asaa di katafaa kanya. <verse eid="EZK 22:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EZK 22:28" />Ɔlaababuɛtɛtɛ nɔɔ lekpiitaa akaaloo di ablasaa ya mmle nwu bɛɛta ma di kakyɔnkyɔ odiki otuo ku sɛlaa ku afunu sɛbɔ ɔpɛ kamɛ. Mambuɛ alɛ, ‘Nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE Kplɛ nwu kobuɛ ni alɛ’- di obe wɔ di SAATE nwu diɛkakatɛ nii. <verse eid="EZK 22:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EZK 22:29" />Kasɔ nwu batii mbla katafaa asaa ku kayu ɔsaabla; man-nyinka bapiitɛ ku mba diefĩ nii, mambla kafɔɔ bafɔɔ amumu, mansĩ ma lɛbɛ ɔta.<verse eid="EZK 22:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="EZK 22:30" />“Lamiɛ otii onwii di kamɛ lɛma, nnwɔ nimatofo ni oyoyiɛ, an-yila ni di anu nii, alɛ aayila ni di kasɔ nwu disi anta ni obo nwu ninte nii, di mmle ninaawɔɔsa ni kasɔ nwu, kafɔɔ ntawɛ kuonwii. <verse eid="EZK 22:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EZK 22:31" />Nioso yi, kamanyɛɛnɛ ɔblɔ yakayaka nii nkpete ma di suoto, ninwɔɔsa ma ku lɛblɔfiɛ nii ɔtɔ bembe, ninsoosa asaa ya amuu bɛɛbla ni di mma bamu asintɛɛ, SAATE Kplɛ nwu niebuɛ.”<verse eid="EZK 22:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="EZK 23" />
  <para style="s1">Babilɛma-Sankobi Sikpile Ɔbla</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 23:1" />Ni di SAATE nwu ɔlaa lawa kuatɛɛ alɛ: <verse eid="EZK 23:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 23:2" />“Otii obi, basanko banyɔ banwii lawɛ, ɔya lɛma onwii aale. <verse eid="EZK 23:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 23:3" />Baabakple basɔnɔkpeetɛ di Egipte, baatookpee asɔnɔ diayɔ ni di sekpeele lɛma obe kamɛ. Di kasɔ nwu nkpo suoto, baamimina ma anyɛɛ, baanwɔtɔ kafɔɔ kokpeelebitɛ lɛma anyɛɛbi. <verse eid="EZK 23:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 23:4" />Ɔnɔɔfole leyooto niale Ohola, obilɛma-sankobi kafɔɔ leyooto niale Oholiba. Bale mi baale, ni baalofo babisuɔtɔbi ku babisankobi nɛ. Ohola ninle Samaria, ni di Oholiba nle Yerusalem nɛ.<verse eid="EZK 23:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 23:5" />“Ohola lakpee asɔnɔ di obe wɔ aale ni olè, ole mi; ni aawɛ lɛkɔnsɔklee aata basɔnɔ nɔɔ, Asiria- bakpɛtɛ <verse eid="EZK 23:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 23:6" />ba niakpee ni akpeele bluu, abaa kanyabayilatɛ ku bakpɛtɛ kanyabayilatɛ, di bamuu lɛma lalɛ ni sekosopo, ku bapɔnkɔ basiɛtɛ ba niasiɛ ni di bapɔnkɔ suoto. <verse eid="EZK 23:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 23:7" />Aayɔ suoto nɔɔ aata Asiria batii kplɛ bamuu fɛ sɔnɔkpeetɛ, ni aakpɔnɔfɔsa suoto nɔɔ ku otii biala afiɔ ya aawɛ lɛkɔnsɔklee aata ni nɛ. <verse eid="EZK 23:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 23:8" />Atadiɛ lɛsɔnɔkpee nwu aakye ni kasɔ di Egipte, di obe wɔ di basuɔtɔ latenko nwɔ ni di sekpeele nɔɔ kamɛ, baanwɔtɔ nwɔ ni kakpeelebitɛ anyɛɛbi nɔɔ, baanyɛɛnɛ lɛkɔnsɔklee lɛma kafɔɔ baakpete nwɔ di suoto.<verse eid="EZK 23:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 23:9" />“Nkpo oso lɛyɔ nwɔ lekpee di basɔnɔ nɔɔ nnɛɛ, Asiria batii nwu, mba aawɛ lɛkɔnsɔklee aata nii. <verse eid="EZK 23:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 23:10" />Baadiki nwɔ lɛkyɔtɔ, baakpaa babisuɔtɔbi nɔɔ ku babisankobi nɔɔ baasifiko, ni baalo nwɔ ku kapamii nɛ. Ninfɛ aabakple okyonsanu di basanko kamɛ, ni baayɔ letokonanfi baatika nwɔ di suoto nɛ.<verse eid="EZK 23:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 23:11" />“Obilɛma-sankobi Oholiba lanya nle mmle, kafɔɔ di lɛkɔnsɔklee nɔɔ ku lɛsɔnɔkpee nɔɔ kamɛ yi, aalalaa aalenkee obilɛma-sankobi nwu. <verse eid="EZK 23:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 23:12" />Nnwɔɔ kafɔɔ aawɛ lɛkɔnsɔklee aata Asiria batii nwu- abaa kanyabayilatɛ ku kakpɛ kanyabayilatɛ, bakpɛtɛ ba niasiɛ ni di akpeele ya niawo ni nimu kamɛ, bapɔnkɔ basiɛtɛ ba niasiɛ ni di bapɔnkɔ suoto, di bamuu lale ni bakosopo ba nialɛ ni sekosopo. <verse eid="EZK 23:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 23:13" />Lanya nlɛ nnwɔɔ kafɔɔ aakpɔnɔfɔsa suoto nɔɔ; akyuu lɛma nwu anyɔ lakyɛ di osuku onwii suoto.<verse eid="EZK 23:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 23:14" />“Kafɔɔ aaklee lɛsɔnɔkpee nɔɔ nwu aakyɛnko sitũ. Aanya basuɔtɔ atembi ya bɛɛta beetika ni di oyoyiɛ suoto, Kaldea batii atembi ya bɛɛta ni ku kɔfa sɛɛle, <verse eid="EZK 23:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 23:15" />ku sifiamɛ di sɛtɔ lɛma ku disi aniisaa-wua di asi lɛma; bamuu lɛma letembi late ni fɛle Babel bakeke ba di bapɔnkɔ nnanfi ni banɔɔfotii, baale ni Kaldea banantii. <verse eid="EZK 23:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 23:16" />Nfanwu aanya ma nii, aawɛ lɛkɔnsɔklee aata ma, ni aakpee ma batɔkyɛntɛ di Kaldea nɛ. <verse eid="EZK 23:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 23:17" />Ninfɛ di Babel batii lawa ɔkyɛ nɔɔ di lɛbɔmbɔ atensaa nwu suoto, ni baalalaasa nwɔ di lɛkɔnsɔklee lɛma nwu kamɛ nɛ. Baalalaasa nwɔ baaloo nii, baakpɛ nwɔ oyududu, ni aamunikĩi ɔblɔ kanya aasifi nɛ. <verse eid="EZK 23:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 23:18" />Di obe wɔ aatookpee ni asɔnɔ di lɛkpaka di lɛkyɔtɔ nɔɔ nfɛ nte ni kaayi yi, aakpɛ mi oyududu ni lamunikĩi ɔblɔ kanya lasifi ladiɛ nwɔ fɛ mmle lamunikĩi ni di obilɛma-sankobi ɔkyɛ lasifi ni nɛ. <verse eid="EZK 23:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 23:19" />Kafɔɔ mia nfɛ aakple aatookpee asɔnɔ aatoolenkeesa nɛ, di obe wɔ aatoonyuma ni sekpeele nɔɔ obe, di obe wɔ aale ni sɔnɔkpeetɛ di Egipte. <verse eid="EZK 23:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 23:20" />Nfa aawɛ lɛkɔnsɔklee aata basɔnɔ nɔɔ, mba di sisuɔtɔ lɛma late ni fɛle babɔkɛɛ ba nintuka ni atoo ale ku mba alombi niate ni fɛle bapɔnkɔ ale. <verse eid="EZK 23:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 23:21" />Nioso sekpeele lɛfɔ obe suoto sina ɔkɔnsɔ akleesaa laklee fɔ ɔkɔnsɔ, baanwɔtɔ fɔ anyɛɛbi, baamimina ni kafɔɔ sekpeele lɛfɔ anyɛɛ di obe wɔ faawɛ ni di Egipte.<verse eid="EZK 23:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yaa Lɛkanko Di Ɔsanko-bilɛma Bisɔnle Suoto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZK 23:22" />“Nkpo oso, Oholiba, nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE Kplɛ nwu kobuɛ ni alɛ: Kamatakatɛ basɔnɔ lɛfɔ nkpee fɔ, mba niakpɛ fɔ ni oyududu faakple ni di sɛmaa lɛma, kamatakatɛ ma di ɔfankyi biala nkpee fɔ. <verse eid="EZK 23:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZK 23:23" />Babel batii nwu ku Kaldea batii bamuu, Pekod ku Soa ku Koa basuɔtɔ, manko Asiria batii ba bamuu ninkpe ni ku mma, bakosopo ba ninlɛ ni sekosopo, di bamuu lɛma lale ni abaa kanyabayilatɛ ku bakpɛtɛ kanyabayilatɛ, bakeke ba di bapɔnkɔ nnanfi ni banɔɔfotii ku batii ba ninkpe ni n-yilakɔ kplɛ, di bamuu lɛma nsiɛ ni di bapɔnkɔ suoto. <verse eid="EZK 23:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZK 23:24" />Babataka fɔ di suoto ku akpɛsaa, bakeke ba di bapɔnkɔ nnanfi ni ku atoo atukasaa ku batii ɔlambu; babayila di ɔfankyi biala mantaka kakpɛ di suoto lɛfɔ ku kubiafunsaa, akplɛ ku abiibii ku abɔɔsaa akoto. Kamayɔ fɔ nkpee ma ninnɛɛ nta letokonanfi. Babananfi fɔ kafɔɔ kootoko di osuku lɛma kanya. <verse eid="EZK 23:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EZK 23:25" />Kamadiki sɛsɔfɔwo nii ɔkpɛ ɔblɔ di suoto lɛfɔ, babablako fɔ suoto ɔkpɛ ku ɔblɔ. Bababudi sinwu lee ku atoko lee mankpa, aye ba kafɔɔ niebu bisi ni nkpa kamanɔɔ di kapamii kanya. Babakpaa babisuɔtɔbi ku babisankobi lee mansifiko, aye ba kafɔɔ nimabu ni yi, ɔtɔ kamawɔɔsa ye. <verse eid="EZK 23:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EZK 23:26" />Babadiki akpeele lee kafɔɔ di suoto, man-yɔ anyɛnɛ lee biene nwu kafɔɔ. <verse eid="EZK 23:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EZK 23:27" />Nkpo kamayɔ ateeteesaa ku lɛsɔnɔkpee le faakye ni kasɔ di Egipte n-wako kase nɛ. Flɔbasinnyu asaa ya mmle ku lɛkɔnsɔklee ee fanyuma Egipte diidii.<verse eid="EZK 23:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="EZK 23:28" />“Diekye nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE Kplɛ nwu kobuɛ ni alɛ: Nfɛ kɔmayɔ fɔ nkpee di batii ba feekyidi ni nnɛɛ, mba niakpɛ fɔ ni oyududu, faakple ni di sɛmaa lɛma. <verse eid="EZK 23:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EZK 23:29" />Babablako fɔ suoto ɔkpɛ di ditii kyidi kamɛ, man-yɔ kafɔɔ lɛsaa biala faabla ɔkpɛ faawɛ nii. Babadiɛ fɔ fansiɛ lɛkyɔtɔ ku ototoole, lɛsɔnɔkpee lɛfɔ sinunsɔ nwu kafɔɔ kamadie kayi. Ateeteesaa lɛfɔ ku lɛsɔnɔkpee lɛfɔ nwu <verse eid="EZK 23:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EZK 23:30" />niata nle mmle lawa fɔ di suoto, diekye faawɛ lɛkɔnsɔklee faata nnle nwu, ni faakpɔnɔfɔsa suoto lɛfɔ ku afiɔ lɛma nɛ. <verse eid="EZK 23:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EZK 23:31" />Obilee-sankobi kɔkpaa faayɔ; nkpo oso kamayɔ opũ nɔɔ nkpee di kɔnɛɛ lɛfɔ.<verse eid="EZK 23:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="EZK 23:32" />“Nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE Kplɛ nwu kobuɛ ni alɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 23:32">“Obilee-sankobi opũ kamɛ fabanyi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 23:32">opũ wɔ niemuɔ kuokyofo nii;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 23:32">dibata lɛ-ma ku ditufa n-wa fɔ ni di suoto,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 23:32">diekye asaa amuamu ninsi kaamɛ.<verse eid="EZK 23:32" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="EZK 23:33" />Lɛtansiɛ ku sɛnyaami owi kamayii fɔ kamɛ pɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 23:33">kalalaa ku kawɔɔ opũ nwu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 23:33">ninle ni obilee-sankobi Samaria opũ.<verse eid="EZK 23:33" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="EZK 23:34" />Fabanyi mi ku akpiti nimi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 23:34">fababibiɛ opũ nwu wɔkyɔwɔkyɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 23:34">fambɛbɛɛ kafɔɔ anyɛ́ɛ lɛfɔ.</para>
  <para style="m" vid="EZK 23:34">Ami niɛkakatɛ, SAATE Kplɛ nwu niebuɛ.<verse eid="EZK 23:34" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="EZK 23:35" />“Nkpo oso nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE Kplɛ nwu kobuɛ ni alɛ: Di obe wɔ fatooyee mi, fɛɛtɛ mi ni sɛmɛntu oso yi, dikpeni feefũ seteetee ku lɛsɔnɔkpee lɛfɔ letota.”<verse eid="EZK 23:35" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yaa Lɛkanko Di Babilɛma-Sankobi Nwu Banyɔ Suoto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="EZK 23:36" />Ni di SAATE nwu latɔkɔ mi alɛ: “Otii obi, fabakanko Ohola ku Oholiba? Ni diki ayududusaa sɛsaabla lɛma nwu fatɔkɔ ma. <verse eid="EZK 23:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="EZK 23:37" />Diekye baakpee asɔnɔ, ntɔ kafɔɔ nsi di nnɛɛ lɛma. Baakpee asɔnɔ ku afiɔ lɛma; baayɔ bia babi lɛma baata ole, fɛ alesaa baata ma, babi ba baalofo baatɛɛ nii. <verse eid="EZK 23:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="EZK 23:38" />Baabla mi nle mmle kafɔɔ: Baakpee kakleklekɔ nii oyududu, ni baakpɔnɔfɔsa Anyɛɛtɛyi nii di obe onwii nwu kamɛ nɛ. <verse eid="EZK 23:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="EZK 23:39" />Di dii le suoto baayɔ babi lɛma baata ni ole baata ni afiɔ lɛma, baabuo kakleklekɔ nii baakpɔnɔfɔsa ka. Nni ninle lɛsaa le baabla ni di leyo nii kamɛ nɛ.<verse eid="EZK 23:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="EZK 23:40" />“Bia mankpee basuɔtɔ ba niekye ni nkyonkɔ batii alɛ bawa. Nse bɛɛbabuo, fankpe ntu ta mma oso, faakyankya anu lɛfɔ, fan-yɔ anyɛnɛ lɛfɔ fankpee. <verse eid="EZK 23:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="EZK 23:41" />Fansiɛ di akpomii yɔɔle ya nikɔlɛ ni onyu suoto, fanse opunu blɛfɛɛ di akpomii nwu anu, opunu nwu suoto, ni fan-yɔ olufui ku nnɔnyi be ninle mi ni nle fantika nɛ.<verse eid="EZK 23:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="EZK 23:42" />“Batii ɔlambu wɔ ninan-yɔ nwu ni ole kudu oyiisa lamana nwɔ kuakyi; baakyeko batasiɛntɛ ɔfaafuu kamɛ diakyakaa ni di basuɔtɔ ba niakye ni atiipɛ dikudi kamɛ baawako. Ni baakpee ɔsanko nwu ku obilɛma-sankobi nkɔnii di nnɛɛtũ, baayɔ kafɔɔ akakoto ya nikɔlɛ ni onyu baatũkunsa ma di asi nɛ. <verse eid="EZK 23:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="EZK 23:43" />Ninfɛ labuɛ di ɔsanko wɔ ditoobuo ni di lɛsɔnɔkpee kamɛ suoto nlɛ, ‘Kanunua yi, ta ma bayɔ nwɔ fɛ sɔnɔkpeetɛ, diekye nkpo otii di ɔsanko nwu nle nɛ.’ <verse eid="EZK 23:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="EZK 23:44" />Ni baatenko ɔsanko nwu nɛ. Fɛ mmle di basuɔtɔ ntenko ni sɔnɔkpeetɛ, nkpo baatenko basanko nwu di suoto kɔfiɛtũ nii, Ohola ku Oholiba nɛ. <verse eid="EZK 23:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="EZK 23:45" />Kafɔɔ basuɔtɔ batininitɛ kamananfi basanko ba ninkpee ni asɔnɔ, man-wii ni kafɔɔ ntɔ kaasɔ kootoko, diekye basɔnɔkpeetɛ bale, ntɔ kafɔɔ nsi di nnɛɛ lɛma.<verse eid="EZK 23:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="EZK 23:46" />“Nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE Kplɛ nwu kobuɛ ni alɛ: Bita batii ɔlambu bawa bababuo ma di suoto, baakpee ma lɛyɛkɛ, baafũ kakpɛ kamɛ asaa lɛma. <verse eid="EZK 23:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="EZK 23:47" />Batii ɔlambu nwu kamasafɔ ma afuɔ, mansasafɔ ma kafɔɔ mantɛ ku mpamii lɛma; Babalo babisuɔtɔbi ku babisankobi lɛma, manfiɛ kafɔɔ ayo lɛma.<verse eid="EZK 23:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="EZK 23:48" />“Nkpo kamayɔ suoto sina lɛkɔnsɔklee lɛma nwu n-wako kase di kasɔ nwu suoto nɛ, alɛ diabla ɔlaa osĩ ɔta basanko bamuu, alɛ blaanyunko ye. <verse eid="EZK 23:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="EZK 23:49" />Babananfi ye kootoko di suoto lɛkɔnsɔklee lee nwu suoto, minfũ kafɔɔ letota di sikpile lee suoto di afiɔ ɔtɔ kamɛ. Ninfɛ bibatofo bilɛ ami ninle SAATE Kplɛ nwu nɛ.”<verse eid="EZK 23:49" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="EZK 24" />
  <para style="s1">Alesaa Lɛwambukii Le Niapɛ Ni Kɔsanka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 24:1" />Di lɛlɛɛ nansinle kamɛ, di Israel batii kɔwɛntɛ fosile dii fosile suoto yi, SAATE nwu ɔlaa lawa kuatɛɛ alɛ: <verse eid="EZK 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 24:2" />Otii obi, tɛ dii le mmle nsũ, mmiɛ dii le mmle, diekye Babel ɔka ntɔɔmana Yerusalem eekyi di mmiɛ dii le mmle. <verse eid="EZK 24:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 24:3" />Pɛ otokopĩ leyo le mmle lɛkpa falɛ: ‘Nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE Kplɛ nwu kobuɛ ni alɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 24:3">“ ‘Yɔ alesaa lɛwambukii nwu fatika di ɔtɔ; faayɔ ni fatika,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 24:3">faakpete ntu ninni kamɛ.<verse eid="EZK 24:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 24:4" />Yɔ sina akudi fakpee kaamɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 24:4">sina akudi nwaa amuu- kutĩ ku kɔnɛɛ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 24:4">Yɔ akufi ya mmle biene fayiisa nwu kamɛ;<verse eid="EZK 24:4" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 24:5" />diki bafoso biene fase.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 24:5">Kpee ntɔɔni ɔtɔ ninwu kalɔ fawa akufi nwu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 24:5">faata nya afuu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 24:5">faawa akufi nwu ninwu kamɛ.<verse eid="EZK 24:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 24:6" />“ ‘Diekye nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE Kplɛ nwu kobuɛ ni alɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 24:6">“ ‘Yɔɔsa bɔɔta okpoo kplɛ wɔ nin-wii ni ntɔ kaasɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 24:6">kunta ni lɛwambukii le niɛpɛ ni kɔsanka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 24:6">di kɔsanka nwu dilɔbayɛɛ ni ninni suoto!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 24:6">Diki sina akudi kaamɛ ninwii, ninwii</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 24:6">tansɛsɛɛ sĩ kamɛ.<verse eid="EZK 24:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 24:7" />“ ‘Diekye ntɔ be eewii ni kaasɔ nsi nwɔ kaamɛ:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 24:7">Difuɔnkpaa fukiti suoto aanyɛɛnɛ mi aakpete;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 24:7">atanyɛɛnɛ mi aakpete di kasɔ suoto,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 24:7">di lɛba le di kudu katĩi ni ntɔ nwu.<verse eid="EZK 24:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 24:8" />Alɛ diakpee mi ɔblɔ yakayaka, ninta mbla nkyisa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 24:8">layɔ ntɔ nɔɔ nwu lakpete di difuɔnkpaa fukuti suoto,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 24:8">di mmle manamatĩi mi nii.<verse eid="EZK 24:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 24:9" />“ ‘Nkpo oso nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE Kplɛ nwu kobuɛ ni alɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 24:9">“ ‘Yɔɔsa bɔɔta okpoo kplɛ nwu nin-wii ni ntɔ kaasɔ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 24:9">Ami kafɔɔ, kamakpee ntɔɔni nintaka-kle.<verse eid="EZK 24:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 24:10" />Nioso siisa ntɔɔni nwu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 24:10">faayiensa ɔtɔ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 24:10">Wa sina nwu nwaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 24:10">faakpɔtɔɔsa kutu asaa kaamɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 24:10">faata akufi nwu abla akaa.<verse eid="EZK 24:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 24:11" />Faayɔ dibukii nwu fukuti fatika di akaa nwu suoto nfɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 24:11">dilaase di obe wɔ diefila ni kpankpa di lɛbɔɔsaa sɛɛle nɔɔ lɛsɛɛ ni bɔmbɔ</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 24:11">di mmle di kunusũ nikũ kanyanakĩi nii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 24:11">kɔsanka nikũ kafɔɔ nfiɛ kunloo nii.<verse eid="EZK 24:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 24:12" />Dibuo nii nimuu lɛbla kasakasa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 24:12">kɔsanka bɔblɔɔbɔ nwu nienu kuka ni ninwu suoto diedie,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 24:12">bia ɔtɔ diefuo.<verse eid="EZK 24:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 24:13" />“ ‘Kanunua yi, kunusũ lɛfɔ nwu ninle lɛkɔnsɔklee nɛ. Diekye lakpee kɔnyaabe nlɛ kokleklesa fɔ, kafɔɔ kunusũ lɛfɔ nwu lasĩ odie di suoto lɛfɔ, blɔbasinkleklesa fɔ, dilaase di obe wɔ di ɔblɔ yakayaka nii di suoto lɛfɔ kanya ntɔɔyɔɔ nii.<verse eid="EZK 24:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 24:14" />“ ‘Ami SAATE nwu niebuɛ. Obe ntoowo alɛ kadiki kɔkpaa. Nɔmanyu sɛmaa; nɔmanya nyaami, ee mmunikĩisa disibu nii. Kamakanko fɔ di nkpa disiɛbi lɛfɔ ku ɔsaabla lɛfɔ kanya, SAATE Kplɛ nwu niebuɛ.’ ”<verse eid="EZK 24:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɔlaabuɛtɛtɛ Hesekiel Ɔsɔfɔ Kukpi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 24:15" />Ni di SAATE nwu ɔlaa lawa kuatɛɛ alɛ: <verse eid="EZK 24:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 24:16" />“Otii obi, nyu lo, nfɛ kɔwa otii wɔ nimbuo fɔ ni anu ɔbakpaa di ɔkyɛ lɛfɔ nkyenkye. Kafɔɔ tan-wi sɛnyaami ee faawi kaku ee faawi nnumɛɛ kunwii. <verse eid="EZK 24:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 24:17" />Tũuni buɛɛ; tambla kaku faata kpi. Yɔ disi niniisaa fanii disi lɛfɔ, di nkpeele lɛfɔ kafɔɔ disiɛ fɔ ninkpaa; tantĩi kanya lɛfɔ ee faale akufansaa.”<verse eid="EZK 24:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 24:18" />Nioso lakakatɛ lata batii nwu ku olesɛ, ni di ɔsɔfɔ nii lakpi ku kɔtɔɔfɔ nɛ. Ni di kaleesɛ ku oyita labla fɛ mmle baakpee mi ni kufiofa nɛ.<verse eid="EZK 24:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 24:19" />Ninfɛ di batii nwu lakaalɛ mi alɛ, “Flɔɔtɔkɔ wo asaa ya mmle fɔɔbla ni kasɔ?”<verse eid="EZK 24:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 24:20" />Nioso latɔkɔ ma nlɛ, “SAATE nwu ɔlaa lawa kuatɛɛ alɛ: <verse eid="EZK 24:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 24:21" />Tɔkɔ Israel batii falɛ, ‘Nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE Kplɛ nwu kobuɛ ni alɛ: Nfɛ kɔwa olekatakɔ nii ɔbakpɔnɔfɔsa- osie wɔ suoto minkanta nii, lɛbɔmbɔsaa lee le nimbuo ye ni anu. Babisuɔtɔbi ku babisankobi ba biediɛ biɛtɛ ni di sɛmaa kamanɔɔ di kapamii kanya. <verse eid="EZK 24:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZK 24:22" />Bibabla kafɔɔ fɛ mmle labla nii. Bilɔbatĩi nnya lee, ee bile akufansaa. <verse eid="EZK 24:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZK 24:23" />Bibanii asi lee aniisaa di asi lee, nkpeele lee kafɔɔ nsiɛ ye ninkpaa. Bilɔbasiɛ kaku ee biwi kaku, kafɔɔ bibakoso minfiɔni ta sikpile lee oso, mintũuni di kamɛ lee. <verse eid="EZK 24:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZK 24:24" />Hesekiel kamale nsũ lɛtɛsaa anta ye; bibabla fɛ mmle aabla ni kanya. Nse nle mmle lɛwa kaanya yi, bibatofo bilɛ ami ninle SAATE Kplɛ nwu.’<verse eid="EZK 24:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EZK 24:25" />“Kafɔɔ afɔ, otii obi, di dii le suoto kamafũ ni osie lɛma nwu, suoto lɛyɔɔ ku dibu lɛma nwu, lɛsaa le nimbuo ma ni anu, otu lɛma dibiesaa, babisuɔtɔbi ku babisankobi lɛma yi- <verse eid="EZK 24:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EZK 24:26" />di dii nwu kale, otii wɔ nikotososo ni nimawa amatɔkɔ fɔ ɔlaa wɔ niɛwa nii. <verse eid="EZK 24:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EZK 24:27" />Di obe nwu nkpo kamɛ kanya lɛfɔ kamabɛ; fabakakatɛko nwɔ, flɔbasinlo kanana. Nioso fabale nsũ lɛtɛsaa fanta ma, ni babatofo alɛ ami ninle SAATE nwu nɛ.”<verse eid="EZK 24:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 24" />
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="EZK 25" />
  <para style="s1">Ɔlaa Obuɛ Ɔtɛ Di Amon Suoto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 25:1" />Ni di SAATE nwu ɔlaa lawa kuatɛɛ alɛ: <verse eid="EZK 25:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 25:2" />“Otii obi, yɔ anu lɛfɔ fakyɔɔ di Amon batii suoto, faabuɛ ɔlaa fatɛ di suoto lɛma. <verse eid="EZK 25:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 25:3" />Tɔkɔ ma falɛ, ‘Binu SAATE Kplɛ nwu ɔlaa. Nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE Kplɛ nwu kobuɛ ni alɛ: Ta nle biabuɛ ni bilɛ, “Ɛhɛɛ!” di kakleklekɔ nii suoto, di obe wɔ baakpɔnɔfɔsa ka ni, biabuɛ ni di Israel kasɔ suoto, di obe wɔ kaate ni kafukuti, biabuɛ ni kafɔɔ di Yuda batii suoto di obe wɔ baasifi ni sɛlanle kamɛ oso yi, <verse eid="EZK 25:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 25:4" />nfɛ kɔmayɔ ye nta Kufĩkatunkɔ batii fɛ atesaa. Babatɛ nsiɛkɔ lɛma, mampɛ kafɔɔ akpaayo lɛma di kamɛ lee; babale awosobi lee mannyi kafɔɔ babɔkɛɛ lee nnyɛɛntu. <verse eid="EZK 25:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 25:5" />Kamamunikĩisa Raba okpoo kplɛ mbla sɛfa kaweekɔ nta kapu bapɔnkɔ, nimunikĩisa kafɔɔ Amon batii sekpoo kplɛ mbla ɔnyɛɛ katɛkɔ nta bafoso. Ninfɛ bibatofo bilɛ ami ninle SAATE nwu nɛ. <verse eid="EZK 25:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 25:6" />Diekye nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE Kplɛ nwu kobuɛ ni alɛ: Ta biapɛ ni anɛɛkya, biatutufu ni nkpaa lee kaasɔ, biatɔɔnya ni suoto lɛyɔɔ ku amumu asaa amuu di situ lee kamɛ, biayila ni di Israel kasɔ suoto oso yi, <verse eid="EZK 25:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 25:7" />nkpo oso kamananfi kɔnɛɛ nii di suoto lɛfɔ, nin-yɔ fɔ nta nnle nwu fɛ kakpɛ kamɛ asaa. Kamabudi fɔ ndiki di nnle kamɛ, ninfiɛ fɔ kafɔɔ ndiki di nsɔ nwu suoto. Kamawɔɔsa fɔ, ni fabatofo falɛ ami ninle SAATE nwu nɛ.’ ”<verse eid="EZK 25:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɔlaa Obuɛ Ɔtɛ Di Moab Suoto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 25:8" />“Nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE Kplɛ nwu kobuɛ ni alɛ: ‘Moab ku Seir labuɛ alɛ, “Nyu lo, Yuda batii nfɛ nte fɛle nnle bamba nwu mmuu.” <verse eid="EZK 25:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 25:9" />Nkpo oso kamasɛkɛtɛ osuku ntɛ di Moab sekpoo suoto, kamakye kasɔ di amɛ nɔɔ sekpoo suoto- di Bet-Yesimot, Baal-Meon ku Kiriatiam- ninle ni kasɔ nwu dibu. <verse eid="EZK 25:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 25:10" />Kamayɔ Moab nkyakaa di Amon batii suoto nta kufĩkatunkɔ batii fɛ atesaa, di mmle manasinnyuma ni Amon batii di nnle nwu kamɛ; <verse eid="EZK 25:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 25:11" />kamananfi kafɔɔ Moab kootoko. Ninfɛ babatofo alɛ ami ninle SAATE nwu nɛ.’ ”<verse eid="EZK 25:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɔlaa Obuɛ Ɔtɛ Di Edom Suoto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 25:12" />“Nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE Kplɛ nwu kobuɛ ni alɛ: ‘Ta di Edom labla ni Yuda batii baakyisa ni, baakpi ni lɛpɔɔ osie kanya di nle baabla ni oso yi, <verse eid="EZK 25:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 25:13" />nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE Kplɛ nwu kobuɛ ni alɛ: Kamananfi kɔnɛɛ nii di Edom suoto, nlo kafɔɔ batii nɔɔ ku babɔkɛɛ lɛma. Kamata nwu kunte ofukuti, ni diɛyɔ ni kafɔɔ di Teman diɛlaadu ni Dedan babanɔɔ di kapamii kanya. <verse eid="EZK 25:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 25:14" />Kamayɔ batii nii Israel kɔnɛɛ mbla ɔbla okyisa di Edom suoto, bababla Edom suoto ɔkpɛ di ɔblɔ nii ku lɛblɔfiɛ yakayaka nii kanya; ni babatofo ɔbla okyisa nii nɛ, SAATE Kplɛ nwu niebuɛ.’ ”<verse eid="EZK 25:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɔlaa Obuɛ Ɔtɛ Di Filisti Suoto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 25:15" />“Nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE Kplɛ nwu kobuɛ ni alɛ: ‘Ta Filisti batii ladiki ni kɔkpaa di ɔbla okyisa kamɛ, baabla kafɔɔ baakyisa ni ku amumu di situ lɛma kamɛ, ku saa katiikyidi ka ninaa ni kaloo le baawɛ baata ni Yuda ɔwɔɔsa oso yi, <verse eid="EZK 25:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 25:16" />nkpo oso, nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE Kplɛ nwu kobuɛ alɛ: Nfɛ kɔwa kɔnɛɛ nii ɔbananfi di Filisti batii suoto, nimbudi kafɔɔ Keret batii ndiki, nin-wɔɔsa kafɔɔ mba niebu basi ni nkpa di lekpo kotoko. <verse eid="EZK 25:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 25:17" />Kamabla ɔbla okyisa kplɛ di suoto lɛma, nnanfi ma kafɔɔ kootoko di ɔblɔ yakayaka nii kamɛ. Ni nse lɛbla ɔbla okyisa di suoto lɛma, ninfɛ babatofo alɛ ami ninle SAATE Kplɛ nwu nɛ.’ ”<verse eid="EZK 25:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 25" />
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="EZK 26" />
  <para style="s1">Ɔlaa Obuɛ Ɔtɛ Di Tiro Suoto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 26:1" />Di lefosi lɛlɛɛ kasale kamɛ, di dii kasale suoto di kɔwɛntɛ nwu kamɛ yi, SAATE nwu ɔlaa lawa kuatɛɛ alɛ: <verse eid="EZK 26:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 26:2" />“Otii obi, ta Tiro labuɛ ni di Yerusalem suoto alɛ, ‘Ɛhɛɛ! Nnle nwu kayoko ntoobiɛ, bɛɛsɛkɛtɛ kafɔɔ akloo ninya bɛɛtɛɛ; ni lɛlɛ nfɛ kamalɛ mi diekye kutoobiɛ kate ni yi,’ <verse eid="EZK 26:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 26:3" />nioso nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE Kplɛ nwu kobuɛ ni alɛ: Oo Tiro, n-yɛ fɔ di suoto, kamatakatɛ nnle kpinwu kafɔɔ nkpee fɔ, fɛ mmle di lekpo nkpɛ ni afɛɛfɔ nɔɔ. <verse eid="EZK 26:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 26:4" />Bababiɛ Tiro seyoyiɛ, mambibiɛ kafɔɔ ayo takale nɔɔ nwu mantɛ kaasɔ; kamafiɛ kɔtɛ ntekete di kasɔ nɔɔ suoto mbla ka difuɔnkpaa fukuti. <verse eid="EZK 26:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 26:5" />Abakple lɛba le manlakasa ni asawu di lekpo ntɛɛntɛɛ, diekye SAATE Kplɛ nwu niebuɛ alɛ, ami niɛkakatɛ. Abakple kakpɛ kamɛ asaa anta nnle. <verse eid="EZK 26:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 26:6" />Babalo kafɔɔ sekpoo nɔɔ batii di kasɔ nwu kamu suoto ku kapamii. Ninfɛ babatofo alɛ ami ninle SAATE nwu nɛ.<verse eid="EZK 26:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 26:7" />“Diekye nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE Kplɛ nwu kobuɛ ni alɛ: Kamakpaa Babel ɔka Nebukadnesar, baka ɔka, ku bapɔnkɔ ku bakeke ba di bapɔnkɔ nnanfi ni, ku bapɔnkɔ basiɛtɛ ku bakpɛtɛ kpinwu nkyeko katookasɔ n-wako di Tiro suoto. <verse eid="EZK 26:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 26:8" />Abalo sekpoo lɛfɔ batii di kasɔ nwu kamu suoto ku kapamii; abatofo banyuntɛ ayo takale di suoto lɛfɔ, ampɛ ditii aanadunko seyoyiɛ lɛfɔ, antakatɛ kubiafunsaa nɔɔ kafɔɔ di suoto lɛfɔ. <verse eid="EZK 26:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 26:9" />Abayɔ ayo abiɛsaa nɔɔ ankyɔɔ di seyoyiɛ lɛfɔ suoto, ambibiɛ kafɔɔ ayo takale lɛfɔ nwu antɛ kaasɔ ku akpɛnsaa nɔɔ. <verse eid="EZK 26:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 26:10" />Bapɔnkɔ nɔɔ kamatɛ mampɔ alɛ kudu ko babatakatɛ ni kamatĩi fɔ suoto. Seyoyiɛ lɛfɔ kamatũtũkũ di kakpɛ bapɔnkɔ kudu oyiisa nwu, atoo atukasaa ku bakeke, nse eebuo n-yoko lɛfɔ fɛ mmle di batii mbuo ni okpoo kplɛ wɔ seyoyiɛ se kamɛ beebiɛ beebuo nii. <verse eid="EZK 26:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 26:11" />Bapɔnkɔ nɔɔ akpɔbi kamananafu di sisuku lɛfɔ simuu suoto; abalo batii lɛfɔ ku kapamii, akpaka siene lɛfɔ nwu kafɔɔ kamanɔɔ ante kaasɔ. <verse eid="EZK 26:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 26:12" />Babalɛ lɛsaawɛ lɛfɔ fɛ kakpɛ kamɛ asaa, man-yu kafɔɔ asunsũsaa lɛfɔ; bababiɛ seyoyiɛ lɛfɔ mantɛ kaasɔ, mambibiɛ kafɔɔ ayo lɛfɔ biene nwu, manfuki afuɔ, sewoso ku atɛnkudi lɛfɔ mankpee di lekpo kamɛ. <verse eid="EZK 26:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 26:13" />Kamata sinu kudu lɛfɔ nwu n-wa kasekɔ, blɔbasinnu kafɔɔ bakyitaa lɛfɔ sinu diidii. <verse eid="EZK 26:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 26:14" />Kamabla fɔ difuɔnkpaa fukuti, fabakple kafɔɔ lɛba le manlakasa ni asawu. Blɔbasinse fɔ letofo diidii, diekye ami SAATE nwu niɛkakatɛ, SAATE Kplɛ nwu niebuɛ.<verse eid="EZK 26:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 26:15" />“Nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE Kplɛ nwu kobuɛ antɔkɔ ni Tiro alɛ: Lekpo kotoko nsɔ nwu dilɔbatũkũ nse beenu lɛnɔɔ lɛfɔ kudu, nse batii ba niefũ ni nkɔ letũuni, beelo batii kafɔɔ di kamɛ lɛfɔ? <verse eid="EZK 26:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 26:16" />Ni baka bamuu di lekpo kotoko kamasoo di akakpomii lɛma suoto, man-yɔ kafɔɔ akpeele wua lɛma mantɛ di ɔlɔɔkɔ, mandiki kafɔɔ akpeele lɛma ya beeloso ni ku sikũ ateate mantɛ. Babasiɛ di lɛyɛkɛ kamɛ, mantaba kaasɔ, mantootũtũkũ obe lele, nimbla ma ɔkpɛ di suoto lɛfɔ. <verse eid="EZK 26:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 26:17" />Babawola okunu di suoto lɛfɔ, mansa nwu manta fɔ alɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 26:17">“ ‘Oo okpoo kplɛ wɔ niefũ ni leyooto, di lekpo batii nsi ni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 26:17">lɛ nfɛ fɛɛwɔɔ nkpo!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 26:17">Afɔ wɔ niale ni sientɛ di lekpo suoto,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 26:17">afɔ ku okpoo lɛfɔ batii;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 26:17">biayɔ lɛyɛkɛ lee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 26:17">biakpee di batii ba bamuu niasiɛ ni ninfa.<verse eid="EZK 26:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 26:18" />Kanunua yi, lekpo kotoko nsɔ nwu kotũtũkũ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 26:18">di dii le fɛɛnɔɔ ni suoto;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 26:18">nsɔ nwu di lekpo kamɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 26:18">layɛkɛ di lɛwɔɔ lɛfɔ suoto.’<verse eid="EZK 26:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 26:19" />“Nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE Kplɛ nwu kobuɛ ni alɛ: Nse lɛbla fɔ okpoo kplɛ wɔ ninte ni ofukuti, fɛle sekpoo kplɛ se di batii diesinsi sĩ ni kaamɛ, ni nse lɛyɔ lekpo kplɛ nwu nkyofokɔ lefuusa fɔ di suoto, di ntu nɔɔ nwu kpinwu kafɔɔ letĩi fɔ suoto yi, <verse eid="EZK 26:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 26:20" />ni kamamɛɛsa fɔ kaasɔ ku mba ninsoo mambuo ni di dibiɔ kamɛ, mansifi ni bakofo nfũ. Kamata fɔ fansiɛ di ɔkya kamɛ, fɛ mmle dite ni di saa lɛwɔɔ kamɛ, ku batii ba ninsoo mansifi ni dibiɔ kamɛ, ni flɔbasinkple fawa ee fabafũ kasiɛkɔ lɛfɔ di nkpa basiɛtɛ kasɔ suoto. <verse eid="EZK 26:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 26:21" />Kamata kayɛntɛkɔ lɛfɔ nwɛ difu, di diidii flɔbasinwɛ ni kafɔɔ. Babawolaa fɔ, kafɔɔ blɔbasinnya fɔ diidii, SAATE Kplɛ nwu niebuɛ.”<verse eid="EZK 26:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 26" />
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="EZK 27" />
  <para style="s1">Okunu Kuɔta Ni Tiro</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 27:1" />Ni di SAATE nwu ɔlaa lawa kuatɛɛ alɛ: <verse eid="EZK 27:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 27:2" />“Otii obi, sa okunu di Tiro suoto. <verse eid="EZK 27:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 27:3" />Tɔkɔ Tiro, okpoo wɔ ninte ni di lekpo kasukunya, mansunsũ ni asaa ku lekpo kotoko batii kpinwu falɛ, ‘Nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE Kplɛ nwu kobuɛ ni alɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 27:3">“ ‘Oo Tiro, feebuɛ falɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 27:3">“Lɛtɛ nlɛ sekpeele nwaa.”<verse eid="EZK 27:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 27:4" />Kasɔ lɛfɔ amɛ lawɛ di lekpo nwu ntɛɛntɛɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 27:4">batii ba niatɛ fɔ ni latɛ baalɛ sekpeele nwaa.<verse eid="EZK 27:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 27:5" />Baabɛ ɛfram sewoso lɛfɔ simuu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 27:5">baakyeko Senir<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">27.5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Nnwu mankple manlɛɛ Hermon nɛ</char></note> baawako;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 27:5">baayɔ sida baakyeko Lebanon</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 27:5">baawola oklo abula asakasaa baata fɔ.<verse eid="EZK 27:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 27:6" />Akpɛ awoso ya niakye ni Basan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 27:6">baayɔ baawola seklo nflɛ lɛfɔ;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 27:6">Odum sewoso se baakyeko ni Kitim lekpo kotoko</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 27:6">baayɔ baatĩi oklo lɛfɔ kalɔ, baatĩtĩi kamɛ ku bato oblè.<verse eid="EZK 27:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 27:7" />Dibula fɛnɛnɛɛ biene le beeloso ni ku sikũ ateate se niakye ni Egipte fan-yɔ fankyɛ di ntu osi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 27:7">diale fɛ flankaa lɛfɔ;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 27:7">abansaa lɛfɔ late bluu ku n-ya niɛbla ni fɛ ɔsɛɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 27:7">aakye ni Elisa lekpo kotoko.<verse eid="EZK 27:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 27:8" />Sidon batii ku Arwad batii niale seklo bawantɛ lɛfɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 27:8">Oo Tiro, batii lɛfɔ ba nin-ye ni sɛkpɛ nwu kamɛ nwaa niasiɛ kaamɛ fɛ oklo kamɛ bakpɛmblatɛ lɛfɔ.<verse eid="EZK 27:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 27:9" />Kɔnɛɛ kamɛ sɛkpɛ bablatɛ nɔɔfo ba niakye ni Gebal lasiɛ di oklo kamɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 27:9">fɛ batii ba ninlolaa ni oklo lɛfɔ aba ya niebiɛ ni, mantĩtĩi ni kafɔɔ aba lɛfɔ ya niedufu nii.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 27:9">Seklo nwu simuu di lekpo suoto ku batii ba ninsiɛ ni kaamɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 27:9">n-wa mamatɔɔya atoo lɛfɔ.<verse eid="EZK 27:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 27:10" />“ ‘Persia, Lidia ku Put batii</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 27:10">lale bakpɛtɛ di bakpɛtɛ lɛfɔ kamɛ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 27:10">Man-yɔ kubiafunsaa ku abɔɔsaa akoto lɛma mansaka di seyoyiɛ lɛfɔ suoto,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 27:10">manta fanfũ leyooto.<verse eid="EZK 27:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 27:11" />Arwad ku Helek basuɔtɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 27:11">lale banyuntɛ di seyoyiɛ lɛfɔ di ɔfankyi biala suoto;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 27:11">Gamad basuɔtɔ lawɛ di banyuntɛ ayo takale lɛfɔ kamɛ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 27:11">Baayɔ kubiafunsaa lɛma baasaka di seyoyiɛ lɛfɔ suoto baakyisa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 27:11">baata faatɛ faalɛ sekpeele nwaa.<verse eid="EZK 27:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 27:12" />“ ‘Tarsis labla ɔkpɛ ku afɔ ta asaa ateate lɛsaawɛ kpinwu le niawɛ fɔ ni oso; baakyɛlɛnsa koto fututu, abɔɔsaa wɛɛfɛɛ, abɔɔsaa fututu ku abɔɔsaa nutũle, baafũ asunsũsaa lɛfɔ.<verse eid="EZK 27:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 27:13" />“ ‘Tawan, Tubal ku Mesek lasunsũ asaa ku afɔ; baayɔ balanle ku abɔɔsaa sɛɛle asaa baakyɛlɛnsa baafũ asunsũsaa lɛfɔ.<verse eid="EZK 27:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 27:14" />“ ‘Bet-Togarma batii lakyɛnlɛnsa bapɔnkɔ ba nimbla ni ɔkpɛ, bapɔnkɔ ba ninkyɛ ni kakpɛ ku babɔkɛɛ ba ninte ni fɛle pɔnkɔ baafũ asunsũsaa lɛfɔ.<verse eid="EZK 27:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 27:15" />“ ‘Rodes batii lasunsũ asaa ku afɔ. Lekpo kotoko nsɔ batii kpinwu kafɔɔ niale asaabayatɛ lɛfɔ; bato anyɛɛ ku lɛkambe sewoso baayɔ baata fɔ koto.<verse eid="EZK 27:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 27:16" />“ ‘Siria labla ɔkpɛ ku afɔ ta asunsũsaa kpinwu lɛfɔ oso; baayɔ afuɔ ya manlɛɛ ni turkuoise, abula ya niɛbla ni fɛ ɔsɛɛ, dibula le beeloso ni ku sikũ ateate, dibula biene fɛnɛnɛɛ fututu, lɛsaa le bɔɔlɛɛ ni koral ku afuɔ sɛɛle baakyɛlɛnssa baafũ asunsũsaa lɛfɔ.<verse eid="EZK 27:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 27:17" />“ ‘Yuda ku Israel lasunsũ asaa ku afɔ; baayɔ kamɔɔ ku amɛnɛmɛnɛsaa ya niakye ni Minit, bablɔ, nnɔnyi ku kɔfafifiale baakyɛlɛnsa baafũ asunsũsaa lɛfɔ.<verse eid="EZK 27:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 27:18" />“ ‘Damasko, ta asunsũsaa kpinwu ku lɛsaawɛ kplɛ asaa ateate lɛfɔ oso yi, baasunsũ asaa ku afɔ di nta be niakye ni Helbon ku bafoso sinwini se niakye ni Sahar baata fɔ.<verse eid="EZK 27:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 27:19" />“ ‘Dan batii ku Yawan batii ba niakye ni Usal niaya asunsũsaa lɛfɔ; baayɔ abɔɔsaa wɛɛfɛɛ ya bɛɛbɛntɛ ni, kloboo ku owosodu kɔnɔnkɔnɔ wɔ manlɛɛ ni kalamus baakyɛlɛnsa baafũ asunsũsaa lɛfɔ.<verse eid="EZK 27:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 27:20" />“ ‘Dedan lasunsũ bakuntu ba mantika ni di bapɔnkɔ suoto mansiɛ ni aata fɔ.<verse eid="EZK 27:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 27:21" />Arabia ku Kedar baka bamuu niale asaabayatɛ lɛfɔ; baasunsũ afosobi, akunumuu ku batie baata fɔ.<verse eid="EZK 27:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZK 27:22" />Seba ku Rama asaa basunsũtɛ lasunsũ asaa baata fɔ; baayɔ akɔnɔnkɔnɔsaa biene ku afuɔ ya niefũ ni kɔya ateate amuu, ku koto sɛɛle baakyɛlɛnsa baafũ asunsũsaa lɛfɔ.<verse eid="EZK 27:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZK 27:23" />“ ‘Haran, Kane, Eden ku Seba asaa basunsũtɛ, Asur ku Kilmad lasunsũ asaa ku afɔ. <verse eid="EZK 27:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZK 27:24" />Batii ba mmle layɔ akpeele ya nikɔlɛ ni onyu, abula bluu, abula ya baaloso ni ku sikũ ateate ku bakuntu ba baakpee ni afa ateate baafintĩsa nya baakyasa ni baabasunsũ ku afɔ di asaa kasunsũkɔ lɛfɔ.<verse eid="EZK 27:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EZK 27:25" />“ ‘Tarsis seklo niakyɛ sisuku</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 27:25">fɛ asunsũsaa lɛfɔ batukatɛ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 27:25">Atoo kpinwu layii fɔ kamɛ pɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 27:25">di lekpo ntɛɛntɛɛ.<verse eid="EZK 27:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="EZK 27:26" />Oklo lɛfɔ bawantɛ lawá fɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 27:26">baawako lekpo ntu kplɛ osi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 27:26">Kafɔɔ kufĩkatunkɔ kɔfɛɛfɔ kamabibiɛ fɔ wɔkyɔwɔkyɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 27:26">di lekpo nwu ntɛɛntɛɛ.<verse eid="EZK 27:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="EZK 27:27" />Lɛsaawɛ, asunsũsaa ku atoo lɛfɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 27:27">oklo bawantɛ, oklo kamɛ bakpɛmblatɛ ku oklo balolaatɛ lɛfɔ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 27:27">asaa basunsũtɛ ku bakpɛtɛ lɛfɔ bamuu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 27:27">ku otii bamba biala ninsi ni kaamɛ</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 27:27">kamamɛɛ di lekpo nwu ntɛɛntɛɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 27:27">di dii le suoto di oklo lɛfɔ nwu kamabiɛ nii.<verse eid="EZK 27:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="EZK 27:28" />Lekpo kotoko nsɔ kamatũkũ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 27:28">nse oklo lɛfɔ kamɛ bakpɛmblatɛ leyiisa kudu.<verse eid="EZK 27:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="EZK 27:29" />Mba bamuu ninklee ni seklo nflɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 27:29">kamadiɛ seklo lɛma manse;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 27:29">seklo bawantɛ ku oklo kamɛ bakpɛmblatɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 27:29">kamayila di lekpo nwu kotoko.<verse eid="EZK 27:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="EZK 27:30" />Babatakatɛ sɛlɔ lɛma katoo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 27:30">man-wi kaku osie kanya di suoto lɛfɔ;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 27:30">babalɛ kɔtɛ mankpete di asi lɛma,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 27:30">mampɛ mammunu kafɔɔ di ntɔ̀ kamɛ.<verse eid="EZK 27:30" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="EZK 27:31" />Babakpaasu asi lɛma ta afɔ oso,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 27:31">man-nyukũ kafɔɔ aboko.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 27:31">Babawi kaku ku ɔklà kamɛ ninyinyii mankpee fɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 27:31">man-wi ku ɔkɔnsɔlo.<verse eid="EZK 27:31" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="EZK 27:32" />Di obe wɔ boowi, mambla ni kaku di suoto lɛfɔ yi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 27:32">babasa okunu di suoto lɛfɔ alɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 27:32">“Owe batoodiwɔɔsa fɛle Tiro,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 27:32">di lekpo lamana nwɔ diekyi ni?”<verse eid="EZK 27:32" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="EZK 27:33" />Obe wɔ di asunsũsaa lɛfɔ lakye lekpo osi aawa ni yi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 27:33">faata nnle kpinwu lamiɛ;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 27:33">ku lɛsaawɛ lɛfɔ kplɛ ku asunsũsaa lɛfɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 27:33">faata baka di kasɔ nwu suoto lawɛ lɛlɛ.<verse eid="EZK 27:33" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="EZK 27:34" />Kanunua lekpo ntoobibiɛ fɔ wɔkyɔwɔkyɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 27:34">beekpee di ntu nkyofokɔ kamɛ;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 27:34">asunsũsaa lɛfɔ ku batii lɛfɔ bamuu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 27:34">ntoosoo beesifi ntu kalɔ ku afɔ.<verse eid="EZK 27:34" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="EZK 27:35" />Ɔlaa lɛfɔ labla</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 27:35">batii ba bamuu ninsi ni di lekpo kotoko nsɔ suoto ɔkpɛ;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 27:35">ɔfɔɔ osifi ku difu lapɛ baka lɛma,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 27:35">anu lɛma lawolo ku lɛyɛkɛ.<verse eid="EZK 27:35" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="EZK 27:36" />Asaa basunsũtɛ di nnle nwu kamɛ lawi fɔ nlɛ:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 27:36">Fatɔɔwa kayɛntɛkɔ ka ninkpe ni difu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 27:36">flɔbasinwɛ kafɔɔ diidii.’ ”<verse eid="EZK 27:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 27" />
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="EZK 28" />
  <para style="s1">Ɔlaa Obuɛ Ɔtɛ Di Tiro Ɔka Suoto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 28:1" />Ni di SAATE nwu ɔlaa lawa kuatɛɛ alɛ: <verse eid="EZK 28:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 28:2" />“Otii obi, tɔkɔ Tiro ɔka falɛ, ‘Nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE Kplɛ nwu kobuɛ ni alɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 28:2">“ ‘Di otu lɛfɔ lɛkanta kamɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 28:2">faabuɛ falɛ, “Yaa nle;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 28:2">nsi di yaa lɛkakpomii suoto</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 28:2">di lekpo ntɛɛntɛɛ.”</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 28:2">Kafɔɔ otii fale, diele yaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 28:2">kuntɛ foonyu falɛ feebe anu fɛ yaa.<verse eid="EZK 28:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 28:3" />Feebe anu falenke Daniel?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 28:3">Owofalaa kuonwii diewofa fɔ?<verse eid="EZK 28:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 28:4" />Di ninumbe ku lɛsɔnu lɛfɔ kamɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 28:4">feesiisa lɛsaawɛ fɛɛta suoto lɛfɔ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 28:4">feesiisa kafɔɔ koto sɛɛle ku koto fututu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 28:4">fɛɛtɛ di asaa lɛfɔ ntɛkɔ.<verse eid="EZK 28:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 28:5" />Di lɛsaatofo kplɛ le fakpe ni di asaa osunsũ kamɛ, ni</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 28:5">di lɛsaawɛ lɛfɔ lakpɛ diakyakaa nɛ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 28:5">Ta lɛsaawɛ lɛfɔ kafɔɔ oso,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 28:5">otu lɛfɔ lakanta.<verse eid="EZK 28:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 28:6" />“ ‘Nkpo oso, nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE Kplɛ nwu kobuɛ ni alɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 28:6">“ ‘Ta feenyu falɛ feebe ni anu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 28:6">fɛ mmle di yaa lebe ni anu oso yi,<verse eid="EZK 28:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 28:7" />kamatakatɛ bafɔɔ nkpee fɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 28:7">nnle be ninkpe amumu balenke nii;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 28:7">babananfi mpamii lɛma di sɛlɛ lɛfɔ ku ninumbe lɛfɔ suoto,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 28:7">nimadudufu lɛklɛɛ lɛfɔ nwu nikɔkpa nii.<verse eid="EZK 28:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 28:8" />Babasoosa fɔ mankpee di ɔkya kamɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 28:8">fabakpi kafɔɔ fɛ otii wɔ niɛnɔɔ ni kakpɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 28:8">di lekpo ntɛɛntɛɛ.<verse eid="EZK 28:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 28:9" />Ni fabakple fambuɛ falɛ, “Yaa nle,”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 28:9">di mba nielo fɔ ni anu?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 28:9">Otii lete fabale, diele yaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 28:9">di mba nielo fɔ ni nnɛɛ.<verse eid="EZK 28:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 28:10" />Fabakpi batii ba ninankyɛlɛnsa ni suoto kukpi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 28:10">di bafɔɔ nnɛɛ.</para>
  <para style="m" vid="EZK 28:10">Ntɔɔkakatɛ, SAATE Kplɛ nwu niebuɛ.’ ”<verse eid="EZK 28:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Tiro Ɔka Kasɔ Lɛpɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 28:11" />Ni di SAATE nwu ɔlaa lawa kuatɛɛ alɛ: <verse eid="EZK 28:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 28:12" />“Otii obi, wola okunu di Tiro ɔka suoto faatɔkɔ nwɔ falɛ: ‘Nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE Kplɛ nwu kobuɛ ni alɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 28:12">“ ‘Faawo nimu di ɔtɛ onyu kamɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 28:12">di ninumbe ku sɛlɛ se niawo nimu layii fɔ ni kamɛ.<verse eid="EZK 28:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 28:13" />Faawɛ di Eden,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 28:13">Yaa kɔba nwu kamɛ;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 28:13">difuɔ le niefũ ni kɔya biala niale fɔ sɛlɛ:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 28:13">afuɔ ya manlɛɛ ni rubi, topas ku emerad,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 28:13">krisolite, oniks ku yaspa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 28:13">safir, turkuoise ku beril.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 28:13">Koto sɛɛle baayɔ baabla asaa lɛfɔ ya baatɛ ni ku n-ya baasesee nii;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 28:13">baabla nya di dii le baabla fɔ ni suoto.<verse eid="EZK 28:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 28:14" />Baapɛ fɔ ɔfɔɔ fɛ nyuntɛ kerubi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 28:14">diekye nkpo kanya lase fɔ nɛ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 28:14">Faawɛ di Yaa kobokote klekle nwu suoto;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 28:14">faakyɛ di ɔtɔ afuɔ kamɛ.<verse eid="EZK 28:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 28:15" />Ole kuonwii ditawɛ di sisuku lɛfɔ suoto,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 28:15">diayɔ ni di dii le baabla fɔ ni</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 28:15">dialaase ni di obe wɔ baanya ni amumu ablasaa di kamɛ lɛfɔ.<verse eid="EZK 28:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 28:16" />Diafe ni di asaa lɛfɔ kpinwu osunsũ okyi kamɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 28:16">di disiensie ɔbla layii fɔ ni kamɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 28:16">ni faabla okpile nɛ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 28:16">Nioso latososa fɔ di Yaa kobokote nwu ku sinunsɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 28:16">Oo nyuntɛ kerubi, latososa fɔ ladiki,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 28:16">di ɔtɔ afuɔ nwu kamɛ.<verse eid="EZK 28:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 28:17" />Lɛkanta labayii otu lɛfɔ kamɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 28:17">ta sɛlɛ lɛfɔ oso,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 28:17">ni faalalaasa ninumbe lɛfɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 28:17">ta lɛklɛɛ lɛfɔ oso nɛ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 28:17">Nioso lafuki fɔ layu kaasɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 28:17">labla fɔ ninyunsaa di baka anu.<verse eid="EZK 28:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 28:18" />Di sikpile lɛfɔ kpinwu ɔbla ku onukwale ɔtanle asaa osunsũ kamɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 28:18">faakpɔnɔfɔsa nkleklekɔ lɛfɔ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 28:18">Nioso lata ɔtɔ ladie kuakye kamɛ lɛfɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 28:18">ni kuafiɛ fɔ nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 28:18">ni lawakosa fɔ kasɔ faabla ntɔ̀ di kasɔ suoto</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 28:18">di batii ba bamuu niatoonyu fɔ ni anu nɛ.<verse eid="EZK 28:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 28:19" />Ɔlaa lɛfɔ lakpɛ nyaami kuata</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 28:19">nnle be mmuu niatofo fɔ nii;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 28:19">fatɔɔwa kayɛntɛkɔ ka ninkpe ni difu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 28:19">flɔbasinwɛ kafɔɔ diidii.’ ”<verse eid="EZK 28:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɔlaa Obuɛ Ɔtɛ Di Sidon Suoto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 28:20" />Ni di SAATE nwu ɔlaa lawa kuatɛɛ alɛ: <verse eid="EZK 28:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 28:21" />“Otii obi, munikĩisa anu lɛfɔ fakyɔɔ Sidon; faabuɛ ɔlaa fatɛ di suoto nɔɔ <verse eid="EZK 28:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZK 28:22" />falɛ: ‘Nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE Kplɛ nwu kobuɛ ni alɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 28:22">“ ‘Oo Sidon, lɛtaka n-yɛ fɔ di suoto,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 28:22">kamawɛ dibu kafɔɔ di kamɛ lɛfɔ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 28:22">Babatofo alɛ ami ninle SAATE nwu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 28:22">nse lɛyɔ letokonanfi lɛwako di suoto nɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 28:22">lediki kafɔɔ leklekle nii letuo di kamɛ nɔɔ.<verse eid="EZK 28:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZK 28:23" />Kamata ofiɛ kpile n-wa di suoto nɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 28:23">nta kafɔɔ ntɔ mbiɛ ninfe di akpaka nɔɔ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 28:23">Batii ba beelo ni kamanɔɔ mante di kamɛ nɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 28:23">di kapamii ka bɛɛyɔ ni di suoto nɔɔ nte ni di ɔfankyi biala suoto.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 28:23">Ninfɛ babatofo alɛ ami ninle SAATE nwu nɛ.<verse eid="EZK 28:23" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Babata Israel Lɛtɔtrɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZK 28:24" />“ ‘Sɛlaa ku afunu nnle be ninle ni kakɔtɔkɔtɔ mantotofo ni ku siwuu piɔnpiɔ dilɔbasinwɛ di Israel batii kamɛ. Ninfɛ babatofo alɛ ami ninle SAATE Kplɛ nwu nɛ.<verse eid="EZK 28:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EZK 28:25" />“ ‘Nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE Kplɛ nwu kobuɛ ni alɛ: Nse lesiisa Israel batii lekyeko nnle nwu kamɛ, di nfũ baasamiisa ma baakpete ni yi, kamadiki suoto nii leklekle ntuo di kamɛ lɛma di nnle nwu anu. Ni babasiɛ di mma bamu kasɔ suoto, nka layɔ lata ni kpɛmblatɛ nii Yakob. <verse eid="EZK 28:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EZK 28:26" />Babasiɛ ninfa di atoko ɔkyɛ ole kamɛ, mantofo kafɔɔ ayo, mankpɛ kafɔɔ nta awosobi afe; babasiɛ di atoko ɔkyɛ ole kamɛ nse lɛyɔ letokonanfi lɛwako di nnle be mmuu ninkaako ma ni man-nyu ma ni nyakatãa suoto. Ninfɛ babatofo alɛ ami ninle SAATE Yaa lɛma nɛ.’ ”<verse eid="EZK 28:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 28" />
  <chapter number="29" style="c" sid="EZK 29" />
  <para style="s1">Ɔlaa Obuɛ Ɔtɛ Di Egipte Suoto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 29:1" />Di lɛlɛɛ fosile kamɛ, di Israel batii kɔwɛntɛ fosile kamɛ, di lefosi dii nyɔɔfa suoto yi, SAATE nwu ɔlaa lawa kuatɛɛ alɛ: <verse eid="EZK 29:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 29:2" />“Otii obi, yɔ anu lɛfɔ fakyɔɔ Egipte ɔka Farao suoto, faabuɛ ɔlaa fatɛ di suoto nɔɔ ku Egipte omuu suoto. <verse eid="EZK 29:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 29:3" />Kakatɛ fatɔɔ faabuɛ falɛ: ‘Nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE Kplɛ nwu kobuɛ ni alɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 29:3">“ ‘Egipte ɔka Farao, lɛtaka n-yɛ fɔ di suoto,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 29:3">afɔ kɔsanwu kplɛ yɛkɛle ko ninte ni di seklenyii lɛfɔ kamɛ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 29:3">Fambuɛ falɛ, “Nil okle ole mi kule;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 29:3">ami niabla nwu lata suoto nii.”<verse eid="EZK 29:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 29:4" />Kafɔɔ kamayɔ badaduwa nkpee di n-yɛɛ lɛfɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 29:4">ninta kafɔɔ kɔkpaku di seklenyii lɛfɔ kamɛ nnu kunkaa di apoo lɛfɔ suoto.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 29:4">Kamananfi fɔ ndiki di seklenyii lɛfɔ kamɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 29:4">ku kɔkpaku ko kumuu nienu kuka ni di apoo lɛfɔ suoto.<verse eid="EZK 29:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 29:5" />Kamadiɛ fɔ ntɛ di ɔfaafuu kamɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 29:5">afɔ ku seklenyii lɛfɔ kɔkpaku kumuu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 29:5">Fabanɔɔ fante kaayi di lepoo kamɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 29:5">blɔbasiisa fɔ batɛ ee basɛsɛɛ fɔ batɛ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 29:5">Kamayɔ fɔ nta lepoo kamɛ babɔkɛɛ di kasɔ suoto ku bakansiɛ di kɔfɛɛfɔ kamɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 29:5">fɛ alesaa.<verse eid="EZK 29:5" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 29:6" />Ninfɛ di mba bamuu ninsi ni di Egipte kamatofo alɛ ami ninle SAATE nwu nɛ.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="EZK 29:6" />
  <para style="p" vid="EZK 29:6">“ ‘Biale okpoku biata Israel batii. <verse eid="EZK 29:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 29:7" />Di obe wɔ baapaataa fɔ ni ku nnɛɛ lɛma yi, faafee amuusi lɛma, ni faabɛbɛɛ nya nɛ; obe wɔ baakpɛ fɔ ni di suoto yi, faafee ntaduu lɛma, ni diakɔnkɔ nɛ.<verse eid="EZK 29:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 29:8" />“ ‘Nkpo oso, nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE Kplɛ nwu kobuɛ ni alɛ: Kamayɔ kapamii di suoto lɛfɔ nimalo batii lɛfɔ ku babɔkɛɛ lɛma. <verse eid="EZK 29:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 29:9" />Egipte kamakple kasɔ fukuti kanlalaa kante. Ninfɛ babatofo alɛ ami ninle SAATE nwu nɛ.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EZK 29:9">“ ‘Ta faabuɛ ni falɛ, “Ole mi di Nil okle nle; ni ami niabla nwu ni oso,” <verse eid="EZK 29:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 29:10" />nkpo oso lɛtaka n-yɛ fɔ di suoto, n-yɛ kafɔɔ di seklenyii lɛfɔ suoto nɛ. Kamabla kafɔɔ Egipte kasɔ nwu kan-wɔɔ, kante kafɔɔ kafukuti, kanlalaa diɛyɔ ni di Migdol diɛlaadu ni Siene, ninaadu bia Etiopia kɔmɛ kanya. <verse eid="EZK 29:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 29:11" />Otii kuonwii kɔkpaa ee bɔkɛɛ kɔkpaa dilɔbafe di kasɔ nwu suoto; kuonwii dilɔbasiɛ ninka suoto alɛɛ afosi ana. <verse eid="EZK 29:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 29:12" />Kamabla Egipte kasɔ kante kafukuti di nsɔ be niɛlalaa dite ni kamɛ. Sekpoo kplɛ nɔɔ kafɔɔ kamabiɛ sinte sifukuti alɛɛ afosi ana di sekpoo kplɛ se niɛwɔɔ site ni kamɛ. Kamasɛ Egipte batii nkpee di nnle nwu kamɛ, ninsamiisa ma kafɔɔ nkpete di nsɔ nwu kamɛ nfenko.<verse eid="EZK 29:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 29:13" />“ ‘Kafɔɔ nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE Kplɛ nwu kobuɛ ni alɛ: Di alɛɛ afosi ana kalookɔ yi, kamasiisa Egipte batii nkyeko nnle nwu kamɛ, di nfũ baasamiisa ma baakpete nii. <verse eid="EZK 29:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 29:14" />Kamakplesa ma nkyeko sɛlanle kamɛ nwako, ninkplesa ma nsifiko Patros, bawa lɛma kasɔ suoto. Nfa babale sɛkakalekɔ biibii nɛ. <verse eid="EZK 29:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 29:15" />Kabale sɛkakalekɔ ka niebiibii kalenke ni di sɛkanlekɔ kamɛ, klɔbasinkple katakatɛ kafɔɔ suoto ninka katoo di nnle bamba suoto diidii. Kamatɛ nkpiɛkpiɛsa ka alɛ klɔbasinkple kale sɛka di nnle suoto. <verse eid="EZK 29:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 29:16" />Egipte dilɔbasinle disitikasaa bata Israel batii, kafɔɔ babale ninyumasa manta sikpile lɛma di lɛkyakaako le baakaalɛ baakyeko ni ɔkyɛ lɛma kamɛ. Ninfɛ babatofo alɛ ami ninle SAATE Kplɛ nwu nɛ.’ ”<verse eid="EZK 29:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɔka Nebukadnesar Kamalenkee Egipte</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 29:17" />Di afosi-anyɔ lɛlɛɛ kuɛnsinle kamɛ, di Israel batii kɔwɛntɛ kasale kamɛ di dii kasale suoto yi, SAATE nwu ɔlaa lawa kuatɛɛ alɛ: <verse eid="EZK 29:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 29:18" />“Otii obi, Babel ɔka Nebukadnesar ntɔɔta bakpɛtɛ nɔɔ lebuo di Tiro suoto osie kanya; disi biala lafini, nimuusi biala kafɔɔ lafifiele. Kafɔɔ nnwɔɔ ku bakpɛtɛ nɔɔ ditawɛ letota kuninwii baakyeko kakpɛ ka baakpɛ ni Tiro kamɛ. <verse eid="EZK 29:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 29:19" />Nkpo oso, nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE Kplɛ nwu kobuɛ ni alɛ: Kamayɔ Egipte nkpee di Babel ɔka Nebukadnesar nnɛɛ, abalɛ kafɔɔ lɛsaawɛ nɔɔ ansifiko. Abafũ nwu, an-yɔ kafɔɔ kasɔ nwu kakpɛ kamɛ asaa fɛ letota anta bakpɛtɛ nɔɔ. <verse eid="EZK 29:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 29:20" />Ntɔɔyɔ Egipte kasɔ lɛtɔɔ fɛ letota di kɔnyaabe ko aakpee ni oso. Diekye nnwɔɔ ku bakpɛtɛ nɔɔ niabla ɔkpɛ nwu baatɛɛ, SAATE Kplɛ nwu niebuɛ.<verse eid="EZK 29:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 29:21" />“Di dii nwu nkpo kale, kamata lɛkyà nyila ninta Israel leyo, nimbɛ kanya lɛfɔ kafɔɔ di kamɛ lɛma. Ninfɛ babatofo alɛ ami ninle SAATE nwu nɛ.”<verse eid="EZK 29:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 29" />
  <chapter number="30" style="c" sid="EZK 30" />
  <para style="s1">SAATE Nwu Kamananfi Egipte Kootoko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 30:1" />Ni di SAATE nwu ɔlaa lawa kuatɛɛ alɛ: <verse eid="EZK 30:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 30:2" />“Otii obi, buɛ ɔlaa fatɛ, faabuɛ falɛ: ‘Nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE Kplɛ nwu kobuɛ ni alɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 30:2">“‘Wi kaku osie kanya faabuɛ falɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 30:2">“Dii nwu nkpo diyɔɔsa!”<verse eid="EZK 30:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 30:3" />Diekye dii nwu ntɔɔtɛɛtɛɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 30:3">SAATE nwu dii ntɔɔtɛɛtɛɛ-</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 30:3">alokonkyɛ dii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 30:3">obe wɔ di nnle nwu kamawɔɔ nii.<verse eid="EZK 30:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 30:4" />Kapamii kamawa di Egipte suoto,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 30:4">dibuo dibinte kafɔɔ kamawa di Etiopia suoto.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 30:4">Nse mba beelo ni lɛnɔɔ di Egipte yi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 30:4">babalɛ lɛsaawɛ nɔɔ mansifiko</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 30:4">mambibiɛ kafɔɔ asɔse nɔɔ mantɛ kaasɔ.<verse eid="EZK 30:4" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 30:5" />“ ‘Etiopia ku Put, Lidia ku Arabia omuu, Libia ku kanya ninii kasɔ nwu batii kamanɔɔ di kapamii kanya diɛkyakaa ni di Egipte.<verse eid="EZK 30:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 30:6" />“ ‘Nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE Kplɛ nwu kobuɛ ni alɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 30:6">“ ‘Batii ba nin-yɛ ni Egipte kamaa kamanɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 30:6">lɛkanta nɔɔ osie nwu kafɔɔ kamawa kasɔ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 30:6">Diɛyɔ ni di Migdol diɛlaadu ni di Siene,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 30:6">babanɔɔ di kapamii kanya di kamɛ nɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q4" vid="EZK 30:6">SAATE Kplɛ nwu niebuɛ.<verse eid="EZK 30:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 30:7" />“ ‘Babate bafukuti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 30:7">di nsɔ be ninte ni nfukuti kamɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 30:7">sekpoo kplɛ lɛma kafɔɔ kamate</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 30:7">di sekpoo kplɛ se niɛwɔɔ site ni kamɛ.<verse eid="EZK 30:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 30:8" />Nse lekpee Egipte ɔtɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 30:8">di bakyakaakotɛ nɔɔ kafɔɔ bamuu lɛwɔɔ yi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 30:8">ninfɛ babatofo alɛ ami ninle SAATE nwu nɛ.<verse eid="EZK 30:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 30:9" />“ ‘Batɔkyɛntɛ kamadie di ɔkyɛ nii di seklo kamɛ manayɛkɛsa Etiopia batii ba niediki atoko basi ni di dii nwu nkpo suoto. Babanu dibuo osie kanya di Egipte kawɔɔ dii nwu suoto, diekye nwaako diɔwa ɔbawa.<verse eid="EZK 30:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 30:10" />“ ‘Nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE Kplɛ nwu kobuɛ ni alɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 30:10">“ ‘Kamayɔ Egipte batii ɔlambu nwu n-wako kase,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 30:10">diefe ni di Babel ɔka Nebukadnesar kɔnɛɛ suoto.<verse eid="EZK 30:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 30:11" />Babakpaa nnwɔɔ ku bakpɛtɛ nɔɔ- mba niɛtɛ bakpe ni amumu balenke ni nnle nwu-</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 30:11">manwako mamawɔɔsa kasɔ nwu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 30:11">Babananfi mpamii lɛma di Egipte suoto,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 30:11">manlo kafɔɔ batii man-yiisa kasɔ nwu suoto.<verse eid="EZK 30:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 30:12" />Kamata Nil seklenyii nsɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 30:12">nsunsũ kasɔ nwu kafɔɔ nta batii kpile.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 30:12">Diefe ni di bafɔɔ nnɛɛ kamɛ yi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 30:12">kamalalaasa kasɔ nwu ku lɛsaa biala ninsi ka ni kaamɛ ntɛ. Ami SAATE nwu niɛkakatɛ.<verse eid="EZK 30:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 30:13" />“ ‘Nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE Kplɛ nwu kobuɛ ni alɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 30:13">“ ‘Kamawɔɔsa afiɔtii nwu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 30:13">nimbibiɛ kafɔɔ atembi asaa nwu di Memfis.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 30:13">Ɔka kuonwii dilɔbasinwɛ di Egipte,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 30:13">kamata lɛyɛkɛ kafɔɔ nwɛ di kasɔ kamuu suoto.<verse eid="EZK 30:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 30:14" />Kamata Patros kasɔ nlalaa kante,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 30:14">ninkpee Soan ɔtɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 30:14">kamayɔ letokonanfi kafɔɔ n-wako di Tebes suoto.<verse eid="EZK 30:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 30:15" />Kamanyɛɛnɛ ɔblɔ yakayaka nii nkpete di Pelusium suoto,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 30:15">Egipte kawofakɔ nwu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 30:15">mbudi kafɔɔ Tebes batii ɔlambu nwu ndiki.<verse eid="EZK 30:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 30:16" />Kamakpee Egipte ɔtɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 30:16">Pelusium kamasiɛ di dibuo kplɛ kamɛ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 30:16">Afɛɛfɔ siene kamabiɛ Tebes seyoyiɛ antɛ kaasɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 30:16">Memfis kamasiɛ di ninyinyii kamɛ obe lele.<verse eid="EZK 30:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 30:17" />On ku Pibeset bakosopo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 30:17">kamanɔɔ di kapamii kanya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 30:17">sekpoo kplɛ nwu simu kafɔɔ kamasifi sɛlanle kamɛ.<verse eid="EZK 30:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 30:18" />Ditunu dibale di dii nwu di Tehafne,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 30:18">nse letekete Egipte atoo nutũle nwu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 30:18">nfa di lɛkanta nɔɔ osie nwu kamase nɛ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 30:18">Alokonkyɛ kamatĩi nwɔ suoto,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 30:18">sekpoenyii nɔɔ kafɔɔ kamasifi sɛlanle kamɛ.<verse eid="EZK 30:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 30:19" />Nioso kamayɔ letokonanfi n-wako di Egipte suoto,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 30:19">ni babatofo alɛ ami ninle SAATE nwu nɛ.’ ”<verse eid="EZK 30:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Egipte Ɔka Osie Wɔ Baafũ Nii</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 30:20" />Di lefosi lɛlɛɛ kasale kamɛ, di Israel batii kɔwɛntɛ kasale kamɛ, di dii kuɛnsinle suoto yi, SAATE nwu ɔlaa lawa kuatɛɛ alɛ: <verse eid="EZK 30:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 30:21" />“Otii obi, ntoofee Egipte ɔka Farao kɔnɛɛ. Badinii kũ alɛ kuakyá ee baboodi kũ alɛ kuawɛ osie nwaa kunta kapamii oklee. <verse eid="EZK 30:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZK 30:22" />Nkpo oso nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE Kplɛ nwu kobuɛ ni alɛ: Lɛtaka n-yɛ di Egipte ɔka Farao suoto. Kamafefee nnɛɛ nɔɔ akyuu nwu anyɔ, nko ninlɛ ni ku nko niefee nii, ninta kafɔɔ kapamii nkpa kundie di kɔnɛɛ nɔɔ. <verse eid="EZK 30:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZK 30:23" />Kamasamiisa Egipte batii nkpete di nnle nwu kamɛ, ninsɛ ma kafɔɔ nfenko di nsɔ nwu kamɛ. <verse eid="EZK 30:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZK 30:24" />Kamakpee Babel ɔka nnɛɛ osie, nin-yɔ kafɔɔ kapamii nii nkpee nwɔ kɔɔnɛɛ, kafɔɔ kamafee Farao nnɛɛ. Abatũuni di anu nɔɔ kafɔɔ fɛle otii wɔ niefũ ni kakɔ osie kanya. <verse eid="EZK 30:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EZK 30:25" />Kamakpee Babel ɔka nnɛɛ osie, kafɔɔ Farao nnɛɛ kamakpa ninsaka. Ninfɛ babatofo alɛ ami ninle SAATE nwu, nse lɛyɔ kapamii nii lekpee di Babel ɔka kɔnɛɛ, ɛɛnanfi ka kafɔɔ ɛɛkyɔɔ di Egipte suoto nɛ. <verse eid="EZK 30:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EZK 30:26" />Kamasamiisa Egipte batii nkpete di nnle nwu kamɛ, ninsɛ ma kafɔɔ nfenko di nsɔ nwu kamɛ. Ninfɛ babatofo alɛ ami ninle SAATE nwu nɛ.”<verse eid="EZK 30:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 30" />
  <chapter number="31" style="c" sid="EZK 31" />
  <para style="s1">Baayɔ Egipte Baakaatɛɛsa Ku Sida Kowoso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 31:1" />Di lefosi lɛlɛɛ kasale kamɛ, di Israel batii kɔwɛntɛ tiɛfa, dii kasale suoto yi, SAATE nwu ɔlaa lawa kuatɛɛ alɛ: <verse eid="EZK 31:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 31:2" />“Otii obi, tɔkɔ Egipte ɔka Farao ku batii nɔɔ ɔlambu nwu falɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 31:2">“ ‘Owe babayɔ mankaatɛɛsa ku afɔ di sɛka ole kamɛ?<verse eid="EZK 31:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 31:3" />Nyu lo, Asiria late fɛle kowoso ko bɔɔlɛɛ ni sida di Lebanon di obe owo kamɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 31:3">kuataka katoo</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 31:3">ku sɛla se nialɛ ni onyu, kuabla ni oyududu di lepoo;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 31:3">sɛnya nikũ lataka katoo sialaadu kolo.<verse eid="EZK 31:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 31:4" />Ntu lata kũ kuamuɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 31:4">ntu ntaakɔ kyofole lata kũ kuakaana;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 31:4">seklenyii lɛma labiɛ siafe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 31:4">di lɛba le baasɔ kũ ni nimuu siakyi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 31:4">ni diata seklenyii ninwu labiɛ siakpete</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 31:4">di lepoo nwu awoso amuu kamɛ nɛ.<verse eid="EZK 31:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 31:5" />Nioso kuataka katoo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 31:5">kualenkee lepoo nwu awoso amuu;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 31:5">sɛla nikũ lamuɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 31:5">ni siadie sɛla kaanale,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 31:5">siafukuti, ta kuawɛ ni ntu kpinwu oso.<verse eid="EZK 31:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 31:6" />Bakansiɛ bamuu di kɔfɛɛfɔ kamɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 31:6">labla ayo lɛma di sɛla nikũ kamɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 31:6">lepoo kamɛ babɔkɛɛ bamuu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 31:6">lalofo di sɛla nikũ kalɔ;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 31:6">nnle kplɛ mmuu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 31:6">lasiɛ di oyududu nikũ kalɔ.<verse eid="EZK 31:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 31:7" />Nimuɔ nikũ lalɛ onyu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 31:7">ku sɛla nikũ se niafukuti nii,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 31:7">diekye sidu nikũ lasoo siasifi kasɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 31:7">sialaadu ntu kpinwu.<verse eid="EZK 31:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 31:8" />Sida awoso nwu di Yaa kɔba kamɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 31:8">ditafuo kũ ɔkasiiko,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 31:8">ee ɛfram awoso</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 31:8">akyɛkyɛ ku sɛla nikũ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 31:8">ee bayɔ kɔkpɛ́ awoso</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 31:8">bakaatɛɛsa ku sɛla nikũ-</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 31:8">kowoso kukunwii di Yaa kɔba kamɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 31:8">ditawo kũ sɛlɛ.<verse eid="EZK 31:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 31:9" />Ami niabla kũ kualɛ onyu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 31:9">ku sɛla kpinwu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 31:9">alɛ awoso nwu amuu di Eden lakpɛ sɛsɔfɔwo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 31:9">di Yaa kɔba nwu kamɛ.<verse eid="EZK 31:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 31:10" />“ ‘Nkpo oso, nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE Kplɛ nwu kobuɛ ni alɛ: Ta kuataka ni katoo, di sɛnya nikũ lataka katoo sialaadu ni kolo, kuakanta ni kafɔɔ ta lɛtaka nikũ oso yi, <verse eid="EZK 31:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 31:11" />lɛyɔ kũ lekpee di nnle nwu ɔka nnɛɛ, alɛ ablako nwɔ suoto ɔkpɛ di amumu nikũ kanya. Ntoofuki kũ lɛtɛ di ɔlɔɔkɔ, <verse eid="EZK 31:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 31:12" />bafɔɔ nnle be kafɔɔ niɛtɛ bakpe ni amumu balenke ni kamabudi kũ mantɛ kaasɔ, mankyɛ mandiɛ kũ. Sɛla nikũ kamafee sinte di abokote suoto ku sɛtaata simuu kamɛ; sɛla nikũ kamafefee sinte di kasɔ nwu kɔwɛ kumuu kamɛ. Nnle nwu mmuu di kasɔ suoto kamadie di oyududu nikũ kalɔ mansifi mandiɛ kũ. <verse eid="EZK 31:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 31:13" />Bakansiɛ ba bamuu di kɔfɛɛfɔ kamɛ kamasiɛ di kowoso nwu nimafee kunte ni suoto. Lepoo kamɛ babɔkɛɛ bamuu kafɔɔ kamasiɛ di sɛla nikũ kamɛ. <verse eid="EZK 31:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 31:14" />Nioso awoso bamba ya nin-yɛ ni di okle-lɔɔkɔ kukunwii dilɔbasintaka katoo di lɛkanta kamɛ diidii, atakatɛ awoso nwu sɛnya katoo silaadu kolo. Awoso bamba ya beekpete ni ntu nwaa kukunwii dilɔbasintaka katoo kulaadu lɛtaka nwu nkpo okle diidii; amuu n-yɛ ata kukpi, ayɛ ata kasɔ kaalɔ, di nkpa batii kamɛ, ku mba ninsoo mansifi ni ɔkya kamɛ.<verse eid="EZK 31:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 31:15" />“ ‘Nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE Kplɛ nwu kobuɛ ni alɛ: Di dii le baasoosa kũ baakpee ni di ɔkya kamɛ yi, latĩi ntu ntaakɔ kyofole nwu ku kaku owi ɔta kũ; lata seklenyii nisĩ ditabiɛ siafe, lasɛɛ kafɔɔ ntu nimi kpinwu osuku. Ta nni oso, lanyukũsa Lebanon ku dibula wɛɛfɛɛ, ni di lepoo kamɛ awoso amuu layɔɔ nɛ. <verse eid="EZK 31:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 31:16" />Lata nnle nwu latũtũkũ di kasɔ nikũ ɔpɛ kudu oyiisa ladie ni di obe wɔ lasoosa kũ lakpee ni di ɔkya kamɛ, manko mba niasoo baasifi ni ɔkya kamɛ. Ninfɛ di Eden awoso amuu niawo ni nwaa ku Lebanon awoso ya nialɛ alenke nii, ku awoso ya amuu baakpete ni ntu nwaa, lawɛ kɔnɛɛ okpee kaafutu di kasɔ nwu kalɔ nɛ. <verse eid="EZK 31:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 31:17" />Mba niasiɛ ni di oyududu nikũ, basiɛwo nikũ, di nnle nwu kamɛ kafɔɔ ntoosoo beesifi ɔkya kamɛ ku nkũ, baalaakyakaa di mba baalo ni ku kapamii.<verse eid="EZK 31:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 31:18" />“ ‘Eden awoso amɛnle babayɔ mankaatɛɛsa ku afɔ di lɛklɛɛ ku sɛka ole kamɛ? Kafɔɔ, afɔ kafɔɔ, babawakosa fɔ kasɔ ku Eden awoso mankpee di kasɔ kalɔ; fabate di batii ba ninankyɛlɛnsa ni suoto, ku mba baalo ni ku kapamii kamɛ.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EZK 31:18">“ ‘Nnya Farao ku batii nɔɔ ɔlambu nɛ, SAATE Kplɛ nwu niebuɛ.’ ”<verse eid="EZK 31:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 31" />
  <chapter number="32" style="c" sid="EZK 32" />
  <para style="s1">Baayɔ Egipte Ɔka Baakaatɛɛsa Ku Lɛnkɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 32:1" />Di lefosi lɛlɛɛ nyɔɔfa kamɛ, di Israel batii lefosi kɔwɛntɛ nyɔɔfa kamɛ di dii kasale suoto yi, SAATE nwu ɔlaa lawa kuatɛɛ alɛ: <verse eid="EZK 32:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 32:2" />“Otii obi, wola okunu di Egipte ɔka Farao suoto faatɔkɔ nwɔ falɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 32:2">“ ‘Fate fɛle kyata di nnle nwu kamɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 32:2">fate fɛle bɔkɛɛ kplɛ yɛkɛle di lekpo kamɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 32:2">kuɔpɛ kummunikĩi ni di seklenyii lɛfɔ kamɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 32:2">kuɔbɔkaa ni ntu nwu ku nkpaa lɛfɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 32:2">kuokunsa ni kafɔɔ seklenyii nwu.<verse eid="EZK 32:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 32:3" />“ ‘Nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE Kplɛ nwu kobuɛ ni alɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 32:3">“ ‘Batii ɔlambu kplɛ kamakyakaako mi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 32:3">ntaa asawu nii di suoto lɛfɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 32:3">babananfi fɔ kafɔɔ ku asawu nii mandiki.<verse eid="EZK 32:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 32:4" />Kamafuki fɔ ntɛ di kasɔ suoto,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 32:4">kamadiɛ fɔ ntɛ di lepoo nwu kamɛ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 32:4">Kamata bakansiɛ bamuu di kɔfɛɛfɔ kamɛ nsiɛ fɔ di suoto,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 32:4">lepoo kamɛ babɔkɛɛ bamuu kafɔɔ kamakonko di suoto lɛfɔ.<verse eid="EZK 32:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 32:5" />Kamasamiisa suoto sina lɛfɔ nkpete di abokote suoto,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 32:5">ninta sɛtaata n-yii ku kpi lɛfɔ.<verse eid="EZK 32:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 32:6" />Kamata kasɔ ku abokote amuu n-yii</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 32:6">ku ntɔ lɛfɔ be nikobiɛ ninfe nii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 32:6">kɔwɛ kafɔɔ kamayii ku suoto sina lɛfɔ.<verse eid="EZK 32:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 32:7" />Nse lɛwɔɔsa fɔ leloo yi, kamatĩi osi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 32:7">ninta kafɔɔ awɛntrɛbi lɛma nwɔfɔ tunutunu;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 32:7">kamayɔ lelokonkyɛ ntĩi kufĩ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 32:7">kɔwɛntɛ kafɔɔ dilɔbakpa.<verse eid="EZK 32:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 32:8" />Sɛtɔ se simuu ninkpa ni di osi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 32:8">dilɔbasinkpa di suoto lɛfɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 32:8">kamayɔ ditunu n-wako di kasɔ lɛfɔ suoto,</para>
  <para style="q4" vid="EZK 32:8">SAATE Kplɛ nwu niebuɛ.<verse eid="EZK 32:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 32:9" />Kamata batii kpinwu situ nnu dibuo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 32:9">nse lɛwako kawɔɔ lɛfɔ di nnle nwu kamɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 32:9">di nsɔ be fatatofo ni kamɛ.<verse eid="EZK 32:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 32:10" />Kamata fankpɛ batii kpinwu nyaami,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 32:10">baka lɛma kafɔɔ kamatũtũkũ ku lɛyɛkɛ ta afɔ oso,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 32:10">nse lɛnwanyi kapamii nii di anu lɛma.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 32:10">Obiala lɛma kamatũtũkũ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 32:10">anta nkpa nɔɔ obe lele</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 32:10">di dii le fabapɛ ni kaasɔ.<verse eid="EZK 32:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 32:11" />“ ‘Diekye nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE Kplɛ nwu kobuɛ ni alɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 32:11">“ ‘Babel ɔka nwu kapamii</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 32:11">kamawa fɔ di suoto.<verse eid="EZK 32:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 32:12" />Kamata batii ɔlambu lɛfɔ nnɔɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 32:12">di basientɛ mpamii kanya-</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 32:12">mba ninkpe ni amumu balenke ni di nnle mmuu kamɛ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 32:12">Babata Egipte ndiɛ lɛkanta nwu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 32:12">batii ɔlambu nɔɔ bamuu kafɔɔ kamawɔɔ.<verse eid="EZK 32:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 32:13" />Kamawɔɔsa banankyue nɔɔ bamuu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 32:13">ndiki di ntu kpinwu ɔlɔɔkɔ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 32:13">otii kuonwii kɔkpaa dilɔbasimbɔkaa ntu nwu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 32:13">ee banankyue akpɔbi dikunsa mi.<verse eid="EZK 32:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 32:14" />Ni kamata ntu nɔɔ nte,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 32:14">nta kafɔɔ seklenyii nɔɔ mbiɛ sinfe fɛle nnɔnyi,</para>
  <para style="q4" vid="EZK 32:14">SAATE Kplɛ nwu niebuɛ.<verse eid="EZK 32:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 32:15" />Nse lɛta Egipte kasɔ lete kafukuti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 32:15">lɛlalaasa kafɔɔ lɛsaa biala di kasɔ nwu suoto,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 32:15">lelo mba bamuu ninsi ni ninfa yi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 32:15">ninfɛ babatofo alɛ ami ninle SAATE nwu nɛ.’<verse eid="EZK 32:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 32:16" />“Nnya okunu wɔ babasa mantɔɔ ni. Nnle nwu babisankobi nimasa nwu; Egipte ku batii nɔɔ ɔlambu bamuu babasa nwu manta, SAATE Kplɛ nwu niebuɛ.”<verse eid="EZK 32:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bakpi Kafa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 32:17" />Di lefosi lɛlɛɛ nnyɔɔfa kamɛ, di Israel batii kɔwɛntɛ kasale kamɛ di lefosi dii nɔnle suoto yi, SAATE nwu ɔlaa lawa kuatɛɛ alɛ: <verse eid="EZK 32:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 32:18" />“Otii obi, wi kaku osie kanya fata Egipte batii ɔlambu nwu, faakpaa nwɔ kafɔɔ ku nnle siene babisankobi akyuu nwu anyɔ fasifiko dibiɔ kamɛ, ku mba nikosoo mansifi ni ɔkya kamɛ. <verse eid="EZK 32:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 32:19" />Kaalɛ ma falɛ, ‘Beele fɔ sibualɛ balenke batii bule? Soofasifi faalaate di batii nwu ninankyɛlɛnsa ni suoto kamɛ.’ <verse eid="EZK 32:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 32:20" />Babanɔɔ di mba beelo ni ku kapamii kamɛ. Batɔɔbɔkɔtɛ kapamii nwu; ta bananfi nwɔ ku batii nɔɔ ɔlambu bamuu basifiko. <verse eid="EZK 32:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 32:21" />Batunletɛ sientɛ nwu kamabuɛ di ɔkya nwu kamɛ di Egipte ku bakyakaakotɛ nɔɔ suoto alɛ, ‘Batoosoo bɛɛwa bate ku mba ninankyɛlɛnsa ni suoto, ku mba beelo ni ku kapamii.’<verse eid="EZK 32:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZK 32:22" />“Asiria nkpe ninfa ku bakpɛtɛ nɔɔ bamuu; batii nɔɔ ba baalo ni bamuu sɛkya lɛmana nwɔ siekyi, bale ni mba bamuu nianɔɔ ni di kapamii kanya. <verse eid="EZK 32:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZK 32:23" />Sɛkya lɛma nte di dibiɔ nwu nkyofokɔ, di bakpɛtɛ nɔɔ nte beekyi ni ɔkya nɔɔ. Batoolo mba bamuu niabuɛ ni lɛyɛkɛ ɔlaa baakyakasa ni di nkpa batii kasɔ suoto, baanɔɔ ni di kapamii kanya.<verse eid="EZK 32:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZK 32:24" />“Elam batii nkpe ninfa, di batii ɔlambu nɔɔ bamuu lɛmana ɔkya nɔɔ beekyi nii. Bamuu lɛma bakpi bale, baanɔɔ ni di kapamii kanya. Batii ba bamuu niabuɛ lɛyɛkɛ ɔlaa baakyakasa ni di batii ba di nkpa basiɛtɛ kasɔ suoto lasoo baasifi kasɔ kalɔ, batakyɛnlɛnsa suoto. Sinunsɔ lɛma latika ma di suoto ku mba nikosoo mansifi ni dibiɔ kamɛ. <verse eid="EZK 32:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EZK 32:25" />Bɛɛtɛ atensaa bɛɛtɔɔ di bakpi kamɛ, manko batii ɔlambu nɔɔ ba bamuu niɛmana ɔkya nɔɔ beekyi nii. Bamuu lɛma diɛkyɛlɛnsa suoto, ni beelo ma ku kapamii nɛ. Ta di lɛyɛkɛ lɛma lakyaka ni di nkpa basiɛtɛ kasɔ suoto oso yi, sinunsɔ lɛma ntika ma di suoto ku mba nikosoo mansifi ni dibiɔ kamɛ; bɛɛyɔ ma bɛɛtɛ di bakpi kamɛ.<verse eid="EZK 32:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="EZK 32:26" />“Mesek batii ku Tubal batii nkpe ninfa, ku batii ɔlambu lɛma ba bamuu niɛmana ni sɛkya lɛma beekyi nii. Bamuu lɛma ditakyɛlɛnsa suoto, baalo ma ni ku kapamii ta baakyakasa ni lɛyɛkɛ lɛma nwu di nkpa basiɛtɛ kasɔ suoto oso. <verse eid="EZK 32:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EZK 32:27" />Baate ku bakpɛtɛ bamba ba nitakyɛlɛnsa ni suoto, baanɔɔ ni kakpɛ, baasoo baasifi ni ɔkya kamɛ ku kakpɛ akpɛsaa lɛma, mba mpamii baayɔ baatɛ ni di asi lɛma kalɔ. Okpile lɛma letokonanfi latika di akufi lɛma suoto, nu di bakpɛtɛ ba mmle lɛyɛkɛ layii nkpa basiɛtɛ kasɔ suoto diafenko.<verse eid="EZK 32:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="EZK 32:28" />“Oo Egipte ɔka, afɔ kafɔɔ yi, bababiɛ fɔ mantɛ di batii ba ninankyɛlɛnsa ni suoto kamɛ, minko mba beelo ni ku kapamii.<verse eid="EZK 32:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="EZK 32:29" />“Edom nkpe ninfa, baka nɔɔ ku banɔɔfotii nɔɔ bamuu; nu baawɛ osie yi, bɛɛtɛ ma ku mba baalo ni ku kapamii. Bate ku batii ba ninankyɛlɛnsa ni suoto, manko mba niesoo beesifi ni dibiɔ kamɛ.<verse eid="EZK 32:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="EZK 32:30" />“Katookasɔ baka bamuu ku Sido batii bamuu nkpe ninfa; baasoo baasifi kasɔ ku bakpi di sinunsɔ kamɛ, nu di osie lɛma niawako lɛyɛkɛ nwu. Bate batakyɛlɛnsa ni suoto, manko mba baalo ni ku kapamii, ni di sinunsɔ lɛma ntika ma di suoto manko mba niesoo beesifi ni dibiɔ kamɛ nɛ.<verse eid="EZK 32:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="EZK 32:31" />“Egipte ɔka- nnwɔɔ ku bakpɛtɛ nɔɔ bamuu- kamanya ma, anta otu nte kafɔɔ batii ɔlambu nɔɔ bamuu ba baalo ni ku kapamii, SAATE Kplɛ nwu niebuɛ. <verse eid="EZK 32:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EZK 32:32" />Kuntɛ ami niatɔɔ aakyakasa lɛyɛkɛ nwu di nkpa basiɛtɛ kasɔ suoto yi, babatɛ Egipte ɔka ku batii ɔlambu nɔɔ bamuu di batii ba ninankyɛlɛnsa ni suoto kamɛ, manko mba baalo ni ku kapamii, SAATE Kplɛ nwu niebuɛ.”<verse eid="EZK 32:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 32" />
  <chapter number="33" style="c" sid="EZK 33" />
  <para style="s1">Yaa Ladiki Hesekiel Fɛ Nyuntɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 33:1" />Ni di SAATE nwu ɔlaa lawa kuatɛɛ alɛ: <verse eid="EZK 33:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 33:2" />“Otii obi, kakatɛ fata okpoo lɛfɔ batii, faatɔkɔ ma falɛ: ‘Nse lɛyɔ kapamii di kasɔ kawo suoto, di kasɔ nwu batii lediki otii lɛma onwii bɛɛbla nyuntɛ lɛma, <verse eid="EZK 33:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 33:3" />ɛɛnya kapamii nwu kɔwa di kasɔ nwu suoto, ɛɛfɛ dikyukyoo alɛ oosĩ ɔlaa anta batii nwu, <verse eid="EZK 33:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 33:4" />ni nse otii owo lenu dikyukyoo nwu kafɔɔ ananfũ ɔlaa osĩ ɔta nwu akpee, di kapamii nwu lɛwa kɛɛbalo nwɔ yi, ni ntɔ nɔɔ kamatika di nnwɔɔ omu nɔɔ disi. <verse eid="EZK 33:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 33:5" />Di obe wɔ aanu ni dikyukyoo nwu sɛlɔ kafɔɔ atayɔ ni ɔlaa osĩ ɔta nwu oso yi, ntɔ nɔɔ kamatika di nnwɔɔ omu nɔɔ disi. Nse fɛle an-yɔ nwu ole di ɔlaa osĩ ɔta nwu suoto yi, atabafũ suoto nɔɔ nkpa. <verse eid="EZK 33:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 33:6" />Kafɔɔ nse nyuntɛ nwu lɛnya kapamii nwu kɔwa ananfɛ dikyukyoo nwu alɛ aasĩ ɔlaa anta batii nwu di kapamii nwu lɛwa kɛɛbalo onwii lɛma yi, ni otii nwu kamakpi ta sikpile nɔɔ oso, kafɔɔ kamakaalɛ ntɔ nɔɔ nkyeko nyuntɛ nwu ɔkyɛ.’<verse eid="EZK 33:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 33:7" />“Nioso afɔ Otii obi, ntɔɔyɔ fɔ lɛbla nyuntɛ lɛta Israel batii; nkpo oso nu ɔlaa wɔ kamabuɛ ni, faasĩ ɔlaa fata ma fatɛɛ. <verse eid="EZK 33:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 33:8" />Nse lɛtɔkɔ kpiletɛ nlɛ, ‘Oo afɔ kpiletɛ, nwaako fabakpi,’ fanankakatɛ fasĩ ɔlaa fatɔɔ akyisa nkpa yi, ni otii kpile nwu kamakpi anta sikpile nɔɔ, kafɔɔ kamakaalɛ ntɔ nɔɔ nkyeko ɔkyɛ lɛfɔ. <verse eid="EZK 33:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 33:9" />Kafɔɔ nse nwaako, feesĩ ɔlaa fɛɛta kpiletɛ nwu falɛ akyi di sisuku nɔɔ suoto anambla nkpo yi, abakpi anta sikpile nɔɔ, kafɔɔ afɔ fabadiki nkpa lɛfɔ.<verse eid="EZK 33:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Otii Biala Kablakɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 33:10" />“Otii obi, tɔkɔ Israel batii falɛ, ‘Nnya ɔlaa wɔ biobuɛ ni bilɛ: “Ɔtanlolaa ɔbla ku sikpile loo nle atoo ɛɛta wo, ni buɔwɔɔ ta nnya oso nɛ. Ni lɛ nfɛ buafuo nkpa osiɛ?” ’ <verse eid="EZK 33:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 33:11" />Tɔkɔ ma falɛ, ‘Nwaako lɛnya nkpe ni nkpa, SAATE Kplɛ nwu niebuɛ alɛ, ninnya suoto lɛyɔɔ di kpiletɛ kukpi suoto, kafɔɔ alɛ baakyi di sisuku lɛma suoto mansiɛ nkpa. Bikyi! Bikyi di sisuku kpile lee suoto! Oo Israel batii, obe oso biakpi?’<verse eid="EZK 33:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 33:12" />“Nkpo oso yi, otii obi, tɔkɔ okpoo lɛfɔ batii falɛ, ‘Tininitɛ ɔsaabla tinini dilɔbadiki nwɔ nse ɛɛbla otokopĩ, kpiletɛ kafɔɔ akpilesaa ɔbla dilɔbatɔɔ anɔɔ nse eekyi eediɛ nya ɔbla. Nse tininitɛ lɛbla okpile yi, blɔbatɔɔ asiɛ nkpa ta sɛsaabla tinini se atɔɔbla ɛɛbafe ni oso.’ <verse eid="EZK 33:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 33:13" />Nse lɛtɔkɔ tininitɛ nlɛ nwaako fabasiɛ nkpa, kafɔɔ eetika disi di sɛsaabla tinini se aabla ni, ɛɛlaabla okpile yi, blɔbanyuma asaa tinini ya aabla ni kuninwii ninya; abakpi anta okpile wɔ ɛɛbla nii. <verse eid="EZK 33:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 33:14" />Ni nse lɛtɔkɔ kpiletɛ nlɛ, ‘Nwaako fabakpi,’ kafɔɔ nse nfɛ eekyi di sikpile nɔɔ suoto, ɛɛbla nle ninlɛ ni ku nle niesiɛko nii- <verse eid="EZK 33:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 33:15" />eekplesa lɛsaa le aafũ aase ni kamaa fiɛ aafɛnsa koto aata ni otii ɛɛta, eekplesa lɛsaa le aayu ni ɛɛta, eetikanko afiofa ya ninta ni nkpa, anambla kafɔɔ dikpilesaa kuninwii yi, nwaako abasiɛ nkpa; ɔlɔbakpi. <verse eid="EZK 33:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 33:16" />Blɔbanyuma sikpile se aabla ni kuonwii lɛma di suoto nɔɔ. Atɔɔbla nle ninlɛ ni ku nle niesiɛko nii; nwaako abasiɛ nkpa.<verse eid="EZK 33:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 33:17" />“Kafɔɔ okpoo lee batii alɛ, ‘SAATE nwu osuku diɛkyɛkyɛ. Kafɔɔ osuku lɛma ninankyɛkyɛ. <verse eid="EZK 33:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 33:18" />Nse tininitɛ lekyi di ɔsaabla tinini nɔɔ suoto ɛɛlaabla dikpile yi, abakpi anta ni. <verse eid="EZK 33:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 33:19" />Nse kpiletɛ kafɔɔ lekyi di akpilesaa nɔɔ ɔbla suoto, ɛɛbla lɛsaa le ninlɛ ni ku nle niesɛko ni yi, abasiɛ nkpa ta nninkpo ɔbla oso. <verse eid="EZK 33:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 33:20" />Ao Israel batii, kafɔɔ biobuɛ bilɛ, ‘SAATE nwu osuku diɛkyɛkyɛ.’ Kafɔɔ kamakanko obiala lee di nnwɔɔ omu nɔɔ sisuku kanya.”<verse eid="EZK 33:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lɛkya Oyie Di Yerusalem Obiɛ Suoto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 33:21" />Di sɛlanle loo kamɛ osiɛ lefosi lɛlɛɛ nyɔɔfa kamɛ, di Israel batii kɔwɛntɛ fosile kamɛ, di dii nɔnle suoto yi, osuɔtɔ onwii niatoso aadie ni di Yerusalem lawa ɔkyɛ nii aabatɔkɔ mi alɛ, “Okpoo kplɛ nwu ntoobiɛ!” <verse eid="EZK 33:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZK 33:22" />Kafɔɔ kɔtɔɔfɔ nwu fiɛ di osuɔtɔ nwu lawa ni yi, SAATE nwu kɔnɛɛ latika mi di suoto, ni aabɛ kanya nii fiɛ di osuɔtɔ nwu lawa ɔkyɛ nii ku olesɛ nwu nɛ. Nioso aabɛ mi kanya, ni nintasinle omumu nɛ.<verse eid="EZK 33:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZK 33:23" />Ninfɛ di SAATE nwu ɔlaa lawa kuatɛɛ alɛ: <verse eid="EZK 33:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZK 33:24" />“Otii obi, batii ba ninsi ni di sekpoo se niɛbiɛ site ni di Israel kasɔ suoto kobuɛ alɛ, ‘Abraham yi, otii onwii lete aale, kafɔɔ aafũ kasɔ nwu. Kafɔɔ awo bupɔ; nwaako batɔɔyɔ kasɔ nwu bɛɛta wo fɛ kale wo.’ <verse eid="EZK 33:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EZK 33:25" />Nkpo oso tɔkɔ ma falɛ, ‘Nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE Kplɛ nwu kobuɛ ni alɛ: Di obe wɔ biole ni sina se di ntɔ nsi ni osi ninsĩ kaamɛ, di afiɔ lee bionyu nii, biowii ni ntɔ kafɔɔ kaasɔ, lɛ nfɛ di kasɔ nwu kabla ye kale? <verse eid="EZK 33:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EZK 33:26" />Bietika disi di mpamii lee suoto, biɔbla ayududusaa, obiala lee kafɔɔ kɔkpanko owo nɔɔ ɔsɔfɔ. Lɛ nfɛ di kasɔ nwu kabla ye kale?’<verse eid="EZK 33:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="EZK 33:27" />“Tɔkɔ ma ɔlaa wɔ mmle falɛ: ‘Nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE Kplɛ nwu kobuɛ ni alɛ: Nwaako lɛnya nkpe ni nkpa, mba niebu basi ni di sekpoo se niɛbiɛ site ni kamɛ kamanɔɔ di kapamii kanya. Kamayɔ mba ninsi ni di lepoo nta lepoo kamɛ babɔkɛɛ mbɛbɛɛ, mba kafɔɔ ninsi ni di n-wofakɔ ku sifuɔntuu kamɛ kamakpi di ofiɛ kpile kanya. <verse eid="EZK 33:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EZK 33:28" />Kamata kasɔ nwu nlalaa kante kafukuti, osie nɔɔ lɛkanta nwu kafɔɔ kamawa kase, Israel abokote kafɔɔ kamate afukuti alɛ otii kuonwii dilɔbafuo ɔwaalɛ ofe nya kaamɛ. <verse eid="EZK 33:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EZK 33:29" />Ninfɛ babatofo alɛ ami ninle SAATE nwu nɛ, nse lɛbla kasɔ nwu kɛɛlalaa keete kafukuti ta ayududusaa ya amuu baabla ni oso.’<verse eid="EZK 33:29" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lɛsaa Le Niadie Diakye Ni Ɔlaabuɛtɛtɛ Ɔlaa Kamɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="EZK 33:30" />“Kafɔɔ afɔ, otii obi yi, okpoo lɛfɔ batii kɔkakatɛ di suoto lɛfɔ di seyoyiɛ nwu suoto ku ayo nwu nyokontũ, boobuɛ mantɔkɔ bawo alɛ, ‘Biwa biɛbanu kanya ka niekye ni SAATE nwu nfũ kɛɛwa ni.’ <verse eid="EZK 33:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EZK 33:31" />Batii nii lɛwa ɔkyɛ lɛfɔ, fɛ mmle mambla nii, baasiɛ di anu lɛfɔ alɛ bɔɔkyɔɔ ɔlaa lɛfɔ atoko, kafɔɔ mann-yɔ sĩ bakpee di ɔkpɛ ɔbla kamɛ. Mandiki mantuo ku kanya lɛma alɛ bɛɛyɔ nwu ole, kafɔɔ situ lɛma nkpe onumbɛbɛɛ siɛta katafaa asaa ɔwɛ. <verse eid="EZK 33:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EZK 33:32" />Nwaako, faadiɛ lɛsalɛsaa fata ma dilenkee otii wɔ ninsa ni lɛbɔmbɔ sinu ku sɛlɔ biene, ampɛ ni lɛsansaa nwaa, diekye man-nu sɛlaa lɛfɔ, kafɔɔ mann-yɔ sĩ bakpee di ɔkpɛ ɔbla kamɛ.<verse eid="EZK 33:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="EZK 33:33" />“Nse n-ya mmle amuu lɛbawa kaanya- nwaako abawa kaanya kafɔɔ- ninfɛ babatofo alɛ ɔlaabuɛtɛtɛ owo ntodiwɛ kaamɛ lɛma nɛ.”<verse eid="EZK 33:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 33" />
  <chapter number="34" style="c" sid="EZK 34" />
  <para style="s1">Israel Bafosobakpatɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 34:1" />Ni di SAATE nwu ɔlaa lawa kuatɛɛ alɛ: <verse eid="EZK 34:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 34:2" />“Otii obi, buɛ ɔlaa fatɛ di Israel bafosobakpatɛ suoto; buɛ ɔlaa fatɛ faatɔkɔ ma falɛ: ‘Nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE Kplɛ nwu kobuɛ ni alɛ: Israel bafosobakpatɛ ba nikonyu ni suoto lɛma lete, bayɔɔsa! Diele bafosobakpatɛ ninkpa bafoso? <verse eid="EZK 34:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 34:3" />Minle babɔkɛɛ lɛla, min-yɔ bafoso sinwini minkaa akpeele minkpee, minlo kafɔɔ babɔkɛɛ ba ninsi ni lɛla. Kafɔɔ biloololaa bafoso nwu binyu. <verse eid="EZK 34:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 34:4" />Bitakpee mba niakpiɛkpiɛ ni osie ee biabla mba niatoofiɛ ni kɔfa ee bianii mba niafefee ni nkɔ. Bitakplesa mba niayu ni osuku biawako ee biawolaa mba niayu nii. Biayɔ kakuo ku amumu biakpa ma. <verse eid="EZK 34:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 34:5" />Nioso baasasami, diekye bafosokpatɛ kuonwii ditawɛ, ni baakple alesaa baata lepoo kamɛ babɔkɛɛ di obe wɔ baasasami ni nɛ. <verse eid="EZK 34:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 34:6" />Bafoso nii lakyɛ baakyikyii abokote amuu ku lekpenkpe takale biala suoto. Baasasami baakpete di kasɔ nwu kamuu suoto, kuonwii kafɔɔ ditakaalɛ ma disi ee awolaa ma.<verse eid="EZK 34:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 34:7" />“ ‘Nkpo oso, aye bafosobakpatɛ, binu SAATE nwu ɔlaa wɔ eebuɛ ni alɛ: <verse eid="EZK 34:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 34:8" />Nwaako lɛnya nkpe ni nkpa yi, SAATE Kplɛ nwu niebuɛ, ta di babɔkɛɛ nii nnaa ni bafosokpatɛ oso beemufũ ma, beekple kafɔɔ alesaa bɛɛta babɔkɛɛ ba bamuu ninkpe ni kobe, diekye bafosobakpatɛ nii ditawolaa ni bafoso nii, kafɔɔ baanyu ni suoto lɛma asi, ditale ni bafoso nii asi baanyu ni oso yi, <verse eid="EZK 34:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 34:9" />nkpo oso, Oo aye bafosobakpatɛ, binu SAATE nwu ɔlaa: <verse eid="EZK 34:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 34:10" />Nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE Kplɛ nwu kobuɛ ni alɛ: Lɛtaka n-yɛ di bafosobakpatɛ suoto, kamakaalɛ bafoso nii ɔlaa nkyeko nnɛɛ lɛma. Kamata ma mandiɛ bafoso ɔkpa, di mmle di bafosobakpatɛ nwu dilɔbasinfuo ni suoto lɛma asi onyu. Kamadiki bafoso nii di nnya lɛma, bafoso nwu dilɔbasinle alesaa ata ma.<verse eid="EZK 34:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bafosokpatɛ Biene</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 34:11" />“ ‘Diekye nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE Kplɛ nwu kobuɛ ni alɛ: Ami omu kamawolaa bafoso nii, ninnyu ma disi kafɔɔ. <verse eid="EZK 34:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 34:12" />Fɛ mmle di bafosokpatɛ nnyu ni bafoso nɔɔ ba niɛsasami ni disi, nse akpe ku mma yi, nkpo kamanyu bafoso nii disi nɛ. Kamadiki ma nkyeko aba ya amuu di nfũ baasasamisa ma baakpee ni di alokonkyɛ ku ditunu dii nwu suoto. <verse eid="EZK 34:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 34:13" />Kamakpaa ma ndieko di nnle nwu kamɛ, ninsiisa ma kafɔɔ nkyeko nsɔ nwu suoto, ninkpaa ma n-wako mma bamu kasɔ suoto. Kamata ma man-wee sɛfa di Israel abokote suoto, di kɔwɛ kamɛ ku sekpoo nwu simuu kamɛ di kasɔ nwu suoto. <verse eid="EZK 34:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 34:14" />Kamakpa ma di sɛfa kaweekɔ biene kamɛ, Israel abokote takale nwu kafɔɔ kamale ma sɛfa kaweekɔ. Nfa babate di sɛfa kaweekɔ biene nwu kamɛ nɛ. Nfa kafɔɔ babawee sɛfa bokoboko di Israel abokote suoto nɛ. <verse eid="EZK 34:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 34:15" />Ami omu kamakpa bafoso nii, nta ma kafɔɔ mante kaasɔ buɛɛ, SAATE Kplɛ nwu niebuɛ. <verse eid="EZK 34:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 34:16" />Kamawolaa mba nieyu nii, ninkplesa mba nieyu ni osuku kafɔɔ nwako. Kamanii mba niefefee ni, ninkpee mba niekpiɛkpiɛ ni osie, kafɔɔ kamawɔɔsa mba ninsi ni lɛla ku mba ninkpe ni osie. Kamakpa bafoso nwu di osuku tinini suoto.<verse eid="EZK 34:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 34:17" />“ ‘Kafɔɔ aye, bafoso nii yi, nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE Kplɛ nwu kobuɛ ni alɛ: Kamaka lɛka di foso ku foso bamba ntɛɛ, nka lɛka kafɔɔ di akunumuu ku batie ntɛɛ. <verse eid="EZK 34:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 34:18" />Alesaa nwu biole ni di sɛfa kaweekɔ biene nwu diɛpɔ ata ye? Ni dikaatɛ kafɔɔ alɛ biananafu sɛfa kaweekɔ lee bule nwu ku nkpaa lee? Ntu klenkle nwu bionyi ni diɛpɔ dita ye? Ni dikaatɛ kafɔɔ alɛ biakunsa ntu nwu bule ku nkpaa lee? <verse eid="EZK 34:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 34:19" />Dikaatɛ alɛ bafoso nii lele alesaa ya biananafu ni, man-nyi kafɔɔ ntu be biakunsa ni ku nkpaa lee?<verse eid="EZK 34:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 34:20" />“ ‘Nkpo oso nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE Kplɛ nwu kobuɛ antɔkɔ ma ni alɛ: Binyu lo, ami omu kamaka lɛka di bafoso ba ninsi ni lɛla ku bafoso ba niekoso ni ntɛɛ. <verse eid="EZK 34:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 34:21" />Ta biɛyɔ sɛfankyi ku amuusi bietutukusa ni babɔkɛɛ ba niɛwa ni kasɔ, biewuwuo ni bafoso ba bamuu niekpiɛkpiɛ ni ku akya lee dialaase ni di obe wɔ biatososa ma baasifi ni oso yi, <verse eid="EZK 34:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZK 34:22" />kamafũ bafoso nii nkpa, blɔbasinmufũ ma kafɔɔ. Kamaka lɛka di foso onwii ku foso bamba ntɛɛ. <verse eid="EZK 34:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZK 34:23" />Kamayɔ fosokpatɛ onwii nse ma kaanya, kpɛmblatɛ nii Dawid, nnwɔɔ kafɔɔ nimakpa ma nɛ; abakpa ma, anle kafɔɔ fosokpatɛ lɛma. <verse eid="EZK 34:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZK 34:24" />Ami SAATE nwu nimale Yaa lɛma, kpɛmblatɛ nii Dawid kafɔɔ nimale ɔka di kamɛ lɛma. Ami SAATE nwu niɛkakatɛ.<verse eid="EZK 34:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EZK 34:25" />“ ‘Kamabla atoko ɔkyɛ ole kanya ninii ku mma, ntososa kafɔɔ lepoo kamɛ babɔkɛɛ ba ninkpe ni kobe ndiki di kasɔ nwu suoto, di mmle baalaasiɛ ni di ɔfaafuu kamɛ, mante ni kafɔɔ di lepoo kamɛ di atoko ɔkyɛ ole kamɛ. <verse eid="EZK 34:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EZK 34:26" />Kamawii ma lɛtɔtrɔ ku aba ya amuu niɛmana lekpenkpe nii eekyi nii. Kamata kanto wɛɛwɛɛ nnɔɔ di obe kanya; lɛtɔtrɔ kanto wɛɛwɛɛ nimanɔɔ. <verse eid="EZK 34:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EZK 34:27" />Lepoo kamɛ awoso kamatika abi lɛnya, alesaa kafɔɔ kamalɛ di kasɔ nwu suoto; batii nwu kamawɛ atoko ɔkyɛ ole di kasɔ lɛma nwu suoto. Ni babatofo alɛ ami ninle SAATE nwu nɛ, nse letekete atoo lɛma nutũle nwu di suoto lɛma, lediki ma kafɔɔ lekyeko batii ba niayɔ ma baabla ni balanle nnɛɛ. <verse eid="EZK 34:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EZK 34:28" />Blɔbasinle batii ba di nnle bamba lamufũ nii, ee babɔkɛɛ ba ninkpe ni kobe labɛbɛɛ ma. Babasiɛ di atoko ɔkyɛ ole kamɛ, otii kuonwii kafɔɔ dilɔbayɛkɛsa ma. <verse eid="EZK 34:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EZK 34:29" />Kamata ma kasɔ ka ninlɛ kɛɛta ni alesaa ninya, blɔbasinle batii ba di kɔka kamakpɛ ni di kasɔ nwu suoto ee nnle bamba batii bama ma. <verse eid="EZK 34:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EZK 34:30" />Ninfɛ babatofo alɛ ami, SAATE nwu Yaa lɛma, nsiko ma, ni mma Israel batii nwu kafɔɔ, bale batii nii nɛ, SAATE Kplɛ nwu niebuɛ. <verse eid="EZK 34:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EZK 34:31" />Aye bafoso nii, sɛfa nii kaweekɔ bafoso, bile batii nii, ami kafɔɔ nle Yaa lee, SAATE Kplɛ nwu niebuɛ.’ ”<verse eid="EZK 34:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 34" />
  <chapter number="35" style="c" sid="EZK 35" />
  <para style="s1">Yaa Lananfi Edom Kootoko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 35:1" />Ni di SAATE nwu ɔlaa lawa kuatɛɛ alɛ: <verse eid="EZK 35:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 35:2" />“Otii obi, yɔ anu lɛfɔ fakyɔɔ Seir Kobokote; faabuɛ ɔlaa fatɛ ninkũ suoto. <verse eid="EZK 35:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 35:3" />Buɛ falɛ: ‘Nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE Kplɛ nwu kobuɛ ni alɛ: Seir Kobokote, lɛtaka n-yɛ fɔ di suoto, kamananfi kɔnɛɛ nii kafɔɔ nkyɔɔ di suoto lɛfɔ, nimbla fɔ fanlalaa fante kufukuti. <verse eid="EZK 35:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 35:4" />Kamata sekpoo lɛfɔ mbibiɛ, fante kafɔɔ ofukuti. Ninfɛ fabatofo falɛ ami ninle SAATE nwu nɛ.<verse eid="EZK 35:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 35:5" />“ ‘Ta katiikyidi ka niawɛ fɔ ni, diayɔ ni saa, faayɔ Israel batii faata baalo ni ku kapamii, di obe wɔ kamɛ di ɔlaa kpile latũ ma ni, di letokonanfi lɛma nwu ladu ni kayɛntɛlekɔ nini oso yi, <verse eid="EZK 35:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 35:6" />nkpo oso nwaako lɛnya nkpe ni nkpa, SAATE Kplɛ nwu niebuɛ alɛ, kamayɔ fɔ nta ntɔ owii kaasɔ, dibatikanko fɔ kafɔɔ. Di obe wɔ fanankyidi ni ntɔ owii oso yi, ntɔ owii nwu kamatikanko fɔ. <verse eid="EZK 35:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 35:7" />Kamata Seir Kobokote nlalaa kunte kufukuti, nin-wɔɔsa kafɔɔ batii ba bamuu ninkyɛ, mankple ni ndiki ninkũ suoto. <verse eid="EZK 35:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 35:8" />Kamata abokote lɛfɔ n-yii ku bakpi; mba beelo ni ku kapamii kamanɔɔ mante di akpenkpe lɛfɔ suoto ku sɛtaata lɛfɔ ku kɔwɛ lɛfɔ amuu kamɛ. <verse eid="EZK 35:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 35:9" />Kamata fɔ fante ofukuti dinaa ni kaloo; batii dilɔbawɛ di sekpoo lɛfɔ nwu kamɛ. Ninfɛ fabatofo falɛ ami ninle SAATE nwu nɛ.<verse eid="EZK 35:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 35:10" />“ ‘Diekye faabuɛ falɛ, “Nnle be mmle nwu nnyɔ ku nsɔ be kamale wo n-le, bubafũ mi ni kafɔɔ,” nu di ami SAATE nwu lawɛ ninfa, <verse eid="EZK 35:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 35:11" />nkpo oso nwaako lɛnya nkpe ni nkpa yi, SAATE Kplɛ nwu niebuɛ alɛ, kamabla ye di mmle kanya biadiki ɔblɔ ku sɛsɔfɔwo ɔkpɛ biatuo ni di okyidi lee wɔ biakyidi ma ni kamɛ, ni ami kafɔɔ kamadiki suoto nii ntuo di kamɛ lɛma nse lɛkanko fɔ. <verse eid="EZK 35:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 35:12" />Ninfɛ bibatofo bilɛ ami SAATE nwu ntoonu sɛlaakuu se biabuɛ ni di Israel abokote nwu suoto. Biabuɛ bilɛ, “Batɔɔlalaasa nya bɛɛtɛ nii, ni bɛɛyɔ nya bɛɛta wo alɛ buabɛbɛɛ nɛ.” <verse eid="EZK 35:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 35:13" />Biabla akantasaa di suoto nii, biakakatɛ kafɔɔ di suoto nii biawaalɛsa, kafɔɔ lanu sĩ. <verse eid="EZK 35:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 35:14" />Nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE Kplɛ nwu kobuɛ ni alɛ: Di obe wɔ di kasɔ nwu kamuu kɔnya ni suoto lɛyɔɔ, kamata fɔ fante ofukuti. <verse eid="EZK 35:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 35:15" />Ta faanya ni suoto lɛyɔɔ di obe wɔ di Israel batii atesaa late ni afukuti oso yi, nkpo okle kamabla fɔ nɛ. Fabate ofukuti, Ao Seir Kobokote, afɔ ku Edom omuu. Ninfɛ babatofo alɛ ami ninle SAATE nwu nɛ.’ ”<verse eid="EZK 35:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 35" />
  <chapter number="36" style="c" sid="EZK 36" />
  <para style="s1">Yaa Kamata Israel Lɛtɔtrɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 36:1" />“Otii obi, buɛ ɔlaa fatɛ di Israel abokote suoto, faabuɛ falɛ, ‘Oo Israel abokote, binu SAATE nwu ɔlaa. <verse eid="EZK 36:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 36:2" />Nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE Kplɛ nwu kobuɛ ni alɛ: Lo nwu labuɛ di suoto lɛfɔ alɛ, “Ɛhɛɛ! Saa abokote takale nwu ntokple ale wo.” ’ <verse eid="EZK 36:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 36:3" />Nkpo oso buɛ ɔlaa fatɛ faabuɛ falɛ, ‘Nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE Kplɛ nwu kobuɛ ni alɛ: Ta baawɔɔsa ye baadiki ni di ɔfankyi biala biabakple ni nnle nwu bule bale, biale ni kafɔɔ lɛkakatɛ nyakatãa ku ditiilalaasa biata ni batii nwu oso yi, <verse eid="EZK 36:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 36:4" />nioso, Oo Israel abokote, binu SAATE Kplɛ nwu ɔlaa: Nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE Kplɛ nwu kobuɛ antɔkɔ ni abokote ku akpenkpe, sekle ku sɛtaata, ku aba ya niebibiɛ ate ni ku sekpoo se kakpɛ kamɛ asaa baalɛ ni, baale ni kafɔɔ lɛmansaa baata ni nnle nwu bule niɛmana fɔ beekyi ni. <verse eid="EZK 36:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 36:5" />Nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE Kplɛ nwu kobuɛ ni alɛ: Di lɛblɔfiɛ nii niatɔɔfiɛ mi ni kamɛ lakakatɛ di nnle nwu bule suoto, ku Edom omuu suoto, diekye suoto lɛyɔɔ ku katiikyidi ka niasiɛ ni di situ lɛma kamɛ baayɔ kasɔ nii baabla ni mma bamu kale, di mmle kanya baafũ ni sɛfa kaweekɔ kasɔ nika.’ <verse eid="EZK 36:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 36:6" />Nkpo oso buɛ ɔlaa fatɛ fata Israel kasɔ, faabuɛ fatɔkɔ abokote ku akpenkpe, sekle ku sɛtaata nwu falɛ: ‘Nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE Kplɛ nwu kobuɛ ni alɛ: Lɛkakatɛ di sɛsɔfɔwo nii ɔkpɛ lɛblɔfiɛ yakayaka kamɛ, ta dibuo le kamɛ biafe ni di nnle nwu atufa kamɛ. <verse eid="EZK 36:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 36:7" />Nkpo oso nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE Kplɛ nwu kobuɛ ni alɛ: Lekplesa kɔnɛɛ katoo lɛka ntam nlɛ, nnle be niɛmana ye beekyi ni kafɔɔ kamafũ atufa.<verse eid="EZK 36:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 36:8" />“ ‘Kafɔɔ aye, Oo Israel abokote, bibadie sɛla mintika kafɔɔ abi minta batii nii Israel, diekye babawa kafa di obe kakui kamɛ. <verse eid="EZK 36:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 36:9" />Lɛyɔ nwu ole di suoto lee, kamale ye sibualɛ kafɔɔ; babakpɛ afe di suoto lee, mampɛ asaa kafɔɔ di suoto lee. <verse eid="EZK 36:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 36:10" />Kamata batii nlɛɛsa di lɛpɔ kamɛ di suoto lee, bia Israel batii bamuu. Batii kamawɛ di sekpoo nwu, manse kafɔɔ sekpoo se niɛwɔɔ site ni dibudi. <verse eid="EZK 36:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 36:11" />Kamata batii ku babɔkɛɛ nkpɛ di lɛpɔ kamɛ, di suoto lee, babatika abi, mamapɔ kpinwu. Kamata batii nsiɛ ye di suoto fɛ mmle diate ni saa, ninta lɛlɛ nlɛ ye ninlenkee mmle diate ni kofokofoko. Ninfɛ bibatofo bilɛ ami ninle SAATE nwu nɛ. <verse eid="EZK 36:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 36:12" />Kamata batii, batii nii Israel, mankyɛ di suoto lee. Babafũ ye, aye kafɔɔ bibale ma atesaa; bilɔbasinta babi lɛma bakpi diidii.<verse eid="EZK 36:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 36:13" />“ ‘Nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE Kplɛ nwu kobuɛ ni alɛ: Ta batii mbuɛ mantɔkɔ fɔ ni alɛ, “Fanwee ni batii, fanta kafɔɔ kale lɛfɔ babi nkpi ni oso yi,” <verse eid="EZK 36:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 36:14" />nkpo oso flɔbasinwee batii ee fata kale lɛfɔ babi bakpi, SAATE Kplɛ nwu niebuɛ. <verse eid="EZK 36:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 36:15" />Namasinta fɔ fanu nnle nwu sɛtɔkɔlaa, flɔbasinfe di batii nwu atufa kamɛ ee nta kale lɛfɔ kapɛ kaasɔ, SAATE Kplɛ nwu niebuɛ.’ ”<verse eid="EZK 36:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Israel Nkpa Fɔle Disiɛbi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 36:16" />Ni di SAATE nwu ɔlaa lakple kuawa kuatɛɛ alɛ: <verse eid="EZK 36:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 36:17" />“Otii obi, di Israel batii lasiɛ ni di kasɔ lɛma kamu suoto yi, baakpɔnɔfɔsa ka ku lɛkyɛmbi lɛma ku sɛsaabla lɛma. Lɛkyɛmbi lɛma late fɛle mmle di ɔsanko mpɛ ni kɔkpaa kaasɔ kɔwɛntɛ biala di anu nii. <verse eid="EZK 36:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 36:18" />Nioso lanyɛɛnɛ ɔblɔ yakayaka nii lakpete ma di suoto ta baawii ni ntɔ kaasɔ, baakpɔnɔfɔsa ni kasɔ nwu kafɔɔ ku afiɔ lɛma oso. <verse eid="EZK 36:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 36:19" />Latɔɔ ma lakpee di nnle kamɛ, ni baasasami baabuo di nsɔ nwu mmuu kamɛ nɛ; lakanko ma di lɛkyɛmbi lɛma ku sɛsaabla lɛma kanya. <verse eid="EZK 36:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 36:20" />Kakɔlele kafɔɔ baakyɛ di nnle nwu kamɛ yi, baakpɔnɔfɔsa leyooto nii klekle nwu, diekye baabuɛ di suoto lɛma alɛ, ‘Batii ba mmle ninle Yaa batii nɛ, kafɔɔ diabawa alɛ dikpeni beedie di kasɔ nɔɔ suoto.’ <verse eid="EZK 36:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 36:21" />Lɛyɔ nwu ole lɛta leyooto nii klekle, leyooto le di Israel batii lakpɔnɔfɔsa ni di nnle nwu kamɛ di nfũ baakyɛ nii.<verse eid="EZK 36:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZK 36:22" />“Nkpo oso yi, tɔkɔ Israel batii falɛ, ‘Nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE Kplɛ nwu kobuɛ ni alɛ: Oo Israel batii, diele aye oso kɔwa asaa ya mmle ɔbabla, kafɔɔ ta leyooto nii klekle oso, leyooto le biakpɔnɔfɔsa ni di nnle nwu kamɛ di nfũ biakyɛ ni. <verse eid="EZK 36:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZK 36:23" />Kamadiki leyooto kplɛ nii leklekle ntuo, leyooto le biakpɔnɔfɔsa ni di nnle nwu kamɛ, leyooto le biakpɔnɔfɔsa ni di kamɛ lɛma. Nse lediki leklekle nii letuo diefe ni di suoto lee di anu lɛma yi, ninfɛ di nnle nwu kamatofo alɛ ami ninle SAATE nwu nɛ, SAATE Kplɛ nwu niebuɛ.<verse eid="EZK 36:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZK 36:24" />“ ‘Diekye kamakpaa ye ndieko di nnle nwu kamɛ; kamasiisa ye nkyeko nsɔ nwu suoto nkplesa ye n-wako aye bamu kasɔ suoto. <verse eid="EZK 36:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EZK 36:25" />Kamanwanwanyi ntu klenkle di suoto lee, n-se bitɔɔbla klekle; kamafoto ye ndiki di ɔtanklekle lee omuu ku afiɔ lee amuu kamɛ. <verse eid="EZK 36:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EZK 36:26" />Kamata ye otu fɔle, n-yɔ kafɔɔ ninwuna fɔle nkpee ye; kamadiki difuɔ otu lee nwu, ninta ye sina lɛbɔtɔ otu. <verse eid="EZK 36:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EZK 36:27" />Kamayɔ Ninwuna nii nkpee di kamɛ lee, ninta ye kafɔɔ minkyɛ di sisuku nii suoto, minlolaa afiofa nii kafɔɔ minle. <verse eid="EZK 36:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EZK 36:28" />Bibasiɛ di kasɔ ka lata ni bawa lee; bibale batii nii, ami kafɔɔ kamale Yaa lee. <verse eid="EZK 36:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EZK 36:29" />Kamadiki ye nkyeko ɔtanklekle lee omuu kamɛ. Kamata alesaa nlɛ, nta nya kafɔɔ ampɔ kpinwu, nɔmata kafɔɔ kɔka ɔkpɛ kuwa di suoto lee. <verse eid="EZK 36:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EZK 36:30" />Kamata awosobi ntika di awoso suoto ampɔɔsa, nta alesaa kafɔɔ nlɛ nwaa di afe, di mmle okle flɔbasinfe ni di sinunsɔ kamɛ di nnle nwu kamɛ ta kɔka ɔkpɛ oso. <verse eid="EZK 36:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EZK 36:31" />Ninfɛ bibanyuma sisuku kpile lee ku asiensiesaa lee ablasaa, suoto lee nkpɛ ye oyududu di sikpile lee ku ayududusaa lee sɛsaabla suoto nɛ. <verse eid="EZK 36:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EZK 36:32" />Komiɛ nlɛ bitofo bilɛ diele aye oso kɔbla nle mmle, SAATE Kplɛ nwu niebuɛ. Oo Israel batii, sinunsɔ sikpɛ ye, biekpee anu kaasɔ ta lɛkyɛmbi lee oso!<verse eid="EZK 36:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="EZK 36:33" />“ ‘Nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE Kplɛ nwu kobuɛ ni alɛ: Di dii le suoto kamakleklesa ye ni di sikpile lee simuu kamɛ yi, kamata batii nnaase disiɛ di sekpoo lee nwu kamɛ, manse kafɔɔ sekpoo biɛle nwu dibudi. <verse eid="EZK 36:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="EZK 36:34" />Babakpɛ kasɔ ka ninte ni kafukuti, di mmle kanasinte ni kafukuti di batii ba bamuu ninfe ka ni di suoto anu. <verse eid="EZK 36:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="EZK 36:35" />Bababuɛ alɛ, “Kasɔ ka baalalaasa baatɛ ni nintookple kate fɛle Eden kɔba nɛ; sekpoo kplɛ se niabiɛ ni, siate ni sifukuti, siawɔɔ ni kafɔɔ nfɛ ninle sekpoo siene ku batii nsiɛkɔ.” <verse eid="EZK 36:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="EZK 36:36" />Ninfɛ di nnle be niebu diɛmana fɔ diekyi ni kamatofo alɛ ami SAATE nwu niese sekpoo se baawɔɔsa ni lese dibudi, lese kafɔɔ asaa lɛsɔ di kasɔ ka niate ni kafukuti suoto nɛ. Ami SAATE nwu niɛkakatɛ, kamabla ni kafɔɔ.’<verse eid="EZK 36:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="EZK 36:37" />“Nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE Kplɛ nwu kobuɛ ni alɛ: Kamakple nnu Israel batii lekoto otikiti, nimbla nle mmle nta ma: Kamata batii lɛma mpɔ kpinwu fɛ bafoso, <verse eid="EZK 36:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="EZK 36:38" />mampɔ kpinwu fɛ babɔkɛɛ ba manaata ni asaaɔta di Yerusalem di ayi finle nɔɔ olebee kamɛ. Nkpo di sekpoo kplɛ se niabiɛ siate ni kamayii ku batii kpinwu nɛ. Ninfɛ babatofo alɛ ami ninle SAATE nwu nɛ.”<verse eid="EZK 36:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 36" />
  <chapter number="37" style="c" sid="EZK 37" />
  <para style="s1">Odiki Otuo Di Akufi Kosole Ɔtaata Suoto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 37:1" />SAATE nwu kɔnɛɛ latika mi di suoto, ni aakpaa mi adieko diafe ni di SAATE nwu Ninwuna suoto, ni aayɔ mi aalaatɛ di ɔtaata onwii ntɛɛntɛɛ nɛ; ɔtaata nwu layii ku akufi. <verse eid="EZK 37:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 37:2" />Aakpaa mi aafenko katoo ku kala di kamɛ lɛma, ni lanya akufi kpinwu di ɔtaata nwu kasɔ nɛ, akufi ya niatɛ aakoso ni nwaa. <verse eid="EZK 37:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 37:3" />Ni aakaalɛ mi alɛ, “Otii obi, akufi ya mmle kamafuo nkpa ɔwɛ?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EZK 37:3">Ni labuɛ nlɛ, Oo SAATE Kplɛ, lete lɛfɔ ninye.”<verse eid="EZK 37:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 37:4" />Ninfɛ aatɔkɔ mi alɛ, “Buɛ ɔlaa fatɛ fata akufi ya mmle, faatɔkɔ nya falɛ, ‘Akufi kosole, binu SAATE nwu ɔlaa! <verse eid="EZK 37:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 37:5" />Nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE Kplɛ nwu kobuɛ antɔkɔ ni akufi ya mmle alɛ: Kamata ninwuna mbuo ye kaamɛ, minwɛ nkpa. <verse eid="EZK 37:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 37:6" />Kamakpee ye suoto sikũ, ninta sina nkaa ye di suoto, nimbla kafɔɔ suoto kukũ ntĩi ye suoto; kamanwuna ninwuna nkpee ye kaamɛ, minwɛ nkpa. Ninfɛ bibatofo bilɛ ami ninle SAATE nwu nɛ.’ ”<verse eid="EZK 37:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 37:7" />Nioso labuɛ ɔlaa latɛ fɛ mmle baatɔkɔ mi nii. Ninfɛ latoobuɛ ɔlaa latɔɔtɛ ni yi, kudu kunwii lawɛ, akufi nwu latɔɔsansa baawo, ni di akufi lakya baawo, dikufi ku dikufi nɛ. <verse eid="EZK 37:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 37:8" />Latɛ anu lanyu, ni lanya suoto sikũ ku sina ladie siakaa ma di suoto nɛ. Suoto kukũ kafɔɔ latĩi ma suoto, kafɔɔ ninwuna ditasiɛ ma kaamɛ.<verse eid="EZK 37:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 37:9" />Ninfɛ aatɔkɔ mi alɛ, “Buɛ ɔlaa fatɛ fata ninwuna nwu; otii obi, buɛ ɔlaa fatɛ, faatɔkɔ ni falɛ, ‘Nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE Kplɛ nwu kobuɛ ni alɛ: Oo ninwuna, die di afɛɛfɔ ana nwu kamɛ fawa, faabanwuna fakpete di bakpi ba mmle kamɛ, alɛ baawɛ nkpa.’ ” <verse eid="EZK 37:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 37:10" />Nioso labuɛ ɔlaa latɛ fɛ mmle aatɔkɔ mi nii, ni di ninwuna labuo ma kaamɛ nɛ; baawɛ nkpa ni baataka baayila di nkpaa lɛma suoto- baale bakpɛtɛ dikudi kplɛ.<verse eid="EZK 37:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 37:11" />Ninfɛ aatɔkɔ mi alɛ: “Otii obi, akufi ya mmle ninle Israel batii bamuu nɛ. Boobuɛ alɛ, ‘Akufi loo ntookoso, osuku loo onyu kafɔɔ ntooyu; batoobudi wo beeyu.’ <verse eid="EZK 37:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 37:12" />Nkpo oso buɛ ɔlaa fatɛ, faatɔkɔ ma falɛ: ‘Nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE Kplɛ nwu kobuɛ ni alɛ: Oo batii nii, kɔwa sɛkya lee ɔbatikiti nindiki ye kafɔɔ nkyeko sĩ kamɛ; kamakplesa ye n-wako Israel kasɔ suoto. <verse eid="EZK 37:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 37:13" />Ni di aye, batii nii, bibatofo bilɛ ami ninle SAATE nwu nɛ, nse letikiti sɛkya lee lediki ye kafɔɔ lekyeko sĩ kamɛ. <verse eid="EZK 37:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 37:14" />Kamayɔ Ninwuna nii nkpee ye kaamɛ minwɛ nkpa, kamata ye kafɔɔ minsiɛ di aye bamu kasɔ suoto. Ninfɛ bibatofo bilɛ ami SAATE nwu niakakatɛ, ntɔɔbla ni kafɔɔ, SAATE nwu niebuɛ.’ ”<verse eid="EZK 37:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yuda Ku Israel Di Sɛka Kalekɔ Kanwii Kamɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 37:15" />Ni di SAATE nwu ɔlaa lawa kuatɛɛ alɛ: <verse eid="EZK 37:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 37:16" />“Otii obi, yɔ kawesee faakpana asaa fatika ka di suoto falɛ, ‘Kawesee ka mmle nle Yuda ku Israel batii ku mba niɛbla ni onwii ku nnwɔɔ kale.’ Faayɔ kawesee bamba, faakpana asaa fatika ka di suoto falɛ, ‘Efraim kawesee nle Yosef ku Israel batii bamuu ku mba niɛbla ni onwii ku nnwɔɔ kale.’ <verse eid="EZK 37:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 37:17" />Kyasa kowesee nwu baawo diɛbla kawesee kanwii, alɛ kuakple kanwii di kɔnɛɛ lɛfɔ.<verse eid="EZK 37:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 37:18" />“Nse okpoo lɛfɔ batii lɛkaalɛ fɔ alɛ, ‘Floodiki lɛsaa le mmle kasɔ fata wo?’ <verse eid="EZK 37:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 37:19" />Tɔkɔ ma falɛ, ‘Nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE Kplɛ nwu kobuɛ ni alɛ: Nfɛ kɔwa Yosef kawesee nwu ɔbayɔ- nka ninsi ni di Efraim kɔnɛɛ- ku Israel batii ana ya niɛbla ni onwii ku nnwɔɔ, ninkyasa ka di Yuda kawesee suoto, mbla ma kawesee kanwii, ni babakple onwii di kɔnɛɛ nii.’ <verse eid="EZK 37:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 37:20" />Klee kowesee nwu fɛɛkpana asaa feetika ni di anu lɛma, <verse eid="EZK 37:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 37:21" />faatɔkɔ ma falɛ, ‘Nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE Kplɛ nwu kobuɛ ni alɛ: Kamadiki Israel batii nkyeko nnle be kamɛ baasifi nii. Kamasiisa ma nkyeko kakɔ biala, nkplesa ma n-wako mma bamu kasɔ suoto. <verse eid="EZK 37:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZK 37:22" />Kamabla ma kale kanwii di kasɔ nwu suoto, di Israel abokote suoto. Ɔka onwii nimawɛ di bamuu lɛma suoto, diidii blɔbasinle nnle nnyɔ ee basɛ di sɛkakalekɔ akyuu anyɔ. <verse eid="EZK 37:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZK 37:23" />Blɔbasin-yɔ afiɔ lɛma ku atembi nyakatãa nwu ee ɔtanlolaa ɔbla lɛma kuninwii bakpɔnɔfɔsa suoto lɛma. Diekye kamadiki ma nkyeko sikpile lɛma simuu se niefenko ma ni sɛmaa kamɛ, ninkleklesa ma. Babale batii nii, ami kafɔɔ kamale Yaa lɛma.<verse eid="EZK 37:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZK 37:24" />“ ‘Kpɛmblatɛ nii Dawid nimale sɛka di suoto lɛma, bamuu lɛma kafɔɔ kamawɛ bafosokpatɛ onwii. Babale afiofa nii, manlolaa kafɔɔ sɛsaabla nii manklee. <verse eid="EZK 37:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EZK 37:25" />Babasiɛ di kasɔ ka lata ni kpɛmblatɛ nii Yakob, kasɔ ka suoto di bate lee lasiɛ nii. Mma ku babi lɛma ku bawa lɛma kamasiɛ ninfa dinaa ni kaloo. Kpɛmblatɛ nii Dawid kafɔɔ kamale ɔka lɛma dinaa ni kaloo. <verse eid="EZK 37:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EZK 37:26" />Kamabla atoko ɔkyɛ ole kanya ninii ku mma; kabale kanya ninii ka ninaa ni kaloo. Kamata ma manyila kpinkpĩ, nta lɛpɔ lɛma nkpɛ ninkyakaa, kamayɔ kakleklekɔ nii kafɔɔ ntɛ di kamɛ lɛma dinaa ni kaloo. <verse eid="EZK 37:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EZK 37:27" />Kasiɛkɔ nii kamawɛ ku mma; kamale Yaa lɛma, mma kafɔɔ babale batii nii. <verse eid="EZK 37:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EZK 37:28" />Ni di nnle nwu kamatofo alɛ ami SAATE nwu niɛbla Israel Klekle, nse kakleklekɔ nii nsi di kamɛ lɛma dinaa ni kaloo nɛ.’ ”<verse eid="EZK 37:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 37" />
  <chapter number="38" style="c" sid="EZK 38" />
  <para style="s1">Gog Nle Yaa Lɛkpɛnsaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 38:1" />Ni di SAATE nwu ɔlaa lawa kuatɛɛ alɛ: <verse eid="EZK 38:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 38:2" />“Otii obi, yɔ anu lɛfɔ fakyɔɔ Gog, di Magog kasɔ nwu ɔka kplɛ Mesek ku Tubal suoto; buɛ ɔlaa fatɛ di suoto nɔɔ, <verse eid="EZK 38:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 38:3" />faabuɛ falɛ: Nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE Kplɛ nwu kobuɛ ni alɛ: Oo Gog, ɔka kplɛ Mesek ku Tubal, lɛtaka n-yɛ fɔ di suoto. <verse eid="EZK 38:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 38:4" />Kamamumunikĩisa fɔ nkyiko, nin-yɔ badaduwa nkpee di n-yɛɛ lɛfɔ, ndiki fɔ n-wako ku bakpɛtɛ lɛfɔ bamuu- bapɔnkɔ lɛfɔ, bapɔnkɔ basiɛtɛ lɛfɔ ba ninkle ni akpɛsaa lɛma amuu, ku batii ɔlambu kplɛ ba ninkle ni kubiafunsaa akplɛ ku abiibii, di bamuu lɛma kɔnwanyi ni mpamii lɛma. <verse eid="EZK 38:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 38:5" />Persia, Etiopia ku Put kamawɛ ku mma, di bamuu lɛma nkle ni kubiafunsaa ku abɔɔsaa akoto. <verse eid="EZK 38:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 38:6" />Gomer kafɔɔ ku bakpɛtɛ nɔɔ bamuu, ku Bet-Togarma wɔ niekye ni katookasɔ fanfa ku bakpɛtɛ nɔɔ bamuu- nnle kpinwu be ninkpe ni ku afɔ.<verse eid="EZK 38:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 38:7" />“ ‘Ta anu lɛfɔ ate kɛsɛkɛsɛ; faalolaa suoto, afɔ ku batii ɔlambu nwu bamuu ba niesi ni di suoto lɛfɔ, faayila ma kaanya. <verse eid="EZK 38:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 38:8" />Di ayi kpinwu sɛmaa yi, babalɛɛ ye kakpɛ. Di alɛɛ ya ninkɔwa ni kamɛ yi, bibataka di kasɔ ka nintoodie ni di kakpɛ kamɛ suoto, mba batii baasiisa baakyeko ni nnle kpinwu kamɛ baawako ni Israel abokote ya niate ni afukuti kofokofoko suoto. Batɔɔkpaa ma beedieko di nnle nwu kamɛ, ni di kanunua bamuu lɛma nfɛ basi di atoko ɔkyɛ ole kamɛ nɛ. <verse eid="EZK 38:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 38:9" />Afɔ ku bakpɛtɛ akudi lɛfɔ ku nnle kpinwu be ninkpe ni ku afɔ kamakata minkyɛ, bibakyɛ fɛle afɛɛfɔ siene; bibate fɛle alokonkyɛ nietĩi ni kasɔ.<verse eid="EZK 38:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 38:10" />“ ‘Nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE Kplɛ nwu kobuɛ ni alɛ: Di dii nwu nkpo suoto yi, sɛlaa kpinwu kamawa fɔ diisi, fankũ kanwumbe kpile kafɔɔ. <verse eid="EZK 38:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 38:11" />Fababuɛ falɛ: “Kamataka di kasɔ ka manantofo seyoyiɛ bakyisa ni sekpoenyii suoto; kamadieko batii ba ninsi ni di atoko ɔkyɛ ole kamɛ, mononyu osuku kafɔɔ bata ni lɛsalɛsaa- di bamuu lɛma basi banaa ni seyoyiɛ ku n-yoko ku abɔɔsaa. <verse eid="EZK 38:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 38:12" />Kamadieko ma, nlɛ ma asaa nimmunikĩisa kafɔɔ kɔnɛɛ nii nkyɔɔ di batii ba nfɛ ninsi ni di nsɔ be baawɔɔsa ni suoto ku batii ba baasiisa baakyeko ni nnle nwu kamɛ, baawɛ ni babɔkɛɛ sele ku asaa, basi ni di kasɔ nwu ntɛɛntɛɛ.” <verse eid="EZK 38:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 38:13" />Seba ku Dedan ku Tarsis asaa basunsũtɛ ku sekpoenyii nɔɔ simuu kamakaalɛ fɔ alɛ, “Kakpɛ kamɛ asaa fɛɛwa ɔlɛ? Osiisa feesiisa batii ɔlambu lɛfɔ falɛ fɔɔbayu, fantuka koto fututu ku koto sɛɛle, fanfũ babɔkɛɛ sele ku asaa, fan-yɔ kafɔɔ kakpɛ kamɛ asaa kpinwu fansifiko?” ’<verse eid="EZK 38:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 38:14" />“Nkpo oso, otii obi, buɛ ɔlaa fatɛ, faatɔkɔ Gog falɛ: ‘Nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE Kplɛ nwu kobuɛ ni alɛ: Di dii nwu nkpo kale, nse batii nii Israel nsi di atoko ɔkyɛ ole kamɛ, flɔbatofo nwu ole? <verse eid="EZK 38:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 38:15" />Fabakye kasiɛkɔ lɛfɔ di katookasɔ fanfa fanwa, afɔ ku nnle kpinwu be nimawɛ ni ku afɔ, di bamuu lɛma kamasiɛ ni di bapɔnkɔ suoto, batii ɔlambu kplɛ ku bakpɛtɛ siene babale. <verse eid="EZK 38:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 38:16" />Fabatu fambuo di batii nii Israel suoto fɛle alokonkyɛ ya nietĩi ni kasɔ. Oo Gog, di ayi ya nikɔwa ni kamɛ, kamata fɔ fantaka di kasɔ nii suoto, di mmle di nnle kamatofo mi ni nse lediki suoto nii leklekle letuo, diefe ni di suoto lɛfɔ di anu lɛma.<verse eid="EZK 38:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 38:17" />“ ‘Nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE Kplɛ nwu kobuɛ ni alɛ: Diele afɔ suoto lakakatɛ di ayi ya nintɔbafe ni kamɛ, diafe ni di bakpɛmblatɛ nii Israel ɔlaababuɛtɛtɛ suoto? Di obe nwu kamɛ baabuɛ ɔlaa baatɛ di alɛɛ kpinwu kamɛ alɛ kamakpaa fɔ fantaka di suoto lɛma.<verse eid="EZK 38:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yaa Lɛkanko Di Gog Suoto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 38:18" />Nnya lɛsaa le nimawa ni di dii nwu nkpo suoto: Nse Gog ledieko Israel kasɔ nwu yi, ɔblɔ yakayaka nii kamataka, SAATE Kplɛ nwu niebuɛ. <verse eid="EZK 38:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 38:19" />Di sɛsɔfɔwo nii ɔkpɛ ku lɛblɔfiɛ yakayaka nii kamɛ, labuɛ di obe nwu kamɛ nlɛ kasɔ kamatukũ osie kanya di Israel kasɔ suoto. <verse eid="EZK 38:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 38:20" />Lekpo kamɛ kɔkpaku, bakansiɛ di kɔfɛɛfɔ kamɛ, lepoo kamɛ babɔkɛɛ, lɛsaa biala ninkpɔkɔ ni di kasɔ suoto, ku batii bamuu di kasɔ nwu suoto kamatũtũkũ kpakpakpa di anu nii. Abokote kamakyi anfuu, aba takale kamabibiɛ, oyoyiɛ biala kafɔɔ kamabiɛ kunte kaasɔ. <verse eid="EZK 38:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 38:21" />Kamadiki kapamii nkpee Gog di abokote nii amuu suoto, SAATE Kplɛ nwu niebuɛ. Otii biala kamayɔ kapamii di obilɛma suoto. <verse eid="EZK 38:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZK 38:22" />Kamayɔ ofiɛ kpile ku ntɔ owii kaasɔ nkanko nwɔ; kamata kanto kplɛ, atubakani ku amã ya nikofiɛ ni ku ɔtɔ nnɔɔ fɛ kanto ankpete nwɔ, manko bakpɛtɛ nɔɔ ku nnle be kpinwu ninkpe ni ku nnwɔɔ suoto. <verse eid="EZK 38:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZK 38:23" />Nkpo kamatuo nimuɔ nii ku leklekle nii nɛ, ninta kafɔɔ mantofo mi di nnle kpinwu anu. Ninfɛ babatofo alɛ ami ninle SAATE nwu nɛ.’<verse eid="EZK 38:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 38" />
  <chapter number="39" style="c" sid="EZK 39" />
  <para style="s1">Baalenkee Gog</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 39:1" />“Afɔ otii obi, buɛ ɔlaa fatɛ di Gog suoto faabuɛ falɛ: ‘Nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE Kplɛ nwu kobuɛ ni alɛ: Oo Gog, Mesek ku Tubal ɔka kplɛ, lɛtaka n-yɛ fɔ di suoto. <verse eid="EZK 39:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 39:2" />Kamamumunikĩisa fɔ nkyiko, ninanfi fɔ nkyɛnko sitũ. Kamakpaa fɔ nkyeko katookasɔ fanfa nwako, nintɔɔ fɔ nkpee Israel abokote suoto. <verse eid="EZK 39:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 39:3" />Ni kamataa kɔtaa lɛfɔ nkyeko kɔmɛntunɛɛ lɛfɔ, ninta akplɔ lɛfɔ kafɔɔ nkpakpaa di koletanɛɛ lɛfɔ. <verse eid="EZK 39:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 39:4" />Israel abokote osi fabanɔɔ, afɔ ku bakpɛtɛ lɛfɔ bamuu ku nnle be ninkpe ni ku afɔ. Kamayɔ fɔ nta alente ateate ku lepoo kamɛ babɔkɛɛ fɛ alesaa. <verse eid="EZK 39:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 39:5" />Fabakpi fante di lepoo kamɛ, diekye ami niɛkakatɛ, SAATE Kplɛ nwu niebuɛ. <verse eid="EZK 39:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 39:6" />Kamadiki ɔtɔ nkpee Magog ku mba ninsi ni di atoko ɔkyɛ ole kamɛ di lekpo kotoko nsɔ suoto, ni babatofo alɛ ami ninle SAATE nwu nɛ.<verse eid="EZK 39:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 39:7" />“ ‘Kamata mantofo leyooto nii klekle nwu di batii nii Israel kamɛ. Nɔmasinta bakpɔnɔfɔsa leyooto nii klekle nwu. Ni di nnle nwu kafɔɔ kamatofo alɛ ami SAATE nwu ninle Klekletɛ nwu di Israel nɛ. <verse eid="EZK 39:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 39:8" />Nfɛ diɔwa! Nwaako dibawa kaanya, SAATE Kplɛ nwu niebuɛ. Nle mmle ninle dii le suoto lakakatɛ ni nɛ.<verse eid="EZK 39:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 39:9" />“ ‘Nioso batii ba ninsi ni di Israel sekpoo kamɛ kamadie mankyɛ manaayɔ akpɛsaa mambla ntɔɔni manfiɛ- kubiafunsaa akplɛ ku abiibii, kɔtaa ku akplɔ, kakpɛ nwosoku ku akplɔ kaanale. Babayɔ nya mambla ntɔɔni alɛɛ akuɛnsĩ. <verse eid="EZK 39:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 39:10" />Dilɔbasinfĩ alɛ baalaabudi ntɔɔni mankyeko afe ee babudi mi bakyeko apoo kamɛ, diekye babayɔ akpɛsaa nwu mambla ntɔɔni. Babafũ kafɔɔ kakpɛ kamɛ asaa lɛma ya di batii ba niafũ ma ni ale nfũ. Man-yu kafɔɔ batii ba niayu ma ni ale, SAATE Kplɛ nwu niebuɛ.<verse eid="EZK 39:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 39:11" />“ ‘Di dii nwu nkpo kale yi, kamata Gog batii kakookaakɔ di Israel, di ɔtaata wɔ di batii ba ninkyɛ ni osuku di kufĩkatunkɔ diofe ni Lekpo lɛkyɛ. Batii kakookaakɔ nwu kamasɛɛ osuku bakyɛntɛ osuku, diekye babakookaa Gog ku batii ɔlambu nɔɔ ninfa. Nioso babalɛɛ lɛba nwu alɛ Hamon Gog Ɔtaata.<verse eid="EZK 39:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 39:12" />“ ‘Israel batii kamatookookaa ma awɛntɛ akuɛnsĩ amu, ta mmle baakleklesa ni kasɔ nwu oso. <verse eid="EZK 39:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 39:13" />Kasɔ nwu batii bamuu kamakookaa ma, di dii le kafɔɔ babakpee mi ni dibu kamale onyuma dii ninta ma, SAATE Kplɛ nwu niebuɛ.<verse eid="EZK 39:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 39:14" />“ ‘Babafũ batii mantookleklesa kasɔ nwu obe lele. Bawo kamakyɛ manfe di kasɔ nwu kamuu suoto, diɛkyakaa ni ku mma kafɔɔ yi, babamba kamakookaa bakpi ba niebu bate ni kaasɔ. Di awɛntɛ akuɛnsĩ nwu kayɛntɛkɔ babakye okyi lɛma nwu kasɔ. <verse eid="EZK 39:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 39:15" />Nse bookyikyii kasɔ nwu, di onwii lɛma lɛnya otii dikufi lewo yi, abayɔ nsũ lɛtɛsaa antɛ di ɔlɔɔkɔ nini, ninaase di obe wɔ di ɔkya bakututɛ lekookaa ni dikufi nwu di Hamon Gog Ɔtaata nwu. <verse eid="EZK 39:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 39:16" />(Okpoo wɔ manlɛɛ ni Hamona kafɔɔ kamawɛ ninfa.) Nkpo babakleklesa kasɔ nwu nɛ.’<verse eid="EZK 39:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 39:17" />“Kafɔɔ afɔ Otii obi, nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE Kplɛ nwu kobuɛ ni alɛ: Tɔkɔ bakansiɛ ateate biala ku lepoo kamɛ babɔkɛɛ bamuu falɛ: ‘Bisi, biekye kakɔ biala biwa oleɔta wɔ kɔbla nta ye ni, oleɔta kplɛ nwu di Israel abokote suoto. Nfa bibawee sina min-nyi ntɔ nɛ. <verse eid="EZK 39:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 39:18" />Bibawee basientɛ sina, min-nyi kafɔɔ kasɔ baka ntɔ, fɛ akunumuu ku bafoso, batie ku banankyue-suɔtɔ bale- di bamuu lɛma bale ni babɔkɛɛ ba ninsi ni lɛla beekye ni Basan. <verse eid="EZK 39:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 39:19" />Bibawee lɛla ninaase di obe wɔ biemiɛ nii, min-nyi ntɔ kafɔɔ ninaase ni di obe wɔ dibasiɛnsa ye ni di oleɔta wɔ kɔbla nta ye ni kalekɔ. <verse eid="EZK 39:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 39:20" />Bibawee bapɔnkɔ ku bapɔnkɔ basiɛtɛ, basientɛ ku bakpɛtɛ ateate sina mim-miɛ di opunu nii suoto,’ SAATE Kplɛ ni niebuɛ.<verse eid="EZK 39:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Israel Ose Lelolaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 39:21" />“Kamayɔ leklekle nii ntɛ di nnle nwu kamɛ, nnle nwu mmuu kafɔɔ kamanya letokonanfi le lɛnanfi ni ku kɔnɛɛ ko letika ni di suoto lɛma. <verse eid="EZK 39:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZK 39:22" />Diɛyɔ ni di dii nwu nkpo diesifi nii, Israel batii kamatofo alɛ ami ninle SAATE Yaa lɛma. <verse eid="EZK 39:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZK 39:23" />Ni di nnle nwu kamatofo alɛ Israel batii lasifi sɛlanle kamɛ ta sikpile lɛma oso nɛ, diekye batale onukwale baatɛɛ. Nioso lakyisa anu nii di suoto lɛma, ni layɔ ma lakpee di balo lɛma nnɛɛ, ni di bamuu lɛma baanɔɔ di kapamii kanya nɛ. <verse eid="EZK 39:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZK 39:24" />Lablako ma suoto ɔkpɛ di ɔtanklekle lɛma ku ɔtanlolaa ɔbla lɛma kanya, ni lakyisa anu nii di suoto lɛma nɛ.<verse eid="EZK 39:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EZK 39:25" />“Nkpo oso nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE Kplɛ nwu kobuɛ ni alɛ: Nfɛ kamakplesa Yakob nkyeko sɛlanle kamɛ n-wako, kamanya kafɔɔ Israel batii bamuu nyaami, kamakpɛ kafɔɔ sɛsɔfɔwo osie kanya nta leyooto nii klekle. <verse eid="EZK 39:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EZK 39:26" />Babayee sinunsɔ lɛma ku onukwale ɔtanle lɛma wɔ baadiki baatuo mi ni omuu nse basi di atoko ɔkyɛ ole kamɛ di kasɔ lɛma suoto, di otii kuonwii nnaa abayɛkɛsa ma nii. <verse eid="EZK 39:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EZK 39:27" />Nse lɛkpaa ma lekyeko nnle nwu kamɛ, lesiisa ma kafɔɔ lekyeko balo lɛma nsɔ nwu lɛwako yi, kamadiki suoto nii leklekle ntuo nfenko di suoto lɛma, di nnle kpinwu anu. <verse eid="EZK 39:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EZK 39:28" />Ninfɛ babatofo alɛ ami ninle SAATE Yaa lɛma nɛ. Diekye, kuntɛ latɔɔ ma lakpee sɛlanle kamɛ di nnle nwu kamɛ yi, kamasiisa ma n-wako kasɔ lɛma kamu suoto, nɔmadiɛ kuonwii ntɛ. <verse eid="EZK 39:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EZK 39:29" />Nɔmasinkyisa anu nii di suoto lɛma, diekye kamanyɛɛnɛ Ninwuna nii nkpete di Israel batii suoto, SAATE Kplɛ nwu niebuɛ.”<verse eid="EZK 39:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 39" />
  <chapter number="40" style="c" sid="EZK 40" />
  <para style="ms">ODIKI OTUO DI DII KAAMAA OLEKATAKƆ SUOTO</para>
  <para style="s1">Baakpaa Hesekiel Baasifiko Yerusalem</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 40:1" />Di sɛlanle loo osiɛ kamɛ alɛɛ afosi-anyɔ lɛnɔɔle kamɛ, di lɛlɛɛ nwu kasɔ kakyekɔ kamɛ, di kɔwɛntɛ nwu dii fosile suoto, di okpoo kplɛ nwu labiɛ ni sɛmaa, di lefosi lɛlɛɛ naafa kamɛ- dii nwu nkpo kale suoto, SAATE nwu kɔnɛɛ latika mi di suoto, ni aakpaa mi aasifiko nfa nɛ. <verse eid="EZK 40:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 40:2" />Di Yaa odiki otuo kamɛ yi, aakpaa mi aasifiko Israel kasɔ suoto, ni aayɔ mi aalaatika di kobokote ko niataka ni nwaa, di ayo lawɛ ni di kobokote nwu kalakasɔ lɛkyɛ, diate ni fɛle okpoo kplɛ. <verse eid="EZK 40:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 40:3" />Aakpaa mi aasifiko nfa, ni lanya osuɔtɔ onwii di letembi nɔɔ late ni fɛle lɛbɔɔsaa sɛɛle; layila di osuku kayoko aaklee dibula fɛnɛnɛɛ okũ ku lɛklapoosaa kawesee di kɔnɛɛ nɔɔ. <verse eid="EZK 40:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 40:4" />Ni di osuɔtɔ nwu latɔkɔ mi alɛ, “Otii obi, nyu ku anu lɛfɔ, faanu ku atoko lɛfɔ, faakyɔɔ kafɔɔ lɛsaa biala le kamatuo fɔ ni atoko, diekye nni oso bɛɛkpaa fɔ bɛɛwako nfũ nɛ. Tɔkɔ Israel batii lɛsaa biala fɛɛnya ni.”<verse eid="EZK 40:4" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kufĩkatunkɔ Kayoko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 40:5" />Ni lanya oyoyiɛ onwii lamana olekatakɔ nwu lɛkyɛ kuakyi nɛ. Lɛklapoosaa kawesee nwu di osuɔtɔ nwu kɔnɛɛ lɛkaana labla nkpaa lefosi, di dibiala lɛkaana labla ni kɔkpaa kunwii ku ɔfã. Aaklapoosa ni oyoyiɛ nwu; opĩ ninwu labla lɛklapoosaa kawesee nwu kanwii ku kawesee nwu kanwii lɛtaka.<verse eid="EZK 40:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 40:6" />Ninfɛ aasifi kayoko ka niakyɔɔ ni kufĩkatunkɔ anu nɛ. Ni aakata oyoyiɛ nwu nkatakɔ aalaaklapoosa kayoko nwu anu nɛ; lekyofo nika labla nkpaa lefosi. <verse eid="EZK 40:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 40:7" />Koyoe ko niakaa ni di kayoko nwu sɛlɔɔkɔ kuɔta ni banyuntɛ lɛkaana labla nkpaa lefosi, lɛblɛfɛ kafɔɔ labla nkpaa lefosi, seyoyiɛ se baatofo siakyɔɔ ni di koyoe nwu sebo opĩ labla nkpaa nnɛ. Kamɛ kayoko ka niatɛɛtɛɛ ni lɛkpata nwu niakyɔɔ ni olekatakɔ nwu anu lekyofo labla nkpaa lefosi.<verse eid="EZK 40:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 40:8" />Ninfɛ aaklapoosa lɛkpata nwu kayoko nɛ; <verse eid="EZK 40:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 40:9" />lekyofo nika labla lefosi nkpaa ntiɛ, obo wɔ niate ni kafɔɔ opĩ labla nkpaa ntiɛ. Kayoko nwu lɛkpata lakyɔɔ anu olekatakɔ nwu.<verse eid="EZK 40:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 40:10" />Koyoe kutiɛ lawɛ di kufĩkatunkɔ kayoko nwu ɔfankyi biala; atiɛ nwu lɛklapoo lale ninwii, seyoyiɛ se niakyɔɔ ni di ɔfankyi biala kafɔɔ lɛklapoo lale ninwii. <verse eid="EZK 40:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 40:11" />Ninfɛ aaklapoosa nfũ manfe mambuo ni kayoko nwu lɛblɛfɛ nɛ; lɛblɛfɛ nini labla lefosi nkpaa nkuɛnsĩ, lɛkaana kafɔɔ labla afosi-anyɔ nkpaa nnyɔ. <verse eid="EZK 40:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 40:12" />Di kayoe biala anu yi, oyoyiɛ layila di lɛtaka ninwu labla ni kɔkpaa kunwii ku ɔfã, koyoe nwu kafɔɔ labla nkpaa lefosi di ɔfankyi biala. <verse eid="EZK 40:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 40:13" />Ninfɛ aaklapoosa kayoko nwu diayɔ ni di kayoe kanwii osi dialaase ni di kayoe nyɔɔfa osi; obo wɔ niate ni diayɔ ni di kayokontũ kanwii dialaase ni di kanyɔɔfa labla afosi-ana nkpaa nnyɔ. <verse eid="EZK 40:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 40:14" />Aaklapoosa lɛkpata nwu anu amuu niafe ni di kamɛ kayoko nwu- diabla nkpaa kɔlafa. Aaklapoosa aalaadu lɛkpata le niakyɔɔ ni kaflɔnkɔ nwu anu. <verse eid="EZK 40:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 40:15" />Obo wɔ niate, diayɔ ni di kayoko kanya dialaadu ni lɛkpata nwu kayɛntɛlekɔ labla afosi-anɛ nkpaa nna. <verse eid="EZK 40:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 40:16" />Basɛfle lamana koyoe nwu ku seyoyiɛ se simuu baatofo baakyɔɔsa ni di kayoko nwu kamɛ baakyi, fɛ mmle di lɛkpata nwu late nii; basɛfle nwu bamuu niamana baakyi ni lakyɔɔ anu kamɛ. Baabla awɔsɔ baatika di seyoyiɛ se baatofo baakyɔɔsa ni anu amuu.<verse eid="EZK 40:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kaflɔnkɔ Ka Niawɛ Ni Di Kayi Lɛkyɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 40:17" />Ninfɛ aakpaa mi aawako kaflɔnkɔ ka niawɛ ni di kayi lɛkyɛ nɛ. Ni lanya koyoe kowo ku kafenkɔ afuɔ ya baatɛ baakyisa ni kaflɔnkɔ nwu kamuu ninfa nɛ; koyoe afosi-atiɛ niayila di kafenkɔ afuɔ ya baatɛ baakyisa ni anu. <verse eid="EZK 40:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 40:18" />Baatɛ afuɔ di n-yoko nwu sɛlɔɔkɔ, aablɛfɛ aakaatɛɛ kafɔɔ di lɛkaana nwu kanya; nle mmle niale kafenkɔ afuɔ ya baatɛ ni di kalɔ lɛkyɛ nɛ. <verse eid="EZK 40:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 40:19" />Ninfɛ aaklapoosa obo wɔ niate ni, diayɔ ni di kalɔ kayoko kamɛ aawako kayi di kaflɔnkɔ ka kaamɛ nɛ; diabla kɔlafa afosi-akuɔ nkpaa nnɛ di kufĩkatunkɔ lɛkyɛ ku katookasɔ lɛkyɛ.<verse eid="EZK 40:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Katookasɔ Kayoko Nwu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 40:20" />Ninfɛ aaklapoosa kayoko ka niakyɔɔ ni anu katookasɔ, lɛkaana ku lɛblɛfɛ, diofe ni kaflɔnkɔ ka niawɛ ni di kayi lɛkyɛ nɛ. <verse eid="EZK 40:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 40:21" />Koyoe kutiɛ niawɛ di ɔfankyi biala, seyoyiɛ se baatofo baakyɔɔsa ni ku lɛkpata nini lakaatɛɛ ku kayoko kasale kale. Lɛkaana labla afosi-anɛ nkpaa nna, lɛblɛfɛ kafɔɔ labla afosi-ana nkpaa nnyɔ. <verse eid="EZK 40:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZK 40:22" />Basɛfle nini, akpata nini ku awɔsɔ ya baabla baatika ni lɛklapoo lakaatɛɛ ku kayoko ka niakyɔɔ ni kufĩkatunkɔ anu kale. Nkatakɔ nkuɔ niawɛ mankata manaadu ni osi nini, di lɛkpata lakyɔɔ ma ni anu. <verse eid="EZK 40:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZK 40:23" />Kayoko lawɛ kaasifi kaflɔnkɔ ka kaamɛ, kaakyɔɔ anu katookasɔ kayoko, fɛ mmle okle kaate ni di kufĩkatunkɔ. Aaklapoosa diayɔ ni di kayoko kanwii dialaadu ni nka niakyɔɔ ka ni anu; diabla kɔlafa afosi-akuɔ nkpaa nnɛ.<verse eid="EZK 40:23" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kalakasɔ Kayoko Nwu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZK 40:24" />Ninfɛ aakpaa mi aasifiko kalakasɔ lɛkyɛ, ni lanya kayoko lakyɔɔ anu kalakasɔ nɛ. Aaklapoosa seyoyiɛ se nintɛɛ ku akpata nini lakaatɛɛ fɛ abule. <verse eid="EZK 40:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EZK 40:25" />Basɛfle lawɛ di kayoko nwu ku akpata nwu amuu baakyi, fɛle basɛfle bule bale. Lɛkaana nini labla afosi-anɛ nkpaa nna, lɛblɛfɛ nini kafɔɔ labla afosi-ana nkpaa nnyɔ. <verse eid="EZK 40:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EZK 40:26" />Nkatakɔ nkuɛnsĩ niawɛ mankata manaadu ni osi nini, di akpata nini lawɛ aakyɔɔ ma ni anu; baabla awɔsɔ baatika di seyoyiɛ se baatofo baakyɔɔsa ni anu di ɔfankyi biala. <verse eid="EZK 40:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EZK 40:27" />Kaflɔnkɔ ka kaamɛ kafɔɔ lawɛ kayoko kanwii niakyɔɔ ni anu kalakasɔ, ni aaklapoosa diayɔ ni di kayoko ka mmle aalaadu kayoko ka di kayi di kalakasɔ lɛkyɛ nɛ; diabla kɔlafa afosi-akuɔ nkpaa nnɛ.<verse eid="EZK 40:27" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kaflɔnkɔ Ka Kaamɛ: Kalakasɔ Kayoko Nwu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="EZK 40:28" />Ninfɛ aakpaa mi aafenko di kalakasɔ kayoko aawako kaflɔnkɔ ka kaamɛ, ni aaklapoosa kalakasɔ kayoko nwu nɛ; lɛklapoo nika lakaatɛɛ ku abule. <verse eid="EZK 40:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EZK 40:29" />Koyoe nini, seyoyiɛ se baatofo baakyɔɔ ni ku lɛkpata nini lakaatɛɛ ku abule. Basɛfle lamana kayoko nwu ku lɛkpata nimuu diakyi. Lɛkaana nini labla afosi-anɛ nkpaa nna lɛblɛfɛ kafɔɔ labla afosi-ana nkpaa nnyɔ. <verse eid="EZK 40:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EZK 40:30" />(Akpata nwu n-yoko be niamana kaflɔnkɔ ka kaamɛ diakyi ni lɛkaana labla afosi-ana nkpaa nnyɔ, lɛblɛfɛ kafɔɔ labla nkpaa nnɛ.) <verse eid="EZK 40:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EZK 40:31" />Lɛkpata nini lakyɔɔ anu kaflɔnkɔ ka di kayi; baabla awɔsɔ baatika di ntɛɛntɛɛ seyoyiɛ nwu suoto, nkatakɔ nnɛ kafɔɔ niawɛ diofe ni osi nini.<verse eid="EZK 40:31" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kaflɔnkɔ Ka kaamɛ: Kufĩkatunkɔ Kayoko Nwu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="EZK 40:32" />Ninfɛ aakpaa mi aawako kaflɔnkɔ ka kaamɛ, di kufĩkatunkɔ lɛkyɛ, ni aaklapoosa kayoko nwu nɛ, diakaatɛɛ ku abule. <verse eid="EZK 40:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="EZK 40:33" />Koyoe nini, seyoyiɛ se baatofo baakyɔɔsa ni ku lɛkpata nini lakaatɛɛ ku abule. Kayoko nwu ku lɛkpata nini lawɛ basɛfle baakyisa amuu. Lɛkaana nini labla afosi-anɛ nkpaa nna, lɛblɛfɛ nini kafɔɔ labla afosi-ana nkpaa nnyɔ. <verse eid="EZK 40:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="EZK 40:34" />Lɛkpata nini lakyɔɔ anu kaflɔnkɔ ka niawɛ ni di kayi; baabla awɔsɔ baatika di ntɛɛntɛɛ seyoyiɛ nwu di ɛfankyi nwu ɛnyɔ suoto, nkatakɔ nnɛ kafɔɔ niawɛ diasifi ni osi nini.<verse eid="EZK 40:34" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kaflɔnkɔ Nwu Kaamɛ: Katookasɔ Kayoko Nwu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="EZK 40:35" />Ninfɛ aakpaa mi aawako katookasɔ kayoko nwu, ni aaklapoosa ka nɛ. Diakaatɛɛ ku abule. <verse eid="EZK 40:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="EZK 40:36" />Fɛ mmle di koyoe nini, seyoyiɛ se baatofo baakyɔɔsa ni ku lɛkpata nini late nii, diawɛ basɛfle kafɔɔ baakyisa amuu. Lɛkaana nini labla afosi-anɛ nkpaa nna, lɛblɛfɛ nini kafɔɔ labla afosi-ana nkpaa nnyɔ. <verse eid="EZK 40:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="EZK 40:37" />Lɛkpata nini lakyɔɔ anu kaflɔnkɔ ka niawɛ ni di kayi; baabla awɔsɔ baatika di ntɛɛntɛɛ seyoyiɛ nwu di ɛfankyi nwu ɛnyɔ suoto, nkatakɔ nnɛ kafɔɔ niawɛ diasifi ni osi nini.<verse eid="EZK 40:37" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ayo Ya Niakaako Ni Katookasɔ Kayoko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="EZK 40:38" />Leyo ninwii lawɛ ku kokloo di lɛkpata nwu di n-yoko nwu kaamɛ biala kamɛ, nfa manfoto ofiɛ asaaɔta sina nɛ. <verse eid="EZK 40:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="EZK 40:39" />Di kayoko nwu lɛkpata kamɛ yi, epunu ɛnyɔ layila di ɔfankyi biala, nsĩ suoto manlo ofiɛ asaaɔta, okpile asaaɔta ku lɛpɔɔ okpi asaaɔta babɔkɛɛ nɛ. <verse eid="EZK 40:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="EZK 40:40" />Di oyoyiɛ wɔ ninkpe ni di kayoko nwu lɛkpata kaayi, diakaako ni nkatakɔ be di katookasɔ kayoko lɛkyɛ yi, epunu ɛnyɔ layila, epunu ɛnyɔ kafɔɔ layila di nkatakɔ nwu kakyɛ nyɔɔfa lɛkyɛ. <verse eid="EZK 40:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="EZK 40:41" />Nioso epunu ɛna niayila di kayoko nwu kakyɛ kanwii, ɛna kafɔɔ layila di kakyɛ nyɔɔfa- epunu nwu emuu labla ɛnɛ- epunu nwu suoto manlo oleɔta babɔkɛɛ nɛ. <verse eid="EZK 40:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="EZK 40:42" />Ɛpunu ɛna be baawola ni ku afuɔ baata ni ofiɛ asaaɔta kafɔɔ layila ninfa, obiala lɛkaana labla anɛɛkpa afosi-atiɛ, lɛblɛfɛ labla anɛɛkpa afosi-atiɛ, lɛtaka kafɔɔ labla lefosi anɛɛkpa anɛ. Nsĩ suoto mantika mpamii be manlo ni ofiɛ asaaɔta babɔkɛɛ ku seleɔta bamba nɛ. <verse eid="EZK 40:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="EZK 40:43" />Baakakaasa amufũsaa nnya nnyɔ di oyoyiɛ omuu suoto baafenko, dibiala lɛkaana labla kɔnɛɛ lɛblɛfɛ. Sipunu nwu layila siata asaaɔta sina.<verse eid="EZK 40:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="EZK 40:44" />Di kayoko ka kaamɛ kayi lɛkyɛ, di kaflɔnkɔ ka kaamɛ kamɛ yi, ayo anyɔ lawɛ, ninwii lawɛ di katookasɔ kayoko lɛkyɛ diakyɔɔ anu kalakasɔ, lɛnyɔɔfa kafɔɔ lawɛ di kalakasɔ lɛkyɛ diakyɔɔ anu katookasɔ. <verse eid="EZK 40:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="EZK 40:45" />Ni aatɔkɔ mi alɛ, “Leyo le niɛkyɔɔ ni anu kalakasɔ ninle olebatatɛ ba nin-yɛ ni di olekatakɔ kanya lele nɛ. <verse eid="EZK 40:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="EZK 40:46" />Leyo le kafɔɔ niɛkyɔɔ ni anu katookasɔ ninle olebatatɛ ba nin-yɛ ni di oleɔta akyikye kanya lele nɛ. Mba mmle ninle Sadok babisuɔtɔbi ba lete ninle ni Lewi batii ba ninkpe ni osuku mantɛɛtɛɛ ni SAATE nwu alɛ baabla ni kasumu sɛsaabla di anu nɔɔ nɛ.”<verse eid="EZK 40:46" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kaflɔnkɔ Ka Kaamɛ Ku Olekatakɔ Nwu Leyo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="EZK 40:47" />Ninfɛ aaklapoosa kaflɔnkɔ nwu nɛ: Nimuu lakyɛkyɛ- Lɛkaana nini labla kɔlafa afosi-akuɔ nkpaa nnɛ, lɛblɛfɛ nini kafɔɔ labla kɔlafa afosi-akuɔ nkpaa nnɛ. Oleɔta akyikye kafɔɔ lawɛ di olekatakɔ nwu anu.<verse eid="EZK 40:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="EZK 40:48" />Ninfɛ aakpaa mi aawako olekatakɔ nwu lɛkpata, ni aaklapoosa lɛkpata nwu ntɛɛntɛɛ seyoyiɛ nɛ; lɛblɛfɛ nisĩ labla nkpaa nnɛ di ɛfankyi nwu ɛnyɔ. Kayoko nwu lɛblɛfɛ labla afosi-anyɔ nkpaa nna, seyoyiɛ se baatofo baakyɔɔsa ni kafɔɔ lɛblɛfɛ labla nkpaa nnɔɔ di ɛfankyi nwu ɛnyɔ. <verse eid="EZK 40:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="EZK 40:49" />Lɛkpata nwu lɛblɛfɛ labla afosi-atiɛ nkpaa nna, diayɔ ni di sitũ diawa ni sɛmaa labla nkpaa afosi-anyɔ. Nkatakɔ lawɛ mankata manaadu ni nfa, akpaka kafɔɔ layila di ntɛɛntɛɛ oyoyiɛ biala ɔlɔɔkɔ.<verse eid="EZK 40:49" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 40" />
  <chapter number="41" style="c" sid="EZK 41" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 41:1" />Ninfɛ di osuɔtɔ nwu lakpaa mi aawako kakleklekɔ ka niawɛ ni di kayi lɛkyɛ, ni aaklapoosa ntɛɛntɛɛ seyoyiɛ nwu nɛ; ntɛɛntɛɛ seyoyiɛ nwu lɛblɛfɛ labla nkpaa lefosi di ɔfankyi biala. <verse eid="EZK 41:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 41:2" />Kayokontũ nwu lɛblɛfɛ labla lefosi nkpaa nkuɛnsĩ, seyoyiɛ se baatofo baakyɔɔsa ni kafɔɔ lɛblɛfɛ labla nkpaa nnɛ di ɔfankyi biala. Aaklapoosa kafɔɔ kakleklekɔ nwu kayi lɛkyɛ; lɛkaana nini labla afosi-akuɔ nkpaa nnɛ, lɛblɛfɛ kafɔɔ labla afosi-atiɛ nkpaa nna.<verse eid="EZK 41:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 41:3" />Ninfɛ aabuo di kakleklekɔ ka kaamɛ ni aaklapoosa kayokontũ nwu ntɛɛntɛɛ seyoyiɛ nɛ; dibiala lɛblɛfɛ labla nkpaa ntiɛ. Kayokontũ nwu lɛblɛfɛ labla nkpaa lefosi, seyoyiɛ se baatofo baakyɔɔsa ni di ɔfankyi biala kafɔɔ lɛblɛfɛ labla lefosi nkpaa nnyɔ. <verse eid="EZK 41:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 41:4" />Ni aaklapoosa kakleklekɔ ka kaamɛ lɛkaana nɛ; diabla afosi-atiɛ nkpaa nna, lɛblɛfɛ nini kafɔɔ labla afosi-atiɛ nkpaa nna dialaadu kakleklekɔ ka di kayi lɛkyɛ kayɛntɛlekɔ. Ni aatɔkɔ mi alɛ, “Nfũ mmle ninle Kakleklekɔ kaamɛ Kakleklekɔ nɛ.”<verse eid="EZK 41:4" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ayo Ya Baatofo Baakaasa Ni Di Olekatakɔ Nwu Seyoyiɛ Suoto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 41:5" />Ninfɛ aaklapoosa olekatakɔ nwu oyoyiɛ nɛ; opĩ nini labla nkpaa lefosi, leyo biala kafɔɔ niakaa ni di olekatakɔ nwu aakyi ni lɛblɛfɛ labla nkpaa nkuɛnsĩ. <verse eid="EZK 41:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 41:6" />Sɛlɔɔkɔ ayo ya baatofo baakaasa ni labla sitika sitiɛ, ninwii di lɛbamba suoto, ayo afosi-atiɛ niatika di ditika biala suoto. Baatofo asunsaa baakyisa di olekatakɔ nwu seyoyiɛ alɛ aamufũ sɛlɔɔkɔ ayo nwu anklee, alɛ dilaale olekatakɔ nwu seyoyiɛ nikamufũ nya anklee nii. <verse eid="EZK 41:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 41:7" />Sɛlɔɔkɔ ayo nwu niamana ni olekatakɔ nwu aakyi ni amuu latɔɔblɛfɛ aatɔɔkyakaa di otofo ditika biala suoto. Baatofo ayo ya niamana olekatakɔ nwu aakyi ni alɛ osi ale latɔɔblɛfɛ aatɔkyakaa, nioso otofo ditika biala mblɛfɛ ninlenkee kalɔ lele, fɔɔkata fankyɛ ni di osi lɛkyɛ. Kakatakɔ layɔ di kalɔ ayo, kaafe di ntɛɛntɛɛ ayo, kaakata kaasifi ayo ya di osi.<verse eid="EZK 41:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 41:8" />Lanya kafɔɔ nlɛ baanii olekatakɔ nwu kalɔ nimuu baakyisa, diale lɛsɔse diata ayo nwu baatofo ni di sɛlɔɔkɔ. Diale lɛklapoosaa kawesee nkpaa lefosi lɛkaana. <verse eid="EZK 41:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 41:9" />Sɛlɔɔkɔ ayo nwu di kayi lɛkyɛ opĩ labla nkpaa nnɛ. Obo wɔ niate ni di olekatakɔ nwu sɛlɔɔkɔ ayo <verse eid="EZK 41:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 41:10" />ku olebatatɛ ayo ntɛɛ lɛblɛfɛ labla afosi-atiɛ nkpaa nna diakyi olekatakɔ nwu nimuu. <verse eid="EZK 41:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 41:11" />N-yoko lawɛ manfe ni di sɛlɔɔkɔ ayo nwu di obo wɔ niate ni nintɛɛ, kanwii lawɛ di katookasɔ lɛkyɛ kabamba kafɔɔ lawɛ di kalakasɔ lɛkyɛ; obo wɔ niate ni lɛblɛfɛ labla nkpaa nnɛ diakyi nimuu.<verse eid="EZK 41:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Leyo Le Niawɛ Ni Di Kufĩkamɛɛkɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 41:12" />Leyo le niakyɔɔ ni anu olekatakɔ nwu kaflɔnkɔ di kufĩkamɛɛkɔ lɛkyɛ lɛblɛfɛ labla kɔlafa- lefosi nkpaa nkuɔ. Leyo nwu oyoyiɛ opĩ labla nkpaa nnɛ, lɛkaana nini kafɔɔ labla nkpaa kɔlafa-afosi-anɔɔ.<verse eid="EZK 41:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 41:13" />Ninfɛ aaklapoosa olekatakɔ nwu nɛ; lɛkaana nini labla kɔlafa-afosi-akuɔ nkpaa nnɛ, olekatakɔ kaflɔnkɔ ku leyo ku seyoyiɛ nini kafɔɔ lɛkaana labla kɔlafa-afosi-akuɔ nkpaa nnɛ. <verse eid="EZK 41:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 41:14" />Olekatakɔ kaflɔnkɔ nwu lɛblɛfɛ di kufĩkatunkɔ, diakyakaa ni di olekatakɔ nwu anu, labla kɔlafa-afosi-akuɔ nkpaa nnɛ.<verse eid="EZK 41:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mmle Baatofo Ni Olekatakɔ Nwu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 41:15" />Ninfɛ aaklapoosa leyo le niakyɔɔ ni anu kaflɔnkɔ ka niawɛ ni di olekatakɔ nwu sɛmaa, diakyakaa ni di sebombo nini di ɔfankyi biala; diabla kɔlafa-afosi-akuɔ nkpaa nnɛ.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EZK 41:15">Kakleklekɔ kayi lɛkyɛ ku kakleklekɔ ka kaamɛ ku lɛkpata le niakyɔɔ ni anu kaflɔnkɔ nwu, <verse eid="EZK 41:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 41:16" />diakyakaa ni di n-yokontũ basɛfle biibii nwu ku sebombo se niamana ni atiɛ lɛma nwu siakyi nii- baatĩtĩi dibiala ku sewoso, diakyakaa ni di n-yokontũ nwu. Baatĩtĩi kayosɔ ku oyoyiɛ dialaadu basɛfle nwu. <verse eid="EZK 41:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 41:17" />Di obo wɔ niate ni di kayoko nwu nsintɛɛ di kayi lɛkyɛ diasifi ni kakleklekɔ nwu kamɛ ku seyoyiɛ nwu suoto di sebo se simuu niate siakyi ni kakleklekɔ nwu kayi ku kamɛ, <verse eid="EZK 41:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 41:18" />baabla bakerubi ku awɔsɔ atembi baatika. Awɔsɔ lasisiɛ di bakerubi nwu sebo. Kerubi biala lawɛ anu anyɔ: <verse eid="EZK 41:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 41:19" />Anu ya niale ni otii anu lakyɔɔ anu ɔwɔsɔ di kakyɛ kanwii, anu ya niale ni kyata anu kafɔɔ lakyɔɔ anu ɔwɔsɔ di kakyɛ nyɔɔfa. Baabla nya amuu baatika di olekatakɔ nwu kamuu baakyisa. <verse eid="EZK 41:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 41:20" />Diayɔ ni di kayosɔ dialaadu ni di obo wɔ di kayoko nsintɛɛ yi, baabla bakerubi ku awɔsɔ baatika di kakleklekɔ kayi seyoyiɛ suoto.<verse eid="EZK 41:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Oleɔta Akyikye Ya Baabla Ni ku Kowoso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 41:21" />Olekatakɔ kayi lɛkyɛ nyokontũ sewoso lawɛ akɔ ana, n-se kafɔɔ niawɛ ni di Kakleklekɔ Kaamɛ Kakleklekɔ anu ladie nsinkpo. <verse eid="EZK 41:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZK 41:22" />Oleɔta akyikye ya baabla ni ku kowoso lɛtaka ninya labla nkpaa nnɔɔ, lɛkaana kafɔɔ labla nkpaa ntiɛ di akɔ nwu ana; akɔ ninya, nkpaa ninya ku sɛlɔɔkɔ ninya lale kowoso. Ni di osuɔtɔ nwu latɔkɔ mi alɛ, “Nnya opunu wɔ nin-yɛ ni di SAATE nwu anu.”<verse eid="EZK 41:22" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Leyo Nwu Akloo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZK 41:23" />Kakleklekɔ kayi lɛkyɛ ku Kakleklekɔ Kaamɛ Kakleklekɔ lawɛ akloo ya mansɛkɛtɛ ni akyuu nwu anyɔ. <verse eid="EZK 41:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZK 41:24" />Kokloo biala lawɛ nkyɛ nnyɔ- nkɔnii nnyɔ diata ni kokloo kakyɛ biala. <verse eid="EZK 41:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EZK 41:25" />Baabla kafɔɔ bakerubi ku awɔsɔ baatika di kakleklekɔ kayi lɛkyɛ akloo nwu fɛle n-ya baabla baatika ni di seyoyiɛ nwu suoto. Ni baayɔ kafɔɔ owoso baapɛ akpanta baasakasa di lɛkpata nwu anu nɛ. <verse eid="EZK 41:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EZK 41:26" />Basɛfle maamaa baabla awɔsɔ baatika ni di ɔfankyi biala lawɛ di lɛkpata seyoyiɛ nwu sɛlɔɔkɔ. Olekatakɔ nwu sɛlɔɔkɔ ayo kafɔɔ lawɛ akpanta.<verse eid="EZK 41:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 41" />
  <chapter number="42" style="c" sid="EZK 42" />
  <para style="s1">Ayo Anyɔ Ya Niatɛɛtɛɛ Ni Olekatakɔ Nwu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 42:1" />Ninfɛ di osuɔtɔ nwu lakpaa mi aasifiko kaflɔnkɔ nwu kayi lɛkyɛ katookasɔ, ni aakpaa mi aawako ayo nwu niakyɔɔ ni anu olekatakɔ nwu kaflɔnkɔ ku oyoyiɛ wɔ di kayi katookasɔ lɛkyɛ nɛ. <verse eid="EZK 42:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 42:2" />Leyo le kokloo niakyɔɔ ni anu katookasɔ lɛkyɛ lɛkaana labla kɔlafa-afosi-akuɔ nkpaa nnɛ, lɛblɛfɛ kafɔɔ labla afosi-anɛ nkpaa nna. <verse eid="EZK 42:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 42:3" />Aakya baawo di kaflɔnkɔ ka niale ni afosi-atiɛ nkpaa nna diayɔ ni di kaflɔnkɔ ka kaamɛ diakyɔɔ ni anu kafɔɔ di kaflɔnkɔ kafenkɔ ka baatɛ ni afuɔ kaasɔ di kayi lɛkyɛ, sebombo late siakyɔɔ bawo anu di ayo ya beetofo ni di sitika sitiɛ kamɛ. <verse eid="EZK 42:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 42:4" />Osuku late kaamɛ di ayo nwu anu, lɛblɛfɛ ninwu labla lefosi nkpaa nkuɛnsĩ, lɛkaana kafɔɔ labla kɔlafa-afosi-akuɔ nkpaa nnɛ. Akloo lɛma lawɛ di katookasɔ lɛkyɛ. <verse eid="EZK 42:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 42:5" />Nioso yi, koyoe ko niatika ni di osi lamaamaa, diekye sebombo nwu lafũ obo kpinwu sialenkee koyoe ko niawɛ ni di kalɔ ku ayo nwu ntɛɛntɛɛ ale. <verse eid="EZK 42:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 42:6" />Koyoe ko niatika ni di ditika tiɛfa suoto ditawɛ akpaka, fɛ mmle di nflɔnkɔ nwu lawɛ nii; nioso n-ya niatika ni di osi labiibii aalenkee n-ya niawɛ ni di kalɔ ku ntɛɛntɛɛ. <verse eid="EZK 42:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 42:7" />Oyoyiɛ onwii lakyɔɔ anu koyoe nwu kaflɔnkɔ ka niawɛ ni di kayi lɛkyɛ; lɛkaana ninwu labla afosi-anɛ nkpaa nna dialaadu ayo nwu anu. <verse eid="EZK 42:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 42:8" />Diekye di koyoe ko niayila ni di lɛkyɛ le niakaako ni kaflɔnkɔ ka di kayi lɛkyɛ labla afosi-anyɔ nkpaa nna, n-ya kafɔɔ niatɛ aayila aakaako ni kakleklekɔ nwu lɛkaana labla kɔlafa-afosi-akuɔ nkpaa nna. <verse eid="EZK 42:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 42:9" />Kalɔ koyoe nwu lawɛ kayoko di kufĩkatunkɔ lɛkyɛ di otii nkye ni kaflɔnkɔ ka di kayi lɛkyɛ ambuo nya ni kamɛ.<verse eid="EZK 42:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 42:10" />Di kalakasɔ lɛkyɛ diofe ni kaflɔnkɔ ka di kayi lɛkyɛ, diakya ni di olekatakɔ kaflɔnkɔ nwu niakyɔɔ ni anu oyoyiɛ wɔ di kayi lɛkyɛ yi, ayo lawɛ <verse eid="EZK 42:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 42:11" />di nfenkɔ late di anu lɛma. N-ya mmle late fɛle ayo ya niawɛ ni di katookasɔ lɛkyɛ; lɛkaana ku lɛblɛfɛ lɛnya lale ninwii, n-yoko ku n-yokontũ lɛma lale ni okle onwii. Fɛ mmle di n-yokontũ okle onwii late ni di katookasɔ yi, <verse eid="EZK 42:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 42:12" />nkpo kafɔɔ di n-yokontũ late di kalakasɔ ayo nwu nɛ. Kayokontũ lawɛ di osuku nwu kasɔkakyekɔ kuakaa di oyoyiɛ wɔ niakyɔɔ ni anu kufĩkatunkɔ, di otii nfe ambuo ni ayo nwu kamɛ.<verse eid="EZK 42:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 42:13" />Ninfɛ aatɔkɔ mi alɛ, “Katookasɔ ku kalakasɔ ayo ya niɛkyɔɔ ni anu olekatakɔ kaflɔnkɔ nwu nle olebatatɛ ale, lɛba le di olebatatɛ ba nintɛɛtɛɛ ni SAATE nwu kamale asaaɔta ya niɛtɛ eeklekle alenke ni nɛ. Nfa babatɛ asaaɔta ya niɛtɛ eeklekle alenke ni nɛ- alesaa asaaɔta, okpile asaaɔta ku lɛpɔɔ okpi asaaɔta- diekye lɛba nwu leklekle. <verse eid="EZK 42:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 42:14" />Nse olebatatɛ nwu lɛnya beebuo kakleklekɔ nwu yi, dinaa alɛ beedie bɛɛwa kaflɔnkɔ ka di kayi lɛkyɛ diɛlaase di obe wɔ beediki ni akpeele ya kamɛ basi bɔɔbla ni kasumu ɔkpɛ bɛɛtɛ nii, diekye asaa klekle ale. Akpeele bamba dikpeni beekpee fiɛ bɛɛtɛɛtɛɛ aba ya ninle ni batii ale.”<verse eid="EZK 42:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Olekatakɔ Kayilakɔ Nwu Ɔklapoosa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 42:15" />Aaloo ni olekatakɔ nwu kamɛ ɔklapoosa yi, aakpaa mi aafenko di kufĩkatunkɔ kayoko aadieko, ni aaklapoosa olekatakɔ kayi lɛkyɛ kamuu aafenko nɛ: <verse eid="EZK 42:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 42:16" />Aaklapoosa kufĩkatunkɔ lɛkyɛ ku lɛklapoosaa kawesee nwu; diabla nkpaa alafa-anɛ-afosi-ana. <verse eid="EZK 42:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 42:17" />Aaklapoosa katookasɔ lɛkyɛ; diabla nkpaa alafa-anɛ-afosi-ana di lɛklapoosaa kawesee nwu. <verse eid="EZK 42:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 42:18" />Aaklapoosa kalakasɔ lɛkyɛ; diabla nkpaa alafa-anɛ-afosi-ana di lɛklapoosaa kawesee nwu. <verse eid="EZK 42:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 42:19" />Ninfɛ aamunikĩi aafe kufĩkamɛɛkɔ lɛkyɛ, aalaaklapoosa nɛ; diabla nkpaa alafa-anɛ-afosi-ana di lɛklapoosaa kawesee nwu. <verse eid="EZK 42:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 42:20" />Nioso aaklapoosa nkyɛ nwu nna mmuu. Olekatakɔ nwu lawɛ oyoyiɛ kuakyisa nwu, lɛkaana labla nkpaa alafa-anɛ-afosi-ana, lɛblɛfɛ kafɔɔ labla nkpaa alafa-anɛ-afosi-ana, alɛ diablasa asaa ya nieklekle ni di n-ya ninanklekle ni suoto.<verse eid="EZK 42:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 42" />
  <chapter number="43" style="c" sid="EZK 43" />
  <para style="s1">SAATE Nwu Leklekle Lapɛakple Aawa Olekatakɔ Nwu Kamɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 43:1" />Ninfɛ di osuɔtɔ nwu lakpaa mi aawako kayoko ka niakyɔɔ ni anu kufĩkatunkɔ nɛ. <verse eid="EZK 43:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 43:2" />Ni lanya Israel Yaa nwu leklekle lakye kufĩkatunkɔ diatɔɔwa nɛ. Sɛlɔ nɔɔ late fɛle okle wɔ nikobiɛ kunfe ni diwi, leklekle nɔɔ kafɔɔ lata kasɔ lakpa. <verse eid="EZK 43:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 43:3" />Odikiotuo wɔ lanya ni late fɛle odiki otuo wɔ lanya ni di obe wɔ aawa ni okpoo kplɛ nwu ɔwɔɔsa, fɛle odiki otuo wɔ kafɔɔ lanya ni di Kebar Okle kotoko, ni lafuusa anu kaasɔ nɛ. <verse eid="EZK 43:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 43:4" />Ni di SAATE nwu leklekle labuo olekatakɔ nwu di kayoko ka niakyɔɔ ni anu kufĩkatunkɔ nɛ. <verse eid="EZK 43:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 43:5" />Ninfɛ di Ninwuna nwu lakɛnkɛ mi aakpaa mi aawako kaflɔnkɔ ka kaamɛ kamɛ, ni di SAATE nwu leklekle layii olekatakɔ nwu kamɛ pɔ nɛ.<verse eid="EZK 43:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 43:6" />Di obe wɔ di osuɔtɔ nwu layila mi ni di ɔlɔɔkɔ yi, lanu otii onwii latɔɔkakatɛ aatɔɔtɛɛ aatookyeko ni olekatakɔ nwu kamɛ. <verse eid="EZK 43:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 43:7" />Ni aabuɛ alɛ: “Otii obi, lɛba le mmle ninle lɛkakpomii nii kayilakɔ ku nkpaa nii kasekɔ nɛ. Lɛba le mmle kamasiɛ di Israel batii kamɛ dinaa ni kaloo. Israel batii dilɔbasinkpɔnɔfɔsa leyooto nii klekle nwu diidii- mma bamu ee baka lɛma- di lɛsɔnɔkpee lɛma kamɛ ku baka lɛma bakpi ba di ntakalekɔ lɛma nwu. <verse eid="EZK 43:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 43:8" />Man-yɔ ni n-yokontũ sewoso lɛma mankaakosa ni n-yokontũ nii, man-yɔ ni kafɔɔ akloo lɛma mankpee ni di akloo nii ɔlɔɔkɔ, di oyoyiɛ lete ninsi ni di ami ku mma ntɛɛ. Mankpɔnɔfɔsa leyooto nii di ayududusaa lɛma ɔbla kamɛ. Nioso lawɔɔsa ma di ɔblɔ nii kamɛ. <verse eid="EZK 43:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 43:9" />Nunua yi, ta ma bakyisa lɛsɔnɔkpee lɛma nwu ku baka lɛma bakpi nwu di anu nii, ni kamasiɛ di kamɛ lɛma dinaa ni kaloo.<verse eid="EZK 43:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 43:10" />“Afɔ Otii obi, diki mmle di olekatakɔ nwu nte ni fatuo Israel batii nwu, alɛ sinunsɔ kakpɛ ma di sikpile lɛma suoto. Ta ma babu nwu banyu, <verse eid="EZK 43:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 43:11" />ni nse sinunsɔ lɛkpɛ ma di asaa ya amuu batɔɔbla ni yi, faata ma batofo olekatakɔ nwu letembi- mmle beese nini, mbuokɔ nini ku ndiekɔ nini- letembi nini nimuu ku sɛsaabla nini ku afiofa nini amuu. Kpana asaa ya mmle fatɛ di anu lɛma, di mmle baale ni onukwale manta ni letembi nini, mantikanko ni sɛsaabla nini simuu.<verse eid="EZK 43:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 43:12" />“N-ya mmle ninle olekatakɔ nwu kufiofa nɛ: Aba ya amuu niɛmana eekyi ni di kobokote nwu osi kamatɛ ambla klekle nwaa. Nkpo ninle olekatakɔ nwu kufiofa nɛ.<verse eid="EZK 43:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Oleɔta Akyikye Nwu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 43:13" />“Nnya oleɔta akyikye nwu ɔklapoosa di nkpaa lɛkaana kanya, lɛklapoosaa nwu lɛkaana lɛbla kɔkpaa kunwii ku ɔfã: Oleɔta akyikye okplo wɔ baabɛ ni lekyofo labla kɔkpaa kunwii ku ɔfã, atokosi nini lɛblɛfɛ kafɔɔ labla anɛɛkpa anaasĩ diakyi. Oleɔta akyikye nwu lɛtaka ninle nle nɛ: <verse eid="EZK 43:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 43:14" />Diayɔ ni di okplo di kasɔ dialaadu ni amuusi nini, kalɔ lɛkyɛ lɛtaka labla nkpaa ntiɛ, lɛblɛfɛ kafɔɔ anɛɛkpa afosi-anyɔ, diayɔ ni di amuusi nini di kabiibiikɔ lɛkyɛ dialaadu ni di kakplɛkɔ lɛtaka labla nkpaa nkuɛnsĩ, lɛblɛfɛ kafɔɔ anɛɛkpa afosi-anyɔ. <verse eid="EZK 43:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 43:15" />Oleɔta akyikye nwu ɔtɔ kakutaakɔ lɛtaka labla nkpaa nkuɛnsĩ, akya ana kafɔɔ layila aakyɔɔ ni osi di ɔtɔ kakutaakɔ nwu kamɛ. <verse eid="EZK 43:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 43:16" />Oleɔta akyikye ɔtɔ kakutaakɔ akɔ ana nwu lakyɛkyɛ, lɛtaka ninya labla nkpaa afosi-anyɔ, lɛblɛfɛ kafɔɔ labla nkpaa afosi-anyɔ. <verse eid="EZK 43:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 43:17" />Osi amuusi kafɔɔ akɔ ana nwu lakyɛkyɛ, lɛkaana labla nkpaa afosi-anyɔ-nna, lɛblɛfɛ kafɔɔ labla nkpaa afosi-anyɔ-nna, atokosi ya baatika baakyisa ni labla anɛɛkpa lefosi, lekyofo kafɔɔ labla anɛɛkpa afosi-anyɔ diakyisa nimuu. Oleɔta akyikye nwu nkatakɔ lakyɔɔ anu kufĩkatunkɔ.”<verse eid="EZK 43:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Oleɔta Akyikye Nwu Okleklesa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 43:18" />Ninfɛ di osuɔtɔ nwu latɔkɔ mi alɛ, “Otii obi, nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE Kplɛ nwu kobuɛ ni alɛ: N-ya mmle nimale oleɔta sɛsaabla anta ni ofiɛ asaaɔta ku ntɔ ɔnwanwanyi di oleɔta akyikye suoto nse beetofo nya ni: <verse eid="EZK 43:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 43:19" />Dikpeni fɛɛyɔ lɛnankyuebi-suɔtɔ fɛɛta fɛ okpile asaaɔta fɛɛta olebatatɛ ba ninle ni Lewi batii, beekye ni Sadok leyo kamɛ, man-wa mamabla ni kasumu sɛsaabla di anu nii, SAATE Kplɛ nwu niebuɛ. <verse eid="EZK 43:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 43:20" />Dikpeni fɛɛyɔ ntɔ nɔɔ nwo feekpekpete di oleɔta akyikye akya nwu ana suoto ku osi amuusi akɔ nwu ana suoto, faakpekpete fakyisa kafɔɔ atokosi ninya amuu. Nkpo fabakleklesa oleɔta akyikye, fambla lekoto otikiti fanta nya nɛ. <verse eid="EZK 43:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 43:21" />Dikpeni fɛɛyɔ nankyue-suɔtɔ fɛɛta okpile asaaɔta, fanfiɛ ni kafɔɔ di lɛba le beediki bɛɛtɛ ni di olekatakɔ nwu ɔlɔɔkɔ di kakleklekɔ nwu kayi lɛkyɛ.<verse eid="EZK 43:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZK 43:22" />“Di dii nyɔɔfa suoto, dikpeni fɛɛyɔ katiekpaa ka ninaa ni kɔbɔ fɛɛta okpile asaaɔta. Dikpeni feekleklesa oleɔta akyikye nwu fɛ mmle baakleklesa nya ni ku nankyue-suɔtɔ. <verse eid="EZK 43:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZK 43:23" />Nse feeloo oleɔta akyikye nwu okleklesa yi, dikpeni feediki nankyue-suɔtɔ ku dikunumuu feekyeko babɔkɛɛ sele kamɛ fɛɛta asaaɔta, di akyuu nwu anyɔ nnaa ni kɔbɔ. <verse eid="EZK 43:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZK 43:24" />Dikpeni fɛɛyɔ ma fɛɛtɛ di SAATE nwu anu, dikpeni olebatatɛ kafɔɔ lɛnwanwanyi mmba nin-nya suoto, bɛɛyɔ nya bɛɛta oleɔta bɛɛta SAATE nwu fɛ ofiɛ asaaɔta.<verse eid="EZK 43:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EZK 43:25" />“Ta katiekpaa kanwii dii biala di ayi akuɛnsĩ kamɛ diɛta ni okpile asaaɔta; faata kafɔɔ lɛnankyuebi-suɔtɔ ninwii ku dikunumuu ninwii, di akyuu nwu anyɔ banaa ni kɔbɔ fakyeko babɔkɛɛ sele kamɛ. <verse eid="EZK 43:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EZK 43:26" />Ayi akuɛnsĩ dikpeni bɛɛbla lekoto otikiti bɛɛta oleɔta akyikye nwu baakleklesa nya; nkpo kanya babadiki nya kayi nɛ. <verse eid="EZK 43:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EZK 43:27" />Di ayi ya mmle kayɛntɛkɔ, diɛyɔ ni di dii nɛnle suoto diesifi ni yi, olebatatɛ kamata ofiɛ asaaɔta ku atoko ɔkyɛ ole asaaɔta lee di oleɔta akyikye nwu suoto. Ni kamafũ ye, SAATE Kplɛ nwu niebuɛ.”<verse eid="EZK 43:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 43" />
  <chapter number="44" style="c" sid="EZK 44" />
  <para style="s1">Mmle Baablako Ni Kufĩkatunkɔ Kayoko Ɔkpɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 44:1" />Ninfɛ di osuɔtɔ nwu lakplesa mi aawako kayoko ka di kakleklekɔ nwu kayi lɛkyɛ, nka niakyɔɔ ni anu kufĩkatunkɔ, baasɛɛ ka nii. <verse eid="EZK 44:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 44:2" />Ni di SAATE nwu latɔkɔ mi alɛ, “Dikpeni bɛɛsɛɛ kayoko ka mmle beese. Dinaa alɛ bɛɛsɛkɛtɛ ka; otii kuonwii dilaafe ninka kamɛ abuo. Dikpeni bɛɛsɛɛ ka beese, diekye SAATE Israel Yaa nwu, ntoobuo ninka eefe. <verse eid="EZK 44:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 44:3" />Ɔka nwu omu lete ninkafuo osiɛ di kayoko nwu kamɛ anle alesaa di SAATE nwu anu. Afe di osuku wɔ ninte ni di lɛkpata kayoko osuku abuo, aafe di osuku nwu onwii adie.”<verse eid="EZK 44:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 44:4" />Ninfɛ di osuɔtɔ nwu lakpaa mi aafenko di katookasɔ kayoko aasifiko olekatakɔ nwu anu nɛ. Lanyunyu, ni lanya SAATE nwu leklekle latooyii SAATE nwu olekatakɔ kamɛ nɛ. Ni lafuusa anu kaasɔ nɛ.<verse eid="EZK 44:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 44:5" />Ni di SAATE nwu latɔkɔ mi alɛ, “Otii obi, tɛ anu kaasɔ fanyu, lolaafanu nwaa, faalolaa atoko fakyɔɔ di ɔlaa biala lɛtɔkɔ fɔ lekyeko ni sɛsaabla nwu simuu di SAATE nwu olekatakɔ suoto. Ta anu lɛfɔ atika di olekatakɔ nwu mbuokɔ ku ndiekɔ nwu mmuu di kakleklekɔ nwu suoto. <verse eid="EZK 44:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 44:6" />Tɔkɔ Israel batii batokopĩtɛ nwu falɛ, ‘Nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE Kplɛ nwu kobuɛ ni alɛ: Oo Israel batii, ayududusaa lee sɛsaabla nfɛ mpɔ! <verse eid="EZK 44:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 44:7" />Diɛkyakaa ni di ayududusaa sɛsaabla nwu simuu bamba suoto yi, biɛkpaa bafɔɔ ba ninankyɛlɛnsa ni suoto di otu kamɛ ku suoto sina kamɛ biɛbakpee di kakleklekɔ nii kamɛ, biɛkpɔnɔfɔsa olekatakɔ nii, di obe wɔ mintɛɛ ni alesaa, lɛla ku ntɔ, biɛlalaasa kafɔɔ kanya ninii nii nwu. <verse eid="EZK 44:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 44:8" />Di obe wɔ dikaatɛ alɛ biɛbla ni ɔkpɛ lee di akleklesaa nii kanya, ni biɛyɔ batii bamba biese di kakleklekɔ nii kanya nɛ. <verse eid="EZK 44:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 44:9" />Nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE Kplɛ nwu kobuɛ ni alɛ: Dinaa alɛ ɔfɔɔ kuonwii wɔ ninankyɛlɛnsa ni suoto di otu ku suoto sina kamɛ lebuo kakleklekɔ nii nwu, bia bafɔɔ ba ninsi ni di Israel batii kamɛ nnaa osuku.<verse eid="EZK 44:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Baadiki Lewi Batii Di Olebatatɛ Ɔsaabla Kamɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 44:10" />“ ‘Lewi batii ba niadie ni di ɔkyɛ nii baasifi ni fanfa, di obe wɔ di Israel batii layu ni osuku, baalalaa baakyi baalaatikanko ni afiɔ lɛma yi, dikpeni sikpile lɛma letokonanfi ntika di suoto lɛma. <verse eid="EZK 44:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 44:11" />Babafuo ɔkpɛ ɔbla di kakleklekɔ nii, manyila di olekatakɔ nwu n-yoko kanya, mambla ɔkpɛ kafɔɔ nini kamɛ; babafuo ofiɛ asaaɔta ku seleɔta babɔkɛɛ olo ɔta batii, manyila kafɔɔ di batii anu mambla ɔkpɛ nwu manta ma. <verse eid="EZK 44:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 44:12" />Kafɔɔ ta baabla ɔkpɛ baata ma ni di afiɔtii lɛma anu, baata ni kafɔɔ Israel batii labla ni sikpile oso yi, nkpo oso lakplesa kɔnɛɛ nii katoo laka ntam nlɛ, dikpeni sikpile lɛma letokonanfi nwu letika di suoto lɛma, SAATE Kplɛ nwu niebuɛ. <verse eid="EZK 44:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 44:13" />Banaa osuku mantɛɛtɛɛ mi alɛ bɔɔbabla ɔkpɛ nii fɛ olebatatɛ ee batɛɛtɛɛ akleklesaa nii kuninwii ee asaaɔta nii ya niɛtɛ eeklekle nii; dikpeni ayududusaa sɛsaabla lɛma nwu sinunsɔ letika di suoto lɛma. <verse eid="EZK 44:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 44:14" />Kafɔɔ akpakpa dite yi, kamayɔ ma nse di olekatakɔ nwu sɛkpɛ kanya ku sɛkpɛ se simuu dikpeni bɛɛbla ni niini kamɛ.<verse eid="EZK 44:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Olebatatɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 44:15" />“ ‘Kafɔɔ olebatatɛ ba ninle ni Lewi batii ku Sadok banantii ba niabla ni kakleklekɔ nii nwu sɛkpɛ di onukwale ole kamɛ di obe wɔ di Israel batii layu osuku baadie ni di ɔkyɛ nii baasifi ni yi, mma batɛɛtɛɛ mi baabla kasumu ɔkpɛ di anu nii; bayila di anu nii, baata lɛla ku ntɔ seleɔta. SAATE Kplɛ nwu niebuɛ. <verse eid="EZK 44:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 44:16" />Mma lete dikpeni beebuo kakleklekɔ nii nwu nɛ; mma lete dikpeni beekpukuti bɛɛtɛɛtɛɛ opunu nii bɛɛbla kasumu ɔkpɛ di anu nii, mambla kafɔɔ ɔkpɛ nii nɛ.<verse eid="EZK 44:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 44:17" />“ ‘Nse beebuo kaflɔnkɔ ka kaamɛ n-yoko yi, dikpeni beekpee akpeele fututu fɛnɛnɛɛ; dinaa alɛ beekpee bɔkɛɛ sinwini akpeele kuninwii di obe wɔ bɔɔbla ni kasumu ɔkpɛ di kaflɔnkɔ ka kaamɛ n-yoko nwu ee di olekatakɔ nwu kamɛ. <verse eid="EZK 44:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 44:18" />Dikpeni beenii asi aniisaa fututu fɛnɛnɛɛ di asi lɛma, kalɔ akpeele fututu fɛnɛnɛɛ kafɔɔ di sɛtɔ lɛma. Dinaa alɛ mankpee lɛsaa kuninwii nimata ma mankpɛ ni apipi. <verse eid="EZK 44:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 44:19" />Nse beedie bɛɛkyɛ kaflɔnkɔ ka di kayi lɛkyɛ di lɛba le di batii nkpe ni yi, dikpeni beediki akpeele ya kamɛ beesiɛ bɛɛbla ni kasumu ɔkpɛ, badiɛ nya batɛ di ayo klekle nwu kamɛ, baakpee akpeele bamba, di mmle manaakleklesa ni batii nwu ku akpeele lɛma nwu.<verse eid="EZK 44:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 44:20" />“ ‘Dinaa alɛ bɛɛkpaasu asi lɛma ee bata asi lɛma layii, kafɔɔ banwiɛ asi lɛma obe lele. <verse eid="EZK 44:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 44:21" />Oletatɛ kuonwii atan-nyi nta nse eebuo kaflɔnkɔ ka kaamɛ. <verse eid="EZK 44:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZK 44:22" />Dinaa alɛ bɛɛyɔ bakpisɔfɔ ee basanko ba beesĩ nii; kokpeelebitɛ ko ninle ni Israel batii ee olebatatɛ bakpisɔfɔ lete baafuo ɔyɔ. <verse eid="EZK 44:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZK 44:23" />Dikpeni beetuo batii nii dikyi le ninsi ni di lekleklesaa ku nle ninanklekle nii, beetuo ma kafɔɔ mmle baakpee ni kasɛ di lɛsaa le niɛkpa ni kɔmɛ ku nle ninankpa ni kɔmɛ ntɛɛ.<verse eid="EZK 44:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZK 44:24" />“ ‘Di kalɔ́ lele kamɛ yi, olebatatɛ dikpeni beele bakantɛ bɛɛka lɛka nwu di afiofa nii kanya. Dikpeni beemufũ afiofa nii ku sɛsaabla nii beeklee bɛɛta ayi finle nii ya amuu lɛtɛ nii, dikpeni bɛɛbla kafɔɔ Lɛnyɛɛtɛyi nii klekle.<verse eid="EZK 44:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EZK 44:25" />“ ‘Diɛkaatɛ alɛ oletatɛ lɛtɛɛtɛɛ otii wɔ nintookpi nii ɛɛkpɔnɔfɔsa ni suoto nɔɔ; kafɔɔ, nse otii wɔ niekpi ni lale ote ee ɔya, obisuɔtɔbi ee obisankobi, obilɛma-suɔtɔbi ee obilɛma-sankobi wɔ ninadiyɔ ni kɔsa yi, ni aafuo suoto nɔɔ ɔkpɔnɔfɔsa. <verse eid="EZK 44:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EZK 44:26" />Di suoto nɔɔ okleklesa sɛmaa yi, dikpeni eesiɛ ayi akuɛnsĩ fiɛ di suoto nɔɔ kamaklekle. <verse eid="EZK 44:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EZK 44:27" />Di dii le suoto ababuo ni kakleklekɔ nwu kaflɔnkɔ ka kaamɛ alɛ ɔɔlaabla ni kasumu ɔkpɛ yi, dikpeni ɛɛta okpile asaaɔta ɛɛta suoto nɔɔ, SAATE Kplɛ nwu niebuɛ.<verse eid="EZK 44:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="EZK 44:28" />“ ‘Lete nii nimale atesaa ya di olebatatɛ nkpe nii. Diɛkaatɛ alɛ biɛta ma lɛsaawɛ kuninwii di Israel; ami nimale ma lɛsaawɛ. <verse eid="EZK 44:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EZK 44:29" />Babale alesaa asaaɔta, okpile asaaɔta ku lɛpɔɔ okpi asaaɔta; ku lɛsaa biala di Israel beediki bɛɛta ni SAATE nwu kamale ma ale. <verse eid="EZK 44:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EZK 44:30" />Alesaa kasale biene lee amuu ku akyɛsaa finle lee amuu kamale olebatatɛ nwu ale. Dikpeni biɛyɔ kasɔ lee alesaa kasale biɛta ma alɛ lɛtɔtrɔ kawa di leyo lɛfɔ kamɛ batii suoto. <verse eid="EZK 44:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EZK 44:31" />Olebatatɛ nnaa osuku beele kansiɛ ee bɔkɛɛ wɔ bɛɛnya alɛ eekpi ate ni ee di babɔkɛɛ yakayaka lɛbɛbɛɛ nii.<verse eid="EZK 44:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 44" />
  <chapter number="45" style="c" sid="EZK 45" />
  <para style="s1">SAATE Nwu Kalekɔ Di Kasɔ Nwu Suoto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 45:1" />“ ‘Nse biɛsɛ kasɔ nwu fɛ atesaa yi, biediki kasɔ nwu lɛba lewo bitɛ lete bita SAATE nwu fɛ kasɔ klekle, di lɛkaana dibla nkpaa nkpe alafa ana afosi-anyɔ, lɛblɛfɛ kafɔɔ nkpaa nkpe alafa-atiɛ-afosi-atiɛ nkpe nkuɔ; obo nwu omuu kamale lɛba klekle. <verse eid="EZK 45:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 45:2" />Di obo wɔ mmle kamɛ yi, badiki kasɔ nwu lɛba nkpaa nkpe alafa-anɛ-afosi-ana, di akɔ nwu ana nkyɛkyɛ ni bata kakleklekɔ nwu, di nkpaa afosi-anɛ-nna kafɔɔ kale kasɔ fukuti kakyisa kakleklekɔ nwu. <verse eid="EZK 45:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 45:3" />Di kasɔ klekle nwu yi, biklapoosa lɛba di lɛkaana nle ni nkpaa nkpe alafa-ana-afosi-anyɔ, lɛblɛfɛ kafɔɔ nkpaa nkpe kɔlafa-afosi-akuɔ-nnɛ bitɛ. Nka kamɛ di kakleklekɔ nwu, Kakleklekɔ Kaakleklekɔ kamawɛ nɛ. <verse eid="EZK 45:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 45:4" />Kabale kasɔ klekle kanta olebatatɛ ba nimbla ni kasumu ɔkpɛ di kakleklekɔ nwu kamɛ, mankpukuti mantɛɛtɛɛ mambla ni kafɔɔ kasumu ɔkpɛ di SAATE nwu anu. Kabale lɛba kanta olebatatɛ ayo kasekɔ ku lɛba klekle ninta kakleklekɔ nwu. <verse eid="EZK 45:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 45:5" />Lɛba bamba di lɛkaana lɛbla ni nkpaa nkpe alafa-ana-afosi-ana-nnyɔ, lɛblɛfɛ kafɔɔ lɛbla ni nkpaa nkpe kɔlafa-afosi-akuɔ-nnɛ kamale Lewi batii kale, fɛ lɛsaawɛ lɛma diɛta ni sekpoo se kamɛ babasiɛ nii.<verse eid="EZK 45:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 45:6" />“ ‘Bidiki lɛba bita okpoo kplɛ nwu fɛ kalekɔ nɔɔ, di lɛba klekle nwu ɔlɔɔkɔ; kabale Israel batii bamuu kale. Lɛblɛfɛ dibla nkpaa nkpe afosi-anɛ-nna di lɛkaana kafɔɔ dibla nkpaa nkpe-alafa-ana-afosi-anyɔ.<verse eid="EZK 45:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɔka Kasɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 45:7" />“ ‘Ɔka kamawɛ kasɔ ante kɔmɛ di ɔfankyi biala di kasɔ klekle nwu ku okpoo kplɛ nwu kasɔ. Kasɔ nwu kamayɔ di kufĩkamɛɛkɔ kansifi kufĩkamɛɛkɔ lɛkyɛ, kan-yɔ di kufĩkatunkɔ kansifi kufĩkatunkɔ lɛkyɛ. Kabayɔ lɛkaana kanya di kufĩkamɛɛkɔ kanaadu kufĩkatunkɔ kɔmɛ suoto, kankaatɛɛ ku anà nwu kasɔ kanwii kale suoto. <verse eid="EZK 45:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 45:8" />Kasɔ ka mmle nimale ɔka lɛsaawɛ di Israel nɛ. Ni baka nii dilɔbasinnyinka batii nii, kafɔɔ babata Israel batii nklee kasɔ nwu di ana lɛma kanya.<verse eid="EZK 45:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Afiofa Ɛɛta Ni Baka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 45:9" />“ ‘Nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE Kplɛ nwu kobuɛ ni alɛ: Oo Israel baka! Bitoosii ɔkyɛ, bidiɛ amumu ku ninyinka lee nwu, biɛbla lɛsaa le ninlɛ, diesiɛko ni kafɔɔ. Bidiɛ lɛsaawɛ ofũ di batii nii nnɛɛ, SAATE Kplɛ nwu niebuɛ. <verse eid="EZK 45:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 45:10" />Biyɔ akadisaa ya niewo ni biblako ɔkpɛ, kankyi wɔ niewo ni ku lɛkyafi le niewo ni. <verse eid="EZK 45:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 45:11" />Dikpeni kankyi ku lɛkyafi lɛkyɛkyɛ, bakpoko lefosi ninsiɛ di lɛkyafi ninwii kamɛ, abɛɛsibii lefosi kafɔɔ asiɛ di kankyi kamɛ; lɛbɛsibii dile lɛkadisaa dita akyuu nwu anyɔ. <verse eid="EZK 45:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 45:12" />Gera afosi-anyɔ disiɛ di sekel onwii kamɛ. Sekel afosi-anyɔ ku sekel afosi-anyɔ-anɔɔ ku sekel lefosi-anɔɔ ale mina onwii.<verse eid="EZK 45:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Asaaɔta Ku Ayi Klekle</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 45:13" />“ ‘Nnya atasaa finle ya dikpeni biɛta ni: Bibadiki lɛbɛsibii kuɔnle minkyeko kamɔɔ kankyi biala kamɛ, mindiki kafɔɔ lɛbɛsibii kuɔnle minkyeko atitabi kankyi biala kamɛ. <verse eid="EZK 45:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 45:14" />Di nnɔnyi lɛkyɛ, bɛɛyɔ kpoko bɛɛklapoosa ni yi, badiki kpoko onwii bakyeko lɛkyafi biala kamɛ (bakpoko lefosi ninsi di lɛkyafi ninwii kamɛ, bakpoko lefosi lɛkyɛkyɛ ku lɛkyafi ninwii). <verse eid="EZK 45:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 45:15" />Badiki kafɔɔ foso onwii bakyeko bafoso alafa-anyɔ biala ba ninsi ni lɛla nwaa kamɛ, di Israel babɔkɛɛ sɛfa kaweekɔ nwaa suoto. N-ya mmle babayɔ manta alesaa asaaɔta, ofiɛ asaaɔta ku atoko ɔkyɛ ole asaaɔta mambla lekoto otikiti manta batii nɛ, SAATE Kplɛ nwu niebuɛ. <verse eid="EZK 45:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 45:16" />Dikpeni kasɔ nwu batii bamuu lɛyɔ nwu ole di asaa finle ya mmle ɔta kamɛ diɛta ni Israel ɔka ɔkpɛ ɔblako. <verse eid="EZK 45:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 45:17" />Ɔka ɔkpɛ kubale alɛ ɛɛta ofiɛ asaaɔta, alesaa asaaɔta ku nta asaaɔta ɛɛta ayi nwu nlekɔ, Awɛntɛ Fɔle ku Anyɛɛtɛyi- di ayi ole ya amuu bɛɛta ni di Israel batii kamɛ. Nnwɔɔ nimata okpile asaaɔta, alesaa asaaɔta, ofiɛ asaaɔta ku atoko ɔkyɛ ole asaaɔta man-yɔ mambla lekoto otikiti manta Israel batii nɛ.<verse eid="EZK 45:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ayi Finle Ole</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 45:18" />“ ‘Nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE Kplɛ nwu kobuɛ ni alɛ: Di kɔwɛntɛ kasale dii kasale suoto yi, biyɔ lɛnankyuebi-suɔtɔ le ninaa ni kɔbɔ bikleklesa kakleklekɔ nwu. <verse eid="EZK 45:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 45:19" />Oletatɛ ayɔ okpile asaaɔta ntɔ nwu afifia di olekatakɔ nwu kayokontũ, afifia di oleɔta akyikye amuusi nkyakɔ nwu nna suoto ku kaflɔnkɔ ka kaamɛ n-yokontũ suoto. <verse eid="EZK 45:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 45:20" />Bibla nkpo okle di kɔwɛntɛ nwu dii kuɛnsinle suoto bita otii lele niɛbla okpile ninanle ɔtɛ ɛɛtɛ ɛɛbla ni ee di ɔtantofo kamɛ; nkpo biɛbla lekoto otikiti bita olekatakɔ nwu nɛ.<verse eid="EZK 45:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 45:21" />“ ‘Bile Okpi Diisi Ofe Dii nwu di Israel batii kɔwɛntɛ kasale suoto. Di lefosi dii naafa suoto yi, bile dii nwu ayi akuɛnsĩ, di obe wɔ mmle kamɛ, biele bloblo wɔ di lɛnyankasaa diesi ni kaamɛ. <verse eid="EZK 45:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZK 45:22" />Di dii nwu nkpo kale yi, ɔka ata nankyue-suɔtɔ fɛ okpile asaaɔta ata suoto nɔɔ ku kasɔ nwu batii bamuu. <verse eid="EZK 45:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZK 45:23" />Di Ayi akuɛnsĩ nwu olebee kamɛ yi, dikpeni ɔka lɛta banankyue-suɔtɔ bakuɛnsĩ ku akunumuu akuɛnsĩ ba ninaa ni kɔbɔ fɛ ofiɛ asaaɔta dii biala ɛɛta SAATE nwu. Aayɔ katiekpaa kafɔɔ ata diɛta ni okpile asaaɔta. <verse eid="EZK 45:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZK 45:24" />Dikpeni ɛɛta kamɔɔ kankyi onwii ɛɛkaasa di nankyue-suɔtɔ biala suoto, ɛɛta kafɔɔ kamɔɔ kankyi onwii ɛɛkaasa di dikunumuu biala suoto, diɛkyakaa ni di nnɔfɔ kpoko onwii suoto diɛta ni kamɔɔ kankyi biala.<verse eid="EZK 45:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EZK 45:25" />“ ‘Di ayi akuɛnsĩ Dii nwu ole wɔ ninkye ni kasɔ di Israel batii kɔwɛntɛ kuɛnsinle kamɛ di lefosi dii nɔnle suoto yi, dikpeni ankple anta asaa nwu okle anta okpile asaaɔta, ofiɛ asaaɔta, alesaa asaaɔta ku nnɔfɔ.<verse eid="EZK 45:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 45" />
  <chapter number="46" style="c" sid="EZK 46" />
  <para style="s1">Ɔka Ku Ayi Ole</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 46:1" />“ ‘Nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE Kplɛ nwu kobuɛ ni alɛ: Basɛɛ kaflɔnkɔ ka kaamɛ niɛkyɔɔ ni anu kufĩkatunkɔ di ayi akuɔ ya mambla ni ɔkpɛ suoto. Kafɔɔ basɛkɛtɛ ka di Lɛnyɛɛtɛyi ku Kɔwɛntɛ Fɔle dii suoto. <verse eid="EZK 46:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 46:2" />Ɔka nwu afe di kayoko nwu lɛkpata di kayi lɛkyɛ abuo aalaayila di kayokontũ nwu owoso ɔlɔɔkɔ. Di olebatatɛ nwu bayɔ ofiɛ asaaɔta nɔɔ ku atoko ɔkyɛ ole asaaɔta nɔɔ bata ole. Dikpeni eesumu di kayoko nwu kayokontũ kanya, nse atodie eesifi kafɔɔ, blɔbasɛɛ kayoko nwu diɛlaase di kɔtɔɔfɔ. <verse eid="EZK 46:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 46:3" />Dikpeni kasɔ nwu batii lesumu di Anyɛɛtɛyi ku Awɛntɛ Fɔle suoto di SAATE nwu anu di kayoko ka mmle katũ. <verse eid="EZK 46:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 46:4" />Ofiɛ asaaɔta ya di ɔka nwu kamawako ni SAATE nwu di Lɛnyɛɛtɛyi suoto ale afosobi-suɔtɔ akuɔ ku dikunumuu ninwii, di bamuu nnaa ni kɔbɔ. <verse eid="EZK 46:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 46:5" />Kamɔɔ asaaɔta ya manta mankyakaa ni di dikunumuu suoto ale kankyi onwii ku kamɔɔ asaaɔta ya ninkyakaa ni di afosobi nwu suoto di lɛpɔ le kanya eenyu alɛ aafuo ni ɔta. Diɛkyakaa ni di nnɔfɔ abo ana diɛta ni kamɔɔ kankyi biala suoto. <verse eid="EZK 46:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 46:6" />Di Kɔwɛntɛ Fɔlɛ dii suoto yi, ata lɛnankyuebi-suɔtɔ ninwii, afosobi akuɔ ku dikunumuu ninwii, di bamuu nnaa ni kɔbɔ. <verse eid="EZK 46:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 46:7" />Dikpeni ɛɛta kamɔɔ kankyi onwii diɛkyakaa di nankyue-suɔtɔ suoto fɛ alesaa asaaɔta, kankyi onwii akyakaa di dikunumuu nwu suoto, ku afosobi nwu di lɛpɔ le oomiɛ alɛ ata akyakaa ni ku nnɔfɔ abo ana di kamɔɔ kankyi biala suoto. <verse eid="EZK 46:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 46:8" />Nse ɔka nwu lebuo yi, afe di kayoko nwu lɛkpata kamɛ, aafe nkpo okle kafɔɔ adie.<verse eid="EZK 46:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 46:9" />“ ‘Nse kasɔ nwu batii lɛwa SAATE nwu anu di ayi ole ya beediki bɛɛtɛ bɛɛta ni ole suoto, ni otii lele niefe di katookasɔ kayoko eebuo alɛ oosumu yi, aafe di kalakasɔ kayoko adie; olele kafɔɔ niefe di kalakasɔ kayoko eebuo yi, afe di katookasɔ kayoko adie. Kuonwii atampɛ aakple aafe di kayoko ka kamɛ aafe aabuo ni kamɛ, kafɔɔ obiala afe di kayoko nyɔɔfa kamɛ adie. <verse eid="EZK 46:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 46:10" />Dikpeni ɔka nwu lesiɛ kaamɛ lɛma, ambuo kamɛ nse beebuo kamɛ, andie kafɔɔ nse boodie.<verse eid="EZK 46:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 46:11" />“ ‘Di ayi ole ku ayi ya beediki bɛɛtɛ bɛɛta ni ayi ole nlekɔ yi, alesaa asaaɔta ale kamɔɔ kankyi ku nankyue-suɔtɔ onwii, kamɔɔ kankyi ku lefosobi ninwii, ku afosobi fɛ mmle omiɛ alɛ ata ni kanya, diɛkyakaa ni di nnɔfɔ abo ana di kamɔɔ kankyi biala suoto. <verse eid="EZK 46:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 46:12" />Nse ɔka nwu lɛwako otu fãa asaaɔta ɛɛta SAATE nwu- kuntɛ ofiɛ asaaɔtɔ ee atoko ɔkyɛ ole asaaɔta ale yi- baasɛkɛtɛ kayoko ka niɛkyɔɔ ni anu kufĩkatunkɔ batɔɔ. Abata ofiɛ asaaɔta nɔɔ ee atoko ɔkyɛ ole asaaɔta nɔɔ fɛ mmle ambla ni di Anyɛɛtɛyi suoto. Nni kamaa abadie, nse eedie yi, baasɛɛ kayoko nwu.<verse eid="EZK 46:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Dii Biala Asaaɔta</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 46:13" />“ ‘Dikpeni fɛɛta lefosobi le nintoofũ ni lɛlɛɛ ninwii dinaa ni kɔbɔ dii biala diɛta ni ofiɛ asaaɔta fɛɛta SAATE nwu; fabata ni olesɛ biala. <verse eid="EZK 46:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 46:14" />Dikpeni olesɛ biala kafɔɔ fɛɛta alesaa asaaɔta ku nni, di nnaafũ kankyi nkyakaa ni ku nnɔfɔ abo ana, babayɔ mambakaa ni nnaafũ nwu. Alesaa asaaɔta ya mmle ɔbla ɔta SAATE nwu nle ɔsaabla wɔ nimate ni dinaa ni kaloo. <verse eid="EZK 46:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 46:15" />Nioso babata lefosobi ku alesaa asaaɔta nwu ku nnɔfɔ olesɛ biala manta ofiɛ asaaɔta obe lele.<verse eid="EZK 46:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɔka Ku Kasɔ Nwu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 46:16" />“ ‘Nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE Kplɛ nwu kobuɛ ni alɛ: Nse ɔka lɛta lɛsaa eekyeko atesaa nɔɔ kamɛ ɛɛta babisuɔtɔbi nɔɔ onwii yi, ni dibale banantii nɔɔ kafɔɔ lele; dikpeni diele lɛsaawɛ lɛma di atesaa kanya. <verse eid="EZK 46:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 46:17" />Nse kafɔɔ ɛɛbla lɛtasaa eekyeko atesaa nɔɔ kamɛ ɛɛta bakpɛmblatɛ nɔɔ onwii lɛma yi, ni kpɛmblatɛ nwu kamaklee ni ninaase di suoto osiɛko lɛlɛɛ kamɛ; nse ditoomunikĩi diesifi ɔka nwu ɔkyɛ. Atesaa nɔɔ nle babisuɔtɔbi nɔɔ lete ale; ale lete lɛma ale. <verse eid="EZK 46:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 46:18" />Dinaa alɛ ɔka lefũ batii nwu atesaa kuninwii ninnɛɛ lɛma, antososa ma di lɛsaawɛ lɛma suoto. Dikpeni ɛɛta babisuɔtɔbi nɔɔ atesaa lɛma eekyeko lɛsaawɛ nɔɔ nimu kamɛ, di mmle manaafũ ni otii nii kuonwii lɛsaawɛ ninnɛɛ nɔɔ.’ ”<verse eid="EZK 46:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Olekatakɔ Nwu Ɔtɔ Nkutaakɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 46:19" />Ninfɛ di osuɔtɔ nwu lakpaa mi aafenko di kayoko ka niate ni di koyoe klekle nwu kayoko ɔlɔɔkɔ niakyɔɔ ni anu katookasɔ, n-ya ninle ni olebatatɛ ale, ni aatuo mi lɛba di kufĩkamɛɛkɔ lɛkyɛ nɛ. <verse eid="EZK 46:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 46:20" />Ni aatɔkɔ mi alɛ, “Nnya lɛbale di olebatatɛ kamawa ni lɛpɔɔ okpi asaaɔta ku okpile asaaɔta, manfiɛ ni kafɔɔ alesaa asaaɔta bloblo, di mmle manaayɔ nya bawako ni kaflɔnkɔ ka di kayi lɛkyɛ alɛ baakleklesa ni batii nwu.”<verse eid="EZK 46:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 46:21" />Ninfɛ aakpaa mi aawako kaflɔnkɔ ka di kayi lɛkyɛ, aaleko mi katũ aakyiko akɔ nwu ana, ni lanya kaflɔnkɔ bamba di lɛkɔ biala kamɛ nɛ. <verse eid="EZK 46:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZK 46:22" />Nflɔnkɔ biibii lawɛ di kayi lɛkyɛ nflɔnkɔ nwu akɔ ana kamɛ lɛkaana labla nkpaa afosi-akuɔ-nnɛ lɛblɛfɛ kafɔɔ labla nkpaa afosi-ana-nnɛ; kaflɔnkɔ nwu biala di akɔ ana nwu nimuɔ lale ninwii. <verse eid="EZK 46:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZK 46:23" />Afuɔnkyikye lawɛ di nflɔnkɔ nwu nna biala kamɛ diakyi, ku abaya baatofo baakpee baakyisa ni nimuu di afuɔnkyikye nwu kalɔ baata ni ɔtɔ okutaa. <verse eid="EZK 46:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZK 46:24" />Ni aatɔkɔ mi alɛ, “N-ya mmle ninle ɔtɔ nkutaakɔ be di batii ba nimbla ni kasumu ɔkpɛ di olekatakɔ nwu kamawa ni batii nwu oleɔta alesaa.”<verse eid="EZK 46:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 46" />
  <chapter number="47" style="c" sid="EZK 47" />
  <para style="s1">Okle Wɔ Niabiɛ Kuakye Ni Olekatakɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 47:1" />Ni di osuɔtɔ nwu lakplesa mi aawako olekatakɔ nwu kayoko nɛ. Ni lanya ntu latoodie diatookye olekatakɔ kayokontũ nwu kalɔ di kufĩkatunkɔ lɛkyɛ nɛ (diekye olekatakɔ nwu lakyɔɔ anu kufĩkatunkɔ). Ntu nwu lasoo diatookye olekatakɔ nwu kalɔ di kalakasɔ lɛkyɛ, di oleɔta akyikye nwu kalakasɔ. <verse eid="EZK 47:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 47:2" />Ninfɛ aakpaa mi aafenko di katookasɔ kayoko, ni aaleko mi katũ aakyiko kayi, diofe ni kayoko ka kaayi niakyɔɔ ni anu kufĩkatunkɔ, ntu nwu kafɔɔ latoobiɛ diatookye kalakasɔ lɛkyɛ.<verse eid="EZK 47:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 47:3" />Di osuɔtɔ nwu latoofe ni kufĩkatunkɔ lɛkyɛ, aaklee ni lɛklapoosa di kɔnɛɛ nɔɔ yi, aaklapoosa nkpaa kakpe alafa-anɔɔ aadiki, ni aaleko mi katũ aafenko di ntu be lekyofo niadu ni lɛnankpo kanya nɛ. <verse eid="EZK 47:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 47:4" />Ni aakple aaklapoosa nkpaa kakpe alafa-anɔɔ bamba aadiki, ni aaleko mi katũ aafenko di ntu be lekyofo niadu ni dikunkyi kanya nɛ. Ni aaklapoosa nkpaa kakpe alafa-anɔɔ bamba aadiki, ni aaleko mi katũ aafenko di ntu be lekyofo niadu ni ɔtɔ̀ kanya nɛ. <verse eid="EZK 47:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 47:5" />Ni aakple aaklapoosa lɛba nkpaa kakpe alafa-anɔɔ bamba aadiki nɛ, kafɔɔ nunua okle wɔ nintafuo ni ɔwaalɛ kuale, diekye ntu lapɔ diakyofo alɛ baafia ni ninmi kamɛ- okle wɔ di otii dilaafuo ni ɔwaalɛ kuale. <verse eid="EZK 47:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 47:6" />Ni aakaalɛ mi alɛ, “Otii obi, fɔɔnya nle mmle?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EZK 47:6">Ninfɛ aaleko mi katũ aakplesa aasifiko okle nwu kotoko nɛ. <verse eid="EZK 47:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 47:7" />Obe wɔ ladu ni nfa yi, lanya awoso kpinwu di lɛpɔ kamɛ di okle nwu kotoko ɔfankyi biala. <verse eid="EZK 47:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 47:8" />Ni aatɔkɔ mi alɛ, “Okle wɔ mmle kobiɛ kunfe kufĩkatunkɔ kasɔ lɛkyɛ, ni kuosoo kumbuo di Araba<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">47.8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Yordan Ɔtaata nɛ</char></note> kamɛ, di lɛba le kuobuo ni di Lekpo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">47.8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Nni ninle Lekpo le niekpi ni nɛ</char></note> kamɛ nɛ. Nse kuobiɛ kuobuo di Lekpo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">47.8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Nni ninle Lekpo le niekpi ni nɛ</char></note> kamɛ yi, ntu nwu mbla nnwaa. <verse eid="EZK 47:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 47:9" />Babɔkɛɛ ba ninkpe ni nkpa sɛlambu kamawɛ nkpa di kakɔ lele di okle nwu kobiɛ kunfe. Kɔkpaku kamawɛ di lɛpɔ kamɛ, diekye ntu be mmle mbiɛ ninkyɛ nfa ninta mmba ntu nwu mbla nnwaa; nkpo oso, kakɔ lele di okle nwu lebiɛ kuofe yi, lɛsaa biala kamawɛ nkpa. <verse eid="EZK 47:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 47:10" />Kɔkpaku badikitɛ kamayila di lekpo nwu kotoko; diɛyɔ ni di En-Gedi diɛlaadu ni En-Eglaim yi, aba ya manlakasa ni asawu kamawɛ. Kɔkpaku ateate kubale- fɛle Lekpo Kplɛ kɔkpaku okle. <verse eid="EZK 47:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 47:11" />Kafɔɔ kasɔ ka ninle afɔ́ ku apatapata kasɔ dilɔbabla nnwaa; babadiɛ mi ninta mmba. <verse eid="EZK 47:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 47:12" />Alewoso ateate amuu kamayila di okle nwu ɛfankyi nwu ɛnyɔ atoko. Afata ninya dilɔbayɔɔ, ee abi ninya asĩ otika. Abatika abi kɔwɛntɛ biala, diekye ntu be ninkye ni kakleklekɔ nwu mbiɛ ninkyɛ nya ɔkyɛ. Abi ninya kamale alesaa, afata ninya kafɔɔ kamakyá sifiɛ.”<verse eid="EZK 47:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kasɔ Nwu Amɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 47:13" />Nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE Kplɛ nwu kobuɛ ni alɛ: “N-ya mmle ninle amɛ ya suoto dikpeni fɛɛsɛ ni kasɔ nwu fɛ atesaa fɛɛta ni Israel ana lefosi-anyɔ nwu. Di Yosef kafɔɔ awɛ aba anyɔ. <verse eid="EZK 47:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 47:14" />Dikpeni fɛɛsɛ kasɔ nwu kyɛkyɛ fɛɛta ma. Diekye latakatɛ kɔnɛɛ katoo laka ntam nlɛ kamayɔ ka nta bawa lee, nlɛ kasɔ ka mmle kamale atesaa lee.<verse eid="EZK 47:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 47:15" />“Nya mmle di kasɔ nwu kɔmɛ kamatika kunfe ni:</para>
  <para style="b" vid="EZK 47:15" />
  <para style="li1" vid="EZK 47:15">“Di katookasɔ lɛkyɛ yi, kɔmɛ nwu kamayɔ di Lekpo Kplɛ le ninte ni di Hetlon osuku kunfe di Lebo-Hamat kunaadu Sedad, <verse eid="EZK 47:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 47:16" />Berota ku Sibraim (wɔ ninte ni di Damasko ku Hamat kɔmɛ obo), kunaadu bia Haser-Hatikon, wɔ ninte ni di Hauran kɔmɛ suoto. <verse eid="EZK 47:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 47:17" />Kɔmɛ nwu kamasana kunkye lekpo kunaadu Hasar-Enan, konfe di Damasko katookasɔ kɔmɛ ku Hamat katookasɔ lɛkyɛ kɔmɛ. Nko mmle nimale katookasɔ lɛkyɛ kɔmɛ nɛ.<verse eid="EZK 47:17" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 47:18" />“Di kufĩkatunkɔ lɛkyɛ yi, kɔmɛ nwu kamafe di Hauran ku Damasko obo, kunfe di Yordan wɔ ninte ni di Gilead ku Israel kasɔ obo, kunaadu kufĩkatunkɔ lekpo kunsifi bia Tamar. Nko mmle nimale kufĩkatunkɔ lɛkyɛ kɔmɛ nɛ.<verse eid="EZK 47:18" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 47:19" />“Di kalakasɔ lɛkyɛ yi, kɔmɛ nwu kamakye di Tamar kunaadu bia Meriba-Kades ntu, nse kutoofe di Egipte Kaklenyii kuɔlaadu Lekpo Kplɛ nwu. Nko mmle nimale kalakasɔ kɔmɛ nɛ.<verse eid="EZK 47:19" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 47:20" />“Di kufĩkamɛɛkɔ lɛkyɛ yi, Lekpo Kplɛ nwu nimale kɔmɛ kunaadu lɛba lewo di Lebo-Hamat ɔfankyi. Nko mmle nimale kufĩkamɛɛkɔ kɔmɛ nɛ.<verse eid="EZK 47:20" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 47:21" />“Bisɛ kasɔ ka mmle bita suoto lee di Israel ana nwu kanya. <verse eid="EZK 47:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZK 47:22" />Bisɛ ka fɛ atesaa bita suoto lee ku bafɔɔ ba nintoodiki ni kasiɛ di kamɛ lee bakpe ni babi. Binya ma fɛ ntɔ lee- Israel batii okpoo batii; dikpeni bɛɛta ma atesaa ku aye di Israel ana nwu kamɛ. <verse eid="EZK 47:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZK 47:23" />Kɔna lele kamɛ di ɔfɔɔ nwu lebuo yi, nfa dikpeni biɛtɔɔ atesaa nɛ,” SAATE Kplɛ nwu niebuɛ.<verse eid="EZK 47:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 47" />
  <chapter number="48" style="c" sid="EZK 48" />
  <para style="s1">Kasɔ Nwu Ɔsɛ Ɔta Israel Ana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 48:1" />“N-ya mmle ninle ana nwu ayooto nɛ: Di katookasɔ kɔmɛ lɛkyɛ yi, Dan kamawɛ dikyuu ninwii; kɔmɛ nwu kamakyɛ di Hetlon osuku wɔ niefe kuosifi ni Lebo-Hamat; Hasar-Enan ku Damasko katookasɔ kɔmɛ ko ninkaako ni Hamat kamale kɔmɛ nwu lɛba diɛyɔ ni di kufĩkatunkɔ lɛkyɛ diesifi ni kufĩkamɛɛkɔ lɛkyɛ.<verse eid="EZK 48:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 48:2" />“Aser kamawɛ dikyuu ninwii; kɔmɛ nwu kamatika di Dan kɔmɛ suoto diɛyɔ ni di kufĩkatunkɔ diesifi ni kufĩkamɛɛkɔ.<verse eid="EZK 48:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 48:3" />“Naftali kamawɛ dikyuu ninwii; kɔmɛ kamatika di Aser kɔmɛ suoto diɛyɔ ni di kufĩkatunkɔ diesifi ni kufĩkamɛɛkɔ.<verse eid="EZK 48:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 48:4" />“Manase kamawɛ dikyuu ninwii; kɔmɛ kamatika di Naftali kɔmɛ suoto diɛyɔ ni di kufĩkatunkɔ diesifi ni kufĩkamɛɛkɔ.<verse eid="EZK 48:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 48:5" />“Efraim kamawɛ dikyuu ninwii; kɔmɛ kamatika di Manase kɔmɛ suoto diɛyɔ ni di kufĩkatunkɔ diesifi ni kufĩkamɛɛkɔ.<verse eid="EZK 48:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 48:6" />“Reuben kamawɛ dikyuu ninwii; kɔmɛ kamatika di Efraim kɔmɛ suoto, diɛyɔ ni di kufĩkatunkɔ diesifi ni kufĩkamɛɛkɔ.<verse eid="EZK 48:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 48:7" />“Yuda kamawɛ dikyuu ninwii; kɔmɛ nwu kamatika di Reuben kɔmɛ suoto, diɛyɔ ni di kufĩkatunkɔ diesifi ni kufĩkamɛɛkɔ.<verse eid="EZK 48:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lɛba Finle Di Kasɔ Nwu Ntɛɛntɛɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 48:8" />“Di Yuda kasɔ kɔmɛ diɛyɔ ni di kufĩkatunkɔ diɛlaadu ni kufĩkamɛɛkɔ kamale lɛba le bibadiki minta ni fɛ lɛtasaa finle. Lɛblɛfɛ nini kamabla nkpaa nkpe-afosi-ana-nnyɔ, lɛkaana kafɔɔ nini diɛyɔ ni di kufĩkatunkɔ diɛlaase ni di kufikamɛɛkɔ kamakyɛkyɛ ku kɔna nwu kunwii lɛma kale; kakleklekɔ nwu kamayila di kasɔ nwu ntɛɛntɛɛ.<verse eid="EZK 48:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 48:9" />“Dikyuu finle le dikaatɛ ale biediki biɛtɛ biɛta ni SAATE nwu lɛkaana kamabla nkpaa nkpe-afosi-ana-nnyɔ, lɛblɛfɛ kafɔɔ nkpaa lefosi-nkpe nkuɔ-alafa-ana-afosi-anɔɔ. <verse eid="EZK 48:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 48:10" />Nle mmle kamale lɛba klekle ninta olebatatɛ. Lɛkaana nini kamabla nkpaa nkpe afosi-ana-nnyɔ di katookasɔ lɛkyɛ, lɛblɛfɛ kafɔɔ kamabla nkpaa lefosi nkpe nkuɔ-alafa-ana-afosi-anɔɔ di kufĩkamɛɛkɔ lɛkyɛ. lɛblɛfɛ kamabla nkpaa lefosi nkpe nkuɔ-alafa-ana-afosi-anɔɔ di kufĩkatunkɔ lɛkyɛ, lɛkaana kafɔɔ nkpaa nkpe afosi-ana nkpe nnyɔ di kalakasɔ lɛkyɛ. Ntɛɛntɛɛ nwu di SAATE nwu kakleklekɔ kamayila nɛ. <verse eid="EZK 48:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 48:11" />Nka mmle nimale olebatatɛ ba beekleklesa ni kale nɛ. Sadok batii ba niale ni onukwale di ɔkpɛ nii ɔbla kamɛ batayu ni osuku fɛ mmle di Lewi batii labla ni di obe wɔ di Israel batii layu ni osuku. <verse eid="EZK 48:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 48:12" />Kabale lɛtasaa finle le niekye ni dikyuu le nieklekle ni kamɛ ninta ma. Dikyuu le niɛtɛ dieklekle dilenke ni, di kɔmɛ kamatika ni di Lewi batii kɔmɛ suoto.<verse eid="EZK 48:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 48:13" />“Di olebatatɛ kasɔ kɔmɛ lɛkyɛ yi, Lewi batii kamawɛ dikyuu ninwii di lɛkaana mabla ni nkpaa nkpe afosi-ana-nnyɔ, lɛblɛfɛ kafɔɔ nkpaa lefosi nkpe nkuɔ-alafa-ana-afosi-anɔɔ. Lɛkaana nika kamuu kamabla nkpaa nkpe afosi-ana-nnyɔ, lɛblɛfɛ kafɔɔ nkpaa lefosi nkpe nkuɔ-alafa-ana-afosi-anɔɔ. <verse eid="EZK 48:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 48:14" />Banaa osuku beesunsũ ee bɛɛkyɛlɛnsa kasɔ nwu kukanwii beefũ lɛsaa. Kasɔ ka mmle nle kasɔ ka ninlɛ kalenke nii, dinaa kafɔɔ alɛ keebuo di batii bamba nnɛɛ, diekye kɛɛbla kasɔ klekle kɛɛta SAATE nwu.<verse eid="EZK 48:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 48:15" />“Lɛba le niebu ni di lɛkaana lɛbla ni nkpaa nkpe-nnɛ-alafa-anyɔ-afosi-anyɔ-nnɔɔ, lɛblɛfɛ nkpaa nkpe afosi-ana-nnyɔ, kamale lɛba le di okpoo kplɛ nwu otii biala kamafuo ni ayo otofo, kanta ni kafɔɔ babɔkɛɛ sɛfa kaweekɔ. Okpoo kplɛ kamawɛ di ntɛɛntɛɛ nika. <verse eid="EZK 48:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 48:16" />Nnya mmle di okpoo kplɛ nwu lɛklapoo nwu kamate ni: Katookasɔ lɛkyɛ kamabla nkpaa nkpe nkuɛnsĩ alafa-anɔɔ, kalakasɔ nkpaa nkpe nkuɛnsĩ alafa-anɔɔ, kufĩkatunkɔ nkpaa nkpe nkuɛnsĩ alafa-anɔɔ, kufĩkamɛɛkɔ kafɔɔ nkpaa nkpe nkuɛnsĩ alafa-anɔɔ. <verse eid="EZK 48:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 48:17" />Babɔkɛɛ sɛfa kaweekɔ diɛta ni okpoo kplɛ nwu kamabla nkpaa alafa ana afosi-anyɔ di katookasɔ, nkpaa alafa ana afosi-anyɔ di kalakasɔ, nkpaa alafa ana afosi-anyɔ di kufĩkatunkɔ, nkpaa alafa ana afosi-anyɔ kafɔɔ di kufĩkamɛɛkɔ. <verse eid="EZK 48:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 48:18" />Kasɔ ka nimabu kante ni kɔmɛ ku kasɔ klekle dikyuu nwu lɛkaana kamabla nkpaa lefosi-nkpe-nkuɔ-alafa-ana-afosi-anɔɔ di kufĩkatunkɔ, nkpaa lefosi-nkpe-nkuɔ-alafa-ana-afosi-anɔɔ di kufĩkamɛɛkɔ lɛkyɛ. Kasɔ nika alesaa kamale alesaa anta okpoo kplɛ nwu bakpɛmblatɛ. <verse eid="EZK 48:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 48:19" />Bakpɛmblatɛ ba niekye ni okpoo kplɛ nwu kamɛ babakpɛ ni kasɔ nwu kamakye Israel ana nwu amuu kamɛ. <verse eid="EZK 48:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 48:20" />Kasɔ kamuu akɔ ana nwu kamakyɛkyɛ, kababla nkpaa nkpe-afosi-ana-nkpe-nnyɔ di ɔfankyi biala suoto. Bibadiki dikyuu klekle nwu mintɛ fɛ lɛtasaa finle, diɛkyakaa ni di okpoo kplɛ nwu lɛsaawɛ suoto.<verse eid="EZK 48:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 48:21" />“Kasɔ ka nimabu kante ni di ɛfankyi nwu ɛnyɔ niɛbla ni kasɔ klekle ku okpoo kplɛ nwu lɛsaawɛ kamale ɔka kale. Lɛblɛfɛ di kufĩkatunkɔ lɛkyɛ kamayɔ di kasɔ klekle nwu nkpaa nkpe-afosi-ana-nkpe-nnyɔ kanaatika di kufĩkatunkɔ kɔmɛ suoto, kufĩkamɛɛkɔ lɛkyɛ kafɔɔ kamayɔ di nkpaa nkpe-afosi-ana-nkpe-nnyɔ kanaatika di kufĩkamɛɛkɔ kɔmɛ suoto. Aba ya mmle akyuu nwu anyɔ ninte ni di ana nwu nsɔ lɛkaana kanya kamale ɔka kale. Kasɔ klekle nwu ku olekatakɔ kakleklekɔ nwu kamawɛ di ntɛɛntɛɛ lɛma. <verse eid="EZK 48:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZK 48:22" />Nioso, Lewi batii lɛsaawɛ ku okpoo kplɛ nwu lɛsaawɛ kamate di lɛba le ninle ni ɔka kasɔ ntɛɛntɛɛ. Lɛba le ninle ni ɔka kasɔ kamate di Yuda kɔmɛ ku Benyamin kɔmɛ obo.<verse eid="EZK 48:22" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ana Bamba Kasɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZK 48:23" />“Ana nwu bule mma yi: Benyamin kamawɛ dikyuu ninwii; kabayɔ di kufĩkatunkɔ lɛkyɛ kansifi kufĩkamɛɛkɔ lɛkyɛ.<verse eid="EZK 48:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZK 48:24" />“Simeon kamawɛ dikyuu ninwii; kɔmɛ kamatika di Benyamin kɔmɛ suoto kun-yɔ di kufĩkatunkɔ kunsifi kufĩkamɛɛkɔ.<verse eid="EZK 48:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EZK 48:25" />“Isakar kamawɛ dikyuu ninwii; kɔmɛ kamatika di Simeon kasɔ suoto kun-yɔ di kufĩkatunkɔ kunsifi kufĩkamɛɛkɔ.<verse eid="EZK 48:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="EZK 48:26" />“Sebulun kamawɛ dikyuu ninwii; kɔmɛ kamatika di Isakar kasɔ suoto kun-yɔ di kufĩkatunkɔ kunsifi kufĩkamɛɛkɔ.<verse eid="EZK 48:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="EZK 48:27" />“Gad kamawɛ dikyuu ninwii; kɔmɛ kamatika di Sebulun kasɔ suoto kun-yɔ di kufĩkatunkɔ kunsifi kufĩkamɛɛkɔ.<verse eid="EZK 48:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="EZK 48:28" />“Gad kɔmɛ di kalakasɔ kamafe di kalakasɔ lɛkyɛ kun-yɔ di Tamar kanaatika di Meriba-Kades ntu kanya, kunfe di Egipte Kaklenyii kunaadu Lekpo Kplɛ nwu.<verse eid="EZK 48:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="EZK 48:29" />“Nka mmle ninle kasɔ ka bibasɛ minta ni Israel ana nwu fɛ atesaa nɛ. Mbe mmle nwu kafɔɔ nimale nsɔ lɛma nɛ,” SAATE Kplɛ nwu niebuɛ.<verse eid="EZK 48:29" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yerusalem N-yoko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="EZK 48:30" />“N-ya mmle nimale aba ya babafe mandie ni di okpoo kplɛ nwu kamɛ nɛ: Keekye ni kasɔ di katookasɔ lɛkyɛ, di lɛkaana kamabla ni nkpaa nkpe nkuɛnsĩ alafa-anɔɔ, <verse eid="EZK 48:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EZK 48:31" />Israel ana ayooto babayɔ mantika okpoo kplɛ nwu n-yoko. N-yoko be ntiɛ ninkpe ni di katookasɔ lɛkyɛ kamale Reuben kayoko, Yuda kayoko ku Lewi kayoko.<verse eid="EZK 48:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="EZK 48:32" />“Di kufĩkatunkɔ lɛkyɛ, di lɛkaana lɛbla ni nkpaa nkpe nkuɛnsĩ alafa-anɔɔ yi, n-yoko ntiɛ kamawɛ: Yosef kayoko, Benyamin kayoko ku Dan kayoko.<verse eid="EZK 48:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="EZK 48:33" />“Di kalakasɔ lɛkyɛ, ninle ni nkpaa nkpe nkuɛnsĩ alafa-anɔɔ yi, n-yoko ntiɛ kamawɛ: Simeon kayoko, Isakar kayoko ku Sebulun kayoko.<verse eid="EZK 48:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="EZK 48:34" />“Di kufĩkamɛɛkɔ lɛkyɛ, ninle ni nkpaa nkpe nkuɛnsĩ alafa-anɔɔ yi, n-yoko ntiɛ kamawɛ: Gad kayoko, Aser kayoko ku Naftali kayoko.<verse eid="EZK 48:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="EZK 48:35" />“Obo wɔ nimate kunkyi ni okpoo kplɛ nwu omuu kamabla nkpaa nkpe afosi anɔɔ nkpe-nna.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EZK 48:35">“Okpoo kplɛ nwu leyooto diɛyɔ ni di obe nwu nkpo kamɛ diesifi ni nimale: SAATE NWU NKPE NINFA.”<verse eid="EZK 48:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 48" />
</usx>